#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານຮາດແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Not all problems can be solved with better hardware, but choosing the right "
"hardware is an absolute necessity for large scale deployments."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກບັນຫາຈະແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ດ້ວຍຮາດແວທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ແຕ່ການເລືອກຮາດແວທີ່ເໝາະສົມແມ່ນຄວາມຈຳເປັນຢ່າງຍິ່ງສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:3
msgid "The minimum requirements for the {productname} Server are:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳສຳລັບ {productname} Server ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:4
msgid "Eight or more recent {x86_64} CPU cores."
msgstr "CPU {x86_64} ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ 8 ຄໍ (cores) ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:5
msgid "32{nbsp}GiB RAM."
msgstr "RAM 32{nbsp}GiB."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:6
msgid "For installations with thousands of clients, use 64{nbsp}GB or more."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍພັນເຄື່ອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ 64{nbsp}GB ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:7
msgid "Fast I/O storage devices, such as locally attached SSDs."
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີການຮັບ-ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (I/O) ໄວ, ເຊັ່ນ SSD ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:8
msgid "For PostgreSQL data directories, we recommend locally attached RAID-0 SSDs."
msgstr "ສຳລັບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ RAID-0 SSD ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If the {productname} Server is virtualized, enable the `elevator=none` "
"kernel command line option, for the best input/output performance.  You can "
"check the current status with `cat /sys/block/<DEVICE>/queue/scheduler`.  "
"This command will display a list of available schedulers with the currently "
"active one in brackets.  To change the scheduler before a reboot, use `echo "
"none > /sys/block/<DEVICE>/queue/scheduler`."
msgstr "ຖ້າ {productname} Server ເປັນລະບົບສະເມືອນ (Virtualized), ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `elevator=none` ໃນ kernel command line ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບ input/output ທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນດ້ວຍ `cat /sys/block/<DEVICE>/queue/scheduler`. ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ scheduler ທີ່ມີຢູ່ ໂດຍອັນທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຈະຢູ່ໃນວົງເລັບ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນ scheduler ກ່ອນການ reboot, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `echo none > /sys/block/<DEVICE>/queue/scheduler`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:10
msgid "The minimum requirements for the {productname} Proxy are:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:11
msgid ""
"One {productname} Proxy is generally reasonable for **500-1000 clients**, "
"but this is a **recommendation, not a hard limit**, and depends on available "
"network bandwidth"
msgstr "{productname} Proxy ຫນຶ່ງເຄື່ອງ ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນເໝາະສົມສຳລັບ **ລູກຂ່າຍ 500-1000 ເຄື່ອງ**, ແຕ່ນີ້ແມ່ນ **ຄຳແນະນຳ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຕາຍຕົວ**, ແລະ ຂຶ້ນກັບແບນວິດຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:12
msgid "Two or more recent {x86_64} CPU cores."
msgstr "CPU {x86_64} ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ 2 ຄໍ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:13
msgid "16{nbsp}GB RAM, and sufficient storage for caching."
msgstr "RAM 16{nbsp}GB, ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ພຽງພໍສຳລັບການເຮັດແຄຊ (caching)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Clients should never be directly attached to the {productname} Server in "
"production systems."
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production), ລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ຄວນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In large scale installations, the {productname} Proxy is used primarily as a "
"local cache for content between the server and clients.  Using proxies in "
"this way can substantially reduce download time for clients, and decrease "
"Server egress bandwidth use."
msgstr "ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, {productname} Proxy ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຊົ່ວຄາວ (local cache) ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ. ການໃຊ້ proxy ໃນລັກສະນະນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດເວລາໃນການດາວໂຫຼດຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ແບນວິດຂາອອກຂອງເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The number of clients per proxy will affect the download time.  Always take "
"network structure and available bandwidth into account."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍຕໍ່ proxy ຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ເວລາດາວໂຫຼດ. ຄວນພິຈາລະນາໂຄງສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ແບນວິດທີ່ມີຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:17
msgid ""
"We recommend you estimate the download time of typical usage to determine "
"how many clients to connnect to each proxy.  To do this, you will need to "
"estimate the number of package upgrades required in every patch cycle.  You "
"can use this formula to calculate the download time:"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າປະເມີນເວລາດາວໂຫຼດຈາກການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປ ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າຄວນມີລູກຂ່າຍຈັກເຄື່ອງຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ proxy. ໃນການເຮັດແບບນີ້, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປະເມີນຈຳນວນການອັບເກຣດແພັກເກັດໃນແຕ່ລະຮອບການອັບເດດ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ສູດນີ້ຄິດໄລ່ເວລາດາວໂຫຼດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Size of updates * Number of clients / Theoretical download speed / 60\n"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງການອັບເດດ * ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ / ຄວາມໄວດາວໂຫຼດຕາມທິດສະດີ / 60\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For example, the total time needed to transfer 400{nbsp}MB of upgrades "
"through a physical link speed of 1{nbsp}GB/s to 3000 clients:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເວລາທັງໝົດທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໃນການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອັບເກຣດ 400{nbsp}MB ຜ່ານຄວາມໄວລິ້ງ 1{nbsp}GB/s ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ 3000 ເຄື່ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "400 MB  * 3000 / 119 MB/s / 60 = 169 min\n"
msgstr "400 MB * 3000 / 119 MB/s / 60 = 169 ນາທີ\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Hub XMLRPC API"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Hub XMLRPC API"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Hub XMLRPC API allows you to perform operations across multiple "
"peripheral servers from a single endpoint.  The Hub connects to these "
"peripheral servers using the connection details established via "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc[Hub Online "
"Synchronization].  Ensure that your peripheral servers are correctly "
"registered to the hub before attempting to use the XMLRPC API."
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດປະຕິບັດການຜ່ານຫຼາຍເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຈາກ endpoint ດຽວ. Hub ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ຕັ້ງຂຶ້ນຜ່ານ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc[ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ Hub ແບບອອນລາຍ]. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກລົງທະບຽນກັບ hub ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມໃຊ້ XMLRPC API."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When XMLRPC API is running, connect to it through server FQDN at the "
"location `/hub/rpc/api` using any XMLRPC-compliant client libraries.  For "
"examples, see xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ XMLRPC API ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີທີ່ `/hub/rpc/api` ໂດຍໃຊ້ library ລູກຂ່າຍໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ XMLRPC. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Logs are saved in `/var/log/hub/hub-xmlrpc-api.log`.  Logs are rotated "
"weekly, or when the log file size reaches the specified limit.  By default, "
"the log file size limit is 10{nbsp}MB."
msgstr "Log ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນ `/var/log/hub/hub-xmlrpc-api.log`. Log ຈະຖືກ rotate ທຸກໆອາທິດ ຫຼື ເມື່ອຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ log ຮອດຂີດຈຳກັດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຂີດຈຳກັດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ log ແມ່ນ 10{nbsp}MB."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub XMLRPC API Authentication Modes"
msgstr "ໂໝດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງ Hub XMLRPC API"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:2
msgid "The Hub XMLRPC API supports three different authentication modes:"
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API ຮອງຮັບໂໝດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ 3 ແບບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Manual mode (default): API credentials must be explicitly provided for each "
"server."
msgstr "ໂໝດປັບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ - Manual (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ): ຕ້ອງລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ API ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Relay mode: the credentials used to authenticate with the Hub are also used "
"to authenticate to each server."
msgstr "ໂໝດສົ່ງຕໍ່ - Relay: ຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບ Hub ຈະຖືກນຳໄປໃຊ້ຢືນຢັນກັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:5
msgid "You must provide a list of servers to connect to."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລະບຸລາຍຊື່ເຊີເວີທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Auto-connect mode: credentials are reused for each server, and any "
"peripheral server you have access to is automatically connected."
msgstr "ໂໝດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດ - Auto-connect: ຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ຄືນກັບທຸກເຊີເວີ, ແລະ ເຊີເວີປາຍທາງໃດໆທີ່ເຈົ້າມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:8
msgid "This section provides examples of each authentication method."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຂອງແຕ່ລະວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Manual Authentication"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ Manual"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In manual mode, credentials have to be explicitly provided for each "
"peripheral server before you can connect to it."
msgstr "ໃນໂໝດ manual, ຕ້ອງລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີປາຍທາງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:11
msgid "A typical workflow for manual authentication is:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ manual ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Credentials for the Hub are passed to the `login` method, and a session key "
"for the Hub is returned (`hubSessionKey`)."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບຂອງ Hub ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປທີ່ເມທອດ `login`, ແລະ ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ session key ສຳລັບ Hub ກັບຄືນມາ (`hubSessionKey`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Using the session key from the previous step, {productname} Server IDs are "
"obtained for all the peripheral servers attached to the Hub via the "
"`hub.listServerIds` method."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ session key ຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້າ ເພື່ອຂໍເອົາ ID ຂອງ {productname} Server ສຳລັບທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Hub ຜ່ານເມທອດ `hub.listServerIds`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Credentials for each peripheral server are provided to the `attachToServers` "
"method."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ເມທອດ `attachToServers`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:15
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:41
msgid "This performs authentication against each server's XMLRPC API endpoint."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (endpoint) XMLRPC API ຂອງແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:16
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:42
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:62
msgid "A `multicast` call is performed on a set of servers."
msgstr "ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ `multicast` ຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການໃນກຸ່ມເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:17
msgid ""
"This is defined by `serverIds`, which contains the IDs of the servers to "
"target.  In the background, `system.list_system` is called on each server's "
"XMLRPC API"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ `serverIds`, ເຊິ່ງບັນຈຸ ID ຂອງເຊີເວີເປົ້າໝາຍ. ໃນເບື້ອງຫຼັງ, `system.list_system` ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນ XMLRPC API ຂອງແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:18
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:44
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:64
msgid "Hub aggregates the results and returns the response in the form of a `map`."
msgstr "Hub ຈະຮວບຮວມຜົນລັດ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່າຕອບກັບໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ `map`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:19
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:45
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:65
msgid "The map has two entries:"
msgstr "Map ຈະມີ 2 ລາຍການ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:20
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:46
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:66
msgid ""
"`Successful`: list of responses for those peripheral servers where the call "
"succeeded."
msgstr "`Successful`: ລາຍຊື່ການຕອບກັບສຳລັບເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:21
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:67
msgid ""
"`Failed`: list of responses for those peripheral servers where the call "
"failed."
msgstr "`Failed`: ລາຍຊື່ການຕອບກັບສຳລັບເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:22
msgid ""
"If you want to call a method on just one {productname} Server, then Hub API "
"also provides a `unicast` namespace.  In this case, the response will be a "
"single value and not a map, in the same way as if you called that "
"{productname} server's API directly."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດໃນ {productname} Server ພຽງເຄື່ອງດຽວ, Hub API ຍັງມີ namespace ແບບ `unicast` ໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ຄ່າຕອບກັບຈະເປັນຄ່າດຽວ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນ map, ຄືກັນກັບວ່າເຈົ້າເອີ້ນໃຊ້ API ຂອງ {productname} server ນັ້ນໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Python Script for Manual Authentication:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Python Script ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ Manual:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:24
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:49
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"import xmlrpc.client\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"import xmlrpc.client\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:25
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:50
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL = \"https://<SERVER_FQDN>/hub/rpc/api\"\n"
"HUB_USERNAME = \"<USERNAME>\"\n"
"HUB_PASSWORD = \"<PASSWORD>\"\n"
msgstr ""
"HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL = \"https://<SERVER_FQDN>/hub/rpc/api\"\n"
"HUB_USERNAME = \"<USERNAME>\"\n"
"HUB_PASSWORD = \"<PASSWORD>\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:26
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:51
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy(HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL, verbose=0)\n"
msgstr "client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy(HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL, verbose=0)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "hubSessionKey = client.hub.login(HUB_USERNAME, HUB_PASSWORD)\n"
msgstr "hubSessionKey = client.hub.login(HUB_USERNAME, HUB_PASSWORD)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:28
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:53
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Get the server IDs\n"
"serverIds = client.hub.listServerIds(hubSessionKey)\n"
msgstr ""
"# ດຶງ ID ຂອງເຊີເວີ\n"
"serverIds = client.hub.listServerIds(hubSessionKey)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# For simplicity, this example assumes you are using the same username and "
"password here, as on the hub server.\n"
"# However, in most cases, every server has its own individual credentials.\n"
"usernames = [HUB_USERNAME for s in serverIds]\n"
"passwords = [HUB_PASSWORD for s in serverIds]\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເພື່ອຄວາມງ່າຍ, ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານອັນດຽວກັນກັບ hub server.\n"
"# ແຕ່ໃນຄວາມເປັນຈິງ, ແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີມັກຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງໃຜມັນ.\n"
"usernames = [HUB_USERNAME for s in serverIds]\n"
"passwords = [HUB_PASSWORD for s in serverIds]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Each server uses the credentials set above, client.hub.attachToServers "
"needs\n"
"# them passed as lists with as many elements as there are servers.\n"
"client.hub.attachToServers(hubSessionKey, serverIds, usernames, passwords)\n"
msgstr ""
"# ແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ, client.hub.attachToServers ຕ້ອງການ\n"
"# ຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃນຮູບແບບ list ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນເທົ່າກັບຈຳນວນເຊີເວີ.\n"
"client.hub.attachToServers(hubSessionKey, serverIds, usernames, passwords)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Perform the operation\n"
"systemsPerServer = client.multicast.system.list_systems(hubSessionKey, "
"serverIds)\n"
"successfulResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Successful\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
"failedResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Failed\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກ\n"
"systemsPerServer = client.multicast.system.list_systems(hubSessionKey, serverIds)\n"
"successfulResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Successful\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
"failedResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Failed\"][\"Responses\"]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:32
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:56
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for system in successfulResponses:\n"
"  print(system)\n"
msgstr ""
"for system in successfulResponses:\n"
"  print(system)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:33
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:57
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Log out\n"
"client.hub.logout(hubSessionKey)\n"
msgstr ""
"# ອອກຈາກລະບົບ\n"
"client.hub.logout(hubSessionKey)\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Relay Authentication"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ Relay"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:35
msgid ""
"In relay authentication mode, the credentials used to sign in to the Hub API "
"are also used to sign in into the APIs of the peripheral servers the user "
"wants to work with.  In this authentication mode, it is assumed that the "
"same credentials are valid for every server, and that they correspond to a "
"user with appropriate permissions."
msgstr "ໃນໂໝດ relay, ຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າລະບົບ Hub API ຈະຖືກນຳໄປໃຊ້ເຂົ້າລະບົບ API ຂອງເຊີເວີປາຍທາງຄືກັນ. ໃນໂໝດນີ, ຈະຖືວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຊຸດດຽວກັນນັ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທຸກເຊີເວີ ແລະ ເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີສິດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:36
msgid ""
"After signing in, you must call the `attachToServers` method.  This method "
"defines the servers to target in all subsequent calls."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດ `attachToServers`. ເມທອດນີ້ຈະກຳນົດເຊີເວີເປົ້າໝາຍໃນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ທັງໝົດທີ່ຈະຕາມມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:37
msgid "A typical workflow for relay authentication is:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ relay ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Credentials for the Hub are passed to the `loginWithAuthRelayMode` method, "
"and a session key for the Hub is returned (`hubSessionKey`)."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບຂອງ Hub ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປທີ່ເມທອດ `loginWithAuthRelayMode`, ແລະ ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ session key ສຳລັບ Hub ກັບຄືນມາ (`hubSessionKey`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Using the session key from the previous step, {productname} Server IDs are "
"obtained for all the peripheral servers attached to the Hub via the "
"`hub.listServerIds` method"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ session key ຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້າ ເພື່ອຂໍເອົາ ID ຂອງ {productname} Server ສຳລັບທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Hub ຜ່ານເມທອດ `hub.listServerIds`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:40
msgid ""
"A call to `attachToServers` is made, and the same credentials used to sign "
"in to the Hub are passed to each server."
msgstr "ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ `attachToServers` ໂດຍສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນອັນດຽວກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າ Hub ໄປໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:43
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:63
msgid ""
"This is defined by `serverIds`, which contains the IDs of the servers to "
"target.  In the background, `system.list_system` is called on each server's "
"XMLRPC API."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ `serverIds`, ເຊິ່ງບັນຈຸ ID ຂອງເຊີເວີເປົ້າໝາຍ. ໃນເບື້ອງຫຼັງ, `system.list_system` ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນ XMLRPC API ຂອງແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:47
msgid "`Failed`: list of responses for those peripheral servers the call failed."
msgstr "`Failed`: ລາຍຊື່ການຕອບກັບສຳລັບເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Python Script for Relay Authentication:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Python Script ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ Relay:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hubSessionKey = client.hub.loginWithAuthRelayMode(HUB_USERNAME, "
"HUB_PASSWORD)\n"
msgstr "hubSessionKey = client.hub.loginWithAuthRelayMode(HUB_USERNAME, HUB_PASSWORD)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Authenticate those servers(same credentials will be used as of hub to "
"authenticate)\n"
"client.hub.attachToServers(hubSessionKey, serverIds)\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບເຊີເວີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ (ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນຊຸດດຽວກັບ hub ໃນການຢືນຢັນ)\n"
"client.hub.attachToServers(hubSessionKey, serverIds)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:55
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Perform the needed operation\n"
"systemsPerServer = client.multicast.system.list_systems(hubSessionKey, "
"serverIds)\n"
"successfulResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Successful\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
"failedResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Failed\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຕ້ອງການ\n"
"systemsPerServer = client.multicast.system.list_systems(hubSessionKey, serverIds)\n"
"successfulResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Successful\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
"failedResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Failed\"][\"Responses\"]\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Auto-Connect Authentication"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ Auto-Connect"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Auto-connect mode is similar to relay mode, it uses the Hub credentials to "
"sign in to all peripheral servers.  However, there is no need to use the "
"`attachToServers` method, as auto-connect mode connects to all available "
"peripheral servers.  This occurs at the same time as you sign in to the Hub."
msgstr "ໂໝດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດມີຄວາມຄ້າຍຄືກັບໂໝດສົ່ງຕໍ່, ໂດຍຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບຂອງ Hub ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເມທອດ `attachToServers`, ເພາະໂໝດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ມີຢູ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນພ້ອມກັນກັບຕອນທີ່ເຈົ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Hub."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:60
msgid "A typical workflow for auto-connect authentication is:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ auto-connect ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Credentials for the Hub are passed to the `loginWithAutoconnectMode` method, "
"and a session key for the Hub is returned (`hubSessionKey`)."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບຂອງ Hub ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປທີ່ເມທອດ `loginWithAutoconnectMode`, ແລະ ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ session key ສຳລັບ Hub ກັບຄືນມາ (`hubSessionKey`)."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Python Script for Auto-Connect Authentication:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Python Script ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ Auto-Connect:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"loginResponse = client.hub.loginWithAutoconnectMode(HUB_USERNAME, "
"HUB_PASSWORD)\n"
"hubSessionKey = loginResponse[\"SessionKey\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"loginResponse = client.hub.loginWithAutoconnectMode(HUB_USERNAME, HUB_PASSWORD)\n"
"hubSessionKey = loginResponse[\"SessionKey\"]\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub deployment"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The connection between hub and peripheral servers is now primarily "
"established using "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc[Hub Online "
"Synchronization].  This chapter describes an optional but recommended best "
"practice to use the same CA for all servers."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ hub ແລະ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ ໃນປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນຖືກຕັ້ງຂຶ້ນໂດຍຜ່ານ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc[ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ Hub ແບບອອນລາຍ]. ບົດນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບແນວທາງປະຕິບັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ (ທາງເລືອກແຕ່ແນະນຳ) ໃນການໃຊ້ CA ດຽວກັນສຳລັບທຸກເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You can deploy a hub environment either with third party certificates or "
"with self-generated certificates."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ hub ໄດ້ທັງດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກພາຍນອກ (third party) ຫຼື ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງ (self-generated)."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "With third party certificates"
msgstr "ດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກພາຍນອກ"

#.  FIXME: what does this actually mean?
#.         Just checking that you have those available and use them
#.         while deploying the hub infrastructure?
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Prepare third party certificates for both the Hub Server and the Peripheral "
"servers first."
msgstr "ກຽມໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກພາຍນອກສຳລັບທັງ Hub Server ແລະ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍກ່ອນ."

#.  For a hub environment, first ... then ...
#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:6
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub server installation"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub server"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the Hub Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:8
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Install a container host with {sl-micro}.  For more information about "
"{sl-micro} as a container host, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm#deploy-mlm-server-micro[]."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ container host ດ້ວຍ {sl-micro}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {sl-micro} ໃນຖານະ container host, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm#deploy-mlm-server-micro[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:9
msgid ""
"On the container host, deploy {productname} as the hub server using the "
"third party certificate.  Add `--hubxmlrpc-replicas 1` to the `mgradm "
"install` command line.  For example:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ເປັນ hub server ໂດຍໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກພາຍນອກ. ໃຫ້ຕື່ມ `--hubxmlrpc-replicas 1` ເຂົ້າໃນຄຳສັ່ງ `mgradm install`. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm install podman --ssl-ca-root CA-Certificate.crt --ssl-server-cert "
"hub.crt --ssl-server-key hub.key --ssl-db-ca-root CA-Certificate.crt "
"--ssl-db-cert hud-db.crt --ssl-db-key hub-db.key --hubxmlrpc-replicas 1\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman --ssl-ca-root CA-Certificate.crt --ssl-server-cert hub.crt --ssl-server-key hub.key --ssl-db-ca-root CA-Certificate.crt --ssl-db-cert hud-db.crt --ssl-db-key hub-db.key --hubxmlrpc-replicas 1\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:11
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information about deploying with `mgradm`, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc#deploy-mlm-server-mgradm[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ `mgradm`, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc#deploy-mlm-server-mgradm[]."

#. Next step, peripheral server
#.  On the container host with the hub server, prepare the SSL certificates for the peripheral servers.
#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:12
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Peripheral servers"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing peripheral servers using third party certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໂດຍໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກພາຍນອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Preliminary Requirement: A certificate for every peripheral server and its "
"database (for example, `server.crt`) and a key (for example, `server.key`)."
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ: ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສຳລັບທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງມັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `server.crt`) ແລະ ຄີ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `server.key`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:15
msgid "Preliminary Requirement: CA Certificate."
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ: ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Preliminary Requirement: Hub server installation.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-install.adoc#lsd-hub-install-3rd-hub[]."
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub server. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-install.adoc#lsd-hub-install-3rd-hub[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On every peripheral server host, copy the same CA to "
"`/etc/pki/trust/anchors/` and run `update-ca-certificates`."
msgstr "ໃນທຸກ host ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ, ໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ CA ດຽວກັນໄປທີ່ `/etc/pki/trust/anchors/` ແລະ ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ `update-ca-certificates`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:18
msgid ""
"On every peripheral server host, install {productname} using the following "
"command (replace appropriately the names of the certificates):"
msgstr "ໃນທຸກ host ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ (ປ່ຽນຊື່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm install podman --ssl-ca-root CA-Certificate.crt --ssl-server-cert "
"server.crt --ssl-server-key server.key --ssl-db-ca-root CA-Certificate.crt "
"--ssl-db-cert db.crt --ssl-db-key db.key\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman --ssl-ca-root CA-Certificate.crt --ssl-server-cert server.crt --ssl-server-key server.key --ssl-db-ca-root CA-Certificate.crt --ssl-db-cert db.crt --ssl-db-key db.key\n"

#.  ========================================================================
#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "With self-generated certificates"
msgstr "ດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the hub server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:24
msgid ""
"On the container host, deploy {productname} as the hub server.  Add "
"`--hubxmlrpc-replicas 1` to the `mgradm install` command line.  For example:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ເປັນ hub server. ໃຫ້ຕື່ມ `--hubxmlrpc-replicas 1` ເຂົ້າໃນຄຳສັ່ງ `mgradm install`. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install podman MLM.example.com --hubxmlrpc-replicas 1\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman MLM.example.com --hubxmlrpc-replicas 1\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Peripheral servers with self-generated certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Preliminary Requirement: Hub server installation.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-install.adoc#lsd-hub-install-self-hub[]."
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub server. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-install.adoc#lsd-hub-install-self-hub[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:30
msgid "On the container host of the hub server, enter the server container with:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host ຂອງ hub server, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ server container ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:31
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:9
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:17
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:24
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr "mgrctl term\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:32
msgid "Inside the container, run `rhn-ssl-tool` for every peripheral server:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ container, ໃຫ້ລັນ `rhn-ssl-tool` ສຳລັບທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=PERIPHAL-FQDN\n"
msgstr ""
"rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=PERIPHAL-FQDN\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:34
msgid "For every peripheral server:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:35
msgid ""
"From the hub server container, copy "
"`/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`, "
"`/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.crt` and "
"`/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.key` to the peripheral server host."
msgstr "ຈາກ hub server container, ໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ `/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`, `/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.crt` ແລະ `/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.key` ໄປທີ່ peripheral server host."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:36
msgid ""
"On every peripheral server host, copy `RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT` to "
"`/etc/pki/trust/anchors/`, and run `update-ca-certificates`."
msgstr "ໃນທຸກ host ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ, ໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ `RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT` ໄປທີ່ `/etc/pki/trust/anchors/`, ແລະ ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ `update-ca-certificates`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:37
msgid "On every peripheral server host, deploy {productname} with:"
msgstr "ໃນທຸກ host ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm install podman --ssl-ca-root RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT "
"--ssl-server-cert server.crt --ssl-server-key server.key --ssl-db-ca-root "
"RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT --ssl-db-cert server.crt --ssl-db-key server.key\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman --ssl-ca-root RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT --ssl-server-cert server.crt --ssl-server-key server.key --ssl-db-ca-root RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT --ssl-db-cert server.crt --ssl-db-key server.key\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background information"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:40
msgid "Checking the following hub configuration settings is optional."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ hub ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນເປັນທາງເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:41
msgid ""
"On the container host, find environment variables in "
"`/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-hub-xmlrpc.service` generated by `mgradm`.  If "
"needed, you can customize these variables with `Environment=`settings in a "
"user created `/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-hub-xmlrpc.service.d/local.conf` "
"`systemd` configuration file on the container host."
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment variables) ໃນ `/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-hub-xmlrpc.service` ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ `mgradm`. ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `Environment=` ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ `systemd` ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງທີ່ `/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-hub-xmlrpc.service.d/local.conf` ເທິງ container host."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:42
msgid ""
"It will override settings in `/etc/hub/hub.conf` inside the server "
"container.  It is the same file for all containers."
msgstr "ມັນຈະແທນທີ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ `/etc/hub/hub.conf` ພາຍໃນ server container. ມັນແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນສຳລັບທຸກ container."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:43
msgid "`HUB_API_URL`: URL to the Hub Server XMLRPC API endpoint."
msgstr "`HUB_API_URL`: URL ໄປຫາ Hub Server XMLRPC API endpoint."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Use the default value if you are installing `hub-xmlrpc-api` on the Hub "
"Server.  It is set automatically in the systemd unit file during the "
"installation."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງ `hub-xmlrpc-api` ເທິງ Hub Server. ມັນຖືກຕັ້ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ systemd unit file ລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:45
msgid ""
"`HUB_CONNECT_TIMEOUT`: the maximum number of seconds to wait for a response "
"when connecting to a Server."
msgstr "`HUB_CONNECT_TIMEOUT`: ຈຳນວນວິນາທີສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າການຕອບກັບເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:46
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:48
msgid "Use the default value in most cases."
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:47
msgid ""
"`HUB_REQUEST_TIMEOUT`: the maximum number of seconds to wait for a response "
"when calling a Server method."
msgstr "`HUB_REQUEST_TIMEOUT`: ຈຳນວນວິນາທີສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າການຕອບກັບເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມທອດຂອງ Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:49
msgid ""
"`HUB_CONNECT_USING_SSL`: use HTTPS instead of HTTP for communicating with "
"peripheral Servers."
msgstr "`HUB_CONNECT_USING_SSL`: ໃຊ້ HTTPS ແທນ HTTP ສຳລັບການສື່ສານກັບເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:50
msgid "Recommended for a secure environment.  It is always enabled."
msgstr "ແນະນຳສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຄວາມປອດໄພ. ມັນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານສະເໝີ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Multiple Servers with Hub to Manage Large Scale Deployments"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເຊີເວີຮ່ວມກັບ Hub ເພື່ອຈັດການການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you need to manage a large number of clients, in most cases you can do so "
"with a single {productname} Server, tuned appropriately."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍ {productname} Server ພຽງເຄື່ອງດຽວ ໂດຍມີການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:3
msgid ""
"However, if you need to manage tens of thousands of clients, you might find "
"it easier to use one of the following mechanisms:"
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍເປັນໝື່ນເຄື່ອງ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພົບວ່າມັນງ່າຍກວ່າທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກົນໄກໃດໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:4
msgid ""
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc[Hub Online "
"Synchronization]"
msgstr "xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc[ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ Hub ແບບອອນລາຍ]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:5
msgid ""
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc[Inter-Server "
"Synchronization (ISS v2)]"
msgstr "xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc[ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ (ISS v2)]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:6
msgid ""
"ISS version 2 is based on exporting data from one server (source) and "
"importing it on another (target) server.  It is useful for disconnected "
"setups."
msgstr "ISS ເວີຊັນ 2 ແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ການສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເຊີເວີໜຶ່ງ (ຕົ້ນທາງ) ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າໄປຍັງອີກເຊີເວີໜຶ່ງ (ປາຍທາງ). ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ (disconnected setups)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:7
msgid ""
"{productname} Hub helps managing very large deployments by connecting "
"multiple servers together.  The connection between the Hub and its "
"peripheral servers is established using Hub Online Synchronization.  The "
"typical Hub topology looks like this:"
msgstr "{productname} Hub ຊ່ວຍຈັດການການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ ໂດຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼາຍເຊີເວີເຂົ້າກັນ. ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ Hub ແລະ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ ແມ່ນຖືກຕັ້ງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ Hub ແບບອອນລາຍ. ໂຄງສ້າງ Hub ທົ່ວໄປຈະເປັນແບບນີ້:"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "typical-hub-architecture-overview.svg"
msgstr "typical-hub-architecture-overview.svg"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:9
msgid "One central {productname} Server, which acts as the Hub Server."
msgstr "{productname} Server ສູນກາງ 1 ເຄື່ອງ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ Hub Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:10
msgid ""
"One or more additional {productname} Servers, registered to the Hub.  This "
"document refers to these additional servers as peripheral servers."
msgstr "{productname} Servers ເພີ່ມເຕີມໜຶ່ງເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ Hub. ເອກະສານນີ້ເອີ້ນເຊີເວີເພີ່ມເຕີມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ວ່າ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ (peripheral servers)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Any number of clients registered to the peripheral servers.  Some of these "
"clients can act as {productname} Proxies."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ. ລູກຂ່າຍບາງເຄື່ອງສາມາດເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ {productname} Proxies ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:12
msgid "This chapter gives more details about Hub deployment."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub XMLRPC API Namespaces"
msgstr "Namespaces ຂອງ Hub XMLRPC API"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Hub XMLRPC API operates in a similar way to the {productname} API.  For "
"{productname} API documentation, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/{productnumber}/api/docs/index.html."
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API ເຮັດວຽກໃນລັກສະນະຄ້າຍຄືກັບ {productname} API. ສຳລັບເອກະສານ {productname} API, ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/{productnumber}/api/docs/index.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The Hub XMLRPC API exposes the same methods that are available from the "
"server's XMLRPC API, with a few differences in parameter and return types.  "
"Additionally, the Hub XMLRPC API supports some Hub-specific end points which "
"are not available in the {productname} API."
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API ມີເມທອດຄືກັບທີ່ມີໃນ XMLRPC API ຂອງເຊີເວີ, ແຕ່ມີບາງຈຸດທີ່ຕ່າງກັນໃນເລື່ອງພາຣາມີເຕີ ແລະ ປະເພດຂອງຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງກັບ. ນອກຈາກນີ, Hub XMLRPC API ຍັງຮອງຮັບບາງ endpoint ສະເພາະຂອງ Hub ທີ່ບໍ່ມີໃນ {productname} API."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:4
msgid "The Hub XMLRPC API supports three different namespaces:"
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API ຮອງຮັບ 3 namespaces ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:5
msgid "The `hub` namespace is used to target the Hub XMLRPC API Server."
msgstr "`hub` namespace ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ Hub XMLRPC API Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:6
msgid ""
"It supports Hub-specific XMLRPC endpoints which are primarily related to "
"authentication."
msgstr "ມັນຮອງຮັບຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (endpoints) XMLRPC ສະເພາະຂອງ Hub ເຊິ່ງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The `unicast` namespace is used to target a single server registered in the "
"hub."
msgstr "`unicast` namespace ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ເຊີເວີດ່ຽວທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃນ hub."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:8
msgid ""
"It redirects any call transparently to one specific server and returns any "
"value as if the server's XMLRPC API endpoint was used directly."
msgstr "ມັນຈະສົ່ງຕໍ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄປຫາເຊີເວີໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່າກັບມາຄືກັບວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ XMLRPC API endpoint ຂອງເຊີເວີນັ້ນໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The `multicast` namespace is used to target multiple peripheral servers "
"registered in the hub."
msgstr "`multicast` namespace ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ຫຼາຍເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃນ hub."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:10
msgid ""
"It redirects any call transparently to all the specified servers and returns "
"the results in the form of a `map`."
msgstr "ມັນຈະສົ່ງຕໍ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃດໆໄປຫາທຸກເຊີເວີທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢ່າງໂປ່ງໃສ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຜົນລັດໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ `map`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:11
msgid ""
"If you do not specify a namespace, all calls are transparently redirected to "
"the underlying {productname} Server XMLRPC API of the Hub Server."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ລະບຸ namespace, ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາ {productname} Server XMLRPC API ພື້ນຖານຂອງ Hub Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This allows you to call all available methods on the {productname} Server "
"XMLRPC API."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ທຸກເມທອດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Server XMLRPC API."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Methods called without specifying any of the above namespaces will be "
"forwarded to the normal XMLRPC API of the hub.  This is the API exposed on "
"ports 80 and 443."
msgstr "ເມທອດທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍບໍ່ລະບຸ namespace ຂ້າງເທິງ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາ XMLRPC API ປົກກະຕິຂອງ hub. ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນ API ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຜ່ານພອດ 80 ແລະ 443."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:14
msgid "Some important considerations for hub namespaces:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວນພິຈາລະນາທີ່ສຳຄັນບາງຢ່າງສຳລັບ hub namespaces:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Individual server IDs can be obtained using "
"`client.hub.listServerIds(hubSessionKey)`."
msgstr "ID ຂອງແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີສາມາດຂໍເອົາໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ `client.hub.listServerIds(hubSessionKey)`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The `unicast` namespace assumes all methods receive `hubSessionKey` and "
"serverID as their first two parameters, then any other parameter as "
"specified by the regular Server API."
msgstr "`unicast` namespace ຈະສົມມຸດວ່າທຸກເມທອດໄດ້ຮັບ `hubSessionKey` ແລະ serverID ເປັນສອງພາຣາມິເຕີທຳອິດ, ຕາມດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີອື່ນໆຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໂດຍ Server API ປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client.unicast.[namespace].[methodName](hubSessionKey, serverId, param1, "
"param2)\n"
msgstr "client.unicast.[namespace].[methodName](hubSessionKey, serverId, param1, param2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:18
msgid "The `hubSessionKey` can be obtained using different authentication methods."
msgstr "`hubSessionKey` ສາມາດຂໍເອົາໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The `multicast` namespace assumes all methods receive `hubSessionKey`, a "
"list of `ServerID` values, then lists of per-server parameters as specified "
"by the regular server XMLRPC API."
msgstr "`multicast` namespace ຈະສົມມຸດວ່າທຸກເມທອດໄດ້ຮັບ `hubSessionKey`, ລາຍຊື່ຂອງຄ່າ `ServerID`, ຕາມດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໂດຍ server XMLRPC API ປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The return value is a `map`, with `Successful` and `Failed` entries for each "
"server involved in the call."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນແມ່ນ `map`, ໂດຍມີລາຍການ `Successful` ແລະ `Failed` ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client.multicast.[namespace].[methodname](hubSessionKey, [serverId1, "
"serverId2], [param1_s1, param1_s2], [param2_s1, param2_s2])\n"
msgstr "client.multicast.[namespace].[methodname](hubSessionKey, [serverId1, serverId2], [param1_s1, param1_s2], [param2_s1, param2_s2])\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub Online Synchronization"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ Hub ແບບອອນລາຍ"

#. OM 2025-04-28: shall we write hub or Hub, peripheral or Peripheral? In the GUI, I saw mixed cases.
#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction "
msgstr "ບົດນຳ "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Hub online synchronization is the primary mechanism for connecting "
"peripheral servers to the hub.  It establishes the underlying connection "
"required for other hub features: "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-api.adoc[Hub XMLRPC API] and "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc[Hub Reporting]."
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ Hub ແບບອອນລາຍແມ່ນກົນໄກຫຼັກສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍເຂົ້າກັບ hub. ມັນສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພື້ນຖານທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບຟີເຈີອື່ນໆຂອງ hub: xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-api.adoc[Hub XMLRPC API] ແລະ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc[ການລາຍງານຂອງ Hub]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:4
msgid ""
"It reuses the existing repository synchronization and synchronizes channels "
"in the peripheral servers from the repositories on the hub server."
msgstr "ມັນນຳໃຊ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ repository ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຄືນໃໝ່ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ channel ໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຈາກ repository ໃນ hub server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When the connection between hub and peripheral server is established, the "
"hub server becomes the main source of data for the peripheral server.  In "
"case of vendor channels, hub server is effectively replacing {scclongform}.  "
"In case of custom channels, when they are synchronized, the peripheral "
"server will fetch the packages from the hub and not from the original "
"location of the custom channel defined on the hub."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ hub ແລະ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຖືກຕັ້ງຂຶ້ນ, hub server ຈະກາຍເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັກສຳລັບເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ. ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງ vendor channels, hub server ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ແທນ {scclongform} ໂດຍກົງ. ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງ custom channels, ເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ, ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຈະດຶງແພັກເກັດຈາກ hub ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງເດີມຂອງ custom channel ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ hub."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:6
msgid "The main characteristics of this feature are:"
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະຫຼັກຂອງຟີເຈີນີແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:7
msgid ""
"There can only be one hub server per connection, with one or more peripheral "
"servers."
msgstr "ສາມາດມີ hub server ໄດ້ພຽງເຄື່ອງດຽວຕໍ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ຮ່ວມກັບເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໜຶ່ງເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:8
msgid "Each peripheral server can only have one hub server."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງສາມາດມີ hub server ໄດ້ພຽງເຄື່ອງດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:9
msgid "Content can be synchronized on regular basis, or on demand."
msgstr "ເນື້ອຫາສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນໄດ້ເປັນປະຈຳ ຫຼື ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registration of the hub and peripheral servers"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ hub ແລະ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Hub online synchronization is configured from menu menu:Admin[Hub "
"Configuration]."
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ Hub ແບບອອນລາຍແມ່ນຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ຈາກເມນູ menu:Admin[Hub Configuration]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Configuration process uses token which uniquely identifies peripheral "
"server's connection to the hub."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະໃຊ້ token ເຊິ່ງລະບຸຕົວຕົນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍກັບ hub ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:13
msgid "There are two ways to register a peripheral server to the hub server:"
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການລົງທະບຽນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍກັບ hub server:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:14
msgid ""
"by using a combination of token creation on the peripheral, and subsequent "
"registration on the hub server.  This method uses "
"<<peripheral-token-generation>> and <<token-transfer>>."
msgstr "ໂດຍການໃຊ້ການສ້າງ token ໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ ແລະ ຕາມດ້ວຍການລົງທະບຽນໃນ hub server. ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ <<peripheral-token-generation>> ແລະ <<token-transfer>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:15
msgid ""
"by direct registration from the hub, without any user interactions with the "
"peripheral server.  This method is described in <<direct-registration>>."
msgstr "ໂດຍການລົງທະບຽນໂດຍກົງຈາກ hub, ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີການໂຕ້ຕອບຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ກັບເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ. ວິທີນີ້ຖືກອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ <<direct-registration>>."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In any case, if the peripheral host should be managed by the hub, you must "
"first bootstrap the host as a minion to the hub before proceeding with the "
"registration of the peripheral server.  If the bootstrapping happens later, "
"two systems are shown in the systems list."
msgstr "ໃນທຸກກໍລະນີ, ຖ້າ peripheral host ຄວນຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ hub, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງ bootstrap host ນັ້ນໃຫ້ເປັນ minion ຂອງ hub ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການລົງທະບຽນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ. ຖ້າການ bootstrapping ເກີດຂຶ້ນພາຍຫຼັງ, ຈະມີສອງລະບົບສະແດງໃນລາຍຊື່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registration from peripheral server by token generation"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນຈາກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໂດຍການສ້າງ token"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Before being registered to the hub server, a token needs to be generated on "
"the peripheral server and passed to the administrator of the hub server."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລົງທະບຽນກັບ hub server, ຕ້ອງສ້າງ token ໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ ແລະ ສົ່ງໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງ hub server."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating token on the peripheral server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ token ໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:20
msgid ""
"On the peripheral server, go to menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Access "
"Tokens]."
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Access Tokens]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:21
msgid "Click button btn:[Add token] and select option `Issue new token`."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Add token] ແລະ ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ `Issue new token`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the field `Server FQDN` on the form that opens type the FQDN of the hub "
"server that will be using this token."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Server FQDN` ຂອງແບບຟອມທີ່ເປີດຂຶ້ນມາ, ໃຫ້ພິມ FQDN ຂອງ hub server ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ token ນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:23
msgid "Click btn:[Issue]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Issue]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:24
msgid ""
"A new form with the successfully generated token appears and button "
"btn:[Copy]."
msgstr "ແບບຟອມໃໝ່ພ້ອມກັບ token ທີ່ສ້າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນ ພ້ອມກັບປຸ່ມ btn:[Copy]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The only time token is displayed is at the time of its creation.  Save it in "
"a safe place until it is later needed."
msgstr "Token ຈະຖືກສະແດງພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວໃນຕອນທີ່ສ້າງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກມັນໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ປອດໄພຈົນກວ່າຈະຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:26
msgid "Once generated, the token appears on the screen `Access Tokens`."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງແລ້ວ, token ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຈໍ `Access Tokens`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The generated token needs to be transferred to the hub server before it can "
"be used."
msgstr "Token ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ hub server ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering to the hub server with the token"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນກັບ hub server ດ້ວຍ token"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:29
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:42
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:95
msgid ""
"On the hub server, go to menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Peripherals "
"Configuration]."
msgstr "ໃນ hub server, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Peripherals Configuration]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:30
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Click button btn:[Add peripheral].  A new form `Register a new peripheral "
"server` opens."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Add peripheral]. ແບບຟອມໃໝ່ `Register a new peripheral server` ຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນມາ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:31
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:44
msgid ""
"In the field `Peripheral Server FQDN` enter the name of the peripheral "
"server."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Peripheral Server FQDN` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:32
msgid "In the field `Registration mode` select option `Existing token`."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Registration mode` ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ `Existing token`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the field `Token` paste the token that was created on the peripheral "
"server."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Token` ໃຫ້ວາງ token ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:34
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:48
msgid ""
"In the field `Root CA certificate` specify the certificate using one of the "
"options:"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Root CA certificate` ໃຫ້ລະບຸໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໂດຍໃຊ້ໜຶ່ງໃນຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:35
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Use option `Not needed` if both hub and peripheral servers have the same "
"certificate authority."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `Not needed` ຖ້າທັງ hub server ແລະ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໃຊ້ CA ດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:36
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Use option `Upload a file` if the servers have different certificate "
"authorities to upload a certificate file."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `Upload a file` ຖ້າເຊີເວີໃຊ້ CA ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ ເພື່ອອັບໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:37
msgid "Use option `Paste a PEM certificate` to paste a certificate."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `Paste a PEM certificate` ເພື່ອວາງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Click button btn:[Register].  A newly registered peripheral server will "
"appear on screen `Peripherals Configuration`."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Register]. ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຈໍ `Peripherals Configuration`."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registration from the hub server directly"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນຈາກ hub server ໂດຍກົງ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:40
msgid ""
"It is possible to initiate the registration of a peripheral server from hub "
"server, without any interaction with the peripheral server."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລີ່ມການລົງທະບຽນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໄດ້ຈາກ hub server ໂດຍກົງ, ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີການໂຕ້ຕອບໃດໆກັບເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Direct registering from the hub server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນໂດຍກົງຈາກ hub server"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In the field `Registration mode` select option `Administrator "
"User/Password`."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Registration mode` ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ `Administrator User/Password`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:46
msgid ""
"In the fields `Username` and `Password` enter the credentials for the "
"peripheral server."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Username` ແລະ `Password` ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບສຳລັບເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:47
msgid ""
"The credentials must be those of `SUSE Manager Administrator` of the "
"peripheral server."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບຕ້ອງເປັນຂອງ `SUSE Manager Administrator` ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:51
msgid "Use option `Paste a PEM certificate` in cases when PEM certificate is used."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `Paste a PEM certificate` ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນແບບ PEM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:52
msgid "Click button btn:[Register]."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Register]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:53
msgid ""
"The newly registered peripheral server will be shown in the "
"menu:Systems[System List] with the value `Foreign` in the column `System "
"Type`."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນ menu:Systems[System List] ໂດຍມີຄ່າ `Foreign` ໃນຄໍລຳ `System Type`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:54
msgid ""
"To access its details, click on the peripheral server's name and select tab "
"menu:Details[Peripheral Server]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ ແລະ ເລືອກແທັບ menu:Details[Peripheral Server]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Peripheral server uses hub to access the vendor channels and does not "
"connect to the {scclongform} directly.  Therefore, if you open configured "
"peripheral server's page menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization "
"Credentials], menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] or menu:Admin[Setup Wizard "
"> PAYG Connections], you will see a notification that this is peripheral "
"server and its connections are managed via hub."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໃຊ້ hub ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ vendor channels ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {scclongform} ໂດຍກົງ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າເປີດໜ້າຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວໃນ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials], menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] ຫຼື menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > PAYG Connections], ເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ແມ່ນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງມັນຖືກຈັດການຜ່ານ hub."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access tokens"
msgstr "Access tokens"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:57
msgid ""
"All existing tokens are shown in menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Access "
"Tokens]."
msgstr "Token ທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນ menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Access Tokens]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:58
msgid ""
"A token can viewed as `Consumed` and `Issued`, both from the perspective of "
"the peripheral and the hub server."
msgstr "Token ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ເປັນ `Consumed` (ຖືກໃຊ້) ແລະ `Issued` (ຖືກອອກໃຫ້), ທັງຈາກມຸມມອງຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ ແລະ hub server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:59
msgid "From the perspective of the peripheral server:"
msgstr "ຈາກມຸມມອງຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:60
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Consumed"
msgstr "Consumed (ຖືກໃຊ້)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:61
msgid ""
"The `Consumed`token is generated on the peripheral server and received by "
"the hub server to be used."
msgstr "`Consumed` token ແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ ແລະ ຖືກຮັບໂດຍ hub server ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:62
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Issued"
msgstr "ອອກໃຫ້ເມື່ອ (Issued)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:63
msgid ""
"The `Issued` token is issued by the hub server to be used by the peripheral "
"server."
msgstr "`Issued` token ແມ່ນຖືກອອກໂດຍ hub server ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍນຳໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:64
msgid "From the perspective of the hub server:"
msgstr "ຈາກມຸມມອງຂອງ hub server:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:66
msgid ""
"The `Consumed`token is generated on the hub server and received by the "
"peripheral server to be used."
msgstr "`Consumed` token ແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ hub server ແລະ ຖືກຮັບໂດຍເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:68
msgid ""
"The `Issued` token is issued by the peripheral server to be used by the hub "
"server."
msgstr "`Issued` token ແມ່ນຖືກອອກໂດຍເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍເພື່ອໃຫ້ hub server ນຳໃຊ້."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Token operations"
msgstr "ການຈັດການ Token"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:70
msgid "A token can be invalidated, or deleted."
msgstr "Token ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້ (invalidate) ຫຼື ລຶບອອກໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Be careful when using option btn:[Invalidate] as it no longer grants access "
"to the other server.  This operation ensures that no communication will "
"happen until a new token is generated if the existing one is compromised, or "
"until the current token is reactivated.  Invalidated token can be made valid "
"again at any time."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງໃນການໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ btn:[Invalidate] ເພາະມັນຈະບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງອີກເຊີເວີໜຶ່ງໄດ້. ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການສື່ສານເກີດຂຶ້ນຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການສ້າງ token ໃໝ່ (ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ token ເດີມຖືກລະເມີດຄວາມປອດໄພ) ຫຼື ຈົນກວ່າ token ປັດຈຸບັນຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄືນໃໝ່. Token ທີ່ຖືກ invalidate ແລ້ວ ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ກັບມາໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຄືນທຸກເວລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:72
msgid ""
"It is possible to delete a token.  Deleting is only possible when the server "
"associated with the token is not registered as hub or peripheral.  This "
"operation cannot be undone."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດລຶບ token ໄດ້. ການລຶບຈະເຮັດໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຊີເວີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ token ນັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນ hub ຫຼື peripheral. ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຍົກເລີກໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access hub server details from the peripheral server"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ hub server ຈາກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:74
msgid "Every peripheral server stores the information about its hub server."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທຸກເຄື່ອງຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ hub server ຂອງມັນໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:75
msgid "A peripheral server can only have one hub server configured."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ hub server ໄດ້ພຽງເຄື່ອງດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Accessing hub server details"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຂົ້າເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ hub server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:77
msgid "On the peripheral server, go to menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Hub Details]."
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Hub Details]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:78
msgid "On the screen `Hub Details` find the information about the hub server."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ `Hub Details` ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ hub server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:79
msgid "Field `Hub server FQDN` shows the hub server's FQDN."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ `Hub server FQDN` ສະແດງ FQDN ຂອງ hub server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:80
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:100
msgid ""
"Field `Registration date` shows the time when the peripheral server was "
"registered to the hub server."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ `Registration date` ສະແດງເວລາທີ່ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຖືກລົງທະບຽນກັບ hub server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:81
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:101
msgid "Field `Last modified` shows the time of the last saved configuration change."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ `Last modified` ສະແດງເວລາທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:82
msgid ""
"Field `Root Certificate Authority` shows certificate details.  To download, "
"edit or delete the root certificate, clicking btn:[Download], btn:[Edit] or "
"btn:[Delete] respectively.  Deleting the certificate will break the "
"connection between servers."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ `Root Certificate Authority` ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ. ເພື່ອດາວໂຫລດ, ແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ລຶບ root certificate, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Download], btn:[Edit] ຫຼື btn:[Delete] ຕາມລຳດັບ. ການລຶບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີຂາດຫາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:83
msgid ""
"Field `GPG Public Key` shows whether the GPG key has been configured for the "
"hub server.  For more information about GPG keys between hub and peripheral "
"servers, see <<gpg-for-hub-online-sync>>."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ `GPG Public Key` ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າໄດ້ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ GPG key ສຳລັບ hub server ຫຼື ບໍ່. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ GPG keys ລະຫວ່າງ hub ແລະ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ, ເບິ່ງ <<gpg-for-hub-online-sync>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:84
msgid ""
"Field `Mirror credentials` is the username the peripheral server uses when "
"connecting to the hub server to synchronize vendor channels.  This username "
"is generated automatically on the hub server, and then transmitted to the "
"peripheral server during the registration phase."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ `Mirror credentials` ແມ່ນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໃຊ້ເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ hub server ເພື່ອຊິງໂຄຣໄນ vendor channels. ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ hub server, ແລະ ຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG key usage with hub online synchronization"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ GPG key ຮ່ວມກັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ Hub ແບບອອນລາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:86
msgid ""
"When the metadata on the hub server are signed with a GPG key, the public "
"key is automatically transmitted from hub to peripheral server."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ metadata ໃນ hub server ຖືກເຊັນດ້ວຍ GPG key, public key ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຈາກ hub ໄປຫາເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:87
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} is not signing metadata.  Therefore, when the "
"peripheral server is downloading data from the hub server there is no way of "
"checking if the downloaded metadata have a valid signature, unless the "
"customer has created their own GPG key."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊັນ metadata. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍດາວໂຫລດຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ hub server ຈະບໍ່ມີທາງກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າ metadata ທີ່ດາວໂຫລດມານັ້ນມີລາຍເຊັນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່, ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ລູກຄ້າຈະສ້າງ GPG key ຂອງຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:88
msgid ""
"To enable checking of the data integrity, the GPG key needs to be created on "
"the hub.  When the peripheral server is configured to communicate with the "
"hub, the public GPG key will then automatically be transferred to it."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຕ້ອງສ້າງ GPG key ໃນ hub. ເມື່ອເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ສື່ສານກັບ hub, public GPG key ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາສິ່ງນັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:89
msgid ""
"When the GPG key is created on the hub, field `GPG Public Key` will be set "
"to show that this server is using the GPG key.  For more information about "
"setting up own GPG key, see xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ GPG key ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ hub, ຊ່ອງ `GPG Public Key` ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອສະແດງວ່າເຊີເວີນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ GPG key. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ GPG key ຂອງຕົນເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access peripheral server details from the hub server"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຈາກ hub server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:91
msgid ""
"On the hub server, the menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Peripherals "
"Configuration] page displays the information about all the peripheral "
"servers currently registered."
msgstr "ໃນ hub server, ໜ້າ menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Peripherals Configuration] ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Peripheral servers list columns"
msgstr "ຄໍລຳໃນລາຍຊື່ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column                      | Description\n"
"| Peripheral FQDN             | Fully qualified domain name of the "
"peripheral server.\n"
"| N. of synced channels       | Number of the channels currently "
"synchronized from the hub to this peripheral.\n"
"| N. of synced organizations  | Number of peripheral organization currently "
"owning the synchronized channels.\n"
"| Download Root CA            | Action to download the current root "
"certificate authority, if different from the one used by the hub\n"
"| Delete                      | Action to deregister the peripheral server\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄໍລຳ                      | ລາຍອະທິບາຍ\n"
"| Peripheral FQDN             | Fully qualified domain name ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ.\n"
"| N. of synced channels       | ຈຳນວນ channel ທີ່ຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນຈາກ hub ໄປຍັງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍນີ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"| N. of synced organizations  | ຈຳນວນອົງກອນສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງ channel ທີ່ຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນໃນປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"| Download Root CA            | ການປະຕິບັດການເພື່ອດາວໂຫລດ root CA ປັດຈຸບັນ, ຖ້າມັນຕ່າງຈາກ CA ທີ່ hub ໃຊ້\n"
"| Delete                      | ການປະຕິບັດການເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Accessing the details of a peripheral server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຂົ້າເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:96
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:110
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:124
msgid "Find the perpheral server on the list"
msgstr "ຊອກຫາເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໃນລາຍຊື່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:97
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:111
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:125
msgid ""
"Click the fully qualified domain name of the peripheral server to access its "
"details."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ fully qualified domain name ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍເພື່ອເຂົ້າເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:98
msgid "On the screen `Peripheral Details` ."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ `Peripheral Details`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:99
msgid "Field `Peripheral server FQDN` shows the peripheral server's FQDN."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ `Peripheral server FQDN` ສະແດງ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:102
msgid ""
"Field `Root Certificate Authority` shows certificate details.  To download, "
"edit or delete the root certificate, respectively click btn:[Download], "
"btn:[Edit] or btn:[Delete].  Deleting the certificate will break the "
"connection between servers."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ `Root Certificate Authority` ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ. ເພື່ອດາວໂຫລດ, ແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ລຶບ root certificate, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Download], btn:[Edit] ຫຼື btn:[Delete] ຕາມລຳດັບ. ການລຶບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີຂາດຫາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:103
msgid ""
"Field `Mirror credentials` is the username the peripheral server uses when "
"connecting to the hub server to synchronize vendor channels."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ `Mirror credentials` ແມ່ນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໃຊ້ເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ hub server ເພື່ອຊິງໂຄຣໄນ vendor channels."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:104
msgid ""
"This username is generated automatically on the hub server, and then "
"transmitted to the peripheral server during the registration phase.  To "
"generate new credentials, click btn:[Regenerate Credentials].  This action "
"will create a new password and transmit it securely to the peripheral "
"server."
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ hub server, ແລະ ຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການລົງທະບຽນ. ເພື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Regenerate Credentials]. ການປະຕິບັດການນີ້ຈະສ້າງລະຫັດຜ່ານໃໝ່ ແລະ ສົ່ງມັນໄປຫາເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຢ່າງປອດໄພ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:105
msgid ""
"Field `Synchronized channels` shows the number of currently synchronized "
"channels and organization."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ `Synchronized channels` ສະແດງຈຳນວນ channel ແລະ ອົງກອນທີ່ຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize channels from hub to peripheral server"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ channel ຈາກ hub ໄປຍັງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:107
msgid ""
"Synchronizing vendor channels for the configured hub and server is done via "
"dedicated user interface."
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ vendor channels ສຳລັບ hub ແລະ server ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ ແມ່ນເຮັດຜ່ານ interface ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໂດຍສະເພາະ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing channels from hub to peripheral server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ channel ຈາກ hub ໄປຍັງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:109
msgid "Go to menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Peripherals Configuration]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Peripherals Configuration]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:112
msgid "In the field `Synchronized channels` click on btn:[Edit channels]."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Synchronized channels` ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Edit channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:113
msgid "Page `Sync Channels from Hub to Peripheral` opens."
msgstr "ໜ້າ `Sync Channels from Hub to Peripheral` ຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:114
msgid "Select the channels you want to synchronize."
msgstr "ເລືອກ channel ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:115
msgid ""
"For custom channels also select the target organization on the peripheral "
"from the dropdown."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ custom channels, ໃຫ້ເລືອກອົງກອນປາຍທາງໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຈາກລາຍການ dropdown ຄືກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:116
msgid ""
"The drop-down list exists only for custom channels which do not yet exist on "
"the peripheral server.  If the channel exists, the organization stays "
"unchanged."
msgstr "ລາຍການ drop-down ຈະມີໃຫ້ເລືອກສະເພາະ custom channels ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າ channel ນັ້ນມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ອົງກອນຈະຄືເກົ່າບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:117
msgid "Click btn:[Apply Changes] to view the summary of your changes."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Apply Changes] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງບົດສະຫຼຸບການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:118
msgid "A pop-up window with the summary of your selections will open."
msgstr "ໜ້າຕ່າງ pop-up ພ້ອມກັບບົດສະຫຼຸບການເລືອກຂອງເຈົ້າຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:119
msgid "Click btn:[Confirm] to confirm the selection."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນການເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:120
msgid ""
"Following the confirmation, the channels will be created on the peripheral "
"server and everything will be set up to mirror the channels during the next "
"regular repository synchronization task."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຢືນຢັນ, channel ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ ແລະ ທຸກຢ່າງຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອເຮັດ mirror channel ໃນລະຫວ່າງວຽກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ repository ປົກກະຕິຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:121
msgid "The repository synchronization can be initated from the peripheral server."
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ repository ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ຈາກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Initiating repository synchronization from the peripheral server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຊິງໂຄຣໄນ repository ຈາກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:123
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:132
msgid "Go to menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Hub Details]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Hub Details]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:126
msgid "Click btn:[Sync Channels]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Sync Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:127
msgid "Confirm the operation by clicking btn:[Schedule] on the pop-up window."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນການປະຕິບັດການໂດຍຄລິກ btn:[Schedule] ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ pop-up."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:128
msgid "The full channel synchronization will start in the background."
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ channel ແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນໃນເບື້ອງຫຼັງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deregister peripheral server"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:130
msgid ""
"Deregistration can happen from both sides, from the hub or from the "
"peripheral server."
msgstr "ການຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຈາກທັງສອງຝ່າຍ, ທັງຈາກ hub ຫຼື ຈາກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deregistering from the peripheral server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນຈາກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:133
msgid "Click btn:[Deregister]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Deregister]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:134
msgid "Confirm the operation by clicking btn:[Deregister] on the pop-up window."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນການປະຕິບັດການໂດຍຄລິກ btn:[Deregister] ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ pop-up."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:135
msgid "Page menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Hub Details] is now empty."
msgstr "ໜ້າ menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Hub Details] ຈະວ່າງເປົ່າໃນຕອນນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:136
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deregistering from the hub server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນຈາກ hub server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:137
msgid "Go to menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Peripheral Configuration]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Hub Configuration > Peripheral Configuration]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:138
msgid "Find the perpheral server on the list."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໃນລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:139
msgid "Click btn:[Deregister] next to the peripheral server's name."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Deregister] ຂ້າງຊື່ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc:140
msgid "The peripheral server is no longer shown on the list."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃນລາຍຊື່ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub Reporting"
msgstr "ການອອກລາຍງານຂອງ Hub"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Hub Reporting extends the "
"xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc[Reporting Database] feature by "
"aggregating reporting data from all connected peripheral {productname} "
"servers into a single central reporting database on the Hub."
msgstr "ການລາຍງານຂອງ Hub ຂະຫຍາຍຟີເຈີ xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc[Reporting Database] ໂດຍການຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານຈາກທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຂອງ {productname} ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ ເຂົ້າເປັນຖານຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານສູນກາງດຽວໃນ Hub."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For general reporting database setup, user creation, schema documentation, "
"and Grafana dashboard integration, see "
"xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຖານຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານທົ່ວໄປ, ການສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ເອກະສານ schema, ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Grafana dashboard, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub Architecture"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງ Hub"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:5
msgid "In a hub deployment:"
msgstr "ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ hub:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:6
msgid ""
"the reporting database in the {productname} Hub stores, collects, and "
"aggregates data coming from the reporting databases of all peripheral "
"servers,"
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານໃນ {productname} Hub ຈະເກັບຮັກສາ, ລວບລວມ ແລະ ຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມາຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານຂອງທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:7
msgid ""
"the reporting database in the {productname} Hub also stores its own data "
"from systems directly connected to and managed by the Hub,"
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານໃນ {productname} Hub ຍັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງມັນເອງຈາກລະບົບທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ Hub,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:8
msgid ""
"the reporting database on each peripheral {productname} server stores only "
"its own data,"
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຂອງ {productname} ແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ ຈະເກັບສະເພາະຂໍ້ມູນຂອງມັນເອງ,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:9
msgid ""
"external reporting tools can connect to either the Hub or any peripheral "
"{productname} server."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືການລາຍງານຈາກພາຍນອກສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້ທັງ Hub ຫຼື ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຂອງ {productname} ເຄື່ອງໃດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The connection between hub and peripheral servers is established via hub "
"online synchronization.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ hub ແລະ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ ແມ່ນຖືກຕັ້ງຂຶ້ນຜ່ານການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ Hub ແບບອອນລາຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-online-sync.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub Data Aggregation"
msgstr "ການຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ Hub"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The `update-reporting-hub-default` schedule fetches and aggregates reporting "
"data from all registered peripheral servers.  For a description of both "
"taskomatic reporting schedules, see "
"xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງວຽກ `update-reporting-hub-default` ຈະດຶງ ແລະ ຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານຈາກທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ. ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຕາຕະລາງການລາຍງານ taskomatic ທັງສອງແບບ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:13
msgid ""
"If peripheral servers are in different timezones, align all "
"`update-reporting-default` schedules so that every peripheral server has "
"finished its local job before `update-reporting-hub-default` runs on the "
"Hub."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຢູ່ໃນເຂດເວລາ (timezone) ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, ໃຫ້ປັບຕາຕະລາງວຽກ `update-reporting-default` ທັງໝົດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍສຳເລັດວຽກໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງມັນເອງກ່ອນທີ່ `update-reporting-hub-default` ຈະລັນໃນ Hub."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:14
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງ (Tuning)"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "`report_db_hub_workers`"
msgstr "`report_db_hub_workers`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of workers requesting data from "
"peripheral servers on a hub at the same point in time.\n"
"| Tune when            | The number of peripheral servers increases "
"significantly (more than 100), or a faster synchronization is required.\n"
"| Value default        | 2\n"
"| Value recommendation | 2 - 10\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `report_db_hub_workers = 5`\n"
"| After changing       | Monitor memory and CPU usage of the hub closely "
"before and after the change.\n"
"                         Also monitor the load, CPU and memory usage of the "
"reporting database of the hub.\n"
"| Notes                | All the data collected from the peripheral server "
"must be written into the hub reporting database.\n"
"                         Tuning that database could increase the performance "
"as well.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລາຍອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນ worker ສູງສຸດທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໃນ hub ໃນເວລາພ້ອມກັນ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ຈຳນວນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ (ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 100 ເຄື່ອງ), ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການການຊິງໂຄຣໄນທີ່ໄວກວ່າເກົ່າ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 2\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 2 - 10\n"
"| ຕຳແໜ່ງ             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `report_db_hub_workers = 5`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ       | ໃຫ້ຕິດຕາມການໃຊ້ RAM ແລະ CPU ຂອງ hub ຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດທັງກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"                         ນອກຈາກນີ້ ໃຫ້ຕິດຕາມ load, ການໃຊ້ CPU ແລະ RAM ຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານຂອງ hub ນຳອີກ.\n"
"| ໝາຍເຫດ                | ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ລວບລວມມາຈາກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍຕ້ອງຖືກຂຽນລົງໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານຂອງ hub.\n"
"                         ການປັບແຕ່ງຖານຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນກໍອາດຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້ຄືກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For the `report_db_batch_size` tuning parameter, which applies to all "
"servers including the hub, see "
"xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc#reportdb-batch-size[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີການປັບແຕ່ງ `report_db_batch_size`, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ກັບທຸກເຊີເວີລວມທັງ hub, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc#reportdb-batch-size[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inter-Server Synchronization version 2"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ເວີຊັນ 2"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you have more than one {productname} installation, you will need to copy "
"contents between servers.  Inter-Server Synchronization (ISS) allows you to "
"export data from one server (hub) and import it on another server "
"(peripheral).  This is useful for hub deployment scenarios or disconnected "
"setups."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງບ່ອນ, ເເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງກັອບປີ້ເນື້ອຫາລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ. ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ (ISS) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນຈາກເຊີເວີໜຶ່ງ (hub) ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າໄປຍັງອີກເຊີເວີໜຶ່ງ (peripheral). ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຮູບແບບການຕິດຕັ້ງ hub ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Inter-Server Synchronization packages"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To use ISS you need to install the `inter-server-sync` package on hub and "
"peripheral servers."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ ISS ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ `inter-server-sync` ທັງໃນ hub ແລະ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content synchronization"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:6
msgid "Use `mgrctl term` before running steps inside the server container."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `mgrctl term` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງໆພາຍໃນ server container."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Export data on source server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນໃນເຊີເວີຕົ້ນທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:8
msgid ""
"At the command prompt of the {productname} container host of the hub server, "
"as root, enter the server container:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} container host ຂອງ hub server, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ server container:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:10
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:18
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:25
msgid "Inside the container, execute the following steps:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ container, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:11
msgid "Execute the ISS export command.  The `-h` option provides detailed help:"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງສົ່ງອອກ ISS. ຕົວເລືອກ `-h` ຈະໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "inter-server-sync export -h\n"
msgstr "inter-server-sync export -h\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The export procedure creates an output directory with all the needed data "
"for the import procedure."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການສົ່ງອອກຈະສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂາອອກພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນການນຳເຂົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:14
msgid ""
"To avoid data loss or filling up the container file system, store the data "
"on a persistent volume (preferably `/var/spacewalk`).  For more information "
"about persistent volumes, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#server-hardware-requirements[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ລະບົບຂອງ container ເຕັມ, ໃຫ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ໃນ persistent volume (ແນະນຳແມ່ນ `/var/spacewalk`). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ persistent volumes, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#server-hardware-requirements[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Copy export directory to peripheral server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກັອບປີ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄປຍັງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Contents from the hub server needs to be synchronized to the peripheral "
"server.  At the command prompt of the {productname} container host of the "
"hub server, as root, enter the server container:"
msgstr "ເນື້ອຫາຈາກ hub server ຕ້ອງຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນໄປຍັງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ. ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} container host ຂອງ hub server, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ server container:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:19
msgid "Synchronize to the peripheral server:"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນໄປຍັງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "rsync -r <PATH_EXPORTED_DIR> root@<PERIPHERAL_SERVER>:~/\n"
msgstr "rsync -r <PATH_EXPORTED_DIR> root@<PERIPHERAL_SERVER>:~/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:21
msgid "When all contents is copied, start importing it."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເນື້ອຫາທັງໝົດຖືກກັອບປີ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມການນຳເຂົ້າ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Import data on peripheral server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນໃນເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:23
msgid ""
"At the command prompt of the {productname} container host of the peripheral "
"server, as root, enter the server container:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} container host ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ server container:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:26
msgid "Execute the ISS import command.  The `-h` option provides detailed help:"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນຳເຂົ້າ ISS. ຕົວເລືອກ `-h` ຈະໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "inter-server-sync import -h\n"
msgstr "inter-server-sync import -h\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database connection configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Database connection configuration is loaded by default from "
"`/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`.  Properties file location can be overridden with "
"parameter `--serverConfig`."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກໂຫລດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`. ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ properties ສາມາດຖືກແທນທີ່ໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີ `--serverConfig`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Known limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:31
msgid "Hub and peripheral servers need to be on the same version."
msgstr "Hub ແລະ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ ຕ້ອງເປັນເວີຊັນດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Export and import organization should have exactly the same name.  The "
"organization name is case sensitive."
msgstr "ອົງກອນທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າ ຄວນມີຊື່ຄືກັນຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ຊື່ຂອງອົງກອນແມ່ນມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ ຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ ແລະ ໃຫຍ່ (case sensitive)."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring Large Scale Deployments"
msgstr "ການເຝົ້າລະວັງການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can monitor your {productname} environment using Prometheus and "
"Grafana.  {productname} Server and Proxy are able to provide self-health "
"metrics.  You can also install and manage a number of Prometheus exporters "
"on clients."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} ຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana. {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ສາມາດສະໜອງ metrics ກ່ຽວກັບສຸຂະພາບຂອງລະບົບເອງໄດ້. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຈັດການ Prometheus exporters ຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງໃນລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Prometheus and Grafana packages are included in the {productname} Client "
"Tools for {sle}{nbsp}12, {sle}{nbsp}15, {rhel}{nbsp}7, {rhel}{nbsp}8 and "
"openSUSE 15.x."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ລວມຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Client Tools ສຳລັບ {sle}{nbsp}12, {sle}{nbsp}15, {rhel}{nbsp}7, {rhel}{nbsp}8 ແລະ openSUSE 15.x."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Prometheus and Grafana packages are included in the {productname} Client "
"Tools for {sle}{nbsp}12, {sle}{nbsp}15, {centos}{nbsp}7, {centos}{nbsp}8 and "
"openSUSE 15.x."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ລວມຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Client Tools ສຳລັບ {sle}{nbsp}12, {sle}{nbsp}15, {centos}{nbsp}7, {centos}{nbsp}8 ແລະ openSUSE 15.x."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You need to install Prometheus and Grafana on a machine separate from the "
"{productname} Server.  We recommend you use a managed client as your "
"monitoring server."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກ {productname} Server. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ (managed client) ເປັນເຊີເວີຕິດຕາມຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:6
msgid ""
"It is recommended to monitor the {salt} event bus in the large scale "
"deployments with "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-monitoring.adoc#saline[Saline] to identify "
"possible bottlenecks."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕິດຕາມ {salt} event bus ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ດ້ວຍ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-monitoring.adoc#saline[Saline] ເພື່ອລະບຸບັນຫາຄໍຂວດທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information on monitoring, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເຝົ້າລະວັງ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operation Recommendations"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳດ້ານການດຳເນີນງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains a range of recommendations for large scale "
"deployments."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຳແນະນຳຕ່າງໆ ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Always start small and scale up gradually.  Monitor the server as you scale "
"to identify problems early."
msgstr "ຄວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກຂະໜາດນ້ອຍສະເໝີ ແລະ ຄ່ອຍໆຂະຫຍາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຕິດຕາມເຊີເວີໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຈົ້າຂະຫຍາຍລະບົບເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນບັນຫາໄດ້ໄວ."

#.  Might be worth alphabetising these. LKB 2018-08-09
#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Onboarding Rate"
msgstr "ອັດຕາການນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The rate at which {productname} can onboard clients is limited and depends "
"on hardware resources.  Onboarding clients at a faster rate than "
"{productname} is configured for will build up a backlog of unprocessed "
"keys.  This slows down the process and can potentially exhaust resources.  "
"We recommend that you limit the acceptance key rate programmatically.  A "
"safe starting point would be to onboard a client every 15 seconds.  You can "
"do that with this command:"
msgstr "ອັດຕາທີ່ {productname} ສາມາດນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ (onboard) ແມ່ນມີຈຳກັດ ແລະ ຂຶ້ນກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນຮາດແວ. ການນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໄວເກີນກວ່າທີ່ {productname} ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດມີ key ທີ່ລໍຖ້າການປະມວນຜົນຄ້າງຢູ່ຫຼາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນຊ້າລົງ ແລະ ອາດຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຈົນໝົດ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຈຳກັດອັດຕາການຍອມຮັບ key ຜ່ານການຂຽນຄຳສັ່ງ. ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ປອດໄພຄືການນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບທຸກໆ 15 ວິນາທີ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for k in $(salt-key -l un|grep -v Unaccepted); do salt-key -y -a $k; sleep "
"15; done\n"
msgstr "for k in $(salt-key -l un|grep -v Unaccepted); do salt-key -y -a $k; sleep 15; done\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clients and the RNG"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ RNG"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"All communication to and from clients is encrypted.  During client "
"onboarding, {salt} uses asymmetric cryptography, which requires available "
"entropy from the Random Number Generator (RNG) facility in the kernel.  If "
"sufficient entropy is not available from the RNG, it will significantly slow "
"down communications.  This is especially true in virtualized environments.  "
"Ensure enough entropy is present, or change the virtualization host options."
msgstr "ການສື່ສານທັງໝົດໄປຫາ ແລະ ມາຈາກລູກຂ່າຍແມ່ນຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ, {salt} ຈະໃຊ້ asymmetric cryptography ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງການ entropy ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈາກ Random Number Generator (RNG) ໃນ kernel. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ entropy ພຽງພໍຈາກ RNG, ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສື່ສານຊ້າລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບ virtualized. ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຄ່າ entropy ມີພຽງພໍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຕົວເລືອກຂອງ virtualization host."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"You can check the amount of available entropy with the `cat "
"/proc/sys/kernel/random/entropy_avail`.  It should never be below 100-200."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບປະລິມານ entropy ທີ່ມີຢູ່ດ້ວຍ `cat /proc/sys/kernel/random/entropy_avail`. ມັນບໍ່ຄວນຕ່ຳກວ່າ 100-200."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clients Running with Unaccepted {salt} Keys"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍ {salt} Keys ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍອມຮັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Idle clients which have not been onboarded, that is clients running with "
"unaccepted {salt} keys, consume more resources than idle clients that have "
"been onboarded.  Generally, this consumes about an extra 2.5 Kb/s of inbound "
"network bandwidth per client.  For example, 1000 idle clients will consume "
"about 2.5 Mb/s extra.  This consumption will reduce almost to zero when "
"onboarding has been completed for all clients.  Limit the number of "
"non-onboarded clients for optimal performance."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ລ້າໆ (idle) ເຊິ່ງຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ, ນັ້ນຄືລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍ {salt} keys ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍອມຮັບ, ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບແລ້ວ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ແບນວິດເຄືອຂ່າຍຂາເຂົ້າເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນປະມານ 2.5 Kb/s ຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ລູກຂ່າຍ 1000 ເຄື່ອງ ຈະໃຊ້ແບນວິດເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນປະມານ 2.5 Mb/s. ການໃຊ້ນີ້ຈະຫຼຸດລົງເກືອບເປັນສູນເມື່ອການນຳລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບສຳເລັດ. ໃຫ້ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ onboard ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disabling the {salt} Mine"
msgstr "ການປິດໃຊ້ງານ {salt} Mine"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In older versions, {productname} used a tool called {salt} Mine to check "
"client availability.  The {salt} Mine would cause clients to contact the "
"server every hour, which created significant load.  Since the introduction "
"of a more efficient mechanism in {productname}{nbsp}3.2, the {salt} Mine is "
"no longer required.  Instead, the {productname} Server uses Taskomatic to "
"ping only the clients that appear to have been offline for twelve hours or "
"more, with all clients being contacted at least once in every twenty four "
"hour period by default.  You can adjust this by changing the "
"`web.system_checkin_threshold` parameter in `rhn.conf`.  The value is "
"expressed in days, and the default value is `1`."
msgstr "ໃນເວີຊັນເກົ່າ, {productname} ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ {salt} Mine ເພື່ອກວດສອບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. {salt} Mine ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍຕິດຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີທຸກໆຊົ່ວໂມງ ເຊິ່ງສ້າງ load ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ມີການນຳໃຊ້ກົນໄກທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບກວ່າໃນ {productname}{nbsp}3.2, {salt} Mine ກໍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ແທນທີ່ນັ້ນ, {productname} Server ຈະໃຊ້ Taskomatic ເພື່ອ ping ຫາສະເພາະເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ປາກົດວ່າ offline ເປັນເວລາ 12 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ໂດຍລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຕິດຕໍ່ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງໃນທຸກໆ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນພາຣາມິເຕີ `web.system_checkin_threshold` ໃນ `rhn.conf`. ຄ່າແມ່ນສະແດງເປັນຈຳນວນວັນ, ແລະ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `1`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Newly registered clients will have the {salt} Mine disabled by default.  If "
"the {salt} Mine is running on your system, you can reduce load by disabling "
"it.  This is especially effective if you have a large number of clients."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ {salt} Mine ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຖ້າ {salt} Mine ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເເຈົ້າສາມາດຫຼຸດ load ໄດ້ໂດຍການປິດການໃຊ້ງານມັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຫັນຜົນດີຫຼາຍຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:15
msgid "Disable the {salt} Mine by running this command on the server:"
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານ {salt} Mine ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃນເຊີເວີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:16
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:17
msgid ""
"This will restart the clients and generate some {salt} events to be "
"processed by the server.  If you have a large number of clients, handling "
"these events could create excessive load.  To avoid this, you can execute "
"the command in batch mode with this command:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ restart ລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ສ້າງເຫດການ {salt} ບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຊີເວີປະມວນຜົນ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ການຈັດການເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະສ້າງ load ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນສິ່ງນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລັນຄຳສັ່ງໃນຮູບແບບ batch mode ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:18
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:19
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:20
msgid ""
"You will need to wait for this command to finish executing.  Do not end the "
"process with kbd:[Ctrl+C]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກຈົນສຳເລັດ. ຫ້າມຍົກເລີກຂັ້ນຕອນດ້ວຍການກົດ kbd:[Ctrl+C]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable Unnecessary Taskomatic Jobs"
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານວຽກ Taskomatic ທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To minimize wasted resources, you can disable non-essential or unused "
"Taskomatic jobs."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການເສຍຊັບພະຍາກອນໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດ Taskomatic jobs ທີ່ບໍ່ສຳຄັນ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:22
msgid ""
"You can see the list of Taskomatic jobs in the {productname} {webui}, at "
"menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຂອງ Taskomatic jobs ໄດ້ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ທີ່ເມນູ menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:23
msgid ""
"To disable a job, click the name of the job you want to disable, select "
"`Disable Schedule`, and click btn:[Update Schedule]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານວຽກ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງວຽກທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ເລືອກ `Disable Schedule`, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Update Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To delete a job, click the name of the job you want to delete, and click "
"btn:[Delete Schedule]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບ job, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ job ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລຶບ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Delete Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:25
msgid "We recommend disabling these jobs:"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ປິດ jobs ເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:26
msgid "Daily comparison of configuration files: `compare-configs-default`"
msgstr "ການປຽບທຽບໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າປະຈຳວັນ: `compare-configs-default`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:27
msgid "Hourly synchronization of {cobbler} files: `cobbler-sync-default`"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນໄຟລ໌ {cobbler} ທຸກຊົ່ວໂມງ: `cobbler-sync-default`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:28
msgid "Daily gatherer and subscription matcher: `gatherer-matcher-default`"
msgstr "ຕົວຮວບຮວມ ແລະ ຕົວຈັບຄູ່ການລົງທະບຽນປະຈຳວັນ: `gatherer-matcher-default`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Do not attempt to disable any other jobs, as it could prevent {productname} "
"from functioning correctly."
msgstr "ຫ້າມປິດ jobs ອື່ນໆ, ເພາະມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ {productname} ເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Swap and Monitoring"
msgstr "Swap ແລະ ການເຝົ້າລະວັງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:31
msgid ""
"It is especially important in large scale deployments that you keep your "
"{productname} Server constantly monitored and backed up."
msgstr "ມັນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເຝົ້າລະວັງ {productname} Server ຂອງເຈົ້າຢູ່ສະເໝີ ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ (back up) ໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Swap space use can have significant impacts on performance.  If significant "
"non-transient swap usage is detected, you can increase the available "
"hardware RAM."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ Swap ສາມາດມີຜົນກະທົບຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ. ຖ້າກວດພົບການໃຊ້ swap ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງໃນປະລິມານຫຼາຍ, ເຈົ້າຄວນເພີ່ມ RAM ຂອງຮາດແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:33
msgid ""
"You can also consider tuning the Server to consume less memory.  For more "
"information on tuning, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດພິຈາລະນາປັບແຕ່ງເຊີເວີເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໜ້ອຍລົງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການປັບແຕ່ງ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "AES Key Rotation"
msgstr "ການໝູນວຽນ AES Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Communications from the {salt} Master to clients is encrypted with a single "
"AES key.  The key is rotated when:"
msgstr "ການສື່ສານຈາກ {salt} Master ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍແມ່ນຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍ AES key ດຽວ. ຄີຈະຖືກໝູນວຽນເມື່ອ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:36
msgid "The `salt-master` process is restarted, or"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການ `salt-master` ຖືກ restart, ຫຼື"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Any minion key is deleted (for example, when a client is deleted from "
"{productname})"
msgstr "ມີ minion key ໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກລຶບ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກ {productname})"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:38
msgid ""
"After the AES key has been rotated, all clients must re-authenticate to the "
"master.  By default, this happens next time a client receives a message.  If "
"you have a large number of clients (several thousands), this can cause a "
"high CPU load on the {productname} Server.  If the CPU load is excessive, we "
"recommend that you delete keys in batches, and in off-peak hours if "
"possible, to avoid overloading the server."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກ AES key ຖືກໝູນວຽນ, ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດຕ້ອງຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ master ໃໝ່. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ (ຫຼາຍພັນເຄື່ອງ), ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ CPU load ໃນ {productname} Server ສູງຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າ CPU load ສູງເກີນໄປ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າລຶບ keys ເປັນຊຸດໆ (batches), ແລະ ເຮັດໃນຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານໜາແໜ້ນ (off-peak hours) ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້ ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີເຮັດວຽກໜັກເກີນໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:39
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:20
msgid "For more information, see:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:40
msgid "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/intro_scale.html#too-many-minions-re-authing"
msgstr "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/intro_scale.html#too-many-minions-re-authing"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:41
msgid "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/getstarted/system/communication.html"
msgstr "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/getstarted/system/communication.html"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Large Deployments Guide Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຄູ່ມືການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:2
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:2
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} is designed by default to work on small and medium scale "
"installations.  For installations with more than 1000 clients per "
"{productname} Server, adequate hardware sizing and parameter tuning must be "
"performed."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ {productname} ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ ແລະ ຂະໜາດກາງ. ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍກວ່າ 1000 ເຄື່ອງຕໍ່ {productname} Server, ຕ້ອງມີການກຳນົດຂະໜາດຮາດແວທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການປັບແຕ່ງພາຣາມີເຕີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"There is no hard maximum number of supported systems.  Many factors can "
"affect how many clients can reliably be used in a particular installation.  "
"Factors can include which features are used, and how the hardware and "
"systems are configured."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບຢ່າງຕາຍຕົວ. ຫຼາຍປັດໄຈສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບໃນແຕ່ລະການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ປັດໄຈເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນລວມເຖິງຟີເຈີທີ່ໃຊ້, ແລະ ວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮາດແວ ແລະ ລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"There are two main ways to manage large scale deployments.  You can manage "
"them with a single {productname} Server, or you can use multiple servers in "
"a hub.  Both methods are described in this book."
msgstr "ມີ 2 ວິທີຫຼັກໃນການບໍລິຫານການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່. ເຈົ້າສາມາດບໍລິຫານດ້ວຍ {productname} Server ພຽງເຄື່ອງດຽວ, ຫຼື ຈະໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເຊີເວີໃນຮູບແບບ hub ກໍໄດ້. ທັງສອງວິທີແມ່ນໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນປຶ້ມຫົວນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"With large scale environments one should also consider the usage of "
"{productname} Proxies.  Sizing and location of the Proxies will dependent on "
"the deployment topology.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ຄວນພິຈາລະນາການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} Proxies. ຂະໜາດ ແລະ ສະຖານທີ່ຂອງ Proxy ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບໂທໂປໂລຢີ (topology) ຂອງການວາງລະບົບ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Additionally, if you are operating within a Retail environment, you can use "
"{productname} {smr} to manage large deployments of point-of-service "
"terminals.  There is an introduction to {productname} {smr} in this book."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າເຮັດວຽກໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການຄ້າປີກ (Retail), ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} {smr} ເພື່ອບໍລິຫານການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂອງຈຸດບໍລິການ (point-of-service terminals). ມີການແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບ {productname} {smr} ໄວ້ໃນປຶ້ມຫົວນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/overview.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Tuning and monitoring large scale deployments can differ from smaller "
"installations.  This book contains guidance for both tuning and monitoring "
"within larger installations."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ການເຝົ້າລະວັງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ອາດຈະຕ່າງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ. ປຶ້ມຫົວນີປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຳແນະນຳທັງການປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ການເຝົ້າລະວັງສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing Large Scale Deployments in a Retail Environment"
msgstr "ການບໍລິຫານການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການຄ້າປີກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} {productnumber} is an open source infrastructure "
"management solution, optimized and tailored specifically for the retail "
"industry.  It uses the same technology as {susemgr}, but is customized to "
"address the needs of retail organizations."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} {productnumber} ແມ່ນໂຊລູຊັນບໍລິຫານຈັດການໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານແບບ open source, ທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອອຸດສາຫະກຳການຄ້າປີກໂດຍສະເພາະ. ມັນໃຊ້ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີດຽວກັນກັບ {susemgr}, ແຕ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງອົງກອນການຄ້າປີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} is designed for use in retail situations where customers "
"can use point-of-service terminals to purchase or exchange goods, take part "
"in promotions, or collect loyalty points.  In addition to retail "
"installations, it can also be used for novel purposes, such as maintaining "
"student computers in an educational environment, or self-service kiosks in "
"banks or hospitals."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນສະຖານະການການຄ້າປີກ ບ່ອນທີ່ລູກຄ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຈຸດບໍລິການເພື່ອຊື້ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນເຄື່ອງ, ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມໂປຣໂມຊັນ, ຫຼື ສະສົມຄະແນນ. ນອກຈາກການຄ້າປີກແລ້ວ, ມັນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການເບິ່ງແຍງຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງນັກຮຽນໃນສະຖາບັນການສຶກສາ, ຫຼື ຕູ້ບໍລິການຕົນເອງ (self-service kiosks) ໃນທະນາຄານ ຫຼື ໂຮງໝໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} is intended for use in installations that include "
"servers, workstations, point-of-service terminals, and other devices.  It "
"allows administrators to install, configure, and update the software on "
"their servers, and manage the deployment and provisioning of "
"point-of-service machines."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີທັງເຊີເວີ, ເຄື່ອງເວີກສະເຕຊັນ, ຈຸດບໍລິການ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນອື່ນໆ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ບໍລິຫານລະບົບສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ອັບເດດຊອບແວໃນເຊີເວີ, ລວມທັງບໍລິຫານການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຈັດກຽມເຄື່ອງຈຸດບໍລິການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Point-of-Service (POS) terminals can come in many different formats, such as "
"point-of-sale terminals, kiosks, digital scales, self-service systems, and "
"reverse-vending systems.  Every terminal, however, is provided by a vendor, "
"who set basic information about the device in the firmware.  {productname} "
"{smr} accesses this vendor information to determine how best to work with "
"the terminal in use."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງຈຸດບໍລິການ (POS) ສາມາດມີໄດ້ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ ເຊັ່ນ ເຄື່ອງຄິດເງິນ, ຕູ້ຄີອອດ, ຊິງດິຈິຕອນ, ລະບົບບໍລິການຕົນເອງ ແລະ ລະບົບຮັບຄືນສິນຄ້າອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ທຸກໆເຄື່ອງແມ່ນມາຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor) ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານຂອງອຸປະກອນໄວ້ໃນເຟີມແວ (firmware). {productname} {smr} ຈະເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ຜະລິດນີ້ ເພື່ອກຳນົດວິທີການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດກັບເຄື່ອງນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In most cases, different terminals will require a different operating system "
"(OS) image to ensure they work correctly.  For example, an information kiosk "
"has a high-resolution touchscreen, where a cashier terminal might only have "
"a very basic display.  While both of these terminals require similar "
"processing and network functionality, they will require different OS "
"images.  The OS images ensure that the different display mechanisms work "
"correctly."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ເຄື່ອງທີ່ຕ່າງກັນຈະຕ້ອງການ OS image ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຕູ້ຄີອອດຂໍ້ມູນຈະມີໜ້າຈໍສຳຜັດທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຄື່ອງຄິດເງິນອາດຈະມີໜ້າຈໍສະແດງຜົນແບບພື້ນຖານ. ເຖິງວ່າເຄື່ອງທັງສອງຈະຕ້ອງການການປະມວນຜົນ ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, ແຕ່ພວກມັນກໍຕ້ອງການ OS image ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນນັ້ນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about setting up and using {productname} {smr}, see "
"xref:retail:retail-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ {productname} {smr}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:retail:retail-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/retail-large-scale.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information about setting up and using {productname} {smr}, see "
"xref:retail:uyuni-retail-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {smr}, ເບິ່ງ xref:retail:uyuni-retail-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/single-server.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using a Single Server to Manage Large Scale Deployments"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ເຊີເວີດ່ຽວເພື່ອບໍລິຫານການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/single-server.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section discusses how to set up a single {productname} Server to manage "
"a large number of clients.  It contains some recommendations for hardware "
"and networking, and an overview of the tuning parameters that you need to "
"consider in a large scale deployment."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະເວົ້າເຖິງວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server ພຽງເຄື່ອງດຽວເພື່ອບໍລິຫານລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຳແນະນຳສຳລັບຮາດແວ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ລວມທັງພາບລວມຂອງພາຣາມີເຕີໃນການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງພິຈາລະນາໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning Large Scale Deployments"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The instructions in this section can have severe and catastrophic "
"performance impacts when improperly used.  In some cases, they can cause "
"{productname} to completely cease functioning.  Always test changes before "
"implementing them in a production environment.  During implementation, take "
"care when changing parameters.  Monitor performance before and after each "
"change, and revert any steps that do not produce the expected result."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອາດມີຜົນກະທົບທີ່ຮຸນແຮງຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຫາກໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ {productname} ຢຸດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ເລີຍ. ຄວນທົດສອບການປ່ຽນແປງສະເໝີກ່ອນຈະນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການເຮັດວຽກຈິງ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງການປັບແຕ່ງ, ໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງໃນການປ່ຽນແປງພາຣາມີເຕີ. ໃຫ້ຕິດຕາມປະສິດທິພາບທັງກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງການປ່ຽນແປງ, ແລະ ໃຫ້ຍົກເລີກຂັ້ນຕອນໃດໆກໍຕາມທີ່ບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜົນຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:4
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend that you contact SUSE Consulting for assistance with "
"tuning."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຕິດຕໍ່ SUSE Consulting ເພື່ອຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:5
msgid ""
"SUSE will not provide support for catastrophic failure when these advanced "
"parameters are modified without consultation."
msgstr "SUSE ຈະບໍ່ໃຫ້ການສະໜັບສະໜູນສຳລັບຄວາມຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວທີ່ຮຸນແຮງ ຫາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງພາຣາມີເຕີຂັ້ນສູງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄຳປຶກສາ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Tuning is not required on installations of fewer than 1000 clients.  Do not "
"perform these instructions on small or medium scale installations."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການປັບແຕ່ງສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີລູກຂ່າຍໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 1000 ເຄື່ອງ. ຫ້າມເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ ຫຼື ຂະໜາດກາງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Tuning Process"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການປັບແຕ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Any {productname} installation is subject to a number of design and "
"infrastructure constraints that, for the purposes of tuning, we call "
"environmental variables.  Environmental variables can include the total "
"number of clients, the number of different operating systems under "
"management, and the number of software channels."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃດໆກໍຕາມ ລ້ວນແຕ່ຂຶ້ນກັບຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານການອອກແບບ ແລະ ໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານ ເຊິ່ງໃນການປັບແຕ່ງພວກເຮົາຈະເອີ້ນວ່າ ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environmental variables). ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ລວມເຖິງຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດ, ຈຳນວນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນພາຍໃຕ້ການບໍລິຫານ, ແລະ ຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Environmental variables influence, either directly or indirectly, the value "
"of most configuration parameters.  During the tuning process, the "
"configuration parameters are manipulated to improve system performance."
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈະສົ່ງຜົນທັງທາງກົງ ແລະ ທາງອ້ອມຕໍ່ຄ່າຂອງພາຣາມີເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການປັບແຕ່ງ, ພາຣາມີເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກປັບເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Before you begin tuning, you will need to estimate the best setting for each "
"environment variable, and adjust the configuration parameters to suit."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມການປັບແຕ່ງ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປະເມີນຄ່າທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ແລະ ປັບພາຣາມີເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:11
msgid ""
"To help you with the estimation process, we have provided you with a "
"dependency graph.  Locate the environmental variables on the dependency "
"graph to determine how they will influence other variables and parameters."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນຂະບວນການປະເມີນ, ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຈັດກຽມແຜນພູມຄວາມສຳພັນ (dependency graph) ໄວ້ໃຫ້. ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນແຜນພູມເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າມັນຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຕົວປ່ຽນ ແລະ ພາຣາມີເຕີອື່ນໆແນວໃດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Environmental variables are represented by graph nodes in a rectangle at the "
"top of the dependency graph.  Each node is connected to the relevant "
"parameters that might need tuning.  Consult the relevant sections in this "
"document for more information about recommended values."
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຖືກແທນດ້ວຍໂນດ (nodes) ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງສຸດຂອງແຜນພູມ. ແຕ່ລະໂນດຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທີ່ອາດຕ້ອງມີການປັບແຕ່ງ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳໄດ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຂອງເອກະສານນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Tuning one parameter might require tuning other parameters, or changing "
"hardware, or the infrastructure.  When you change a parameter, follow the "
"arrows from that node on the graph to determine what other parameters might "
"need adjustment.  Continue through each parameter until you have visited all "
"nodes on the graph."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງພາຣາມີເຕີໜຶ່ງອາດຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບພາຣາມີເຕີອື່ນໆນຳ, ຫຼື ອາດຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຮາດແວ ຫຼື ໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າປ່ຽນພາຣາມີເຕີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຕາມລູກສອນຈາກໂນດນັ້ນໃນແຜນພູມ ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າພາຣາມີເຕີອື່ນໃດທີ່ອາດຕ້ອງປັບນຳ. ເຮັດແບບນັ້ນໄປເລື້ອຍໆຈົນຄົບທຸກໂນດໃນແຜນພູມ."

#.  missing file?
#. type: Positional ($1) AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning dependency graph"
msgstr "ແຜນພູມຄວາມສຳພັນໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ"

#.  missing file?
#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "parameter_graph.svg"
msgstr "parameter_graph.svg"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key to the Dependency Graph"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍສັນຍະລັກໃນແຜນພູມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:17
msgid "3D boxes are hardware design variables or constraints"
msgstr "ກ່ອງແບບ 3D ແມ່ນຕົວປ່ຽນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານການອອກແບບຮາດແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:18
msgid "Oval-shaped boxes are software or system design variables or constraints"
msgstr "ກ່ອງຮູບວົງມົນແມ່ນຕົວປ່ຽນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານການອອກແບບຊອບແວ ຫຼື ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Rectangle-shaped boxes are configurable parameters, color-coded by "
"configuration file:"
msgstr "ກ່ອງຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກແມ່ນພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້, ໂດຍແຍກສີຕາມໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:20
msgid "Red: Apache `httpd` configuration files"
msgstr "ສີແດງ: ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Apache `httpd`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:21
msgid "Blue: Salt configuration files"
msgstr "ສີຟ້າ: ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:22
msgid "Brown: Tomcat configuration files"
msgstr "ສີນ້ຳຕານ: ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Tomcat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:23
msgid "Grey: PostgreSQL configuration files"
msgstr "ສີເທົາ: ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ PostgreSQL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:24
msgid "Purple: `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`"
msgstr "ສີມ່ວງ: `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Dashed connecting lines indicate a variable or constraint that might require "
"a change to another parameter"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບຂີດປະ ໝາຍເຖິງຕົວປ່ຽນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທີ່ອາດຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນພາຣາມີເຕີອື່ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Solid connecting lines indicate that changing a configuration parameter "
"requires checking another one to prevent issues"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບເສັ້ນທຶບ ໝາຍເຖິງການປ່ຽນພາຣາມີເຕີໜຶ່ງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບອີກອັນໜຶ່ງເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບັນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:27
msgid ""
"After the initial tuning has been completed, you will need to consider "
"tuning again in these cases:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການປັບແຕ່ງເບື້ອງຕົ້ນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງພິຈາລະນາປັບແຕ່ງໃໝ່ໃນກໍລະນີເຫຼົ່ານີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:28
msgid "If your tuning inputs change significantly"
msgstr "ຖ້າຂໍ້ມູນປັດໄຈທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການປັບແຕ່ງມີການປ່ຽນແປງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:29
msgid "If special conditions arise that require a certain parameter to be changed."
msgstr "ຖ້າເກີດເງື່ອນໄຂພິເສດທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນພາຣາມີເຕີບາງຢ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:30
msgid "For example, if specific warnings appear in a log file."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າຄຳເຕືອນສະເພາະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ (log)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:31
msgid "If performance is not satisfactory"
msgstr "ຖ້າປະສິດທິພາບຍັງບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ໜ້າເພິ່ງພໍໃຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:32
msgid ""
"To re-tune your installation, you will need to use the dependency graph "
"again.  Start from the node where significant change has happened."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແຜນພູມຄວາມສຳພັນອີກຄັ້ງ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກໂນດທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ສຳຄັນເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload files larger then 1GB"
msgstr "ອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 1GB"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Uploading files larger then 1GB"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 1GB"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:35
msgid "On the server, step inside the container environment:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ເຊີເວີ, ເຂົ້າໄປໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ (container):"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Create new file `/etc/apache2/conf.d/maxrequestbody.conf` to make request "
"size unlimited:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ `/etc/apache2/conf.d/maxrequestbody.conf` ເພື່ອກຳນົດໃຫ້ຂະໜາດການຮ້ອງຂໍບໍ່ຈຳກັດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "LimitRequestBody 0 \n"
msgstr "LimitRequestBody 0 \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:39
msgid "Restart apache by running:"
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດ apache ໂດຍການສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart apache2\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart apache2\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Environmental Variables"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:42
msgid ""
"This section contains information about environmental variables (inputs to "
"the tuning process)."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (ຂໍ້ມູນນຳເຂົ້າສຳລັບຂະບວນການປັບແຕ່ງ)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Bandwidth"
msgstr "ແບນວິດເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:44
msgid ""
"A measure of the typically available egress bandwith from the {productname} "
"Server host to the clients or {productname} Proxy hosts.  This should take "
"into account network hardware and topology as well as possible capacity "
"limits on switches, routers, and other network equipment between the server "
"and clients."
msgstr "ການວັດແທກແບນວິດຂາອອກ (egress bandwidth) ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປທີ່ມີຈາກ {productname} Server host ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື {productname} Proxy hosts. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນພິຈາລະນາທັງຮາດແວເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍ (topology) ລວມເຖິງຂີດຈຳກັດຄວາມສາມາດຂອງ switch, router ແລະ ອຸປະກອນເຄືອຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel count"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel count)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:46
msgid ""
"The number of expected channels to manage.  Includes any vendor-provided, "
"third-party, and cloned or staged channels."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ຄາດວ່າຈະບໍລິຫານ. ລວມເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມາຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ, ຈາກພາຍນອກ (third-party), ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກ clone ຫຼື staged ໄວ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client count"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ (Client count)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:48
msgid ""
"The total number of actual or expected clients.  It is important to tune any "
"parameters in advance of a client count increase, whenever possible."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈິງ ຫຼື ທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ມັນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງພາຣາມີເຕີໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າກ່ອນທີ່ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "OS mix"
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະສົມຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (OS mix)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:50
msgid ""
"The number of distinct operating system versions that managed clients have "
"installed.  This is ordered by family ({sle}, openSUSE, {rhel}, or {ubuntu} "
"based).  Storage and computing requirements are different in each case."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂອງເວີຊັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ເຊິ່ງຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍພາຍໃຕ້ການບໍລິຫານ. ນີ້ຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມຕາມຕະກູນ (ອີງຕາມ {sle}, openSUSE, {rhel}, ຫຼື {ubuntu}). ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການປະມວນຜົນຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປໃນແຕ່ລະກໍລະນີ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "User count"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຜູ້ໃຊ້ (User count)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:52
msgid ""
"The expected maximum amount of concurrent users interacting with the {webui} "
"plus the number of programs simultaneously using the XMLRPC API.  Includes "
"`spacecmd`, `spacewalk-clone-by-date`, and similar."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ ເຊິ່ງຈະໃຊ້ງານ {webui} ພ້ອມກັນ ລວມທັງຈຳນວນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ໃຊ້ XMLRPC API ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ລວມເຖິງ `spacecmd`, `spacewalk-clone-by-date` ແລະ ອື່ນໆທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "ພາຣາມີເຕີ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:54
msgid "This section contains information about the available parameters."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "`MaxRequestWorkers`"
msgstr "`MaxRequestWorkers`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of HTTP requests served "
"simultaneously by Apache httpd.\n"
"                         Proxies, {webui}, and XMLRPC API clients each "
"consume one.\n"
"                         Requests exceeding the parameter will be queued and "
"might result in timeouts.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:user-count[User count] and proxy count "
"increase significantly and this line appears in "
"`/var/log/apache2/error_log`: `[...] [mpm_prefork:error] [pid ...] AH00161: "
"server reached MaxRequestWorkers setting, consider raising the "
"MaxRequestWorkers setting`.\n"
"| Value default        | 150\n"
"| Value recommendation | 150-500\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/apache2/server-tuning.conf`, in the "
"`prefork.c` section\n"
"| Example              | `MaxRequestWorkers = 200`\n"
"| After changing       | Immediately change xref:server-limit[`ServerLimit`] "
"and check xref:max-threads[`maxThreads`] for possible adjustment.\n"
"| Notes                | This parameter was renamed to `MaxRequestWorkers`, "
"both names are valid.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/en/mod/mpm_common.html#maxrequestworkers\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງການຮ້ອງຂໍ HTTP ທີ່ Apache httpd ໃຫ້ບໍລິການພ້ອມກັນ.\n"
"                         ແຕ່ລະ Proxy, {webui}, ແລະ XMLRPC API ໄຄລແອນ ຈະນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງລະໜຶ່ງ.\n"
"                         ການຮ້ອງຂໍທີ່ເກີນຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະຖືກຈັດຄິວໄວ້ ແລະ ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດ timeout.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:user-count[ຈຳນວນຜູ້ໃຊ້] ແລະ ຈຳນວນ proxy ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ປາກົດໃນ `/var/log/apache2/error_log`: `[...] [mpm_prefork:error] [pid ...] AH00161: server reached MaxRequestWorkers setting, consider raising the MaxRequestWorkers setting`.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 150\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 150-500\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/apache2/server-tuning.conf`, ໃນສ່ວນ `prefork.c` \n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `MaxRequestWorkers = 200`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ xref:server-limit[`ServerLimit`] ທັນທີ ແລະ ກວດສອບ xref:max-threads[`maxThreads`] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ.\n"
"| ໝາຍເຫດ                | ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່ເປັນ `MaxRequestWorkers`, ທັງສອງຊື່ແມ່ນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/en/mod/mpm_common.html#maxrequestworkers\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ServerLimit`"
msgstr "`ServerLimit`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of Apache httpd processes serving HTTP "
"requests simultaneously.\n"
"                         The number must equal "
"xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`].\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`] "
"changes\n"
"| Value default        | 150\n"
"| Value recommendation | The same value as "
"xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`]\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/apache2/server-tuning.conf`, in the "
"`prefork.c` section\n"
"| Example              | `ServerLimit = 200`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/en/mod/mpm_common.html#serverlimit\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນຂອງໂປຣເຊສ Apache httpd ທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ HTTP ພ້ອມໆກັນ.\n"
"                         ຄ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງເທົ່າກັບ xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`].\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 150\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | ຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`]\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/apache2/server-tuning.conf`, ໃນສ່ວນ `prefork.c` \n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `ServerLimit = 200`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/en/mod/mpm_common.html#serverlimit\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "`maxThreads`"
msgstr "`maxThreads`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of Tomcat threads dedicated to serving "
"HTTP requests\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`] "
"changes.\n"
"                         `maxThreads` must always be equal or greater than "
"xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`]\n"
"| Value default        | 150\n"
"| Value recommendation | The same value as "
"xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`]\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/tomcat/server.xml`\n"
"| Example              | `<Connector port=\"8009\" protocol=\"AJP/1.3\" "
"redirectPort=\"8443\" URIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" address=\"127.0.0.1\" "
"maxThreads=\"200\" connectionTimeout=\"20000\"/>`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-9.0-doc/config/http.html\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນຂອງ Tomcat threads ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໃຫ້ບໍລິການ HTTP\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"                         `maxThreads` ຕ້ອງເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`] ສະເໝີ\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 150\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | ຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ xref:max-request-workers[`MaxRequestWorkers`]\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/tomcat/server.xml`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `<Connector port=\"8009\" protocol=\"AJP/1.3\" redirectPort=\"8443\" URIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" address=\"127.0.0.1\" maxThreads=\"200\" connectionTimeout=\"20000\"/>`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-9.0-doc/config/http.html\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "`connectionTimeout`"
msgstr "`connectionTimeout`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of milliseconds before a non-responding "
"AJP connection is forcibly closed.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly and `AH00992`, `AH00877`, and `AH01030` errors appear in "
"Apache error logs during a load peak.\n"
"| Value default        | 900000\n"
"| Value recommendation | 20000-3600000\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/tomcat/server.xml`\n"
"| Example              | `<Connector port=\"8009\" protocol=\"AJP/1.3\" "
"redirectPort=\"8443\" URIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" address=\"127.0.0.1\" "
"maxThreads=\"200\" connectionTimeout=\"1000000\" "
"keepAliveTimeout=\"300000\"/>`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-9.0-doc/config/http.html\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນມິນລີວິນາທີກ່ອນທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ AJP ທີ່ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຈະຖືກບັງຄັບໃຫ້ປິດ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນໄຄລແອນ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ `AH00992`, `AH00877`, ແລະ `AH01030` ປາກົດໃນ Apache error logs ໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານສູງສຸດ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 900000\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 20000-3600000\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/tomcat/server.xml`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `<Connector port=\"8009\" protocol=\"AJP/1.3\" redirectPort=\"8443\" URIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" address=\"127.0.0.1\" maxThreads=\"200\" connectionTimeout=\"1000000\" keepAliveTimeout=\"300000\"/>`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-9.0-doc/config/http.html\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "`keepAliveTimeout`"
msgstr "`keepAliveTimeout`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of milliseconds without data exchange "
"from the JVM before a non-responding AJP connection is forcibly closed.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly and `AH00992`, `AH00877`, and `AH01030` errors appear in "
"Apache error logs during a load peak.\n"
"| Value default        | 300000\n"
"| Value recommendation | 20000-600000\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/tomcat/server.xml`\n"
"| Example              | `<Connector port=\"8009\" protocol=\"AJP/1.3\" "
"redirectPort=\"8443\" URIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" address=\"127.0.0.1\" "
"maxThreads=\"200\" connectionTimeout=\"1000000\" "
"keepAliveTimeout=\"400000\"/>`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-9.0-doc/config/http.html\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນມິນລີວິນາທີທີ່ບໍ່ມີການແລກປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ JVM ກ່ອນທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ AJP ທີ່ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຈະຖືກບັງຄັບໃຫ້ປິດ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນໄຄລແອນ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ `AH00992`, `AH00877`, ແລະ `AH01030` ປາກົດໃນ Apache error logs ໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານສູງສຸດ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 300000\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 20000-600000\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/tomcat/server.xml`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `<Connector port=\"8009\" protocol=\"AJP/1.3\" redirectPort=\"8443\" URIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" address=\"127.0.0.1\" maxThreads=\"200\" connectionTimeout=\"1000000\" keepAliveTimeout=\"400000\"/>`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-9.0-doc/config/http.html\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tomcat's `-Xmx`"
msgstr "Tomcat's `-Xmx`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum amount of memory Tomcat can use\n"
"| Tune when            | "
"xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] "
"is increased or\n"
"`OutOfMemoryException` errors appear in `/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`\n"
"| Value default        | 1{nbsp}GiB\n"
"| Value recommendation | 4-8{nbsp}GiB\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/tomcat/conf.d/tomcat_java_opts.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `JAVA_OPTS=\"... -Xmx8G ...\"`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage]\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.oracle.com/javase/8/docs/technotes/tools/windows/java.html\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງສຸດທີ່ Tomcat ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] ຖືກເພີ່ມ ຫຼື\n"
"ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ `OutOfMemoryException` ປາກົດໃນ `/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 1{nbsp}GiB\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 4-8{nbsp}GiB\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/tomcat/conf.d/tomcat_java_opts.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `JAVA_OPTS=\"... -Xmx8G ...\"`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ]\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://docs.oracle.com/javase/8/docs/technotes/tools/windows/java.html\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.disable_list_update_status`"
msgstr "`java.disable_list_update_status`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Disable displaying the update status for clients of "
"a system group\n"
"| Tune when            | displaying the update status causes timeouts\n"
"| Value default        | `false`\n"
"| Value recommendation | \n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `java.disable_list_update_status = true`\n"
"| After changing       | ?\n"
"| Notes                |\n"
"| More information     | `man rhn.conf`\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ປິດການສະແດງສະຖານະການອັບເດດສຳລັບໄຄລແອນຂອງກຸ່ມລະບົບ\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ການສະແດງສະຖານະການອັບເດດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ timeout\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | `false`\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | \n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.disable_list_update_status = true`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ?\n"
"| ໝາຍເຫດ                |\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | `man rhn.conf`\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`"
msgstr "`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of threads in Tomcat dedicated "
"to asynchronous operations\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly\n"
"| Value default        | 5\n"
"| Value recommendation | 50 - 150\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `java.message_queue_thread_pool_size = 50`\n"
"| After changing       | Check "
"xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`], as each thread "
"consumes a PostgreSQL connection, starvation might happen if the allocated "
"connection pool is insufficient.\n"
"                         Check xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`], as each "
"thread might perform Salt API calls, starvation might happen if the "
"allocated Salt thread pool is insufficient.\n"
"                         Check xref:tomcat-xmx[Tomcat's `-Xmx`], as each "
"thread consumes memory, `OutOfMemoryException` might be raised if "
"insufficient.\n"
"| Notes                | Incoming Salt events are handled in separate thread "
"pool, see "
"xref:java-salt-event-thread-pool-size[`java.salt_event_thread_pool_size`]\n"
"| More information     | `man rhn.conf`\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ threads ໃນ Tomcat ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກແບບ asynchronous\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນໄຄລແອນ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 5\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 50 - 150\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.message_queue_thread_pool_size = 50`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`], ເນື່ອງຈາກແຕ່ລະ thread ຈະໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ PostgreSQL, ອາດເກີດການຂາດແຄນ (starvation) ຫາກຄິວການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"                         ກວດສອບ xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`], ເນື່ອງຈາກແຕ່ລະ thread ອາດຈະມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt API, ອາດເກີດການຂາດແຄນຫາກ Salt thread pool ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"                         ກວດສອບ xref:tomcat-xmx[Tomcat's `-Xmx`], ເນື່ອງຈາກແຕ່ລະ thread ຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ, ອາດເກີດ `OutOfMemoryException` ຫາກບໍ່ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"| ໝາຍເຫດ                | ເຫດການ Salt ຂາເຂົ້າແມ່ນຖືກຈັດການໃນ thread pool ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ເບິ່ງ xref:java-salt-event-thread-pool-size[`java.salt_event_thread_pool_size`]\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | `man rhn.conf`\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.salt_batch_size`"
msgstr "`java.salt_batch_size`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of minions concurrently "
"executing a scheduled action.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] reaches several "
"thousands and actions are not executed quickly enough.\n"
"| Value default        | 200\n"
"| Value recommendation | 200-500\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `java.salt_batch_size = 300`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"                         Monitor memory usage closely before and after the "
"change.\n"
"| More information     | "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[Salt Rate Limiting]\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ minions ທີ່ປະຕິບັດງານຕາມກຳນົດການພ້ອມກັນ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນໄຄລແອນ] ມີຫຼາຍພັນເຄື່ອງ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ໄວພຽງພໍ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 200\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 200-500\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.salt_batch_size = 300`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"
"                         ຕິດຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດຕັ້ງແຕ່ກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc[Salt Rate Limiting]\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.salt_event_thread_pool_size`"
msgstr "`java.salt_event_thread_pool_size`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of threads in Tomcat dedicated "
"to handling of incoming Salt events.\n"
"| Tune when            | The number of queued Salt events grows. Typically, "
"this can happen during onboarding of large number of minions with higher "
"value of\n"
"                         "
"xref:java-salt-presence-ping-timeout[`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`].\n"
"                         The number of events can be queried by `echo "
"\"select count(*) from susesaltevent;\" \\| spacewalk-sql "
"--select-mode-direct - `\n"
"| Value default        | 8\n"
"| Value recommendation | 20-100\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `java.salt_event_thread_pool_size = 50`\n"
"| After changing       | Check the length of Salt event queue.\n"
"                         Check "
"xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`], as each thread "
"consumes a PostgreSQL connection, starvation might happen if the allocated "
"connection pool is insufficient.\n"
"                         Check xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`], as each "
"thread might perform Salt API calls, starvation might happen if the "
"allocated Salt thread pool is insufficient.\n"
"                         Check xref:tomcat-xmx[Tomcat's `-Xmx`], as each "
"thread consumes memory, `OutOfMemoryException` might be raised if "
"insufficient.\n"
"| More information     | `man rhn.conf`\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ threads ໃນ Tomcat ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຈັດການເຫດການ Salt ຂາເຂົ້າ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ຈຳນວນຄິວຂອງເຫດການ Salt ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຮັບໄຄລແອນ (onboarding) ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ໂດຍທີ່ມີຄ່າ xref:java-salt-presence-ping-timeout[`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`] ສູງ.\n"
"                         ຈຳນວນເຫດການສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ໂດຍ: `echo \"select count(*) from susesaltevent;\" \\| spacewalk-sql --select-mode-direct - `\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 8\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 20-100\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.salt_event_thread_pool_size = 50`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບຄວາມຍາວຂອງຄິວເຫດການ Salt.\n"
"                         ກວດສອບ xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`], ເນື່ອງຈາກແຕ່ລະ thread ຈະໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ PostgreSQL, ອາດເກີດການຂາດແຄນຫາກຄິວການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"                         ກວດສອບ xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`], ເນື່ອງຈາກແຕ່ລະ thread ອາດຈະມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt API, ອາດເກີດການຂາດແຄນຫາກ Salt thread pool ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"                         ກວດສອບ xref:tomcat-xmx[Tomcat's `-Xmx`], ເນື່ອງຈາກແຕ່ລະ thread ຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ, ອາດເກີດ `OutOfMemoryException` ຫາກບໍ່ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | `man rhn.conf`\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`"
msgstr "`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Before any action is executed on a client, a "
"presence ping is executed to make sure the client is reachable.\n"
"                         This parameter sets the amount of time before a "
"second command (in most cases `state.apply` or any other {salt} function) is "
"sent to the client to verify its presence.\n"
"                         Having many clients typically means some will "
"respond faster than others, so this timeout could be raised to accommodate "
"for the slower ones.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly, or some clients are responding correctly but too slowly, and "
"{productname} excludes them from calls.\n"
"                         This line appears in `/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`: "
"`\"Got no result for <COMMAND> on minion <MINION_ID> (minion did not respond "
"in time)\"`\n"
"| Value default        | 4 seconds\n"
"| Value recommendation | 4-20 seconds\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 10`\n"
"| After changing       | Large `java.salt_presence_ping_timeout` value can "
"reduce overall throughput.\n"
"                         This can be compensated by increasing "
"xref:java-salt-event-thread-pool-size[`java.salt_event_thread_pool_size`]\n"
"| More information     | "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-timeouts.adoc[Salt Timeouts]\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປະຕິບັດງານໃດໆໃນໄຄລແອນ, ຈະມີການເຮັດ presence ping ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄຄລແອນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້.\n"
"                         ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງທີສອງ (ໂດຍສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນ `state.apply` ຫຼື ຟັງຊັນ {salt} ອື່ນໆ) ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາໄຄລແອນເພື່ອຢືນຢັນການມີຢູ່.\n"
"                         ການມີໄຄລແອນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບາງເຄື່ອງຈະຕອບສະໜອງໄວກວ່າເຄື່ອງອື່ນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄ່າ timeout ນີ້ອາດຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຮອງຮັບເຄື່ອງທີ່ຊ້າກວ່າ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນໄຄລແອນ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ຫຼື ໄຄລແອນບາງເຄື່ອງຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ຖືກຕ້ອງແຕ່ຊ້າເກີນໄປ, ແລະ {productname} ຕັດພວກມັນອອກຈາກການເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"                         ຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ປາກົດໃນ `/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`: `\"Got no result for <COMMAND> on minion <MINION_ID> (minion did not respond in time)\"`\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 4 ວິນາທີ\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 4-20 ວິນາທີ\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 10`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ຄ່າ `java.salt_presence_ping_timeout` ທີ່ສູງອາດຈະຫຼຸດປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍລວມ (throughput).\n"
"                         ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຊົດເຊີຍໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ xref:java-salt-event-thread-pool-size[`java.salt_event_thread_pool_size`]\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-timeouts.adoc[Salt Timeouts]\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout`"
msgstr "`java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Before any action is executed on a client, a "
"presence ping is executed to make sure the client is reachable.\n"
"                         After "
"xref:java-salt-presence-ping-timeout[`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`] "
"seconds have elapsed without a response, a second command (in most cases "
"`state.apply` or any other {salt} function) is sent to the client and if "
"there is no response from the client for the amount of seconds specified "
"with this parameter one more call (`saltutil.find_job`) is sent for a final "
"check.\n"
"                         This parameter sets the number of seconds after the "
"second command after which the client is definitely considered timeout.\n"
"                         Having many clients typically means some will "
"respond faster than others, so this timeout could be raised to accommodate "
"for the slower ones.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly, or some clients are responding correctly but too slowly, and "
"{productname} excludes them from calls.\n"
"                         This line appears in `/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`: "
"`\"Got no result for <COMMAND> on minion <MINION_ID> (minion did not respond "
"in time)\"`\n"
"| Value default        | 1 second\n"
"| Value recommendation | 1-50 seconds\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout = 20`\n"
"| More information     | "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-timeouts.adoc[Salt Timeouts]\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການໃດໆກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ຈະມີການກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ (presence ping) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ໄດ້.\n"
"                         ຫຼັງຈາກເວລາຜ່ານໄປ xref:java-salt-presence-ping-timeout[`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`] ວິນາທີໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຕອບສະໜອງ, ຄຳສັ່ງທີສອງ (ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນ `state.apply` ຫຼື ຟັງຊັນ {salt} ອື່ນໆ) ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ມີການຕອບສະໜອງຈາກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍພາຍໃນຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນພາລາມິເຕີນີ້, ຈະມີການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງອີກຄັ້ງໜຶ່ງ (`saltutil.find_job`) ເພື່ອເປັນການກວດສອບຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ.\n"
"                         ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ກຳນົດຈຳນວນວິນາທີຫຼັງຈາກຄຳສັ່ງທີສອງ ເຊິ່ງຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກຖືວ່າໝົດເວລາຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ.\n"
"                         ການທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບາງເຄື່ອງຈະຕອບສະໜອງໄວກວ່າເຄື່ອງອື່ນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ເວລາໝົດເວລານີ້ສາມາດປັບເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຮອງຮັບເຄື່ອງທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຊ້າກວ່າ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍບາງເຄື່ອງຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງແຕ່ຊ້າເກີນໄປ, ແລະ {productname} ໄດ້ຕັດພວກມັນອອກຈາກການເອີ້ນໃຊ້.\n"
"                         ຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນ `/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`: `\"Got no result for <COMMAND> on minion <MINION_ID> (minion did not respond in time)\"`\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 1 ວິນາທີ\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 1-50 ວິນາທີ\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout = 20`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-timeouts.adoc[ການກຳນົດເວລາຂອງ Salt]\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "`java.taskomatic_channel_repodata_workers`"
msgstr "`java.taskomatic_channel_repodata_workers`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Whenever content is changed in a software channel, "
"its metadata needs to be recomputed before clients can use it.\n"
"                         Channel-altering operations include the addition of "
"a patch, the removal of a package or a repository synchronization run.\n"
"                         This parameter specifies the maximum number of "
"Taskomatic threads that {productname} will use to recompute the channel "
"metadata.\n"
"                         Channel metadata computation is both CPU-bound and "
"memory-heavy, so raising this parameter and operating on many channels "
"simultaneously could cause Taskomatic to consume significant resources, but "
"channels will be available to clients sooner.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:channel-count[Channel count] becomes larger "
"than 50, or more concurrent operations on channels are expected.\n"
"| Value default        | 2\n"
"| Value recommendation | 2-10\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `java.taskomatic_channel_repodata_workers = 4`\n"
"| After changing       | Check "
"xref:taskomatic-java-maxmemory[`taskomatic.java.maxmemory`] for adjustment, "
"as every new thread will consume memory\n"
"| More information     | `man rhn.conf`\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງເນື້ອໃນໃນ software channel, metadata ຂອງມັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຄຳນວນໃໝ່ກ່ອນທີ່ໄຄລແອນຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"                         ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງແຊນແນວລວມເຖິງການເພີ່ມແພັດ (patch), ການລຶບແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງເກັບ (repository synchronization).\n"
"                         ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ກຳນົດຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ Taskomatic threads ທີ່ {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄຳນວນ channel metadata ຄືນໃໝ່.\n"
"                         ການຄຳນວນ metadata ແມ່ນໃຊ້ CPU ແລະ ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງ, ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ Taskomatic ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ແຊນແນວຈະພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບໄຄລແອນໄວຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:channel-count[ຈຳນວນແຊນແນວ] ມີຫຼາຍກວ່າ 50, ຫຼື ຄາດວ່າມີການດຳເນີນການໃນຫຼາຍແຊນແນວພ້ອມກັນ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 2\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 2-10\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `java.taskomatic_channel_repodata_workers = 4`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:taskomatic-java-maxmemory[`taskomatic.java.maxmemory`] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງ, ເນື່ອງຈາກແຕ່ລະ thread ທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | `man rhn.conf`\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "`taskomatic.java.maxmemory`"
msgstr "`taskomatic.java.maxmemory`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum amount of memory Taskomatic can use.\n"
"                         Generation of metadata, especially for some OSs, "
"can be memory-intensive, so this parameter might need raising depending on "
"the managed xref:os-mix[OS mix].\n"
"| Tune when            | "
"xref:java-taskomatic-channel-repodata-workers[`java.taskomatic_channel_repodata_workers`] "
"increases, OSs are added to {productname} (particularly {rhel} or {ubuntu}), "
"or `OutOfMemoryException` errors appear in "
"`/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log`.\n"
"| Value default        | 4096 MiB\n"
"| Value recommendation | 4096-16384 MiB\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `taskomatic.java.maxmemory = 8192`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"| More information     | `man rhn.conf`\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງສຸດທີ່ Taskomatic ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"                         ການສ້າງ metadata, ໂດຍສະເພາະບາງ OS, ອາດຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ອາດຈະຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຂຶ້ນກັບ xref:os-mix[ການປະສົມປະສານ OS].\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:java-taskomatic-channel-repodata-workers[`java.taskomatic_channel_repodata_workers`] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ມີການເພີ່ມ OS ເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} (ໂດຍສະເພາະ {rhel} ຫຼື {ubuntu}), ຫຼື ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ `OutOfMemoryException` ປາກົດໃນ `/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log`.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 4096 MiB\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 4096-16384 MiB\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `taskomatic.java.maxmemory = 8192`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | `man rhn.conf`\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`"
msgstr "`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of Taskomatic worker threads.\n"
"                         Increasing this value allows Taskomatic to serve "
"more clients in parallel.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly\n"
"| Value default        | 20\n"
"| Value recommendation | 20-200\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount = 100`\n"
"| After changing       | Check "
"xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`] and "
"xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`] for adjustment\n"
"| More information     | "
"http://www.quartz-scheduler.org/documentation/2.4.0-SNAPSHOT/configuration.html\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນຂອງ Taskomatic worker threads.\n"
"                         ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ Taskomatic ສາມາດບໍລິການໄຄລແອນໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນໄຄລແອນ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 20\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 20-200\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount = 100`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`] ແລະ xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງ\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | http://www.quartz-scheduler.org/documentation/2.4.0-SNAPSHOT/configuration.html\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "`org.quartz.scheduler.idleWaitTime`"
msgstr "`org.quartz.scheduler.idleWaitTime`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Cycle time for Taskomatic.\n"
"                         Decreasing this value lowers the latency of "
"Taskomatic.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] is in the "
"thousands.\n"
"| Value default        | 5000 ms\n"
"| Value recommendation | 1000-5000 ms\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `org.quartz.scheduler.idleWaitTime = 1000`\n"
"| More information     | "
"http://www.quartz-scheduler.org/documentation/2.4.0-SNAPSHOT/configuration.html\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ເວລາຮອບການເຮັດວຽກ (Cycle time) ສຳລັບ Taskomatic.\n"
"                         ການຫຼຸດຄ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດ latency ຂອງ Taskomatic.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນໄຄລແອນ] ມີເປັນຫຼັກພັນ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 5000 ms\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 1000-5000 ms\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `org.quartz.scheduler.idleWaitTime = 1000`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | http://www.quartz-scheduler.org/documentation/2.4.0-SNAPSHOT/configuration.html\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "`MinionActionExecutor.parallel_threads`"
msgstr "`MinionActionExecutor.parallel_threads`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Number of Taskomatic threads dedicated to sending "
"commands to Salt clients as a result of actions being executed.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] is in the "
"thousands.\n"
"| Value default        | 1\n"
"| Value recommendation | 1-10\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `taskomatic.minion_action_executor.parallel_threads "
"= 10`\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນ Taskomatic threads ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາ Salt clients ຈາກຜົນຂອງການປະຕິບັດງານ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນໄຄລແອນ] ມີເປັນຫຼັກພັນ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 1\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 1-10\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `taskomatic.minion_action_executor.parallel_threads = 10`\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "`SSHMinionActionExecutor.parallel_threads`"
msgstr "`SSHMinionActionExecutor.parallel_threads`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Number of Taskomatic threads dedicated to sending "
"commands to Salt SSH clients as a result of actions being executed.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] is in the "
"hundreds.\n"
"| Value default        | 20\n"
"| Value recommendation | 20-100\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | "
"`taskomatic.sshminion_action_executor.parallel_threads = 40`\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນ Taskomatic threads ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາ Salt SSH clients ຈາກຜົນຂອງການປະຕິບັດງານ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນໄຄລແອນ] ມີເປັນຫຼັກຮ້ອຍ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 20\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 20-100\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `taskomatic.sshminion_action_executor.parallel_threads = 40`\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`"
msgstr "`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Maximum number of PostgreSQL connections "
"simultaneously available to both Tomcat and Taskomatic.\n"
"                         If any of those components requires more concurrent "
"connections, their requests will be queued.\n"
"| Tune when            | "
"xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] "
"or xref:max-threads[`maxThreads`] increase significantly, or when "
"xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`] "
"has changed significantly.\n"
"                         Each thread consumes one connection in Taskomatic "
"and Tomcat, having more threads than connections might result in starving.\n"
"| Value default        | 20\n"
"| Value recommendation | 100 to 200, higher than the maximum of "
"xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] "
"+ xref:max-threads[`maxThreads`] and "
"xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`]\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `hibernate.c3p0.max_size = 100`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:max-connections[`max_connections`] for "
"adjustment.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://www.mchange.com/projects/c3p0/#maxPoolSize\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ PostgreSQL ສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພ້ອມກັນສຳລັບທັງ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic.\n"
"                         ຫາກມີຄອມໂພເນັນໃດຕ້ອງການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າທີ່ມີ, ການຮ້ອງຂໍຂອງພວກມັນຈະຖືກຈັດຄິວ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] ຫຼື xref:max-threads[`maxThreads`] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອ xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ.\n"
"                         ແຕ່ລະ thread ຈະໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງອັນໃນ Taskomatic ແລະ Tomcat, ການມີ thread ຫຼາຍກວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຂາດແຄນ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 20\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 100 ຫາ 200, ຄວນສູງກວ່າຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງ (java.message_queue_thread_pool_size + maxThreads) ແລະ org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `hibernate.c3p0.max_size = 100`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:max-connections[`max_connections`] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://www.mchange.com/projects/c3p0/#maxPoolSize\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "`rhn-search.java.maxmemory`"
msgstr "`rhn-search.java.maxmemory`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum amount of memory that the `rhn-search` "
"service can use.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly, and `OutOfMemoryException` errors appear in `journalctl -u "
"rhn-search`.\n"
"| Value default        | 512 MiB\n"
"| Value recommendation | 512-4096 MiB\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `rhn-search.java.maxmemory = 4096`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສູງສຸດທີ່ບໍລິການ `rhn-search` ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ `OutOfMemoryException` ປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນ `journalctl -u rhn-search`.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 512 MiB\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 512-4096 MiB\n"
"| ທີ່ຢູ່             | `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `rhn-search.java.maxmemory = 4096`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "`shared_buffers`"
msgstr "`shared_buffers`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The amount of memory reserved for PostgreSQL shared "
"buffers, which contain caches of database tables and index data.\n"
"| Tune when            | RAM changes\n"
"| Value default        | 25% of total RAM\n"
"| Value recommendation | 25-40% of total RAM\n"
"| Location             | "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `shared_buffers = 8192MB`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-resource.html#GUC-SHARED-BUFFERS\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຈອງໄວ້ສຳລັບ PostgreSQL shared buffers, ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍ cache ຂອງຕາຕະລາງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນດັດສະນີ (index).\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | RAM ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 25% ຂອງ RAM ທັງໝົດ\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 25-40% ຂອງ RAM ທັງໝົດ\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `shared_buffers = 8192MB`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-resource.html#GUC-SHARED-BUFFERS\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_connections`"
msgstr "`max_connections`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:98
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Maximum number of PostgreSQL connections available "
"to applications.\n"
"                         More connections allow for more concurrent "
"threads/workers in various components (in particular Tomcat and Taskomatic), "
"which generally improves performance.\n"
"                         However, each connection consumes resources, in "
"particular xref:work-mem[`work_mem`] megabytes per sort operation per "
"connection.\n"
"| Tune when            | "
"xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`] changes "
"significantly, as that parameter determines the maximum number of "
"connections available to Tomcat and Taskomatic\n"
"| Value default        | 400\n"
"| Value recommendation | Depends on other settings, use "
"`/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/susemanager-connection-check` to obtain a "
"recommendation.\n"
"| Location             | "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `max_connections = 250`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"                         Monitor memory usage closely before and after the "
"change.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-connection.html#GUC-MAX-CONNECTIONS\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ PostgreSQL ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ.\n"
"                         ການມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີ threads/workers ພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນຄອມໂພເນັນຕ່າງໆ (ໂດຍສະເພາະ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic), ເຊິ່ງໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ.\n"
"                         ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ແຕ່ລະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະ xref:work-mem[`work_mem`] ເມກາໄບຕ໌ ຕໍ່ການດຳເນີນການຈັດລຽງ (sort) ຕໍ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:hibernate-c3p0-max-size[`hibernate.c3p0.max_size`] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ເນື່ອງຈາກພາຣາມິເຕີນັ້ນເປັນຕົວກຳນົດຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 400\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/susemanager-connection-check` ເພື່ອຂໍຄຳແນະນຳ.\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `max_connections = 250`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"
"                         ຕິດຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດຕັ້ງແຕ່ກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-connection.html#GUC-MAX-CONNECTIONS\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "`work_mem`"
msgstr "`work_mem`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:100
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The amount of memory allocated by PostgreSQL every "
"time a connection needs to do a sort or hash operation.\n"
"                         Every connection (as specified by "
"xref:max-connections[`max_connections`]) might make use of an amount of "
"memory equal to a multiple of `work_mem`.\n"
"| Tune when            | Database operations are slow because of excessive "
"temporary file disk I/O.\n"
"To test if that is happening, add `log_temp_files = 5120` to "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf`, "
"restart PostgreSQL, and monitor the PostgreSQL log files.\n"
"If you see lines containing `LOG:  temporary file:` try raising this "
"parameter's value to help reduce disk I/O and speed up database "
"operations.\n"
"| Value recommendation | 2-20 MB\n"
"| Location             | "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `work_mem = 10MB`\n"
"| After changing       | check if the {productname} Server might need "
"additional RAM.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-resource.html#GUC-WORK-MEM\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ PostgreSQL ຈັດສັນໃຫ້ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕ້ອງການເຮັດການຈັດລຽງ (sort) ຫຼື hash.\n"
"                         ທຸກໆການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ xref:max-connections[`max_connections`]) ອາດຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເທົ່າກັບຫຼາຍເທົ່າຂອງ `work_mem`.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ການດຳເນີນການຖານຂໍ້ມູນຊ້າລົງເນື່ອງຈາກມີການໃຊ້ disk I/O ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ.\n"
"ເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ `log_temp_files = 5120` ໃນ `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf`, ຣີສະຕາດ PostgreSQL, ແລະ ຕິດຕາມໄຟລ໌ log ຂອງ PostgreSQL.\n"
"ຫາກເຈົ້າເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີ `LOG: temporary file:` ໃຫ້ລອງເພີ່ມຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດ disk I/O ແລະ ເລັ່ງການດຳເນີນການຖານຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 2-20 MB\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `work_mem = 10MB`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບວ່າ {productname} Server ອາດຈະຕ້ອງການ RAM ເພີ່ມເຕີມຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-resource.html#GUC-WORK-MEM\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:101
#, no-wrap
msgid "`effective_cache_size`"
msgstr "`effective_cache_size`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:102
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Estimation of the total memory available to "
"PostgreSQL for caching.\n"
"                         It is the explicitly reserved memory "
"(xref:shared-buffers[`shared_buffers`]) plus any memory used by the kernel "
"as cache/buffer.\n"
"| Tune when            | Hardware RAM or memory usage increase "
"significantly\n"
"| Value recommendation | Start with 75% of total RAM.\n"
"                         For finer settings, use "
"xref:shared-buffers[`shared_buffers`] + free memory + buffer/cache memory.\n"
"                         Free and buffer/cache can be determined via the "
"`free -m` command (`free` and `buff/cache` in the output respectively)\n"
"| Location             | "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `effective_cache_size = 24GB`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage]\n"
"| Notes                | This is an estimation for the query planner, not an "
"allocation.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-query.html#GUC-EFFECTIVE-CACHE-SIZE\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ການປະເມີນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທັງໝົດທີ່ PostgreSQL ສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດ caching.\n"
"                         ມັນຄືໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຈອງໄວ້ໂດຍສະເພາະ (xref:shared-buffers[`shared_buffers`]) ລວມກັບໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃດໆທີ່ kernel ໃຊ້ເປັນ cache/buffer.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ຮາດແວ RAM ຫຼື ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ 75% ຂອງ RAM ທັງໝົດ.\n"
"                         ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ xref:shared-buffers[`shared_buffers`] + free memory + buffer/cache memory.\n"
"                         ຄ່າ Free ແລະ buffer/cache ສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ `free -m` (ເບິ່ງທີ່ `free` ແລະ `buff/cache` ໃນຜົນລັອກຕາມລຳດັບ)\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql/_data/postgresql.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `effective_cache_size = 24GB`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ]\n"
"| ໝາຍເຫດ                | ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນພຽງການປະເມີນສຳລັບ query planner, ບໍ່ແມ່ນການຈັດສັນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳແທ້.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/runtime-config-query.html#GUC-EFFECTIVE-CACHE-SIZE\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "`thread_pool`"
msgstr "`thread_pool`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of worker threads serving Salt API HTTP "
"requests.\n"
"                         A higher number can improve parallelism of "
"{productname} Server-initiated Salt operations, but will consume more "
"memory.\n"
"| Tune when            | "
"xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] "
"or "
"xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`] "
"are changed.\n"
"                         Starvation can occur when there are more Tomcat or "
"Taskomatic threads making simultaneous Salt API calls than there are Salt "
"API worker threads.\n"
"| Value default        | 100\n"
"| Value recommendation | 100-500, but should be higher than the sum of "
"xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] "
"and "
"xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`]\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`, in the "
"`rest_cherrypy` section.\n"
"| Example              | `thread_pool: 100`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:worker-threads[`worker_threads`] for "
"adjustment.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/netapi/all/salt.netapi.rest_cherrypy.html#performance-tuning\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນ worker threads ທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ Salt API HTTP requests.\n"
"                         ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດໃນການເຮັດວຽກແບບຂະໜານ (parallelism) ຂອງ Salt operations ທີ່ເລີ່ມໂດຍ {productname} Server, ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] ຫຼື xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`] ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"                         ການຂາດແຄນຊັບພະຍາກອນອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີ Tomcat ຫຼື Taskomatic threads ທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍ Salt API ພ້ອມກັນຫຼາຍກວ່າ Salt API worker threads ທີ່ມີຢູ່.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 100\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 100-500, ແຕ່ຄວນສູງກວ່າຜົນລວມຂອງ xref:java-message-queue-thread-pool-size[`java.message_queue_thread_pool_size`] ແລະ xref:org-quartz-threadPool-threadCount[`org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount`]\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`, ໃນສ່ວນ `rest_cherrypy`.\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `thread_pool: 100`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:worker-threads[`worker_threads`] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/netapi/all/salt.netapi.rest_cherrypy.html#performance-tuning\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:105
#, no-wrap
msgid "`worker_threads`"
msgstr "`worker_threads`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The number of `salt-master` worker threads that "
"process commands and replies from minions and the Salt API.\n"
"                         Increasing this value, assuming sufficient "
"resources are available, allows Salt to process more data in parallel from "
"minions without timing out, but will consume significantly more RAM "
"(typically about 70 MiB per thread).\n"
"                         Setting this value to very high values could cause "
"opposite effect as the workers will compete to each other for the CPU "
"resources and the performance could be dropped significantly.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly, xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`] increases significantly, or "
"`SaltReqTimeoutError` or `Message timed out` errors appear in "
"`/var/log/salt/master` could be a sign of too low or too high value of this "
"parameter.\n"
"| Value default        | 8\n"
"| Value recommendation | 8-32, depending on the number of the CPU cores "
"available for the server, it is recommended to keep the value slightly less "
"than the number of CPU cores.\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `worker_threads: 16`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"                         Monitor memory usage closely before and after the "
"change.\n"
"                         It makes sense to monitor the `salt-master` stats "
"event by enabling `master_stats` and adjusting `master_stats_event_iter` to "
"fine tune the value of this parameter.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#worker-threads\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນ `salt-master` worker threads ທີ່ປະມວນຜົນຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ ການຕອບກັບຈາກ minions ແລະ Salt API.\n"
"                         ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ (ຫາກມີຊັບພະຍາກອນພຽງພໍ) ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ Salt ປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ minions ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນເວລາດຽວກັນໂດຍບໍ່ເກີດ timeout, ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ RAM ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ (ປະມານ 70 MiB ຕໍ່ thread).\n"
"                         ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສູງເກີນໄປອາດສົ່ງຜົນເສຍ ເນື່ອງຈາກ workers ຈະຍາດແຍ່ງຊັບພະຍາກອນ CPU ກັນເອງ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼຸດລົງ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນໄຄລແອນ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, xref:thread-pool[`thread_pool`] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ຫຼື ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ `SaltReqTimeoutError` ຫຼື `Message timed out` ປາກົດໃນ `/var/log/salt/master`.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 8\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 8-32, ຂຶ້ນກັບຈຳນວນ CPU cores ທີ່ມີ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໜ້ອຍກວ່າຈຳນວນ CPU cores ເລັກໜ້ອຍ.\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `worker_threads: 16`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:memory-usage[ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ].\n"
"                         ຕິດຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດຕັ້ງແຕ່ກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#worker-threads\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "`auth_events`"
msgstr "`auth_events`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Determines whether the master will fire "
"authentication events. Authentication events are fired when a minion "
"performs an authentication check with the master.\n"
"                         It helps to reduce the number of events published "
"with the Salt Master Event Publisher and reduce the workload on Event "
"Publisher subscribers.\n"
"| Tune when            | Large amount of `salt/auth` events published in the "
"Salt event bus, which in most cases are useless for the subscribers.\n"
"| Value default        | True\n"
"| Value recommendation | False\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `auth_events: False`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#auth-events\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ກຳນົດວ່າ master ຈະສົ່ງເຫດການການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (authentication events) ຫຼື ບໍ່. ເຫດການນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອ minion ທຳການກວດສອບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ master.\n"
"                         ການປິດສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຈຳນວນເຫດການທີ່ຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ໃນ Salt Master Event Publisher ແລະ ຫຼຸດພາລະການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ subscribers.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ມີເຫດການ `salt/auth` ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ໃນ Salt event bus, ເຊິ່ງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ subscribers.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | True\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | False\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `auth_events: False`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#auth-events\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "`minion_data_cache_events`"
msgstr "`minion_data_cache_events`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:110
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Determines whether the master will fire minion data "
"cache events (`minion/refresh/*`). Minion data cache events are fired when a "
"minion requests a minion data cache refresh.\n"
"                         It helps to reduce the number of events published "
"with the Salt Master Event Publisher and reduce the workload on Event "
"Publisher subscribers.\n"
"| Tune when            | Large amount of `minion/refresh/*` events published "
"in the Salt event bus, which in most cases are useless for the "
"subscribers.\n"
"| Value default        | True\n"
"| Value recommendation | False\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `minion_data_cache_events: False`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#minion-data-cache-events\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ກຳນົດວ່າ master ຈະສົ່ງເຫດການ minion data cache (`minion/refresh/*`) ຫຼື ບໍ່. ເຫດການນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອ minion ຮ້ອງຂໍການຣີເຟຣຊ data cache.\n"
"                         ການປິດສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຈຳນວນເຫດການໃນ Salt Master Event Publisher ແລະ ຫຼຸດພາລະການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ subscribers.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ມີເຫດການ `minion/refresh/*` ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ໃນ Salt event bus, ເຊິ່ງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ subscribers.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | True\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | False\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `minion_data_cache_events: False`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#minion-data-cache-events\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "`pub_hwm`"
msgstr "`pub_hwm`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of outstanding messages sent by "
"`salt-master`. If more than this number of messages need to be sent "
"concurrently, communication with clients slows down, potentially resulting "
"in timeout errors during load peaks.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly and `Salt request timed out. The master is not responding.` "
"errors appear when pinging minions during a load peak.\n"
"| Value default        | 1000\n"
"| Value recommendation | 10000-100000\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `pub_hwm: 10000`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#pub-hwm, "
"https://zeromq.org/socket-api/#high-water-mark\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນຂໍ້ຄວາມສູງສຸດທີ່ຄ້າງຄ່າ (outstanding) ທີ່ສົ່ງໂດຍ `salt-master`. ຫາກມີຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຕ້ອງສົ່ງພ້ອມກັນຫຼາຍກວ່າຄ່ານີ້, ການສື່ສານກັບໄຄລແອນຈະຊ້າລົງ ແລະ ອາດເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ timeout.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນໄຄລແອນ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ `Salt request timed out. The master is not responding.` ປາກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອທຳການ ping ຫາ minions ໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານສູງ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 1000\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 10000-100000\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `pub_hwm: 10000`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#pub-hwm\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "`zmq_backlog`"
msgstr "`zmq_backlog`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:114
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of allowed client connections "
"that have started but not concluded the opening process. If more than this "
"number of clients connects in a very short time frame, connections are "
"dropped and clients experience a delay re-connecting.\n"
"| Tune when            | xref:client-count[Client count] increases "
"significantly and very many clients reconnect in a short time frame, TCP "
"connections to the `salt-master` process get dropped by the kernel.\n"
"| Value default        | 1000\n"
"| Value recommendation | 1000-5000\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `zmq_backlog: 2000`\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#zmq-backlog, "
"http://api.zeromq.org/3-0:zmq-getsockopt (`ZMQ_BACKLOG`)\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄຄລແອນທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ ເຊິ່ງເລີ່ມຂະບວນການແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນສຳເລັດ. ຫາກມີໄຄລແອນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຂົ້າມາພ້ອມກັນຫຼາຍເກີນໄປໃນເວລາສັ້ນໆ, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະຖືກຕັດ ແລະ ໄຄລແອນຈະມີຄວາມຊ້າໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄືນໃໝ່.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | xref:client-count[ຈຳນວນໄຄລແອນ] ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ມີໄຄລແອນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄືນໃໝ່ພ້ອມກັນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໄປຫາ `salt-master` ຖືກຕັດໂດຍ kernel.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 1000\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 1000-5000\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/salt/master.d/tuning.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `zmq_backlog: 2000`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html#zmq-backlog\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:115
#, no-wrap
msgid "`swappiness`"
msgstr "`swappiness`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:116
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | How aggressively the kernel moves unused data from "
"memory to the swap partition.\n"
"                         Setting a lower parameter typically reduces swap "
"usage and results in better performance, especially when RAM memory is "
"abundant.\n"
"| Tune when            | RAM increases, or swap is used when RAM memory is "
"sufficient.\n"
"| Value default        | 60\n"
"| Value recommendation | 1-60. For 128{nbsp}GB of RAM, 10 is expected to "
"give good results.\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/sysctl.conf`\n"
"| Example              | `vm.swappiness = 20`\n"
"| More information     | "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-tuning-memory.html#cha-tuning-memory-vm\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ລະດັບຄວາມພະຍາຍາມຂອງ kernel ໃນການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຈາກໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໄປຍັງ swap partition.\n"
"                         ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຕ່ຳລົງ ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ swap ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບດີຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອມີ RAM ພຽງພໍ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | RAM ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ຫຼື ມີການໃຊ້ swap ທັງໆທີ່ RAM ຍັງພຽງພໍ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | 60\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | 1-60. ສຳລັບ RAM 128{nbsp}GB, ຄ່າ 10 ແມ່ນແນະນຳເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັອກທີ່ດີ.\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/sysctl.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `vm.swappiness = 20`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-tuning-memory.html#cha-tuning-memory-vm\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "`wait_for_backend`"
msgstr "`wait_for_backend`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:118
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Determines whether the `salt-broker` service should "
"wait for backend sockets to be connected before opening the sockets for "
"listening for connections from `salt-minions`.\n"
"                         When enabled, it helps to prevent collecting ZeroMQ "
"messages with the internal buffers of the sockets and pushing them to the "
"`salt-master` once connection is restored.\n"
"| Tune when            | Unstable connectivity between the {productname} "
"Proxy and the {productname} Server.\n"
"| Value default        | False\n"
"| Value recommendation | True\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/salt/broker`\n"
"| Example              | `wait_for_backend: True`\n"
"| More information     | "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-connectivity.adoc#proxies-connectivity[Proxies "
"Connectivity]\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ກຳນົດວ່າບໍລິການ `salt-broker` ຄວນລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ backend sockets ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເປີດ socket ເພື່ອຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກ `salt-minions` ຫຼື ບໍ່.\n"
"                         ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ມັນຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນການສະສົມຂໍ້ຄວາມ ZeroMQ ໃນ buffer ພາຍໃນ ແລະ ການສົ່ງພວກມັນໄປຫາ `salt-master` ພ້ອມກັນເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຄືນມາ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} Server ບໍ່ຄົງທີ່.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | False\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | True\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/salt/broker`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `wait_for_backend: True`\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-connectivity.adoc#proxies-connectivity[Proxies Connectivity]\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "`tcp_keepalive`"
msgstr "`tcp_keepalive`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:120
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The tcp keepalive interval to set on TCP "
"ports. This setting can be used to tune Salt connectivity issues in messy "
"network environments with misbehaving firewalls.\n"
"| Tune when            | Unstable connectivity between managed clients and "
"the {productname} Proxy or the {productname} Server.\n"
"| Value default        | True\n"
"| Value recommendation | True\n"
"| Location             | `/etc/venv-salt-minon/minion.d/tuning.conf` or "
"`/etc/salt/minion.d/tuning.conf`, depending on the minion type.\n"
"| Example              | `tcp_keepalive: True`\n"
"| After changing       | Check "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-connectivity.adoc#minions-connectivity[Minions "
"Connectivity] for more details to fine tune extra keepalive parameters.\n"
"| More information     | "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html#tcp-keepalive, "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-connectivity.adoc#minions-connectivity[Minions "
"Connectivity]\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ໄລຍະເວລາ tcp keepalive ທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນພອດ TCP. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Salt ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີບັນຫາ ຫຼື firewall ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຜິດປົກກະຕິ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງໄຄລແອນ ແລະ {productname} Proxy ຫຼື {productname} Server ບໍ່ຄົງທີ່.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | True\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | True\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | `/etc/venv-salt-minon/minion.d/tuning.conf` ຫຼື `/etc/salt/minion.d/tuning.conf`, ຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງ minion.\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | `tcp_keepalive: True`\n"
"| ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ       | ກວດສອບ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-connectivity.adoc#minions-connectivity[Minions Connectivity] ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນການປັບແຕ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີ keepalive ເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html#tcp-keepalive\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "`DISKCHECKALERT` and `DISKTHRESHOLD`"
msgstr "`DISKCHECKALERT` ແລະ `DISKTHRESHOLD`"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | Environment variables that control disk usage "
"monitoring thresholds for containerized deployments.\n"
"                         `DISKCHECKALERT` triggers a warning notification "
"when disk usage exceeds the specified percentage.\n"
"                         `DISKTHRESHOLD` triggers a critical notification "
"and causes the container health check to fail, which will automatically stop "
"the container.\n"
"                         In large deployments with multi-terabyte storage "
"volumes, the default thresholds (90% and 95%) can leave excessive amounts of "
"disk space unused.\n"
"                         For example, on a 10{nbsp}TB volume, 5% free space "
"equals 500{nbsp}GB, which is wasteful.\n"
"                         Increasing these thresholds allows more efficient "
"use of available storage capacity while maintaining adequate headroom for "
"operations.\n"
"| Tune when            | Large storage volumes are deployed (multiple "
"terabytes) and you want to use disk space more efficiently while maintaining "
"adequate headroom for database growth and repository synchronization.\n"
"| Value default        | `DISKCHECKALERT=90`, `DISKTHRESHOLD=95`\n"
"| Value recommendation | For deployments with 5{nbsp}TB+ storage: "
"`DISKCHECKALERT=95`, `DISKTHRESHOLD=98`.\n"
"                         For deployments with 10{nbsp}TB+ storage: "
"`DISKCHECKALERT=96`, `DISKTHRESHOLD=99`.\n"
"| Location             | Systemd service override files: "
"`/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf` and "
"`/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/diskcheck.conf`\n"
"| Example              | See the procedure below\n"
"| After changing       | Monitor disk usage notifications and ensure "
"adequate space remains for database growth, package repository "
"synchronization, and temporary operations.\n"
"                         Use `df -h` to verify current disk usage levels.\n"
"| Notes                | The disk check runs hourly.\n"
"                         Both the server and database containers should use "
"the same threshold values.\n"
"                         When `DISKTHRESHOLD` is exceeded, container health "
"checks will fail and the container will be automatically stopped.\n"
"                         The database container only monitors "
"`/var/lib/pgsql/data` and this cannot be overridden with `DISKCHECKDIRS`.\n"
"| More information     | xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ          | ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຄວບຄຸມເກນ (threshold) ການຕິດຕາມການໃຊ້ດິດສຳລັບການວາງລະບົບແບບຄອນເທນເນີ.\n"
"                         `DISKCHECKALERT` ຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອການໃຊ້ດິດເກີນເປີເຊັນທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"                         `DISKTHRESHOLD` ຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂັ້ນວິກິດ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການກວດສອບສຸຂະພາບຂອງຄອນເທນເນີລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ເຊິ່ງຈະຢຸດຄອນເທນເນີໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"                         ໃນການວາງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ມີພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຫຼາຍ Terabyte, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (90% ແລະ 95%) ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເສຍພື້ນທີ່ດິດໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ.\n"
"                         ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃນພື້ນທີ່ 10{nbsp}TB, ພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງ 5% ເທົ່າກັບ 500{nbsp}GB, ເຊິ່ງຖືວ່າສິ້ນເປືອງ.\n"
"                         ການເພີ່ມເກນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ໄດ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"| ປັບແຕ່ງເມື່ອ            | ມີການໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ (ຫຼາຍ Terabyte) ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ດິດໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ.\n"
"| ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ        | `DISKCHECKALERT=90`, `DISKTHRESHOLD=95`\n"
"| ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ | ສຳລັບພື້ນທີ່ 5{nbsp}TB+: `DISKCHECKALERT=95`, `DISKTHRESHOLD=98`.\n"
"                         ສຳລັບພື້ນທີ່ 10{nbsp}TB+: `DISKCHECKALERT=96`, `DISKTHRESHOLD=99`.\n"
"| ສະຖານທີ່             | ໄຟລ໌ override ຂອງ Systemd service: `/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf` ແລະ `/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/diskcheck.conf`\n"
"| ຕົວຢ່າງ              | ເບິ່ງຂັ້ນຕອນດ້ານລຸ່ມ\n"
"| ໝາຍເຫດ                | ການກວດສອບດິດຈະເຮັດວຽກທຸກໆຊົ່ວໂມງ.\n"
"                         ທັງຄອນເທນເນີ server ແລະ database ຄວນໃຊ້ຄ່າເກນດຽວກັນ.\n"
"| ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ     | xref:administration:space-management.adoc[]\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Disk Check Thresholds for Large Deployments"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດຄ່າເກນການກວດສອບດິດສຳລັບການວາງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:124
msgid "Create systemd override directories for both services:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ override ຂອງ systemd ສຳລັບທັງສອງບໍລິການ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:125
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/\n"
"mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/\n"
msgstr ""
"mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/\n"
"mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:126
msgid "Create configuration files with higher thresholds for the server service:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ມີເກນສູງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບບໍລິການ server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:127
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"DISKCHECKALERT=95\"\n"
"Environment=\"DISKTHRESHOLD=98\"\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"DISKCHECKALERT=95\"\n"
"Environment=\"DISKTHRESHOLD=98\"\n"
"EOF\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:128
msgid "Create configuration files with higher thresholds for the database service:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ມີເກນສູງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບບໍລິການ database:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:129
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"DISKCHECKALERT=95\"\n"
"Environment=\"DISKTHRESHOLD=98\"\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"DISKCHECKALERT=95\"\n"
"Environment=\"DISKTHRESHOLD=98\"\n"
"EOF\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:130
msgid "Apply the configuration by restarting {productname}:"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ການກຳນົດຄ່າໂດຍການຣີສະຕາດ {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm restart\n"
msgstr "mgradm restart\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:132
#, no-wrap
msgid "Memory Usage"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:133
msgid ""
"Adjusting some of the parameters listed in this section can result in a "
"higher amount of RAM being used by various components.  It is important that "
"the amount of hardware RAM is adequate after any significant change."
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງພາຣາມິເຕີບາງຕົວທີ່ລະບຸໃນສ່ວນນີ້ ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີການໃຊ້ RAM ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນສ່ວນປະກອບຕ່າງໆ. ສິ່ງສຳຄັນຄືຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ RAM ຂອງຮາດແວມີພຽງພໍຫຼັງຈາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ສຳຄັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:134
msgid ""
"To determine how RAM is being used, you will need to check each process that "
"consumes it."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕວດສອບວ່າ RAM ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແນວໃດ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບແຕ່ລະໂປຣເຊສທີ່ໃຊ້ງານມັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operating system"
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:136
msgid "Stop all {productname} services and inspect the output of `free -h`."
msgstr "ຢຸດບໍລິການ {productname} ທັງໝົດ ແລະ ກວດສອບຜົນລັອກຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ `free -h`."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "Java-based components"
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Java"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:138
msgid ""
"This includes Taskomatic, Tomcat, and `rhn-search`.  These services support "
"a configurable memory cap."
msgstr "ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ Taskomatic, Tomcat, ແລະ `rhn-search`. ບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຮອງຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂີດຈຳກັດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "The {productname} Server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:140
msgid ""
"Depends on many factors and can only be estimated.  Measure PostgreSQL "
"reserved memory by checking xref:shared-buffers[`shared_buffers`], "
"permanently.  You can also multiply xref:work-mem[`work_mem`] and "
"xref:max-connections[`max_connections`], and multiply by three for a worst "
"case estimate of per-query RAM.  You will also need to check the operating "
"system buffers and caches, which are used by PostgreSQL to host copies of "
"database data.  These often automatically occupy any available RAM."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນກັບຫຼາຍປັດໄຈ ແລະ ສາມາດຄາດຄະເນໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ວັດແທກໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ PostgreSQL ຈອງໄວ້ໂດຍກວດສອບ xref:shared-buffers[`shared_buffers`] ແບບຖາວອນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຄູນ xref:work-mem[`work_mem`] ກັບ xref:max-connections[`max_connections`], ແລ້ວຄູນດ້ວຍສາມ ເພື່ອຄາດຄະເນການໃຊ້ RAM ຕໍ່ query ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຮ້າຍແຮງທີ່ສຸດ. ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງກວດສອບ buffers ແລະ caches ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ເຊິ່ງ PostgreSQL ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບສຳເນົາຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມັກຈະຈອງ RAM ທີ່ວ່າງຢູ່ທັງໝົດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:141
msgid ""
"It is important that the {productname} Server has sufficient RAM to "
"accommodate all of these processes, especially OS buffers and caches, to "
"have reasonable PostgreSQL performance.  We recommend you keep several "
"gigabytes available at all times, and add more as the database size on disk "
"increases."
msgstr "ເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ {productname} Server ຕ້ອງມີ RAM ພຽງພໍສຳລັບທຸກໂປຣເຊສເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ໂດຍສະເພາະ OS buffers ແລະ caches ເພື່ອໃຫ້ PostgreSQL ມີປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫຼືອພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໄວ້ຫຼາຍໆກິກາໄບຕ໌ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ, ແລະ ເພີ່ມ RAM ເມື່ອຂະໜາດຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃນດິສກ໌ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:142
msgid ""
"Whenever the expected amount of memory available for OS buffers and caches "
"changes, update the `effective_cache_size` parameter to have PostgreSQL use "
"it correctly.  You can calculate the total available by finding the total "
"RAM available, less the expected memory usage."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ປະລິມານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ສຳລັບ OS buffers ແລະ caches ປ່ຽນແປງ, ໃຫ້ອັບເດດພາຣາມິເຕີ `effective_cache_size` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ PostgreSQL ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ທ່ານສາມາດຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າທັງໝົດໄດ້ໂດຍການເອົາ RAM ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ ລົບດ້ວຍປະລິມານການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:143
msgid ""
"To get a live breakdown of the memory used by services on the {productname} "
"Server, use this command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງບໍລິການຕ່າງໆໃນ {productname} Server ແບບສົດໆ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "pidstat -p ALL -r --human 1 60 | tee pidstat-memory.log\n"
msgstr "pidstat -p ALL -r --human 1 60 | tee pidstat-memory.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/tuning.adoc:145
msgid ""
"This command will save a copy of displayed data in the `pidstat-memory.log` "
"file for later analysis."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະບັນທຶກສຳເນົາຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະແດງອອກມາໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ `pidstat-memory.log` ເພື່ອການວິເຄາະໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{byos} Guide"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມື {byos}"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "{byoslongform} ({byos})"
msgstr "{byoslongform} ({byos})"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{byoslongform} ({byos}) images are useful if you already have a support "
"contract with SUSE and want to move your workloads to the public cloud.  An "
"instance launched from a {byos} image is equivalent to a physical machine "
"that just received a SUSE Linux Enterprise Server installation from the "
"{sles} installation image."
msgstr "ອິເມຈ {byoslongform} ({byos}) ແມ່ນມີປະໂຫຍດຫາກເຈົ້າມີສັນຍາການສະໜັບສະໜູນກັບ SUSE ຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍວຽກໄປຍັງ public cloud. instance ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຈາກອິເມຈ {byos} ຈະເທົ່າກັບເຄື່ອງຈິງທີ່ຫາກໍຕິດຕັ້ງ SUSE Linux Enterprise Server ຈາກອິເມຈຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:4
msgid "After creation:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"use `registercloudguest` to register the instance with the SUSE-operated "
"update infrastructure in the cloud framework, or"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ `registercloudguest` ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ instance ກັບໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານການອັບເດດທີ່ຄຸ້ມຄອງໂດຍ SUSE ໃນ cloud framework, ຫຼື"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:6
msgid ""
"use the command `SUSEConnect` to register the system with {scclongform} "
"using the entitlements you already have."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `SUSEConnect` ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລະບົບກັບ {scclongform} ໂດຍໃຊ້ສິດການນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ເຈົ້າມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Connect your system to your own running RMT or {productname} infrastructure "
"in the same way you connect systems in your data center."
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະບົບຂອງທ່ານກັບໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານ RMT ຫຼື {productname} ທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະບົບໃນ data center ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc:8
msgid ""
"{byos} instances make it easier to manage extensions such as `LTSS` or "
"`kernel live-patching`.  Extensions for {payg} instances can only be used in "
"conjunction with {productname}."
msgstr "{byos} instance ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຈັດການສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ (extensions) ເຊັ່ນ `LTSS` ຫຼື `kernel live-patching` ໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍສຳລັບ {payg} instance ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When you have your {productname} Server and, optionally, your {productname} "
"Proxy set up, you are ready to start registering clients."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server ແລະ {productname} Proxy (ຫາກມີ) ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າກໍພ້ອມທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມລົງທະບຽນໄຄລແອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For instructions on registering clients on a public cloud, see "
"xref:client-configuration:clients-pubcloud.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນການລົງທະບຽນ client ໃນ public cloud, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:clients-pubcloud.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For instructions on connecting {payg} instances, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg} instances, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional Resources"
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information on using {suse} products in the public cloud see: "
"link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-public-cloud/all/html/public-cloud/cha-intro.html[SUSE "
"Linux Enterprise Public Cloud Guide]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ໃນ public cloud ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ: link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-public-cloud/all/html/public-cloud/cha-intro.html[SUSE Linux Enterprise Public Cloud Guide]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more {productname} product documentation, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/MLM."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເອກະສານຜະລິດຕະພັນ {productname} ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/MLM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/clients.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To raise an issue or propose a change to the documentation, use the links "
"under the `Resources` menu on the documentation site."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແຈ້ງບັນຫາ ຫຼື ສະເໜີການປ່ຽນແປງເອກະສານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລິ້ງພາຍໃຕ້ເມນູ `Resources` ໃນເວັບໄຊເອກະສານ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:1
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initial Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:2
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/public-cloud-faq.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "ບົດນຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This guide shows you the fastest way to get {productname} up and running in "
"a public cloud using on-demand or {byos} services.  We have tested using "
"{productname} on Amazon EC2, Google Compute Engine, and Microsoft Azure, but "
"these procedures should work with other public cloud providers as well, with "
"some variation."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຈະສະແດງວິທີທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃຫ້ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານໃນ public cloud ໂດຍໃຊ້ບໍລິການແບບ on-demand ຫຼື {byos}. ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ທົດສອບການໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນ Amazon EC2, Google Compute Engine, ແລະ Microsoft Azure ແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ public cloud ອື່ນໆໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"There are three main methods of using {productname} on a public cloud "
"service."
msgstr "ມີສາມວິທີຫຼັກໃນການໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນບໍລິການ public cloud."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{byoslongform} ({byos}):: Most public cloud providers make a {byos} image of "
"{productname} available.  This means you do not need to install "
"{productname}, just set up the server or proxy.  You will need to have "
"{suse} product entitlements before you begin, and there are some additional "
"setup steps required.  The public cloud documentation in the {productname} "
"documentation suite assumes you are using this method."
msgstr "{byoslongform} ({byos}):: ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ public cloud ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະມີອິເມຈ {byos} ຂອງ {productname} ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}, ພຽງແຕ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າ server ຫຼື proxy ກໍພໍ. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີສິດການນຳໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແລະ ຈະມີບາງຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual machine on public cloud"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງຈຳລອງ (Virtual machine) ໃນ public cloud"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In this method, you subscribe to a public cloud service, and install "
"{productname} in a virtual machine, using the {unifiedinstaller}.  You will "
"need to have {suse} product entitlements before you begin.  You can do this "
"by following all the same instructions as you would for any local "
"{productname} installation."
msgstr "ໃນວິທີນີ້, ທ່ານສະໝັກໃຊ້ບໍລິການ public cloud ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນ virtual machine ໂດຍໃຊ້ {unifiedinstaller}. ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີສິດຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດຽວກັນກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນເຄື່ອງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local) ທົ່ວໄປ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "On-demand {sles} {payglongform} ({payg}) image"
msgstr "ອິເມຈ On-demand {sles} {payglongform} ({payg})"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Most public cloud providers make {sles} available as a {byos} image.  This "
"means that {sles} is pre-installed, and you can install {productname} on "
"top, using the {unifiedinstaller}.  You can do this by following all the "
"same instructions as you would for any local {productname} installation.  "
"You will need to have {suse} product entitlements before you begin.  Be "
"careful with this method, because you might end up requiring additional "
"product entitlements that could drive up your costs."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ public cloud ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ມີ {sles} ໃນຮູບແບບອິເມຈ {byos}. ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ {sles} ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ແລະ ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {unifiedinstaller}. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີສິດການນຳໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໃຫ້ລະວັງວິທີນີ້ ເພາະເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສິດການນຳໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນເພີ່ມເຕີມເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍສູງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Server"
msgstr "{productname} ເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"If you are using the {byos} method, start by logging in to your chosen "
"public cloud provider, and launching a {productname} instance.  Depending on "
"the public cloud you are using, you can usually locate the {productname} "
"Server {byos} images by searching for `suse manager`.  In EC2, you need to "
"search within the Community AMIs.  In GCE and Azure, search the marketplace."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ວິທີ {byos}, ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ public cloud ຂອງເຈົ້າ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ {productname} instance. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາອິເມຈ {productname} Server {byos} ໄດ້ໂດຍການພິມ `suse manager`. ໃນ EC2 ໃຫ້ຫາໃນ Community AMIs, ສ່ວນໃນ GCE ແລະ Azure ໃຫ້ຫາໃນ marketplace."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:12
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Select a public cloud instance type that meets the hardware and networking "
"requirements in xref:installation-and-upgrade:pubcloud-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເລືອກປະເພດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ public cloud ທີ່ກົງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານຮາດແວ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:pubcloud-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"When you have your virtual machine ready, and the {byos} image installed, "
"you need to set up {productname} Server.  This is done in the same way as a "
"local installation, using {yast}.  When you have completed {productname} "
"setup, you need to activate the public cloud module.  You can then complete "
"the setup in the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ virtual machine ພ້ອມແລ້ວ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງອິເມຈ {byos} ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບທົ່ວໄປໂດຍໃຊ້ {yast}. ເມື່ອສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ public cloud module, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງໄປຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ສຳເລັດໃນ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Proxy"
msgstr "{productname} ພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"You must use the {byos} method.  Start by logging in to your chosen public "
"cloud provider, and launch a {productname} Proxy instance.  Depending on the "
"public cloud you are using, you can usually locate the {productname} Proxy "
"{byos} images by searching for `suse manager proxy`.  In EC2, you need to "
"search within the Community AMIs.  In GCE and Azure, search the marketplace."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ວິທີ {byos}. ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ public cloud ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ {productname} Proxy instance. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາອິເມຈ {productname} Proxy {byos} ໄດ້ໂດຍການພິມ `suse manager proxy`. ໃນ EC2 ໃຫ້ຫາໃນ Community AMIs, ສ່ວນໃນ GCE ແລະ Azure ໃຫ້ຫາໃນ marketplace."

#.  You can then complete setup in the {productname} {webui}.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/byos/setup.adoc:17
msgid ""
"When you have your virtual machine ready, and the {byos} image installed, "
"you need to set up {productname} Proxy.  This is done in the same way as a "
"local installation, using {suse} setup tools.  When you have completed "
"{productname} Proxy setup, you need to activate the public cloud module."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ virtual machine ພ້ອມແລ້ວ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງອິເມຈ {byos} ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບທົ່ວໄປໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຂອງ {suse}. ເມື່ອສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ public cloud module."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-appendix.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Appendix"
msgstr "ເອກະສານຊ້ອນທ້າຍ"

