msgstr "ການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການ - ທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:2
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:2
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:2
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/public-cloud-faq.adoc:2
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-intro.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Last updated:** {lastupdate}\n"
msgstr "**ອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດ:** {lastupdate}\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"I have an existing {productname} {byos} subscription; can I use this on the "
"cloud?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {productname} {byos} ຢູ່ແລ້ວ; ຂ້ອຍສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນໃນ cloud ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{byos} {byoslongform} {productname} deployments are supported on the cloud, "
"however, billing will not be via the cloud marketplace."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ແບບ {byos} {byoslongform} ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນ cloud, ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການຈະບໍ່ຜ່ານ cloud marketplace."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Once the existing subscription term ends, you can purchase {productname} "
"{payg} via the cloud provider marketplace and manage your instances with a "
"{productname} deployment that is billed via the cloud."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໄລຍະເວລາການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຢູ່ສິ້ນສຸດລົງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຊື້ {productname} {payg} ຜ່ານ cloud provider marketplace ແລະ ຈັດການອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ທີ່ຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການຜ່ານ cloud."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"I have an existing deployment covered by a {byos} {productname} "
"subscription; can I use this new listing in the cloud for a separate "
"deployment of {productname} {payg}?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍມີການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ໃຊ້ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {byos} {productname} ຢູ່ແລ້ວ; ຂ້ອຍສາມາດໃຊ້ລາຍການໃໝ່ນີ້ໃນ cloud ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {payg} ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Yes, the listing works independently from your existing {byos} {productname} "
"subscriptions. Please remember that support processes may be different for "
"deployments using your existing {byos} subscription and those billed via the "
"cloud and note that there is currently no process for migrating deployments "
"between {byos} and {payg} versions."
msgstr "ໄດ້, ລາຍການນີ້ເຮັດວຽກແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {byos} {productname} ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງທ່ານ. ກະລຸນາຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າຂະບວນການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ໃຊ້ {byos} ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ຄິດຄ່າບໍລິການຜ່ານ cloud ແລະ ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ມີຂະບວນການຍ້າຍ (migrate) ການຕິດຕັ້ງລະຫວ່າງເວີຊັນ {byos} ແລະ {payg}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Tell me more about how the billing for {productname} {payg} works via the "
"cloud?"
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍອະທິບາຍເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການ {productname} {payg} ຜ່ານ cloud ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:9
msgid ""
"When purchasing {productname} via the {availability} Marketplaces, the "
"billing is as follows:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊື້ {productname} ຜ່ານ {availability} Marketplaces, ການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການຈະເປັນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:10
msgid "Billing is monthly and handled via cloud marketplace."
msgstr "ການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການເປັນລາຍເດືອນ ແລະ ຈັດການຜ່ານ cloud marketplace."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:11
msgid "Managed instances are recorded hourly."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການຈະຖືກບັນທຶກເປັນລາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:12
msgid "The peak usage total is recorded for the month."
msgstr "ຍອດການໃຊ້ງານສູງສຸດຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ສຳລັບເດືອນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:13
msgid "There is a monthly usage charge for each instance in the count."
msgstr "ມີຄ່າບໍລິການການໃຊ້ງານລາຍເດືອນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃນຍອດລວມ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"I have existing SLES for SAP instances procured via the cloud provider "
"marketplace, is there a cost to manage these instance with {productname} "
"{payg}?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍມີອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SLES for SAP ທີ່ຊື້ຜ່ານ cloud provider marketplace ຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍໃນການຈັດການອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍ {productname} {payg} ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:15
msgid ""
"SLES for SAP Applications {payg}/on-demand instances, when purchased via the "
"cloud marketplace, include Lifecycle Management(LCM) entitlements for "
"{productname}."
msgstr "instance SLES for SAP Applications ແບບ {payg}/on-demand ເມື່ອຊື້ຜ່ານ cloud marketplace ຈະລວມມີສິດການນຳໃຊ້ Lifecycle Management (LCM) ສຳລັບ {productname} ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The {productname} {payg} billing engine recognizes the embedded LCM "
"entitlements and does not include them in the count. This means there are no "
"additional charges to manage these with the {productname} {payg} listing."
msgstr "ລະບົບຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການຂອງ {productname} {payg} ຈະກວດສອບສິດ LCM ທີ່ຕິດມານຳ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ລວມເຂົ້າໃນການນັບຍອດ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບໍ່ມີຄ່າບໍລິການເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນການຈັດການເຄື່ອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍ {productname} {payg}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:17
msgid ""
"However, if {productname} Monitoring is required for these instances, "
"additional charges will apply for this feature."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ {productname} Monitoring ສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ຈະມີຄ່າບໍລິການເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຟີເຈີນີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Is there a way to try {productname} {payg} before purchasing?"
msgstr "ມີວິທີທົດລອງໃຊ້ {productname} {payg} ກ່ອນການຊື້ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If using the {productname} {payg} listing in the cloud marketplace, billing "
"will commence from the time of deployment and when applicable client "
"instances are on-boarded to {productname}."
msgstr "ຫາກໃຊ້ລາຍການ {productname} {payg} ໃນ cloud marketplace, ການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕັ້ງແຕ່ເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເມື່ອມີການນຳເອົາ client instance ເຂົ້າມາຈັດການໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:20
msgid ""
"There is the {productname} {byos} listing in the cloud marketplace that can "
"be used, a trial subscription key can be obtained via the SUSE Website. This "
"deployment cannot be directly converted to allow billing via cloud "
"marketplaces."
msgstr "ມີລາຍການ {productname} {byos} ໃນ cloud marketplace ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້, ໂດຍສາມາດຂໍລະຫັດທົດລອງໃຊ້ (trial subscription key) ໄດ້ຜ່ານເວັບໄຊ SUSE. ແຕ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນໂດຍກົງເປັນການຄິດຄ່າບໍລິການຜ່ານ cloud marketplace ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To benefit from monthly billing via the cloud marketplace, {productname} "
"needs to be redeployed using the version from the {payg} listing in the "
"cloud marketplace."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຈາກການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການລາຍເດືອນຜ່ານ cloud marketplace, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ເວີຊັນຈາກລາຍການ {payg} ໃນ cloud marketplace."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "How does SUSE calculate the amount of managed instances to bill for?"
msgstr "SUSE ຄິດໄລ່ຈຳນວນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການເພື່ອຄິດຄ່າບໍລິການແນວໃດ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:23
msgid "Billing is based on the number of managed instances."
msgstr "ການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການແມ່ນອີງຕາມຈຳນວນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Below are 3 examples of how the node count is calculated, check the table "
"below for the detail."
msgstr "ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນ 3 ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງການຄິດໄລ່ຈຳນວນໂນດ (node count), ກະລຸນາກວດສອບຕາຕະລາງສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Static usage"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານແບບຄົງທີ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Using {productname} with 10 instances registered for management, for 1 month "
"with no additional managed clients added in the month."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ {productname} ໂດຍມີ 10 ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນເພື່ອຈັດການ ເປັນເວລາ 1 ເດືອນ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການເພີ່ມ client ໃໝ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງເດືອນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bursting Model"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການໃຊ້ງານແບບເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນກະທັນຫັນ (Bursting)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Using {productname} with 10 instances registered for management for 3 weeks "
"in the month, bursting to 30 managed instances for 1 week."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ {productname} ໂດຍມີ 10 ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນຈັດການເປັນເວລາ 3 ສັບປະດາໃນເດືອນ, ແລະ ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເປັນ 30 ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເປັນເວລາ 1 ສັບປະດາ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transient model"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການໃຊ້ງານຊົ່ວຄາວ (Transient)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:30
msgid ""
"A temporary deployment of {productname} with 20 managed instances, for 2 "
"weeks (336 hours)"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຊົ່ວຄາວໂດຍມີ 20 ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ ເປັນເວລາ 2 ສັບປະດາ (336 ຊົ່ວໂມງ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The total is calculated by counting number of active nodes (checked "
"hourly).  There is a monthly charge for each managed node under management "
"in the billing cycle."
msgstr "ຍອດລວມແມ່ນຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍການນັບຈຳນວນໂນດທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ (ກວດສອບທຸກຊົ່ວໂມງ). ຈະມີຄ່າບໍລິການລາຍເດືອນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂນດທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໃນຮອບບິນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:32
msgid "Below are 3 examples of how the average node count is calculated."
msgstr "ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນ 3 ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງວິທີການຄິດໄລ່ຈຳນວນໂນດສະເລ່ຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage calculations for different scenarios"
msgstr "ການຄິດໄລ່ການໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບສະຖານະການຕ່າງໆ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|  |Managed Instances |Peak Usage |Billed for\n"
"|Static Usage |10 |10 |10\n"
"|Bursting Model |10 - 3 Weeks, 30 - 1 Week|30 |30\n"
"|Transient Cluster |20 - 2 Weeks |20 |20\n"
msgstr ""
"|  |ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ |ການໃຊ້ງານສູງສຸດ |ຍອດບິນສຳລັບ\n"
"|ການໃຊ້ງານແບບຄົງທີ່ |10 |10 |10\n"
"|ຮູບແບບ Bursting |10 - 3 ສັບປະດາ, 30 - 1 ສັບປະດາ|30 |30\n"
"|ຄລັດເຕີຊົ່ວຄາວ |20 - 2 ສັບປະດາ |20 |20\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Are special commercial terms available?"
msgstr "ມີເງື່ອນໄຂທາງການຄ້າພິເສດໃຫ້ບໍລິການຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:36
msgid ""
"It is dependent on the deployment and the cloud provider, as every Cloud "
"Service Provider (CSP) has its own commercial terms and offers."
msgstr "ມັນຂຶ້ນກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ cloud, ເນື່ອງຈາກຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ Cloud (CSP) ແຕ່ລະແຫ່ງມີເງື່ອນໄຂ ແລະ ຂໍ້ສະເໜີທາງການຄ້າຂອງຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:37
msgid ""
"It may be possible to secure special commercial terms such as an annual "
"subscription. For example, AWS can offer {productname} {payg} via a Private "
"Offer. Please contact SUSE for more information."
msgstr "ອາດຈະສາມາດຂໍເງື່ອນໄຂທາງການຄ້າພິເສດໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ລາຍປີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: AWS ສາມາດສະເໜີ {productname} {payg} ຜ່ານ Private Offer. ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ SUSE ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Can my spending on {productname} {payg} count towards my committed spend "
"with the cloud provider?"
msgstr "ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍຂອງຂ້ອຍໃນ {productname} {payg} ສາມາດນັບລວມເຂົ້າໃນຍອດການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ສັນຍາໄວ້ (committed spend) ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ cloud ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:39
msgid "There are such programs at the cloud providers:"
msgstr "ມີໂຄງການດັ່ງກ່າວຢູ່ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ cloud:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:40
msgid "Azure MACC Program"
msgstr "ໂຄງການ Azure MACC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:41
msgid "AWS Enterprise Discount Program"
msgstr "ໂຄງການ AWS Enterprise Discount"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:42
msgid "Google CUD"
msgstr "Google CUD"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:43
msgid "Yes, it can. Please contact your cloud provider sales team for more details."
msgstr "ໄດ້, ມັນສາມາດນັບລວມໄດ້. ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ທີມງານຂາຍຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ cloud ຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How do I purchase {productname} / LCM subscriptions for additional managed "
"instances?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະຊື້ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {productname} / LCM ສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Once {productname} {payg} has been deployed from the marketplace listing and "
"billing is active, there is no need to make a specific purchase to manage "
"additional instances. Billing is dynamic and based on the number of "
"instances {productname} is managing. Just on-board additional instances to "
"{productname} as needed, this will be reflected in your cloud marketplace "
"bill."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {payg} ຈາກ marketplace ແລະ ລະບົບບິນເຮັດວຽກແລ້ວ, ກໍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດການຊື້ເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອຈັດການອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່. ການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການຈະເປັນໄປແບບໄດນາມິກຕາມຈຳນວນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ {productname} ກຳລັງຈັດການຢູ່. ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ນຳເອົາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມເຂົ້າມາໃນ {productname} ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ, ເຊິ່ງມັນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນບິນ cloud marketplace ຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Is this an annual commitment, will it auto-renew?"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຜູກພັນລາຍປີຫຼືບໍ່, ແລະ ມັນຈະຕໍ່ອາຍຸອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:47
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} {payg} listing on the cloud is billed on a "
"monthly cycle, based on usage. Billing is ongoing for as long as "
"{productname} is deployed and instances are registered."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ລາຍການ {productname} {payg} ໃນ cloud ຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການເປັນຮອບເດືອນ ຕາມການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ. ການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການຈະດຳເນີນໄປເລື້ອຍໆຕາບໃດທີ່ {productname} ຍັງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ມີອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນຢູ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Is there a volume discount / tiered pricing built into the Cloud Listing?"
msgstr "ມີສ່ວນຫຼຸດຕາມປະລິມານ (volume discount) ຫຼື ການຄິດລາຄາຕາມລະດັບ (tiered pricing) ຢູ່ໃນ Cloud Listing ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:49
msgid "Currently, there is no volume discount available."
msgstr "ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ຍັງບໍ່ມີສ່ວນຫຼຸດຕາມປະລິມານໃຫ້ບໍລິການ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"I no longer require support; how can I end the {productname} {payg} "
"subscription?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງການການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (support) ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ; ຂ້ອຍຈະຍົກເລີກການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {productname} {payg} ໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:51
msgid "If you no longer require support, there are 2 options:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ມີ 2 ທາງເລືອກ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:52
msgid "Unregister all systems from the {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນທຸກລະບົບອອກຈາກ {productname} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-general.adoc:53
msgid "Terminate the {productname} instance."
msgstr "ຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກ (Terminate) ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname}."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Billing - Products"
msgstr "ການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການ - ຜະລິດຕະພັນ"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How do I migrate an existing {productname} {byos} instance to the {payg} - "
"{payglongform} version?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະຍ້າຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {byos} ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໄປເປັນເວີຊັນ {payg} - {payglongform} ໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Currently, it is *not possible* to migrate an existing instance to the "
"{payg} version."
msgstr "ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, *ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດ* ຍ້າຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໄປເປັນເວີຊັນ {payg} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Customers can simply deploy a new {productname} {payg} instance from the "
"cloud marketplace and re-onboard all instances using the standard process."
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ໃໝ່ຈາກ cloud marketplace ແລະ ນຳເອົາທຸກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເຂົ້າມາໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂະບວນການມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:5
msgid ""
"link:https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/en/suse-manager/client-configuration/client-config-overview.html[Client "
"configuration overview]"
msgstr "link:https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/en/suse-manager/client-configuration/client-config-overview.html[ພາບລວມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Client]"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "How do I get support?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະຂໍຮັບການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (support) ໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:7
msgid "It is simple to open a support case with SUSE for {productname} {payg}."
msgstr "ການເປີດເຄສຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອກັບ SUSE ສຳລັບ {productname} {payg} ແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ງ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Create a ‘supportconfig’ via {productname} {payg} instance CLI and upload "
"the output to the {scclongform} ({scc}) at the following link:"
msgstr "ສ້າງ ‘supportconfig’ ຜ່ານ CLI ຂອງ {productname} {payg} instance ແລະ ອັບໂຫຼດຜົນລັອກໄປຍັງ {scclongform} ({scc}) ຕາມລິ້ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:9
msgid "https://scc.suse.com/cloudsupport"
msgstr "https://scc.suse.com/cloudsupport"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:10
msgid "Providing marketplace billing is active, a support case will be opened."
msgstr "ຫາກລະບົບບິນໃນ marketplace ຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ເຄສຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈະຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Are there any differences between the {productname} {payg} product on the "
"cloud marketplaces compared to the versions I can run in my own data center?"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {productname} {payg} ໃນ cloud marketplace ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຈາກເວີຊັນທີ່ຂ້ອຍໃຊ້ໃນ data center ຂອງຂ້ອຍເອງຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The {productname} {payg} product available in the cloud marketplace is the "
"same product, with similar functionality that you would run on-premises or "
"with a manual installation."
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {productname} {payg} ທີ່ມີໃນ cloud marketplace ແມ່ນຜະລິດຕະພັນດຽວກັນ, ໂດຍມີຟັງຊັນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຄືກັນກັບເວີຊັນທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ໃນ on-premises ຫຼື ຕິດຕັ້ງເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The only exceptions being the ability to bill via the cloud marketplace and "
"connect to the SUSE Update Infrastructure for {productname} product updates."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນພຽງຢ່າງດຽວຄື ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຄິດບິນຜ່ານ cloud marketplace ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ SUSE Update Infrastructure ສຳລັບການອັບເດດຜະລິດຕະພັນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:14
msgid ""
"It is also worth checking the list of supported client operating systems to "
"ensure your needs are met."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້ ຄວນກວດສອບລາຍຊື່ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ client ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າມັນຕອບໂຈດຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Does the {productname} {payg} instance need to run 24/7?"
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດຕະຫຼອດ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:16
msgid "It is recommended that the {productname} instance always remains active."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How do I get fixes and updates for {productname} {payg}? Do I need a "
"subscription key?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະຮັບການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ອັບເດດສຳລັບ {productname} {payg} ໄດ້ແນວໃດ? ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງມີ subscription key ບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:18
msgid ""
"{productname} {payg}, when deployed via the cloud marketplace will "
"automatically connect to the SUSE Update Infrastructure, no separate "
"{productname} subscription key is required."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {payg} ຜ່ານ cloud marketplace ລະບົບຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ SUSE Update Infrastructure ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ subscription key ຂອງ {productname} ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Updates to the {productname} instance can be applied from those channels "
"using standard SUSE tooling (i.e. zypper)."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຜ່ານຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືມາດຕະຖານຂອງ SUSE (ເຊັ່ນ zypper)."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Is the use of {productname} Hub supported with this listing?"
msgstr "ລາຍການນີ້ຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ {productname} Hub ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Yes, {productname} Hub is recommended for customers with more than 10,000 "
"managed clients. If the {productname} Hub instance has no connected clients, "
"there will be no charge for the {productname} Hub software components."
msgstr "ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, {productname} Hub ໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳສຳລັບລູກຄ້າທີ່ມີ client ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 10,000 ເຄື່ອງ. ຫາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} Hub ບໍ່ມີ client ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່, ກໍຈະບໍ່ມີການຄິດຄ່າບໍລິການສຳລັບສ່ວນປະກອບຊອບແວຂອງ {productname} Hub."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Billing will occur from the downstream {productname} {payg} Server instance, "
"where managed instances are connected."
msgstr "ການຄິດບິນຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຈາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} Server ທີ່ຢູ່ປາຍທາງ (downstream), ເຊິ່ງເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Can I manage {byoslongform} - {byos} SLES instances in the cloud with "
"{productname} {payg}?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍສາມາດຈັດການອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byoslongform} - {byos} SLES ໃນ cloud ດ້ວຍ {productname} {payg} ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To manage {byos} instances, {scclongform} ({scc}) credentials with "
"entitlement to valid SLES or SLES for SAP subscriptions will be "
"required. These credentials should be added to the {productname} "
"configuration to enable this functionality."
msgstr "ໃນການຈັດການ {byos} instances, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {scclongform} ({scc}) ທີ່ມີສິດການນຳໃຊ້ SLES ຫຼື SLES for SAP. ຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ {productname} ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"I have a hybrid setup. Can I manage instances (workloads) outside of the "
"cloud?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບໄຮບຣິດ (hybrid). ຂ້ອຍສາມາດຈັດການ instance (workloads) ທີ່ຢູ່ນອກ cloud ໄດ້ບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:26
msgid "Yes, it is possible to manage instances, in the cloud, on premises or both."
msgstr "ໄດ້, ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດການອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້ທັງໃນ cloud, on-premises ຫຼື ທັງສອງຢ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:27
msgid ""
"To enable management of SUSE workloads in an on-premises data center, {scc} "
"credentials with entitlement to valid SLES or SLES for SAP subscriptions "
"will be required."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດການຈັດການ SUSE workloads ໃນ on-premises data center, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {scc} ທີ່ມີສິດການນຳໃຊ້ SLES ຫຼື SLES for SAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:28
msgid ""
"These credentials should be added to the {productname} configuration to "
"enable this functionality."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນບັນຊີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄວນຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານຟັງຊັນນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" Egress data charges may apply when managing workloads outside of the cloud "
"provider's network.\n"
msgstr " ອາດມີຄ່າບໍລິການຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກ (Egress data charges) ເມື່ອຈັດການວຽກທີ່ຢູ່ນອກເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ cloud.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Are there additional charges for using a {productname} Proxy?"
msgstr "ມີຄ່າບໍລິການເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບການໃຊ້ {productname} Proxy ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:31
msgid ""
"With a hybrid landscape, egress data charges may apply when managing "
"workloads outside of the cloud provider. To reduce these costs, SUSE "
"recommend the use of the containerized proxy."
msgstr "ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບໄຮບຣິດ, ອາດມີຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກເມື່ອຈັດການວຽກຢູ່ນອກ cloud. ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້, SUSE ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ proxy ແບບ container."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Please note: Whilst the {productname} Proxy usage is included as part of the "
"{productname} {payg} subscription, an LCM+ subscription will be billed if "
"the proxy is also a managed workload, so in other words it counted as a "
"managed client."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ເຖິງວ່າການໃຊ້ {productname} Proxy ຈະລວມຢູ່ໃນການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {productname} {payg} ແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ຈະມີການເກັບເງິນ LCM+ ຫາກ proxy ນັ້ນຖືກຈັດການໃນຖານະໄຄລແອນເຄື່ອງໜຶ່ງນຳ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Can I have a {productname} {payg} Server on premises and bill via the Cloud "
"Marketplace?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍສາມາດມີ {productname} {payg} Server ແບບ on-premises ແລ້ວໃຫ້ເກັບເງິນຜ່ານ Cloud Marketplace ໄດ້ບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:34
msgid ""
"No, to benefit from cloud marketplace billing, the {productname} {payg} "
"instance must reside on the cloud. Any {productname} instances on premises "
"will require their own subscriptions."
msgstr "ບໍ່ໄດ້, ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ລະບົບບິນຂອງ cloud marketplace, ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ cloud ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ໃດໆທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ on-premises ຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຂອງຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "What client Operating Systems are supported with {productname} {payg}?"
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ client ໃດແດ່ທີ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ {productname} {payg}?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-products.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Please refer to the product documentation for a full list of supported "
"clients.  "
"link:https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/ja/suse-manager/specialized-guides/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.html[{payg} "
"Overview]"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງເອກະສານຜະລິດຕະພັນສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ client ທັງໝົດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. link:https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/ja/suse-manager/specialized-guides/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.html[ພາບລວມ {payg}]"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Billing - Technical"
msgstr "ການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າບໍລິການ - ດ້ານເຕັກນິກ"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Do I need any special or additional infrastructure to set up {productname} "
"billing via the cloud marketplaces?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານພິເສດ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການຄິດບິນ {productname} ຜ່ານ cloud marketplaces ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:4
msgid ""
"No, all components needed to handle the billing are part of the "
"{productname} {payg} code base."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ, ສ່ວນປະກອບທັງໝົດທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການຈັດການລະບົບບິນແມ່ນລວມຢູ່ໃນຊຸດໂຄດຂອງ {productname} {payg} ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What is the deployment mechanism for {productname} {payg} on the cloud "
"marketplace?"
msgstr "ກົນໄກການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {payg} ໃນ cloud marketplace ແມ່ນແນວໃດ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The cloud marketplace listing for {productname} {payg} will deploy a "
"{productname} instance, together with the embedded billing engine."
msgstr "ລາຍການໃນ cloud marketplace ສຳລັບ {productname} {payg} ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ພ້ອມກັບລະບົບຄິດບິນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງມາໃນຕົວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What version of {productname} is installed when using the marketplace "
"listing?"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ລາຍການໃນ marketplace, {productname} ເວີຊັນໃດຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The cloud marketplace listing for {productname} {payg} is tied to a specific "
"version of {productname} (4.3.8 at launch).  Future listings will typically "
"include the latest version available at the time of product/image "
"creation. Please check the listing for further information."
msgstr "ລາຍການໃນ cloud marketplace ສຳລັບ {productname} {payg} ຈະຜູກກັບເວີຊັນສະເພາະຂອງ {productname} (ເວີຊັນ 4.3.8 ໃນຕອນເປີດຕົວ). ລາຍການໃນອະນາຄົດໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະລວມເອົາເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມີໃນເວລາສ້າງຜະລິດຕະພັນ/ອິມເມຈ. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບລາຍການສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"I need a prior version of {productname} installed; can I still use the "
"listing?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້; ຂ້ອຍຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ລາຍການນີ້ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:10
msgid ""
"No, there is no choice over the {productname} version when deploying using "
"the cloud marketplace listing. If a prior version of {productname} is "
"required, this will need to be installed manually using the standard "
"documentation and {byos} billing."
msgstr "ບໍ່ໄດ້, ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກເວີຊັນຂອງ {productname} ໄດ້ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານລາຍການໃນ cloud marketplace. ຫາກຕ້ອງການ {productname} ເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ເອກະສານມາດຕະຖານ ແລະ ການຄິດບິນແບບ {byos}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How often is the listing updated (including the version of {productname} "
"etc.)?"
msgstr "ລາຍການຈະຖືກອັບເດດເລື້ອຍປານໃດ (ລວມທັງເວີຊັນຂອງ {productname} ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The Marketplace listing is tied to a specific version of {productname}, "
"which is the latest version available at the time of the listing."
msgstr "ລາຍການໃນ Marketplace ຈະຜູກກັບເວີຊັນສະເພາະຂອງ {productname}, ເຊິ່ງເປັນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມີໃນເວລາທີ່ລົງລາຍການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Typically, the listing in the cloud marketplace is updated quarterly, or "
"more frequently if there are security issues."
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ລາຍການໃນ cloud marketplace ຈະຖືກອັບເດດທຸກໆໄຕມາດ, ຫຼື ເລື້ອຍກວ່ານັ້ນຫາກມີບັນຫາດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:14
msgid ""
"It is worth noting that the image update process may not be fully aligned to "
"the {productname} product maintenance releases (every 6-8 weeks), so "
"{productname} {payg} instances should be patched regularly after deployment."
msgstr "ຄວນສັງເກດວ່າຂະບວນການອັບອັບເດດອິມເມຈອາດຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບຮອບການປ່ອຍຕົວບຳລຸງຮັກສາຜະລິດຕະພັນ {productname} (ທຸກໆ 6-8 ສັບປະດາ), ດັ່ງນັ້ນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການແກ້ໄຂ (patched) ເປັນປະຈຳຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"I have purchased multiple {payg} - {payglongform} SUSE products from the "
"cloud provider marketplace (i.e. Rancher, NeuVector and {productname}), does "
"the marketplace billing method still work?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍໄດ້ຊື້ຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE ແບບ {payg} - {payglongform} ຫຼາຍຢ່າງຈາກ cloud marketplace (ເຊັ່ນ Rancher, NeuVector ແລະ {productname}), ວິທີການຄິດບິນຂອງ marketplace ຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Yes, the billing mechanism for the products is independent. Each deployment "
"will be billed separately via the cloud marketplace."
msgstr "ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ກົນໄກການຄິດບິນຂອງແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນແມ່ນແຍກອອກຈາກກັນ. ການຕິດຕັ້ງແຕ່ລະຢ່າງຈະຖືກຄິດບິນແຍກກັນຜ່ານ cloud marketplace."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"I already have an existing {productname} deployment; how can I get this "
"deployment to bill via the cloud marketplace?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຢູ່ແລ້ວ; ຂ້ອຍຈະເຮັດແນວໃດໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້ຄິດບິນຜ່ານ cloud marketplace?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-billing-technical.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Existing deployments *cannot* be directly converted or updated to provide "
"billing via the cloud marketplace. To benefit from monthly billing, "
"{productname} {payg} must be deployed directly from the cloud marketplace "
"listing."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ *ບໍ່ສາມາດ* ປ່ຽນ ຫຼື ອັບເດດໂດຍກົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄິດບິນຜ່ານ cloud marketplace ໄດ້. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຈາກການຄິດບິນລາຍເດືອນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {payg} ໂດຍກົງຈາກລາຍການໃນ cloud marketplace ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Listings"
msgstr "ລາຍການ Public Cloud"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is the {productname} {payg} listing on the cloud marketplaces?"
msgstr "ລາຍການ {productname} {payg} ໃນ cloud marketplaces ແມ່ນຫຍັງ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:4
msgid ""
"By selecting the {productname} {payg} listing from the cloud marketplace, "
"customers can deploy {productname} to their cloud environment with the "
"advantage of having monthly billing via the cloud provider."
msgstr "ໂດຍການເລືອກລາຍການ {productname} {payg} ຈາກ cloud marketplace, ລູກຄ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ cloud ຂອງຕົນເອງ ໂດຍມີຂໍ້ດີຄືການຄິດບິນລາຍເດືອນຜ່ານຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ cloud."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Customers still have the option of using {productname} {byos} "
"({byoslongform}), for which subscriptions and billing is handled directly by "
"{suse}."
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າຍັງມີທາງເລືອກໃນການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {byos} ({byoslongform}), ເຊິ່ງການສະໝັກໃຊ້ ແລະ ການຄິດໄລ່ເງິນຈະຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ {suse} ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where do I find the {productname} {payg} listings?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະຊອກຫາລາຍການ {productname} {payg} ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃສ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The listings can be found in the {availability} Marketplaces.  There are two "
"listings:"
msgstr "ສາມາດຊອກຫາລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ໃນຕະຫຼາດ {availability} (Marketplaces) ເຊິ່ງມີຢູ່ສອງລາຍການຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:8
msgid "On the {aws} Marketplace, you will find the following:"
msgstr "ໃນ {aws} Marketplace, ທ່ານຈະພົບເຫັນລາຍການດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:9
msgid "{productname} Server Family (Non-EU and non-UK only)"
msgstr "{productname} Server Family (ສະເພາະນອກ EU ແລະ ນອກ UK)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:10
msgid "{productname} Server Family (EU and UK only)"
msgstr "{productname} Server Family (ສະເພາະ EU ແລະ UK)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:11
msgid "On the {azure} Marketplace, you will find:"
msgstr "ໃນ {azure} Marketplace, ທ່ານຈະພົບເຫັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:12
msgid "{productname} with 24x7 Support"
msgstr "{productname} ພ້ອມການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຕະຫຼອດ 24x7"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:13
msgid "{productname} with 24x7 Support (EMEA Orders Only)"
msgstr "{productname} ພ້ອມການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຕະຫຼອດ 24x7 (ສະເພາະຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຈາກ EMEA)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For the purposes of this FAQ, we will refer to these listings as "
"{productname} {payg}."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ FAQ ນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະເອີ້ນລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ວ່າ {productname} {payg}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why are there 2 listings and which one should I use?"
msgstr "ເປັນຫຍັງຈຶ່ງມີ 2 ລາຍການ ແລະ ຂ້ອຍຄວນໃຊ້ອັນໃດ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:16
msgid "We have 2 listings for {productname}:"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາມີ 2 ລາຍການສຳລັບ {productname}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "**EU and UK only / EMEA Orders Only** \n"
msgstr "**ສະເພາະ EU ແລະ UK / ສະເພາະການສັ່ງຊື້ໃນ EMEA ເທົ່ານັ້ນ** \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "**non-EU and non-UK only**.\n"
msgstr "**ສະເພາະນອກ EU ແລະ ນອກ UK ເທົ່ານັ້ນ**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:19
msgid ""
"You should pick the listing that reflects in which country your "
"{availability} account gets billed."
msgstr "ທ່ານຄວນເລືອກລາຍການທີ່ກົງກັບປະເທດທີ່ບັນຊີ {availability} ຂອງທ່ານຖືກຄິດໄລ່ເງິນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Are these listings available in all countries?"
msgstr "ລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນທຸກປະເທດຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The {productname} {payg} listing on the cloud is not available to purchase "
"in all countries.  In case it is not available in your country you can still "
"use the {byos} option."
msgstr "ລາຍການ {productname} {payg} ເທິງຄລາວບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ຊື້ໃນທຸກປະເທດ. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນປະເທດຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ທາງເລືອກ {byos} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Your billing country is based on the {availability} Account ID used to do "
"the deployment."
msgstr "ປະເທດທີ່ຄິດບິນຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນອີງຕາມ {availability} Account ID ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:23
msgid "You can find out more about confirming your tax location as follows:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສຶກສາເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຢືນຢັນສະຖານທີ່ເສຍພາສີໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For {awslongform}, it depends on the *tax address* of the account, see "
"link:https://aws.amazon.com/tax-help/location[Tax help based on location]"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ {awslongform}, ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບ *ທີ່ຢູ່ເສຍພາສີ* ຂອງບັນຊີ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ link:https://aws.amazon.com/tax-help/location[ການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອດ້ານພາສີຕາມສະຖານທີ່]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For {azure}, it depends on the *sold to* address of the account, see "
"link:https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/cost-management-billing/manage/change-azure-account-profile[Azure "
"account profile]"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ {azure}, ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບທີ່ຢູ່ *ຜູ້ຊື້ (sold to)* ຂອງບັນຊີ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ link:https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/cost-management-billing/manage/change-azure-account-profile[ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ບັນຊີ Azure]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Please see the link at the end of this FAQ for a list of countries that can "
"and cannot transact {productname} {payg} via the cloud marketplaces."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງລີ້ງຢູ່ທ້າຍ FAQ ນີ້ ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ປະເທດທີ່ສາມາດ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຊື້-ຂາຍ {productname} {payg} ຜ່ານ cloud marketplaces ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"My cloud account is in the USA, but I want to deploy {productname} {payg} in "
"another region, a region that is in a country where I currently cannot "
"transact, is this possible?"
msgstr "ບັນຊີ cloud ຂອງຂ້ອຍຢູ່ໃນສະຫະລັດອາເມລິກາ, ແຕ່ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {payg} ໃນພາກພື້ນ (region) ອື່ນ ເຊິ່ງເປັນປະເທດທີ່ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ສາມາດຊື້-ຂາຍໄດ້ໃນຕອນນີ້, ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:28
msgid ""
"If your cloud provider account is billed to one of the allowed countries, it "
"is possible to deploy {productname} in any region."
msgstr "ຫາກບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ cloud ຂອງທ່ານຖືກຄິດບິນໃນປະເທດໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ, ທ່ານກໍສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນພາກພື້ນໃດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Is this listing available in China?"
msgstr "ລາຍການນີ້ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນປະເທດຈີນຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:30
msgid ""
"It is not possible to transact/bill {productname} {payg} via {availability} "
"Marketplaces in China.  It is possible to deploy into regions in China."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດທຸລະກຳ ຫຼື ຄິດໄລ່ເງິນ {productname} {payg} ຜ່ານ {availability} Marketplaces ໃນປະເທດຈີນໄດ້. ແຕ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນພາກພື້ນຕ່າງໆໃນປະເທດຈີນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:31
msgid ""
"This means you can deploy {productname} in a region in China if your billing "
"is performed in a country that has the {payg} option available.  Please see "
"the addendum at the end of this FAQ for a list of countries that can and "
"cannot transact {productname} {payg} via the cloud."
msgstr "ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນພາກພື້ນຂອງຈີນໄດ້ ຫາກການຄິດໄລ່ເງິນຂອງທ່ານ ເຮັດຢູ່ໃນປະເທດທີ່ມີທາງເລືອກ {payg} ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງເອກະສານເພີ່ມເຕີມຢູ່ທ້າຍ FAQ ນີ້ ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ປະເທດທີ່ສາມາດ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດທຸລະກຳ {productname} {payg} ຜ່ານຄລາວໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Is there still a {byos} listing for {productname} in the marketplace?"
msgstr "ຍັງມີລາຍການ {byos} ສຳລັບ {productname} ໃນ marketplace ຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Yes, for customers that wish to use an existing annual {productname} "
"subscription, the {byos} {productname} listing is available."
msgstr "ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ສຳລັບລູກຄ້າທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {productname} ລາຍປີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ລາຍການ {byos} {productname} ຍັງມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Is there a {payg} listing available for the {productname} Proxy Server?"
msgstr "ມີລາຍການ {payg} ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy Server ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:35
msgid ""
"If a {productname} Proxy is required as part of the architecture, it is "
"suggested to use the containerized proxy.  See the SUSE documentation at: "
"link:https://documentation.suse.com[documentation.suse.com]"
msgstr "ຫາກຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ {productname} Proxy ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໂຄງສ້າງ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ containerized proxy. ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ SUSE ໄດ້ທີ່: link:https://documentation.suse.com[documentation.suse.com]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:36
msgid ""
"menu:Select[{productname} > {productname} {{productnumber}} > Installation "
"and Upgrade guide > Installation > {productname} Proxy > Install "
"Containerized Proxy]"
msgstr "ເມນູ:Select[{productname} > {productname} {{productnumber}} > Installation and Upgrade guide > Installation > {productname} Proxy > Install Containerized Proxy]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:37
msgid ""
"From the subscription point of view, {productname} Proxy is a managed "
"client."
msgstr "ໃນມຸມມອງຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້, {productname} Proxy ຖືວ່າເປັນ client ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການຕົວໜຶ່ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The listing shows pricing information for {productname} node management and "
"a separate price for monitoring. Do I need to subscribe twice if I need "
"monitoring?"
msgstr "ລາຍການສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນລາຄາສຳລັບການຈັດການໂນດ {productname} ແລະ ແຍກລາຄາສຳລັບການຕິດຕາມ (monitoring). ຂ້ອຍຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສະໝັກໃຊ້ສອງຄັ້ງຫຼືບໍ່ຫາກຕ້ອງການການຕິດຕາມ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:39
msgid ""
"There is no need to subscribe twice.  Subscribing to the listing in the "
"cloud provider marketplace allow the {productname} {payg} instance to "
"perform metered billing for {productname} usage."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສະໝັກໃຊ້ສອງຄັ້ງ. ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ລາຍການໃນຕະຫຼາດຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (Instance) ຂອງ {productname} {payg} ສາມາດຄິດໄລ່ເງິນຕາມປະລິມານການໃຊ້ງານ {productname} ຕົວຈິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-listings.adoc:40
msgid ""
"If you onboard an instance and enable {productname} monitoring, there is a "
"monthly charge for management and another charge for monitoring."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານນຳເອົາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເຂົ້າມາ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ການຕິດຕາມ {productname}, ຈະມີຄ່າບໍລິການລາຍເດືອນສຳລັບການຈັດການ ແລະ ອີກສ່ວນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບການຕິດຕາມ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-miscellaneous.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "ອື່ນໆ"

