#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc:1
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Guide"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມື Public Cloud"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide shows you the fastest way to get {productname} up and running in "
"a public cloud environment using on-demand, {payglongform} ({payg}), or "
"{byoslongform} ({byos}) services.  {productname} Proxy in a public cloud is "
"only supported using {byos} services."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຈະສະແດງວິທີທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານ {productname} ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຄລາວສາທາລະນະ ໂດຍໃຊ້ບໍລິການແບບຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ (On-demand), {payglongform} ({payg}), ຫຼື {byoslongform} ({byos}). ທັງນີ້ {productname} Proxy ໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະແມ່ນຮອງຮັບສະເພາະການໃຊ້ບໍລິການແບບ {byos} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#.  Is this statement correct regarding PAYG?
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Additionally, it assumes that you are installing the {productname} Server on "
"a single cloud instance.  These procedures have been tested on {awslongform} "
"and {azure}."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ມັນສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server ລົງໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຄລາວດຽວ. ຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຜ່ານການທົດສອບແລ້ວໃນ {awslongform} ແລະ {azure}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{payglongform} or {byoslongform} services currently work on both "
"{awslongform} and {azure}."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ {payglongform} ຫຼື {byoslongform} ໃນປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງໃນ {awslongform} ແລະ {azure}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information on using {productname}, see the official documentation "
"at https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນຳໃຊ້ {productname}, ເບິ່ງເອກະສານທາງການໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Support"
msgstr "ການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ Public Cloud"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "{byos} and {payg} support"
msgstr "ການສະໜັບສະໜູນແບບ {byos} ແລະ {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Regardless of the public cloud service you use or the plan you choose, "
"{suse} has you covered with support.  Where you get support is dependent on "
"whether you **{byoslongform}** ({byos}) or you use {suse} products "
"**on-demand** **{payglongform}** ({payg})."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ບໍລິການຄລາວສາທາລະນະໃດ ຫຼື ເລືອກແພັກເກັດໃດ, {suse} ກໍມີການສະໜັບສະໜູນໃຫ້ທ່ານ. ຊ່ອງທາງການຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າທ່ານໃຊ້ແບບ **{byoslongform}** ({byos}) ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນຂອງ {suse} ແບບ **ຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ (on-demand)** **{payglongform}** ({payg})."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{byos}:: {byos} instances are supported by {suse} under the terms of your "
"{suse} subscription.  For an overview of {suse}'s support subscriptions, "
"refer to https://www.suse.com/support/."
msgstr "{byos}:: ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ໄດ້ຮັບການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກ {suse} ພາຍໃຕ້ເງື່ອນໄຂການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {suse} ຂອງທ່ານ. ສຳລັບພາບລວມຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້ການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງ {suse}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.suse.com/support/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{payg}:: {productname} {payg} instances include support by SUSE.  To open a "
"ticket for {payg}, see https://scc.suse.com/cloudsupport."
msgstr "{payg}:: ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ລວມມີການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກ SUSE. ເພື່ອເປີດຕິກເກັດ (ticket) ສຳລັບ {payg}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://scc.suse.com/cloudsupport."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information on cloud products and support, see "
"link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-public-cloud/all/html/public-cloud/public-cloud.html[SUSE "
"Public Cloud Guide]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ cloud ແລະ ການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-public-cloud/all/html/public-cloud/public-cloud.html[SUSE Public Cloud Guide]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Information Tracker (PINT)"
msgstr "Public Cloud Information Tracker (PINT)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The Public Cloud Information Tracker (PINT) provides information about the "
"images {suse} publishes and servers that are part of the {suse} operated "
"update infrastructure.  PINT is available at "
"link:https://pint.suse.com/[pint.suse.com] and provided as an API and "
"command-line tool with the `python3-susepubliccloudinfo` package from the "
"Public Cloud Module repository."
msgstr "Public Cloud Information Tracker (PINT) ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບອິມເມຈ (Images) ທີ່ {suse} ເຜີຍແຜ່ ແລະ ເຊີເວີຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານການອັບເດດທີ່ດຳເນີນການໂດຍ {suse}. PINT ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການທີ່ link:https://pint.suse.com/[pint.suse.com] ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນຮູບແບບ API ລວມທັງເຄື່ອງມືຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ (Command-line) ດ້ວຍແພັກເກັດ `python3-susepubliccloudinfo` ຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຊອບແວ (Repository) ຂອງ Public Cloud Module."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collecting system information"
msgstr "ການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:11
msgid ""
"To create a TAR archive with detailed system information that you can hand "
"over to Global Technical Support, run the command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ TAR ທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບແບບລະອຽດ ເພື່ອກຽມສົ່ງໃຫ້ຝ່າຍສະໜັບສະໜູນເຕັກນິກທົ່ວໂລກ (Global Technical Support), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm support config\n"
msgstr "mgradm support config\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The default archive location is `/var/log`, with the file name format being "
"**scc_HOST_DATE_TIME.txz**"
msgstr "ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບ archive ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄື `/var/log`, ໂດຍມີຮູບແບບຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຄື **scc_HOST_DATE_TIME.txz**"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Opening a new support case"
msgstr "ການເປີດເຄສຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To open a new support case for your cloud {payglongform} instance, you need "
"to generate a **supportconfig** file and then follow the steps listed on:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດເຄສຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໃໝ່ສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ cloud {payglongform} ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ **supportconfig** ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:16
msgid "link:https://scc.suse.com/cloudsupport[{scclongform} Cloudsupport]"
msgstr "link:https://scc.suse.com/cloudsupport[ການສະໜັບສະໜູນຄລາວຂອງ {scclongform}]"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Billing services and troubleshooting"
msgstr "ບໍລິການຄິດໄລ່ເງິນ ແລະ ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "billing-data-service"
msgstr "billing-data-service"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:19
msgid ""
"This service serves billing data from {productname} for the "
"**CSP-billing-adapter**.  The service is reachable at:"
msgstr "ບໍລິການນີ້ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການຄິດບິນຈາກ {productname} ໃຫ້ກັບ **CSP-billing-adapter**. ບໍລິການນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ທີ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:20
msgid "http://localhost:18888/"
msgstr "http://localhost:18888/"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:21
msgid "http://localhost:18888/metering"
msgstr "http://localhost:18888/metering"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:22
msgid ""
"This service is maintained by the {productname} team.  This service only "
"logs to **systemd journal**."
msgstr "ບໍລິການນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການບຳລຸງຮັກສາໂດຍທີມງານ {productname}. ບໍລິການນີ້ຈະບັນທຶກ log ໄວ້ໃນ **systemd journal** ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Billing services** must be running or **spacewalk** will refuse to "
"start.\n"
msgstr "**ບໍລິການຄິດບິນ (Billing services)** ຕ້ອງກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ **spacewalk** ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "csp-billing-adapter-service"
msgstr "csp-billing-adapter-service"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This service reports the billing data to the cloud provider (AWS, AZURE).  "
"These logs are stored in:"
msgstr "ບໍລິການນີ້ຈະລາຍງານຂໍ້ມູນການຄິດໄລ່ເງິນໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວ (AWS, AZURE). ບັນທຶກເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ທີ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:26
msgid "`/var/log/csp_billing_adapter.log`"
msgstr "`/var/log/csp_billing_adapter.log`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:27
msgid "Additional status information can be located in:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະເພີ່ມເຕີມສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:28
msgid "`/var/lib/csp-billing-adapter/csp-config.json`"
msgstr "`/var/lib/csp-billing-adapter/csp-config.json`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:29
msgid "This service is maintained by public cloud team."
msgstr "ບໍລິການນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການບຳລຸງຮັກສາໂດຍທີມງານ public cloud."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "uyuni-payg-timer"
msgstr "uyuni-payg-timer"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:31
msgid ""
"This service checks if **billing-data-service** is installed and running.  "
"It also checks if the **csp-billing-adapter-service** is installed and "
"running.  If these services are not running or installed it will attempt to "
"install and start the service."
msgstr "ບໍລິການນີ້ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ກວດສອບວ່າ **billing-data-service** ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງກວດສອບ **csp-billing-adapter-service** ດ້ວຍ. ຫາກບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ, ມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເລີ່ມບໍລິການໃຫ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:32
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Consequences"
msgstr "ຜົນກະທົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:33
msgid ""
"  If one of the previous billing services is not running and cannot be "
"installed or started **spacewalk** will refuse to start."
msgstr "  ຫາກບໍລິການຄິດບິນໃດໜຶ່ງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້, **spacewalk** ຈະບໍ່ຍອມໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:34
msgid "Check `journalctl -u uyuni-payg-timer.service` for additional issues."
msgstr "ກວດສອບ `journalctl -u uyuni-payg-timer.service` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງບັນຫາເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Continuous compliance checks"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Compliance checks"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:37
msgid "Is the billing server running at http://localhost:18888/ ?"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີຄິດບິນກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ທີ່ http://localhost:18888/ ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:38
msgid "Is the **csp-billing-adapter.service** running?"
msgstr "**csp-billing-adapter.service** ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:39
msgid ""
"What is the status of the **csp-billing-adapter** located in "
"`/var/lib/csp-billing-adapter/csp-config.json`?"
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງ **csp-billing-adapter** ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ `/var/lib/csp-billing-adapter/csp-config.json` ແມ່ນຫຍັງ?"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed Checks"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບທີ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:41
msgid "Failed checks are logged in:"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບທີ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:42
msgid "`/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`"
msgstr "`/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:43
msgid "`/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log`"
msgstr "`/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log`"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:45
msgid "No more actions will be executed."
msgstr "ຈະບໍ່ມີການດຳເນີນການໃດໆອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg-support.adoc:46
msgid "`reposync` will stop synchronizing channels."
msgstr "`reposync` ຈະຢຸດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (synchronizing) ຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{aws} Image Preparation and Configuration"
msgstr "ການກຽມອິມເມຈ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າໃນ {aws}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers initial preparation and configuration of the image on "
"{aws}."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະກວມເອົາການຕຽມການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິມເມຈໃນ {aws}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IAM Role"
msgstr "ບົດບາດ IAM (IAM Role)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To ensure seamless operation, proper {aws} permissions for the IAM (Identity "
"and Access Management) role are essential.  This role must be attached to "
"the instance, otherwise disconnection errors will be thrown after one hour."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກເປັນໄປຢ່າງຮາບລື່ນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສິດ {aws} ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບບົດບາດ IAM (Identity and Access Management) ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນ. ບົດບາດນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດການຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼັງຈາກຜ່ານໄປໜຶ່ງຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can pre-create the role on your {aws} account and then select it from "
"the existing btn:[IAM role] drop-down during the instance configuration "
"process."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງບົດບາດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໃນບັນຊີ {aws} ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກຈາກລາຍການ btn:[IAM role] ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you create the role during the creation of an instance, the role will not "
"be attached automatically.  The role should be added post setup."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານສ້າງບົດບາດໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ບົດບາດນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ບົດບາດຄວນຖືກເພີ່ມຫຼັງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:7
msgid ""
"A role can be assigned to a running instance through the following steps: "
"menu:Actions[Security > Modify IAM-role].  It needs to have the following "
"policy attached in order to be used:"
msgstr "ບົດບາດສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຜ່ານຂັ້ນຕອນ: menu:Actions[Security > Modify IAM-role]. ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີນະໂຍບາຍ (policy) ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"    \"AttachedPolicies\": [\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"PolicyName\": \"AWSMarketplaceMeteringFullAccess\",\n"
"            \"PolicyArn\": "
"\"arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AWSMarketplaceMeteringFullAccess\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    ]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"    \"AttachedPolicies\": [\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"PolicyName\": \"AWSMarketplaceMeteringFullAccess\",\n"
"            \"PolicyArn\": \"arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AWSMarketplaceMeteringFullAccess\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    ]\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:9
msgid "To allow the **EC2** service to assume such role:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ບໍລິການ **EC2** ຮັບບົດບາດດັ່ງກ່າວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\"AssumeRolePolicyDocument\": {\n"
"            \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n"
"            \"Statement\": [\n"
"                {\n"
"                    \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n"
"                    \"Principal\": {\n"
"                        \"Service\": \"ec2.amazonaws.com\"\n"
"                    },\n"
"                    \"Action\": \"sts:AssumeRole\"\n"
"                }\n"
"            ]\n"
"        }\n"
msgstr ""
"\"AssumeRolePolicyDocument\": {\n"
"            \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n"
"            \"Statement\": [\n"
"                {\n"
"                    \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n"
"                    \"Principal\": {\n"
"                        \"Service\": \"ec2.amazonaws.com\"\n"
"                    },\n"
"                    \"Action\": \"sts:AssumeRole\"\n"
"                }\n"
"            ]\n"
"        }\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:11
msgid ""
"IAM role can be attached to an **EC2** instance by means of an instance "
"profile, which acts as a container for the role itself."
msgstr "ບົດບາດ IAM ສາມາດຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ **EC2** ໄດ້ຜ່ານ instance profile, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຕົວເກັບບົດບາດນັ້ນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For detailed information on IAM roles, see: "
"link:https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles.html[docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM]"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບບົດບາດ IAM, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ: link:https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles.html[docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM]"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure {productname} Instance"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname}"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring your {productname} instance"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Select the AMI image and provide a meaningful **name** for your server.  "
"Review the details and pricing information provided."
msgstr "ເລືອກອິມເມຈ AMI ແລະ ຕັ້ງ **ຊື່** ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃຫ້ກັບເຊີເວີຂອງທ່ານ. ກວດສອບລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນລາຄາທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You have the option to configure additional instance details in subsequent "
"steps, such as storage, tags, security groups, and the required **IAM "
"role**."
msgstr "ທ່ານມີທາງເລືອກໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ ເຊັ່ນ: ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (storage), ແທັກ (tags), ກຸ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພ (security groups), ແລະ **IAM role** ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:17
msgid "The image automatically suggests a **default CPU configuration**."
msgstr "ອິມເມຈຈະແນະນຳ **ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ CPU ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ** ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Choose an existing key pair or create a new one to grant access to the "
"instance."
msgstr "ເລືອກ key pair ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຫຼື ສ້າງໃໝ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິດໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Your organization should provide the necessary security groups and network "
"configuration."
msgstr "ອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈັດຕຽມກຸ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:20
msgid ""
"If an IAM role has been previously created, you can attach it by selecting "
"it from the existing menu:IAM role[] drop-down.  Otherwise, attach this role "
"after the instance has been launched."
msgstr "ຫາກມີການສ້າງ IAM role ໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ມັນໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກຈາກເມນູ IAM role[]. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ບົດບາດນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:21
msgid "Create the following partitions"
msgstr "ສ້າງພາທິຊັນ (partitions) ດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "**100 GB** for the root partition\n"
msgstr "**100 GB** ສຳລັບ root partition\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "**500 GB** for spacewalk storage\n"
msgstr "**500 GB** ສຳລັບ spacewalk storage\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "**80 GB** for the database.\n"
msgstr "**80 GB** ສຳລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ (database).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For more information see: "
"xref:public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc[AWS "
"requirements]"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມເບິ່ງ: xref:public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc[ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງ AWS]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:26
msgid "Follow the prompts from AWS to complete the configuration as needed."
msgstr "ເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳຈາກ AWS ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ສຳເລັດຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:27
msgid "After reviewing your configuration click the btn:[Launch instance] dropdown."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Launch instance]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:28
msgid "Click on the btn:[Launch Instances] button."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Launch Instances]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:29
msgid "You will be redirected to the **EC2** Dashboard."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງໜ້າ **EC2** Dashboard."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Verify that the instance has successfully launched by selecting "
"menu:Instances[] on the left sidebar.  The {productname} {payg} instance "
"should be running in the main content area."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ໂດຍເລືອກເມນູ menu:Instances[] ຢູ່ແຖບດ້ານຊ້າຍ. ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ຄວນຈະກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນເນື້ອຫາຫຼັກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:31
msgid "[NOTE]"
msgstr "[ໝາຍເຫດ]"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:32
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage and Costs"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Because this is a {payg} image, you will be billed according to your actual "
"usage, including the number of systems you **manage** and **monitor** with "
"this instance.  It is essential to regularly track and review your usage to "
"prevent unexpected costs and ensure alignment with your needs."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກນີ້ແມ່ນອິມເມຈແບບ {payg}, ທ່ານຈະຖືກຄິດບິນຕາມການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ລວມທັງຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ທ່ານ **ຈັດການ** ແລະ **ຕິດຕາມ** ດ້ວຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ກວດສອບການໃຊ້ງານຂອງທ່ານເປັນປະຈຳ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄາດຄິດ ແລະ ໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connecting {payg} Clients and Client Registration"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍ {payg} ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing Connections and Registering {payg} and {byos} images"
msgstr "ການຈັດການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນອິມເມຈແບບ {payg} ແລະ {byos}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:3
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{payg} ({payglongform}) Images:: Connecting and registering {payg} images is "
"supported and can be done without additional prerequisites."
msgstr "{payg} ({payglongform}) ອິມເມຈ:: ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນອິມເມຈ {payg} ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີເງື່ອນໄຂເບື້ອງຕົ້ນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:4
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{byos} ({byoslongform}) Images:: Registering {byos} images requires {scc} "
"({scclongform}) credentials beforehand.  If a user attempts to onboard a "
"{byos} image without providing {scc} credentials, the operation will fail, "
"as these credentials are required to verify your subscription."
msgstr "{byos} ({byoslongform}) ອິມເມຈ:: ການລົງທະບຽນອິມເມຈ {byos} ຕ້ອງມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (Credentials) ຂອງ {scc} ({scclongform}) ລ່ວງໜ້າ. ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ພະຍາຍາມເພີ່ມອິມເມຈ {byos} ໂດຍບໍ່ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນ {scc}, ການດຳເນີນການຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈຳເປັນໃນການກວດສອບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:5
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Always verify the type of image ({payg} or {byos}) prior to initiating the "
"registration process with {productname} to ensure a smooth and error-free "
"connection."
msgstr "ກວດສອບປະເພດອິມເມຈ ({payg} ຫຼື {byos}) ສະເໝີກ່ອນເລີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະເປັນໄປຢ່າງຮຽບຮ້ອຍ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:6
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you have {scc} credentials ensure your {scc} credentials are valid and "
"have the necessary permissions for utilizing {byos} images."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນ {scc}, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນຍັງໃຊ້ໄດ້ ແລະ ມີສິດທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການນຳໃຊ້ອິມເມຈ {byos}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:7
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Do not** register {payg} instances with the {scclongform}.\n"
"Only {byos} instances should be registered against the {scclongform}.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ຫ້າມ** ລົງທະບຽນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg} ກັບ {scclongform}.\n"
"ສະເພາະອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຄວນລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scclongform}.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Registering {payg} instances with the {scclongform}  or your own RMT "
"server will create conflicts that are not easily solved**.  \n"
"{payg} instances are automatically registered against the correct update "
"server when added to your cloud service provider {productname} instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ການລົງທະບຽນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg} ກັບ {scclongform} ຫຼື ເຊີເວີ RMT ຂອງທ່ານເອງ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຂັດແຍ່ງທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຍາກ**. \n"
"ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg} ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີອັບເດດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເມື່ອຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Starting Up Additional {payg} {suse} Products in {aws}"
msgstr "ການເລີ່ມໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ແບບ {payg} ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ {aws}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:10
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For more information on using {suse} {payg} products such as {sle} in the "
"public cloud see: "
"link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-public-cloud/all/html/public-cloud/cha-intro.html[SUSE "
"Linux Enterprise Public Cloud Guide]"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} {payg} ເຊັ່ນ {sle} ໃນ public cloud ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ: link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-public-cloud/all/html/public-cloud/cha-intro.html[SUSE Linux Enterprise Public Cloud Guide]"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Establishing a {payg} {sle} Connection with {productname} {payg}"
msgstr "ການສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg} {sle} ກັບ {productname} {payg}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:12
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:12
msgid ""
"It is important to recognize that there is a difference between "
"**{payglongform} connections** and **bootstrapping**.  Bootstrapping is also "
"known as **client registration**."
msgstr "ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າ **ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບ {payglongform}** ແລະ **ການບູດສະແຕຣັບ (Bootstrapping)** ແມ່ນຕ່າງກັນ. ການບູດສະແຕຣັບ ຍັງຖືກເອີ້ນອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງວ່າ **ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ (Client registration)**."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Once you have started up your {productname} {payg} instance and refreshed "
"products you can add **{payglongform} connections** via the menu:Admin[Setup "
"Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] btn:[+Add Pay-as-you-go] button.  This action links "
"your {productname} {payg} instance with additional {payg} products on {aws}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເລີ່ມອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ແລະ ອັບເດດລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ **ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payglongform}** ໄດ້ຜ່ານເມນູ:Admin[Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] ໂດຍຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[+Add Pay-as-you-go]. ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ຂອງທ່ານ ເຂົ້າກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ {payg} ອື່ນໆໃນ {aws}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:14
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Bootstrapping** or **client registration** is the process of onboarding "
"clients in {productname}. \n"
"The registration process installs the appropriate client tools and provides "
"full management functionality.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ການບູດສະແຕຣັບ** ຫຼື **ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ** ແມ່ນຂັ້ນຕອນການເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າໃນ {productname}. \n"
"ຂັ້ນຕອນການລົງທະບຽນຈະຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງມືລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຈັດການລະບົບຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບ.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:15
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To manage your clients, start by **establishing connections** and then "
"proceed to **bootstrap** your clients.  These two actions are the steps "
"required for initiating and completing the client onboarding process."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການ **ສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່** ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງດຳເນີນການ **ບູດສະແຕຣັບ** ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ. ສອງຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສຳເລັດຂັ້ນຕອນການເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:16
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Connecting {sle} {payg} Instances to {productname} {payg}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {sle} {payg} ເຂົ້າກັບ {productname} {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:17
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:17
msgid "Return to the {productname} Server {webui}."
msgstr "ກັບຄືນໄປຫາ {webui} ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] and click the btn:[+Add "
"Pay-as-you-go] button."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[+Add Pay-as-you-go]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:19
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:19
msgid "Add a description."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄຳອະທິບາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:20
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:20
msgid "Complete the instance SSH connection data:"
msgstr "ກອກຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:21
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:21
msgid "Host: `CSP URL of the machine`"
msgstr "Host: `CSP URL ຂອງເຄື່ອງ`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:22
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:22
msgid "SSH Port: `22`"
msgstr "SSH Port: `22`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:23
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:23
msgid "User: `root`"
msgstr "User: `root`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:24
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:24
