msgstr "Password: `<ລະຫັດຜ່ານ>`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:25
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:25
msgid "SSH Private Key"
msgstr "SSH Private Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:26
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Create] and wait for the sync to finish."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Create] ແລະ ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (sync) ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:27
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Proceed to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] to access your {payg} SUSE "
"Linux Enterprise products."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຜະລິດຕະພັນ {payg} SUSE Linux Enterprise ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Now that you have established connections to the {productname} {payg} "
"instance you can register them as clients. To learn how to register various "
"clients see: xref:client-configuration:registration-methods.adoc[Client "
"Registration Methods]"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານກໍສາມາດລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນ client ໄດ້. ເພື່ອສຶກສາວິທີການລົງທະບຽນ client ປະເພດຕ່າງໆ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ: xref:client-configuration:registration-methods.adoc[ວິທີການລົງທະບຽນ Client]"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtaining the {productname} Server {payg} Public Cloud Image on {aws}"
msgstr "ການຂໍຮັບອິມເມຈ {productname} Server {payg} ໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະຂອງ {aws}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Follow these step-by-step instructions to locate the {productname} "
"{productnumber} {payg} image on {aws}.  You can also review the latest "
"available images for the public cloud using Pint (Public Cloud Information "
"Tracker)."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເທື່ອລະຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ເພື່ອຊອກຫາອິມເມຈ {productname} {productnumber} {payg} ໃນ {aws}. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບອິມເມຈລ່າສຸດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Pint (Public Cloud Information Tracker)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:3
msgid "For more information see: link:https://pint.suse.com/[pint.suse.com]"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່: link:https://pint.suse.com/[pint.suse.com]"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Obtaining the {productname} {payg} Image on {aws}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຂໍຮັບອິມເມຈ {productname} {payg} ໃນ {aws}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In your browser navigate to the link:https://aws.amazon.com/console/[AWS "
"Management Console]."
msgstr "ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ link:https://aws.amazon.com/console/[AWS Management Console]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:6
msgid "Enter your AWS credentials and login."
msgstr "ກອກຂໍ້ມູນບັນຊີ AWS ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:7
msgid ""
"From the AWS Management Console dashboard, locate the menu:Services[] "
"dropdown."
msgstr "ຈາກ dashboard ຂອງ AWS Management Console, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາເມນູເລືອກ menu:Services[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:8
msgid "From the menu select menu:EC2[] under the **Compute** section."
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:EC2[] ພາຍໃຕ້ສ່ວນ **Compute**."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the EC2 dashboard, in the main content section, you'll find the "
"btn:[Launch Instance] button. Click it."
msgstr "ໃນ EC2 dashboard, ຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນເນື້ອຫາຫຼັກ, ທ່ານຈະພົບປຸ່ມ btn:[Launch Instance]. ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:10
msgid ""
"From the **Choose an Amazon Machine Image (AMI)** page.  Select **Browse "
"more AMIs**."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ **Choose an Amazon Machine Image (AMI)**, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ **Browse more AMIs**."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:11
msgid "Search for **{productname}**."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາຄຳວ່າ **{productname}**."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:12
msgid "Depending on your location select your AMI image."
msgstr "ເລືອກອິມເມຈ AMI ຂອງທ່ານ ຕາມສະຖານທີ່ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "**{productname} Server Family (EU and UK only)**\n"
msgstr "**{productname} Server Family (ສະເພາະ EU ແລະ UK ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "**{productname} Server Family (non-EU and non-UK-only)**.\n"
msgstr "**{productname} Server Family (ສະເພາະນອກ EU ແລະ ນອກ UK ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:15
msgid "Click btn:[Select]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Select]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:16
msgid "Proceed for image configuration."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິມເມຈຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:1
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "{aws} System Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງລະບົບສຳລັບ {aws}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When setting up a {productname} {payg} instance on {aws}, it is essential to "
"consider system requirements for optimal performance and functionality.  The "
"default requirements outlined below have been tailored for smooth deployment "
"and operation."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ໃນ {aws}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຄຳນຶງເຖິງຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງລະບົບ ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ຂໍ້ກຳນົດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ງານເປັນໄປຢ່າງຮຽບຮ້ອຍ."

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Requirement | Details\n"
"\n"
"| root storage\n"
"| 100 GB\n"
"\n"
"| spacewalk storage\n"
"| 500 GB\n"
"\n"
"| database storage\n"
"| 80 GB\n"
"\n"
"| CPU\n"
"| 4 cores; Use the **m5a**, **m5i**, **m6a**, **m6i** systems or newer \n"
"\n"
"| Memory\n"
"| 32 GB (minimum 16 GB)\n"
"\n"
"| Network Configuration\n"
"| Typically configured by your organization\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ | ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
"\n"
"| root storage\n"
"| 100 GB\n"
"\n"
"| spacewalk storage\n"
"| 500 GB\n"
"\n"
"| database storage\n"
"| 80 GB\n"
"\n"
"| CPU\n"
"| 4 cores; ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບ **m5a**, **m5i**, **m6a**, **m6i** ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ \n"
"\n"
