"| ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ | ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
"\n"
"| root storage\n"
"| 100 GB\n"
"\n"
"| spacewalk storage\n"
"| 500 GB\n"
"\n"
"| database storage\n"
"| 80 GB\n"
"\n"
"| CPU\n"
"| 4 cores\n"
"\n"
"| ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ\n"
"| 32 GB (ຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ 16 GB)\n"
