#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Log in and Update the system"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ ແລະ ອັບເດດລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:3
msgid "[role=procedure="
msgstr "[role=procedure="

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Within the Managed Resource group you have set up, you will find the virtual "
"machine. To get the details, click on the name of the virtual machine.  Here "
"you can see the (public) IP address which you need to connect to the running "
"instance. SSH into your {azure} instance."
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ Managed Resource group ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ທ່ານຈະພົບເຫັນເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ. ຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນ ທ່ານຈະເຫັນທີ່ຢູ່ IP (ສາທາລະນະ) ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ. ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ເຂົ້າຫາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {azure} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:5
msgid "Switch to the root user and update the system ."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ແລະ ອັບເດດລະບົບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network configuration"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#.  (Azure requirement, not ours).
#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Remember, the {productname} {payg} setup requires, that a new Virtual "
"Network and a new subnet is configured, which was performed in the previous "
"step."
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມວ່າ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} {payg} ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີການກຳນົດຄ່າ Virtual Network ໃໝ່ ແລະ ຊັບເນັດ (Subnet) ໃໝ່ ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ດຳເນີນການແລ້ວໃນຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Because {productname} {payg} is deployed as a 'Managed Application' it is "
"not possible to deploy into an existing network."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ {productname} {payg} ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນຮູບແບບ 'Managed Application', ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Before moving on to the next step, ensure the network is correctly "
"configured:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໄປຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"When you setup new clients which should be managed, take care that you put "
"them into the private subnet which is configured with {productname} {payg} "
"or peer your networks."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈັດການ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ນຳພວກມັນໄປໄວ້ໃນຊັບເນັດສ່ວນຕົວ (Private subnet) ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້ກັບ {productname} {payg} ຫຼື ເຮັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ (peering) ເຂົ້າຫາກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"If you want to manage systems in an already existing network, you must "
"configure **peering**."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄຸ້ມຄອງລະບົບໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ **peering**."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"link:https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-network/tutorial-connect-virtual-networks?tabs=portal#create-virtual-network-peer[Azure "
"documentation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ link:https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-network/tutorial-connect-virtual-networks?tabs=portal#create-virtual-network-peer[ເອກະສານຂອງ Azure]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Network configuration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Ensure the network configuration aligns such that `hostname -f` yields the "
"identical name as the reverse DNS lookup of the private IP address, for "
"instance, when executing `nslookup 10.0.0.X`."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າການກຳນົດຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍສອດຄ່ອງກັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `hostname -f` ສະແດງຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບ ການເຮັດ reverse DNS lookup ຂອງທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສ່ວນຕົວ, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `nslookup 10.0.0.X`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Insert the private IP with its Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN) into "
"`/etc/hosts`."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສ່ວນຕົວ ພ້ອມກັບຊື່ FQDN ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ `/etc/hosts`."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "10.0.0.4   instancename.location.internal.cloudapp.azure.com\n"
msgstr "10.0.0.4   instancename.location.internal.cloudapp.azure.com\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:20
msgid "Check the connection name with:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບຊື່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "nmcli con show\n"
msgstr "nmcli con show\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Modify the DNS search parameter using the connection name identified in the "
"previous step with:"
msgstr "ປັບປ່ຽນພາຣາມິເຕີການຄົ້ນຫາ DNS ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"nmcli con mod <your_connection_name> ipv4.dns-search "
"\"internal.cloudapp.azure.com\"\n"
msgstr "nmcli con mod <ຊື່_ການ_ເຊື່ອມ_ຕໍ່_ຂອງ_ທ່ານ> ipv4.dns-search \"internal.cloudapp.azure.com\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:24
msgid "Bring the connection up with:"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "nmcli con up <your_connection_name>\n"
msgstr "nmcli con up <ຊື່_ການ_ເຊື່ອມ_ຕໍ່_ຂອງ_ທ່ານ>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Subsequently, `hostname -f` should return the same FQDN as obtained from "
"`nslookup 10.0.0.X`."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, `hostname -f` ຄວນຈະສົ່ງຄ່າ FQDN ອັນດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກ `nslookup 10.0.0.X`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:27
msgid ""
"When adding new virtual machines (VMs), such as {sles}, it's crucial to "
"ensure that they are configured within the same subnet as the {productname} "
"instance, or that you have setup network peering.  This step is essential "
"for successful network setup and integration."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (VM) ໃໝ່ ເຊັ່ນ {sles}, ມັນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າ ພວກມັນຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຊັບເນັດດຽວກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname}, ຫຼື ທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ (peering) ແລ້ວ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງເຄືອຂ່າຍປະສົບຜົນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Additionally, be mindful of the geographical restrictions associated with "
"your plans.  Make sure to utilize the appropriate Azure accounts which "
"correspond to the specific geographic zones of your project."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ລະວັງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທາງພູມສາດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບແຜນການຂອງທ່ານ. ກະລຸນາຮັບປະກັນວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ບັນຊີ Azure ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບເຂດພູມສາດສະເພາະຂອງໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure storage"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring storage"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:31
msgid "SSH into your {azure} instance."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ງານ {azure} instance ຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານ SSH."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:32
msgid "Switch to the root user and update the system:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ແລະ ອັບເດດລະບົບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:35
msgid "Configure storage using the appropriate tool:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ເໝາະສົມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:36
msgid "For a standard setup, use `mgr-storage-server`."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບມາດຕະຖານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `mgr-storage-server`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:37
msgid "For a proxy configuration, use `mgr-storage-proxy`."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການກຳນົດຄ່າແບບ proxy, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `mgr-storage-proxy`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:38
msgid "For more details, run:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-storage-server --help\n"
"mgr-storage-proxy --help\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-storage-server --help\n"
"mgr-storage-proxy --help\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:40
msgid "These tools simplify the creation of container storage and database volumes."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄອນເທນເນີ ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນເປັນເລື່ອງງ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:41
msgid "Identify the block devices:"
msgstr "ລະບຸອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (Block devices):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/\n"
msgstr "ls /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:43
msgid "This command lists the disks created during deployment. Typically:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ດິສກ໌ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:44
msgid "`lun3` is the storage disk."
msgstr "`lun3` ແມ່ນດິສກ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:45
msgid "`lun4` is the database disk."
msgstr "`lun4` ແມ່ນດິສກ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:46
msgid "Configure storage using the identified devices:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-storage-server /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/lun3 /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/lun4\n"
msgstr "mgr-storage-server /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/lun3 /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/lun4\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:48
msgid "This command creates persistent storage volumes at:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງວໍລຸມເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນທີ່:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:49
msgid "`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`"
msgstr "`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:50
msgid ""
"For more details, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:51
msgid "Deploy using `mgradm` as root:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ `mgradm` ໃນຖານະ root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install podman <FQDN>\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman <FQDN>\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {payg} {webui} Setup "
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} {payg} "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:3
