#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure {payglongform} Behind Proxy"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າ {payglongform} ຜ່ານ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To identify if a machine is {payg} or not, {productname} needs to use `sudo` "
"to run `instance-flavor-check`tool."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າເຄື່ອງນັ້ນເປັນແບບ {payg} ຫຼື ບໍ່, {productname} ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ `sudo` ເພື່ອຣັນເຄື່ອງມື `instance-flavor-check`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If the customer is using a http proxy, they need to make sure this setting "
"is correctly managed by `sudo`, because by default most environment "
"variables are disregarded."
msgstr "ຫາກລູກຄ້າໃຊ້ http proxy, ພວກເຂົາຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຖືກຈັດການຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍ `sudo`, ເນື່ອງຈາກໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment variables) ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:4
msgid ""
"One way to do it, is to add a file `/etc/sudoers.d/keep_proxy.conf` with the "
"following content:"
msgstr "ວິທີໜຶ່ງທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຄື ການເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ `/etc/sudoers.d/keep_proxy.conf` ໂດຍມີເນື້ອຫາດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Preserve any possible proxy configuration\n"
"Defaults env_keep += \"http_proxy https_proxy no_proxy\"\n"
msgstr ""
"# Preserve any possible proxy configuration\n"
"Defaults env_keep += \"http_proxy https_proxy no_proxy\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-configure-payg-behind-proxy.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This ensures the proxy related environment variables are preserved during "
"the privileges escalation."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຮັບປະກັນວ່າ ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ proxy ຈະຖືກເກັບຮັກສາໄວ້ ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍົກລະດັບສິດ (privileges escalation)."

