#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{payg} Checks"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ {payg}"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checking the credentials"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If the script fails to collect the credentials, it should provide a proper "
"error message in the logs and in the {webui}."
msgstr "ຫາກ script ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໃນການເກັບລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ, ມັນຄວນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນ logs ແລະ ໃນ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:4
msgid "If the credentials are not working, `reposync` should show the proper error."
msgstr "ຫາກຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້, `reposync` ຄວນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using `registercloudguest`"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ `registercloudguest`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Refreshing or changing the `registercloudguest` connection to the public "
"cloud update infrastructure should not interfere with the credentials usage."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດ ຫຼື ການປ່ຽນແປງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ `registercloudguest` ໄປຍັງໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານການອັບເດດຄລາວສາທາລະນະ ບໍ່ຄວນສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ການໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Running `registercloudguest --clean` will cause problems if no new cloud "
"connection is registered with the cloud guest command."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `registercloudguest --clean` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ ຫາກບໍ່ມີການລົງທະບຽນ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄລາວໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ cloud guest."

