msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ໂດຍແຍກດິສກ໌ສຳລັບ {byos}"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Issue"
msgstr "ບັນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} setup results with an error while restarting services during "
"setup.  The setup fails on restarting `tomcat`."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການບໍລິການໃໝ່ລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ `tomcat` ໃໝ່."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-error-1.png"
msgstr "tshoot-error-1.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "ເຫດຜົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When {productname} is set up using separate disks for cache, {postgresql} "
"and spacewalk, the existing data within these partitions are covered under "
"the new mount point."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ {productname} ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ດິດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບ cache, {postgresql} ແລະ spacewalk, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ພາຍໃນພາກສ່ວນ (partitions) ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກກວມເອົາພາຍໃຕ້ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (mount point) ໃໝ່."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-partitions.png"
msgstr "tshoot-partitions.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Because of this, data for certain services like tomcat go missing due to a "
"broken symbolic link."
msgstr "ຍ້ອນເຫດນີ້, ຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບບາງບໍລິການເຊັ່ນ tomcat ຈຶ່ງຫາຍໄປເນື່ອງຈາກລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກ (symbolic link) ຂາດ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-broken-symlink.png"
msgstr "tshoot-broken-symlink.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:10
msgid ""
"As {productname} instance of cloud already has some services set up, when "
"the data is not available during set up it causes the service to not restart "
"as expected.  Therefore the setup fails."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ instance ຂອງ {productname} ເທິງ cloud ມີບາງບໍລິການທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ມັນຈຶ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິການບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຶ່ງຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

