"Separate storage for spacewalk, {postgresql} and cache.  The size of the "
"partition depends on the repository to be synchronized."
msgstr "ແຍກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ spacewalk, {postgresql} ແລະ cache. ຂະໜາດຂອງພາກສ່ວນ (partition) ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບ repository ທີ່ຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:18
msgid "Set up {productname} using `yast2 susemanager_setup`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ `yast2 susemanager_setup`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To resolve or avoid the issue, copy the data of the underlying partition "
"into the new partition by following the steps below:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໃຫ້ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນຂອງພາກສ່ວນເດີມລົງໃນພາກສ່ວນໃໝ່ໂດຍປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving the issue"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:22
msgid "Create a backup partition"
msgstr "ສ້າງພາກສ່ວນ (partition) ສຳຮອງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir /bkp\n"
msgstr "mkdir /bkp\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:24
msgid "Unmount the affected partition for example /var/cache."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Unmount) ພາກສ່ວນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ເຊັ່ນ /var/cache."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "umount /var/cache\n"
msgstr "umount /var/cache\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Check the underlying data in the partition.  This should list the actual "
"data present in the directory."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານໃນພາກສ່ວນດັ່ງກ່າວ. ເຊິ່ງຄວນຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls -l /var/cache\n"
msgstr "ls -l /var/cache\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:28
msgid "Copy the data onto the backup partition created in step 1."
msgstr "ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນພາກສ່ວນສຳຮອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp -prav /var/cache/* /bkp/\n"
msgstr "cp -prav /var/cache/* /bkp/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:30
msgid "Mount the partition again using option 1 or 2:"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Mount) ພາກສ່ວນຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ທາງເລືອກ 1 ຫຼື 2:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(option 1)   /dev/nvme0nxx /var/cache\n"
"(option 2)   mount -a (if you have the entries under /etc/fstab)\n"
msgstr ""
"(ທາງເລືອກ 1)   /dev/nvme0nxx /var/cache\n"
"(ທາງເລືອກ 2)   mount -a (ຖ້າທ່ານມີລາຍການຢູ່ໃນ /etc/fstab)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:32
msgid "Copy the backed up data from step 4 to the mounted partition"
msgstr "ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຮອງໄວ້ຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 4 ໄປຍັງພາກສ່ວນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp -prav /bkp/* /var/cache/\n"
msgstr "cp -prav /bkp/* /var/cache/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:34
msgid "Verify the data is present"
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າມີຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls -l /var/cache/\n"
msgstr "ls -l /var/cache/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:36
msgid "Repeat the {productname} setup"
msgstr "ເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2 susemanager_setup\n"
msgstr "yast2 susemanager_setup\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "ສະຫຼຸບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:39
msgid ""
"When using {productname} in public cloud with separate data partitions, make "
"sure that the existing data in those directories are copied onto the new "
"partition."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນ public cloud ທີ່ມີການແຍກພາກສ່ວນຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກຄັດລອກລົງໃນພາກສ່ວນໃໝ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Clients"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses formulas with forms to configure your SAP clients.  There "
"are two formulas that you need to use:"
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ສູດ (formulas) ພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ SAP ຂອງທ່ານ. ມີສອງສູດທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:3
msgid "`Hana` to configure the HANA database"
msgstr "`Hana` ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າຖານຂໍ້ມູນ HANA"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:4
msgid "`Cluster` to configure the clients into a cluster"
msgstr "`Cluster` ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້ເປັນແບບຄລັສເຕີ (cluster)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The formulas are provided by packages that you can download with your "
"package manager.  You need to install the formulas on the {productname} "
"Server.  When you have installed the package, you can use the {productname} "
"{webui} to enable and configure the formulas.  As you go through the formula "
"configuration process, provide details of the clients that contain your SAP "
"cluster, to set them up appropriately."
msgstr "ສູດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນມາພ້ອມກັບແພັກເກັດທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງສູດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server. ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດໄດ້. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ SAP cluster ຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To install the formulas on the {productname} Server, use your package "
"manager to install these packages:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງສູດຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດຂອງທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:7
msgid "`saphanabootstrap-formula`"
msgstr "`saphanabootstrap-formula`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:8
msgid "`sapnwbootstrap-formula`"
msgstr "`sapnwbootstrap-formula`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:9
msgid "`drbd-formula`"
msgstr "`drbd-formula`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:10
msgid "`habootstrap-formula`"
msgstr "`habootstrap-formula`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:11
msgid "`salt-shaptools`"
msgstr "`salt-shaptools`"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The order that you enable and configure the formulas is important.  You must "
"enable, configure, and apply the HANA formula first.  Then you can enable, "
"configure, and apply the cluster formula.  If you perform these steps in the "
"wrong order, your SAP installation fails."
msgstr "ລຳດັບໃນການເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດແມ່ນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍ. ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້, ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ສູດ HANA ກ່ອນ. ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້, ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ສູດ cluster ໄດ້. ຫາກທ່ານເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຜິດລຳດັບ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP ຂອງທ່ານຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable and Configure the HANA Formula"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ HANA"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:14
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and "
"click the client to use as the primary client in the cluster."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System List] ແລະ ຄລິກເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນລູກຂ່າຍຫຼັກ (primary) ໃນຄລັສເຕີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `Formulas` tab, locate the `Sap Hana Deployment` heading, "
"and check the `Saphanabootstrap` formula in the list.  Click btn:[Save] and "
"apply the highstate to activate the formula."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ `Formulas`, ຊອກຫາຫົວຂໍ້ `Sap Hana Deployment`, ແລະໝາຍເລືອກຟໍມູລາ `Saphanabootstrap` ໃນລາຍການ. ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານຟໍມູລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:16
msgid ""
"When the formula is activated, navigate to the menu:Formulas[Hana] tab, and "
"complete the details in the form."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສູດຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Formulas[Hana], ແລະ ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດໃນແບບຟອມໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Make sure you check `Install required packages` to install everything you "
"need on the client.  In the `Nodes` sections, type the short hostname of the "
"client to install the HANA database or the hostname you can retrieve on the "
"command line with:"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ໝາຍເລືອກ `Install required packages` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ໃນສ່ວນ `Nodes`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ hostname ແບບສັ້ນຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ HANA ຫຼື ຊື່ hostname ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ຜ່ານ command line ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '<client-name>' grains.item host\n"
msgstr "salt '<client-name>' grains.item host\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:19
msgid "Provide further details for the installation."
msgstr "ລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Complete the remaining details according to your environment, click "
"btn:[Save], and apply the highstate.  When the highstate is complete, you "
"can go on to apply the cluster formula."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເຫຼືອໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ຄລິກ btn:[Save], ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate. ເມື່ອ highstate ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການນຳໃຊ້ສູດ cluster ຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "mlm_sap_hana_formula.png"
msgstr "mlm_sap_hana_formula.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable and Configure the Cluster Formula"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ Cluster"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `Formulas` tab, locate the `Cluster` heading, and check the "
"`Habootstrap` formula in the list.  Click btn:[Save] and apply the highstate "
"to activate the formula."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ `Formulas`, ຊອກຫາຫົວຂໍ້ `Cluster`, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກຟໍມູລາ `Habootstrap` ໃນລາຍການ. ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານຟໍມູລາ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "mlm_sap_formulas.png"
msgstr "mlm_sap_formulas.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:26
msgid ""
"When the formula is activated, navigate to the menu:Formulas[Cluster] tab, "
"and complete the details in the form."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສູດຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Formulas[Cluster], ແລະ ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດໃນແບບຟອມໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Make sure you check `Install required packages` to install everything you "
"need on the client.  Give your cluster a name, and specify the hostname of "
"the primary client in the cluster."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ໝາຍເລືອກ `Install required packages` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ຄລັສເຕີຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ລະບຸ hostname ຂອງເຄື່ອງຫຼັກໃນຄລັສເຕີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Complete the remaining details according to your environment, click "
"btn:[Save], and apply the highstate."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເຫຼືອໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ຄລິກ btn:[Save], ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "mlm_sap_cluster_formula.png"
msgstr "mlm_sap_cluster_formula.png"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick Start: SAP Overview"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ່ວນ: ພາບລວມ SAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide shows you how to use {productname} to install and configure "
"an SAP cluster.  It guides you through setting up a single {productname} "
"Server, preparing your client systems, and configuring the cluster using "
"formulas."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນວິທີການໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SAP cluster. ມັນຈະແນະນຳທ່ານຜ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server ດ່ຽວ, ການກຽມລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄລັສເຕີໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about SAP, see the SAP documentation at "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ SAP, ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ SAP ຢູ່ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about {productname}, see the {productname} "
"documentation at https://documentation.suse.com/MLM."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {productname}, ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ {productname} ໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/MLM."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preparing Clients"
msgstr "ການກຽມລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Your SAP cluster requires several client systems.  Prepare your clients on "
"physical or virtual hardware, and ensure you have {sles}{nbsp}15 for SAP "
"installation media ready.  You cannot create an SAP cluster without the "
"{sles} SAP extension, as it provides tooling specific to SAP."
msgstr "SAP cluster ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງ. ໃຫ້ກຽມລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານໃນ ຮາດແວຈິງ ຫຼື ຮາດແວສະເືອນ, ແລະ ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}{nbsp}15 ສຳລັບ SAP ພ້ອມແລ້ວ. ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງ SAP cluster ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ {sles} SAP, ເພາະມັນມີເຄື່ອງມືສະເພາະສຳລັບ SAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:3
msgid ""
"One of the key features of SAP is high availability of the cluster.  Every "
"component within an SAP cluster has redundancy and failover protection.  "
"When you are preparing your clients, ensure you have enough hardware and "
"infrastructure to allow for this.  For more information about hardware "
"requirements, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap/15-SP4/html/SLES-SAP-installation/cha-plan.html#sec-hardware"
msgstr "ໜຶ່ງໃນຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼັກຂອງ SAP ແມ່ນຄວາມພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານສູງ (high availability) ຂອງຄລັສເຕີ. ທຸກໆສ່ວນປະກອບພາຍໃນ SAP cluster ຈະມີການສຳຮອງ ແລະ ລະບົບປ້ອງກັນການຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ (failover). ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານກຽມລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີຮາດແວ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານທີ່ພຽງພໍສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດຮາດແວ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap/15-SP4/html/SLES-SAP-installation/cha-plan.html#sec-hardware"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about the clients you need to set up for an SAP "
"cluster, see https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ SAP cluster, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to the {scclongform}"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍກັບ {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Each client within your SAP cluster must be registered with the "
"{scclongform}.  To obtain your registration code, navigate to "
"https://scc.suse.com/login in your web browser.  Log in to your {scc} "
"account, or follow the prompts to create a new account.  Click the "
"btn:[Subscriptions] tab to see the registration code.  When you install "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 for SAP the {unifiedinstaller} prompts you for the code."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃນ SAP cluster ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scclongform}. ເພື່ອຂໍລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ https://scc.suse.com/login ໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ. ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນເພື່ອສ້າງບັນຊີໃໝ່. ຄລິກທີ່ແຖບ btn:[Subscriptions] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}{nbsp}15 ສຳລັບ SAP, ລະບົບ {unifiedinstaller} ຈະຖາມຫາລະຫັດນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about registering {productname} with {scclongform}, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ {productname} ກັບ {scclongform}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the Clients for Clustering"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍສຳລັບການເຮັດ Clustering"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Every client system must have all the other client systems listed in their "
"`/etc/hosts` file.  Open the `/etc/hosts` file on each client, and add the "
"hostname for each of the other clients."
msgstr "ລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍທຸກເຄື່ອງຕ້ອງມີລາຍຊື່ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນໆທັງໝົດຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ `/etc/hosts`. ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ `/etc/hosts` ໃນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເພີ່ມ hostname ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນໆທັງໝົດລົງໄປ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Shared Storage Device"
msgstr "ສ້າງອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Each of the clients needs to be able to access a shared disk.  The shared "
"disk can be physical hardware connected by ethernet, or you can set up a "
"virtual disk and access it with iSCSI."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງດິສ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້. ດິສ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນສາມາດເປັນຮາດແວຈິງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍ ethernet, ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ virtual disk ແລະ ເຂົ້າເຖິງມັນດ້ວຍ iSCSI ກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you use a virtual disk, consider hosting it on a separate system.  Do not "
"use a client machine to host the shared storage disk."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ virtual disk, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໂຮສ (host) ມັນໄວ້ໃນລະບົບທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ຢ່ານຳໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອໂຮສດິສ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download the SAP Installation Software"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດຊອບແວການຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Download the SAP installation media and save a copy on each client.  The "
"software that you require differs depending on your environment.  For "
"example, if you are using HANA, you need the SAP HANA platform.  If you are "
"using Netweaver, you need different packages.  These software packages are "
"provided by SAP, not by {suse}."
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ. ຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ HANA, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ SAP HANA platform. ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ Netweaver, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງການແພັກເກັດອື່ນ. ແພັກເກັດຊອບແວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ SAP, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Ensure you have saved the installation software in the same file system "
"location on each client.  Alternatively, save it to a shared NFS drive."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ບັນທຶກຊອບແວການຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນ ໃນລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ. ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນໄດຣຟ໌ NFS ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Clients to Use Latest `module.run`"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `module.run` ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Each client needs to be configured to use the latest version of "
"`module.run`.  On each of the client machines, open the `/etc/salt/minion` "
"configuration file and add or edit this line:"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `module.run` ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ. ໃນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `/etc/salt/minion` ແລະ ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use_superseded:\n"
"  - module.run\n"
msgstr ""
"use_superseded:\n"
"  - module.run\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:19
msgid "Restart the `salt-minion` process to enable the changes:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂະບວນການ `salt-minion` ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Additional Disks for HANA"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງດິສ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ HANA"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For the clients that are going to run the HANA database, you require an "
"additional storage device.  This device is used to store files required by "
"HANA, which are located in the `/hana/` directory."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ງານຖານຂໍ້ມູນ HANA, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ອຸປະກອນນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ HANA ຕ້ອງການ, ເຊິ່ງຈະຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/hana/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:23
msgid ""
"We recommend that this storage device be at least 20{nbsp}GB.  For some "
"installations, you might require more, and it is possible to use multiple "
"disks to provide this storage.  For comprehensive hardware requirements, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ມີຂະໜາດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 20{nbsp}GB. ສຳລັບບາງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ດິສ໌ຫຼາຍໜ່ວຍເພື່ອເຮັດເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດຮາດແວທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to the Server"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:25
msgid ""
"First of all, make sure you have an activation key that is associated with "
"the `SLE-Product-SLES_SAP15` base channel.  For more information about "
"activation keys, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກ່ອນອື່ນໝົດ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ activation key ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ base channel `SLE-Product-SLES_SAP15`. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ activation keys, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping].  Fill "
"in the appropriate details, and make sure you check the `Manage System "
"Completely via SSH` checkbox.  In the `Activation Key` field, select the "
"SLES for SAP activation key."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Bootstrapping]. ກອກລາຍລະອຽດໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງ `Manage System Completely via SSH`. ໃນສ່ວນ `Activation Key`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ SLES for SAP activation key."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more information about registering, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Server"
msgstr "ການກຽມເຊີເວີ"

#.  This section needs cleanup for containers!!!
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before you start you need to deploy the {productname} Server.  The method "
"for deploying the {productname} Server varies depending on your hardware and "
"environment."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ (deploy) {productname} Server. ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຮາດແວ ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} is deployed using the `mgradm` command.  During the deployment "
"process, when you are prompted for which product to install, select "
"{productname} Server.  For more information about deploying the "
"{productname} Server, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc[]."
msgstr "{productname} ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `mgradm`. ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ເມື່ອລະບົບຖາມຫາຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ {productname} Server. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You need to do some configuration to set up the {productname} {webui}.  In "
"your browser, navigate to the URL of the server, and configure your "
"administration access to the {webui}."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງຢ່າງສຳລັບ {productname} {webui}. ໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີບເວີ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບຈັດການ (administration) ຂອງ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Now you can use the {webui} to prepare software channels and activation keys "
"for your clients."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {webui} ເພື່ອກຽມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ (software channels) ແລະ activation keys ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, add the appropriate SAP channels: From the "
"{webui}, add `SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 for SAP`."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງ SAP ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ: ຈາກ {webui}, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ `SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 for SAP`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Synchronize the {productname} Server with the {scclongform}.  You can do "
"this using the {webui}.  Add the new channel to your activation key."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ {productname} Server ກັບ {scclongform}. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ຜ່ານ {webui}. ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນ activation key ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To check if a channel has finished synchronizing navigate to "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] and select the `Products` tab.  This dialog "
"displays a completion bar for each product when they are being synchronized."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນວ່າຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ຊິງໂຄຣໄນສຳເລັດແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard] ແລະ ເລືອກແຖບ `Products`. ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຈະສະແດງແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ກຳລັງຊິງໂຄຣໄນຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Software channels can be very large.  The initial channel synchronization "
"can sometimes take up to several hours."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວອາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງຄ໌ຊ່ອງທາງໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດບາງຄັ້ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ ເຖິງຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When the initial synchronization is complete, we recommended you clone the "
"channel before you work with it.  This gives you a backup of the original "
"synchronization data."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຊິງຄ໌ຄັ້ງທຳອິດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໂຄນ (clone) ຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນໄວ້ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານມັນ. ອັນນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງຂອງການຊິງຄ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Command"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt commands have three main components: target, function, and arguments.  "
"The calls are constructed in this format:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ມີສາມສ່ວນປະກອບຫຼັກຄື: target (ເປົ້າໝາຍ), function (ຟັງຊັນ), ແລະ arguments (ອາກິວເມນ). ຮູບແບບການຮຽກໃຊ້ແມ່ນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt 'target' <function> [arguments]\n"
msgstr "salt 'target' <function> [arguments]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The target defines the client, or group of clients, on which to run the "
"function."
msgstr "Target ແມ່ນການກຳນົດລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມລູກຂ່າຍ ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:5
msgid "The function is the particular task to be run."
msgstr "Function ແມ່ນວຽກງານສະເພາະທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:6
msgid "Arguments provide any extra data required by the function."
msgstr "Arguments ແມ່ນການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຟັງຊັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Targets"
msgstr "Salt Targets (ເປົ້າໝາຍ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Salt command targets allow you to specify a client or group of clients.  "
"There are several different targets you can use."
msgstr "Target ຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້. ມີ target ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "General Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:10
msgid "List available grains on all clients:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍການ grains ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:11
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' grains.ls\n"
msgstr "salt '*' grains.ls\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:12
msgid "Target a specific client:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍສະເພາະເຄື່ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt 'web1.example.com' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt 'web1.example.com' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Glob Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍແບບ Glob (ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຕົວແທນ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:15
msgid "Target all clients using a particular domain:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດເມນໃດໜຶ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*example.com' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt '*example.com' test.ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:17
msgid "Target all clients using a particular label:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ໃດໜຶ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt 'label*' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt 'label*' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "List Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍແບບລາຍການ (List)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:20
msgid "Specify a flat list of clients, using their IDs:"
msgstr "ລະບຸລາຍການລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ ID ຂອງພວກເຂົາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -L 'client_ID1, client_ID2, client_ID3' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -L 'client_ID1, client_ID2, client_ID3' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Regular Expression Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍແບບ Regular Expression"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:23
msgid "You can also define targets with PCRE-compliant regular expressions:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍດ້ວຍ PCRE-compliant regular expressions ໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -E '(?!web)' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -E '(?!web)' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "IP Address Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍດ້ວຍ IP Address"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:26
msgid "List available client IP addresses:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍການ IP address ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' network.ip_addrs\n"
msgstr "salt '*' network.ip_addrs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:28
msgid "Target a specific client IP address:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ IP address ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍສະເພາະເຄື່ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -S '172.31.60.74' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -S '172.31.60.74' test.ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:30
msgid "Target all clients on a subnet:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດໃນ subnet ໃດໜຶ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -S 172.31.0.0/16 test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -S 172.31.0.0/16 test.ping\n"

#
#. This is general Linux info, not specific to the topic.
#. You can use the `ip` command to find the subnet mask in the format of `192.168.1.1/24`:
#. ----
#. ip -o -f inet addr show | awk '/scope global/ {print $4}'
#. ----
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:32
msgid ""
"For more on targeting, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/targeting/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/targeting/."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Execution Modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນການປະຕິບັດງານ (Execution Modules) ຂອງ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:34
msgid ""
"When you have specified a target, provide the module and function to execute "
"on the target."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸໂມດູນ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການກັບເປົ້າໝາຍນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:35
msgid "Find which modules can be executed on the target:"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາວ່າໂມດູນໃດແດ່ທີ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການກັບເປົ້າໝາຍໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' sys.doc\n"
msgstr "salt '*' sys.doc\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For a full list of callable modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/modules/all/index.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ທັງໝົດຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/modules/all/index.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Function Arguments"
msgstr "ອາກິວເມນ (Arguments) ຂອງຟັງຊັນ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:39
msgid "Functions accept arguments for any extra data."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນສາມາດຮັບອາກິວເມນສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃດໆກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For example, the `pkg.install` function requires an argument specifying "
"which package to install:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: function `pkg.install` ຕ້ອງການ argument ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຈະຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດໃດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' pkg.install yast2\n"
msgstr "salt '*' pkg.install yast2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:42
msgid ""
"You can provide more than one argument to a function, with spaces between "
"them.  For example:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງອາກິວເມນໃຫ້ກັບຟັງຊັນໄດ້ ໂດຍການເວັ້ນວ່າງລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"salt '*' cmd.run 'echo \"Hello: $FIRST_NAME\"' env='{FIRST_NAME: "
"\"John\"}'\n"
msgstr "salt '*' cmd.run 'echo \"Hello: $FIRST_NAME\"' env='{FIRST_NAME: \"John\"}'\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{salt} Connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {salt}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Depending on the size and spreadness of the environment where {productname} "
"is used some connectivity issues are possible.  There are no common "
"recommendations for all the possible use cases as the environments could be "
"very different expecially if public clouds instances are involved."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຂະໜາດ ແລະ ການກະຈາຍຕົວຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ {productname}, ອາດຈະພົບບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ບາງຢ່າງ. ບໍ່ມີຄຳແນະນຳທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບທຸກກໍລະນີ ເພາະສະພາບແວດລ້ອມອາດແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍ ໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກມີການໃຊ້ public cloud instances ມາ涉及."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minions Connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ Minions"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In case clients are losing the connection to the {productname} Server (or "
"{productname} Proxy if involved), they are unreachable from the "
"{productname} Server {webui} or with command line tools.  To understand such "
"a connection issue check if the client is not reachable from the "
"{productname} Server with `salt MINION_ID test.ping`, while `venv-salt-call "
"test.ping` (or `salt-call test.ping` if non-bundle {salt} is used on the "
"client) is working fine on the client side.  If this is the case, it is "
"recommended to set `tcp_keepalive` parameters."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຂາດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} (ຫຼື {productname} Proxy ຖ້າກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ), ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ໄດ້ຈາກ {webui} ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ຫຼື ດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືຄຳສັ່ງ.  ເພື່ອທຳຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດັ່ງກ່າວ ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ໄດ້ຈາກເຊີເວີ {productname} ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ `salt MINION_ID test.ping` ຫຼື ບໍ່, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ `venv-salt-call test.ping` (ຫຼື `salt-call test.ping` ຫາກມີການໃຊ້ {salt} ແບບບໍ່ແມ່ນ bundle ຢູ່ທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ) ແມ່ນຍັງສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີຢູ່ຝັ່ງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ.  ຫາກເປັນໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີ `tcp_keepalive`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The parameters with the values from the example below can be used as a "
"starting point to look for settings, which could prevent cases of connection "
"loss without restoring for some environments.  It is recommended to put the "
"parameters in the separate drop-in configuration file like "
"`/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf` or "
"`/etc/salt/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf`, depending on the minion type "
"used on the client side."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີພ້ອມກັບຄ່າຕ່າງໆໃນຕົວຢ່າງລຸ່ມນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການຂາດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນບາງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃສ່ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ເຊັ່ນ `/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf` ຫຼື `/etc/salt/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf`, ຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງ minion ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຝັ່ງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Keepalive Parameters Example Values"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ Keepalive"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"######      Keepalive settings        ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# ZeroMQ now includes support for configuring SO_KEEPALIVE if supported by\n"
"# the OS. If connections between the minion and the master pass through\n"
"# a state tracking device such as a firewall or VPN gateway, there is\n"
"# the risk that it could tear down the connection the master and minion\n"
"# without informing either party that their connection has been taken "
"away.\n"
"# Enabling TCP Keepalives prevents this from happening.\n"
msgstr ""
"######      ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Keepalive        ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# ຕອນນີ້ ZeroMQ ຮອງຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SO_KEEPALIVE ແລ້ວ ຫາກ OS ຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"# ຫາກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ minion ແລະ master ຜ່ານອຸປະກອນຕິດຕາມສະຖານະ\n"
"# ເຊັ່ນ firewall ຫຼື VPN gateway, ມັນອາດມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ\n"
"# master ແລະ minion ຈະຖືກຕັດໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ແຈ້ງໃຫ້ທັງສອງຝ່າຍຊາບ.\n"
"# ການເປີດໃຊ້ TCP Keepalives ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດເຫດການນີ້.\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Overall state of TCP Keepalives, enable (1 or True), disable (0 or "
"False)\n"
"# or leave to the OS defaults (-1), on Linux, typically disabled. Default "
"True, enabled.\n"
"tcp_keepalive: True\n"
msgstr ""
"# ສະຖານະໂດຍລວມຂອງ TCP Keepalives, ເປີດໃຊ້ (1 ຫຼື True), ປິດໃຊ້ (0 ຫຼື False)\n"
"# ຫຼື ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຂອງ OS (-1), ໃນ Linux ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້. ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ True, ເປີດໃຊ້.\n"
"tcp_keepalive: True\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# How long before the first keepalive should be sent in seconds. Default "
"300\n"
"# to send the first keepalive after 5 minutes, OS default (-1) is typically "
"7200 seconds\n"
"# on Linux see /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_time.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_idle: 10\n"
msgstr ""
"# ໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງ keepalive ທຳອິດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ). ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ 300\n"
"# ເພື່ອສົ່ງ keepalive ທຳອິດຫຼັງຈາກ 5 ນາທີ, ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຂອງ OS (-1) ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 7200 ວິນາທີ\n"
"# ໃນ Linux ເບິ່ງທີ່ /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_time.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_idle: 10\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# How many lost probes are needed to consider the connection lost. Default "
"-1\n"
"# to use OS defaults, typically 9 on Linux, see "
"/proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_probes.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_cnt: 3\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຈຳນວນການ probe ທີ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພື່ອພິຈາລະນາວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼຸດ. ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ -1\n"
"# ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຂອງ OS, ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 9 ໃນ Linux, ເບິ່ງທີ່ /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_probes.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_cnt: 3\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# How often, in seconds, to send keepalives after the first one. Default -1 "
"to\n"
"# use OS defaults, typically 75 seconds on Linux, see\n"
"# /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_intvl.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_intvl: 10\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຄວາມຖີ່ໃນການສົ່ງ keepalive (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ຫຼັງຈາກອັນທຳອິດ. ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ -1\n"
"# ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານຂອງ OS, ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 75 ວິນາທີໃນ Linux, ເບິ່ງທີ່\n"
"# /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_intvl.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_intvl: 10\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxies Connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ Proxies"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:13
msgid ""
"`salt-broker` service is used on {productname} Proxies to forward {salt} "
"traffic between the {productname} Server and `salt-minion` service used on "
"the client side.  It is possible that `salt-broker` and all the clients "
"behind it could be affected with the same issue as the clients directly "
"connected to the {productname} Server.  The issue could be fixed with the "
"same parameters as recommended for the minions, but specified in "
"`/etc/salt/broker` on each {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ `salt-broker` ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} Proxies ເພື່ອສົ່ງຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນ {salt} ລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Server ແລະ ບໍລິການ `salt-minion` ໃນຝັ່ງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າ `salt-broker` ແລະ ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງອາດຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກບັນຫາດຽວກັນກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} Server. ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ແນະນຳສຳລັບ minions, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ `/etc/salt/broker` ໃນແຕ່ລະ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:14
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy connectivity can also suffer when the connectivity to "
"the {productname} Server is lost for a quite long interval.  In such a case "
"Proxy connected clients started to retry the authentication to the "
"`salt-master` service on the {productname} Server.  This situation could be "
"potentially dangerous because it could lead to collecting large amount of "
"ZeroMQ messages with authentication attemps in the interal buffer of ZeroMQ "
"sockets used inside the `salt-broker` service.  Then, on restoring the "
"connection to the `salt-master` all of the pending messages will be pushed "
"to it.  It could lead to the issues on {productname} Server side with "
"`salt-master` service, because it could be impossible to serve all the "
"cached requests in appropriate time or even to the complete denial of the "
"service."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ {productname} Proxy ອາດຈະມີບັນຫາໄດ້ຫາກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} Server ຂາດຫາຍໄປເປັນເວລາດົນ. ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ, ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ Proxy ຈະເລີ່ມພະຍາຍາມຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນ (authentication) ໃໝ່ກັບບໍລິການ `salt-master` ໃນ {productname} Server. ສະຖານະການນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນອັນຕະລາຍເນື່ອງຈາກມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການສະສົມຂໍ້ຄວາມ ZeroMQ ຈຳນວນມະຫາສານໃນ buffer ຂອງ ZeroMQ sockets ພາຍໃນບໍລິການ `salt-broker`. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ `salt-master` ກັບຄືນມາ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປພ້ອມກັນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດກໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໃນຝັ່ງ {productname} Server ເພາະບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດການກັບຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍທັງໝົດໄດ້ທັນເວລາ ຫຼື ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢຸດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To avoid such situation a set of tuning parameters is available.  As the "
"most important one, `wait_for_backend` should be set to `True`.  This "
"prevents opening the sockets for the clients behind the proxy while the "
"connectivity to the `salt-master` service is not established.  In this case "
"the messages from the clients are not collected in the internal buffers.  "
"`drop_after_retries` is setting the number of retries before closing the "
"sockets to drop the cached messages.  The other parameters could help to "
"fine tune the behavior for the environment."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງສະຖານະການດັ່ງກ່າວ, ມີພາຣາມິເຕີສຳລັບປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ. ທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນ `wait_for_backend` ເຊິ່ງຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນ `True`. ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນການເປີດ sockets ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຫຼັງ proxy ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບບໍລິການ `salt-master` ໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະບໍ່ຖືກສະສົມໄວ້ໃນ buffer. ພາຣາມິເຕີ `drop_after_retries` ຈະກຳນົດຈຳນວນການພະຍາຍາມໃໝ່ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປິດ socket ເພື່ອລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່. ພາຣາມິເຕີອື່ນໆກໍສາມາດຊ່ວຍປັບແຕ່ງພຶດຕິກຳໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Setting timeouts, intervals and `drop_after_retries` to lower values are "
"making `salt-broker` service more aggressive on detecting the connection "
"loss to the `salt-master`, so that it puts the clients behind the proxy to "
"the conditions closer as they are connected directly to the {productname} "
"Server.  Increasing the values could provide some benefits in case if the "
"network channel between the {productname} Proxy and {productname} Server is "
"not stable enough, the message buffering can provide some flexibility while "
"re-establishing the connection."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ timeouts, intervals ແລະ `drop_after_retries` ໃຫ້ມີຄ່າຕ່ຳລົງ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິການ `salt-broker` ກວດສອບການຂາດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ `salt-master` ໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ. ແຕ່ຫາກເພີ່ມຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ສູງຂຶ້ນ ອາດຈະມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} Server ບໍ່ສະຖຽນ, ເພາະການເກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມໄວ້ໃນ buffer ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Values for Keepalive Parameters"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄ່າສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີ Keepalive"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"######   ZeroMQ connection options    ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# For more details about the following parameters check ZeroMQ "
"documentation:\n"
"# http://api.zeromq.org/4-2:zmq-setsockopt\n"
"# All of these parameters will be set to the backend sockets\n"
"# (from the salt-broker to the salt-master)\n"
msgstr ""
"######   ຕົວເລືອກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ZeroMQ    ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບພາຣາມິເຕີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ ZeroMQ:\n"
"# http://api.zeromq.org/4-2:zmq-setsockopt\n"
"# ພາຣາມິເຕີທັງໝົດນີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບ backend sockets\n"
"# (ຈາກ salt-broker ຫາ salt-master)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# connect_timeout (sets ZMQ_CONNECT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# default: 0\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# Sets how long to wait before timing-out a connect to the remote socket.\n"
"# 0 could take much time, so it could be better to set to more strict "
"value\n"
"# for particular environment depending on the network conditions.\n"
"# The value equal to 10000 is setting 10 seconds connect timeout.\n"
"connect_timeout: 3000\n"
msgstr ""
"# connect_timeout (ກຳນົດ ZMQ_CONNECT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ: 0\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ (milliseconds)\n"
"# ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໝົດເວລາ (timeout) ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ remote socket.\n"
"# ຄ່າ 0 ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນເກີນໄປ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຄັ່ງຄັດຂຶ້ນ\n"
"# ຕາມສະພາບເຄືອຂ່າຍໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມນັ້ນໆ.\n"
"# ຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ 10000 ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ timeout 10 ວິນາທີ.\n"
"connect_timeout: 3000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# reconnect_ivl (sets ZMQ_RECONNECT_IVL)\n"
"# default: 100\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# Sets the interval of time before reconnection attempt on connection "
"drop.\n"
"reconnect_ivl: 1000\n"
msgstr ""
"# reconnect_ivl (ກຳນົດ ZMQ_RECONNECT_IVL)\n"
"# ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ: 100\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ\n"
"# ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນທີ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼຸດ.\n"
"reconnect_ivl: 1000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# heartbeat_ivl (sets ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_IVL)\n"
"# default: 0\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# This parameter is important for detection of loosing the connection.\n"
"# In case of value equal to 0 it is not sending heartbits.\n"
"# It's better to set to more relevant value for the particular "
"environment,\n"
"# depending on possible network issues.\n"
"# The value equal to 20000 (20 seconds) works good for most cases.\n"
"heartbeat_ivl: 5000\n"
msgstr ""
"# heartbeat_ivl (ກຳນົດ ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_IVL)\n"
"# ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ: 0\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ\n"
"# ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອການກວດສອບວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼຸດຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"# ຫາກຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 0 ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງ heartbeat.\n"
"# ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ,\n"
"# ໂດຍພິຈາລະນາຈາກບັນຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"# ຄ່າ 20000 (20 ວິນາທີ) ມັກຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີໃນກໍລະນີທົ່ວໄປ.\n"
"heartbeat_ivl: 5000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# heartbeat_timeout (sets ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# default: 0\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# Sets the interval of time to consider that the connection is timed out\n"
"# after sending the heartbeat and not getting the response on it.\n"
"# The value equal to 60000 (1 minute) is considering the connection is "
"down\n"
"# after 1 minute of no response to the heartbeat.\n"
"heartbeat_timeout: 10000\n"
msgstr ""
"# heartbeat_timeout (ກຳນົດ ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ: 0\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ\n"
"# ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຈະພິຈາລະນາວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໝົດເວລາ (timeout)\n"
"# ຫຼັງຈາກສົ່ງ heartbeat ໄປແລ້ວແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບກັບ.\n"
"# ຄ່າ 60000 (1 ນາທີ) ໝາຍເຖິງການພິຈາລະນາວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼຸດ\n"
"# ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຕອບກັບ heartbeat ເປັນເວລາ 1 ນາທີ.\n"
"heartbeat_timeout: 10000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"######   Other connection options    ######\n"
"# The following parameters are not related to ZeroMQ,\n"
"# but the internal parameters of the salt-broker.\n"
"# drop_after_retries\n"
"# default: -1\n"
"# value unit: number of retries\n"
"# Drop the frontend sockets of the salt-broker in case if it reaches\n"
"# the number of retries to reconnect to the backend socket.\n"
"# -1 means not drop the frontend sockets\n"
"# It's better to choose more relevant value for the particular "
"environment.\n"
"# 10 can be a good choise for most of the cases.\n"
"drop_after_retries: 5\n"
msgstr ""
"######   ຕົວເລືອກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອື່ນໆ    ######\n"
"# ພາຣາມິເຕີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ບໍ່ກ່ຽວກັບ ZeroMQ,\n"
"# ແຕ່ເປັນພາຣາມິເຕີພາຍໃນຂອງ salt-broker.\n"
"# drop_after_retries\n"
"# ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ: -1\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ຈຳນວນການລອງໃໝ່\n"
"# ປິດ frontend sockets ຂອງ salt-broker ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ພະຍາຍາມ\n"
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ backend socket ຄົບຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ກຳນົດແລ້ວ.\n"
"# -1 ໝາຍເຖິງ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງປິດ frontend sockets\n"
"# ຄວນເລືອກຄ່າທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"# ຄ່າ 10 ເປັນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ດີສຳລັບກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.\n"
"drop_after_retries: 5\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# wait_for_backend\n"
"# default: False\n"
"# The main aim of this parameter is to prevent  collecting the messages\n"
"# with the open frontend socket and prevent pushing them on connecting\n"
"# the backend socket to prevent large number of messages to be pushed\n"
"# at once to salt-master.\n"
"# It's better to set it to True if there is significant numer of minions\n"
"# behind the salt-broker.\n"
"wait_for_backend: True\n"
msgstr ""
"# wait_for_backend\n"
"# ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ: False\n"
"# ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການສະສົມຂໍ້ຄວາມ\n"
"# ໃນຂະນະທີ່ frontend socket ເປີດຢູ່ ແລະ ປ້ອງກັນການສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດ\n"
"# ທັນທີທີ່ backend socket ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ\n"
"# ຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງ salt-master ພ້ອມກັນໃນບາດດຽວ.\n"
"# ຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນ True ຫາກມີ minions ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ\n"
"# ທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ salt-broker.\n"
"wait_for_backend: True\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Salt States"
msgstr "Salt States ແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can create your own custom Salt states with {productname} as centrally "
"managed configuration channels.  Custom states are stored as Salt state "
"files on the {productname} Server with a `.sls` extension."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ Salt states ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງດ້ວຍ {productname} ເພື່ອເປັນຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບລວມສູນ. Custom states ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນໄຟລ໌ Salt state ໃນ {productname} Server ດ້ວຍນາມສະກຸນ `.sls`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a New Custom Salt Channel"
msgstr "ສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງ Salt ແບບກຳນົດເອງໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} {webui} to create and edit custom Salt state "
"files.  You must create a state channel first, with an initial state named "
"`init.sls`.  The `init.sls` file is used to reference all other state files "
"within the channel.  The custom states that you create using the {webui} are "
"stored on the {productname} Server in the "
"`/srv/susemanager/salt/<organization>/` directory."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ເພື່ອສ້າງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ custom Salt state. ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງ state channel ກ່ອນ, ໂດຍມີ state ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຊື່ວ່າ `init.sls`. ໄຟລ໌ `init.sls` ໃຊ້ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງຫາໄຟລ໌ state ອື່ນໆທັງໝົດພາຍໃນຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນ. Custom states ທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຜ່ານ {webui} ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ {productname} Server ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/srv/susemanager/salt/<organization>/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:5
msgid ""
"After the channel is created with an `init.sls` file, you can write "
"additional state files in the {webui}.  Alternatively, you can upload "
"existing state files to use within your state channel, or import them from "
"other channels or clients."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ `init.sls` ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນໄຟລ໌ state ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ {webui} ໄດ້. ຫຼື ທ່ານອາດຈະອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ state ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຫຼື ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກຊ່ອງທາງ ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Custom Salt Channel and Initial State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງ Salt ແບບກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ State ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:7
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:17
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:23
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:29
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:52
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Configuration[Channels]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Configuration[Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:8
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:53
msgid "Click btn:[Create State Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create State Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:9
msgid "In the `Name` field, type a name for your state."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Name`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບ state ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the `Label` field, type a label.  Use alphanumeric characters, hyphens, "
"and underscores.  Do not use spaces."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Label`, ໃຫ້ພິມປ້າຍຊື່ (label). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນ, ຕົວເລກ, ຂີດຕໍ່ (-) ແລະ ຂີດກ້ອງ (_). ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຫວ່າງວ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the `Description` field, type a short description of the configuration "
"your state performs."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Description`, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ state ຂອງທ່ານດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the `SLS Contents` field, type the contents of your `init.sls` state.  If "
"you want to reference file templates in this configuration channel, ensure "
"your file starts by specifying the source of the managed file, using this "
"syntax:"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `SLS Contents`, ໃຫ້ພິມເນື້ອໃນຂອງ `init.sls` state ຂອງທ່ານ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການອ້າງອີງເຖິງ file templates ໃນຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການລະບຸແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາຂອງ managed file ໂດຍໃຊ້ syntax ນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"file.managed:\n"
"  - source: salt://<org_name>/<channel_name>/etc/<ID>/<filename>\n"
msgstr ""
"file.managed:\n"
"  - source: salt://<org_name>/<channel_name>/etc/<ID>/<filename>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid " Example custom state files are given later in this section.\n"
msgstr " ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ state ແບບກຳນົດເອງຈະມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໃນພາຍຫຼັງໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:15
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click btn:[Update Channel] to save your state.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update Channel] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ state ຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Additional Files to a Custom State Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງ Salt State ແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid " Click the name of the channel you want to add files to."
msgstr " ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:19
msgid ""
"To create a new file, click btn:[Create configuration file] and type the "
"contents of the file."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່, ຄລິກ btn:[Create configuration file] ແລະ ພິມເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To upload an existing file, click btn:[Upload Configuration Files] and "
"select the file to upload."
msgstr "ເພື່ອອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຄລິກ btn:[Upload Configuration Files] ແລະ ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະອັບໂຫຼດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To copy an existing file, click btn:[Import a File from Another Channel or "
"System] and select the file to copy."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຄລິກ btn:[Import a File from Another Channel or System] ແລະ ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະສຳເນົາ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Editing a Custom Salt State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ Salt State ແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:24
msgid "Click btn:[View/Edit <filename>.sls File]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[View/Edit <filename>.sls File]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:25
msgid "Make your changes to the file."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການປ່ຽນແປງໃນໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Update Configuration File] to save your state."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update Configuration File] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ state ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:27
msgid ""
"You can also manage revisions, compare the state to others in your "
"organization, and download the `.sls` file from this dialog."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຈັດການລຸ້ນ (revisions), ປຽບທຽບ state ກັບອັນອື່ນໆໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ `.sls` ໄດ້ຈາກກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning a Client to a Custom Salt State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້ກັບ Salt State ແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:30
msgid "Click the name of the state you want to assign a client to."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ state ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:31
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Systems[Target Systems] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Systems[Target Systems]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:32
msgid "Check the clients you want to assign."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:33
msgid "Click btn:[Subscribe systems]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Subscribe systems]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:34
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt state modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/states/all/index.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt state modules, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/states/all/index.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Custom State Files"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ State ແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:36
msgid ""
"This section contains some example custom state files.  Use these as a basis "
"for writing your own custom states."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີບາງຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ state ແບບກຳນົດເອງ. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານ ໃນການຂຽນ state ແບບກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Manage a File"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຄຸ້ມຄອງໄຟລ໌"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"my_config_change_id:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - name: /etc/my.conf\n"
"    - source: salt://example_org/example_channel/etc/my.conf\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: 644\n"
"    - template: jinja\n"
msgstr ""
"my_config_change_id:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - name: /etc/my.conf\n"
"    - source: salt://example_org/example_channel/etc/my.conf\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: 644\n"
"    - template: jinja\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Package Management"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຄຸ້ມຄອງແພັກເກັດ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"my_pkg_id:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - refresh: True\n"
"    - pkgs:\n"
"      - glibc\n"
"      - kernel-default\n"
"      - hello: 1.0-42\n"
msgstr ""
"my_pkg_id:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - refresh: True\n"
"    - pkgs:\n"
"      - glibc\n"
"      - kernel-default\n"
"      - hello: 1.0-42\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Remote Command"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄຳສັ່ງໄລຍະໄກ (Remote Command)"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ip_forward-on:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: echo \"1\" > /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward\n"
"    - onlyif:\n"
"      - test `cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward` -eq 0\n"
msgstr ""
"ip_forward-on:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: echo \"1\" > /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward\n"
"    - onlyif:\n"
"      - test `cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward` -eq 0\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Service Management"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຄຸ້ມຄອງບໍລິການ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"time_service_id:\n"
"  service.running:\n"
"    - name: chronyd\n"
"    - enable: True\n"
msgstr ""
"time_service_id:\n"
"  service.running:\n"
"    - name: chronyd\n"
"    - enable: True\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom State to Trust a GPG Key"
msgstr "State ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື GPG Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:46
msgid ""
"By default, operating systems trust only their own GPG keys when they are "
"installed, and do not trust keys provided by third party packages.  The "
"clients can be successfully bootstrapped without the GPG key being trusted.  "
"However, you cannot install new third party packages or update them until "
"the keys are trusted."
msgstr "ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານແລ້ວ, ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຈະເຊື່ອຖືສະເພາະ GPG keys ຂອງຕົນເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນເມື່ອຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖື keys ທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍແພັກເກັດຈາກພາຍນອກ (third party). ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດເຮັດ bootstrapping ໄດ້ສຳເລັດໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຊື່ອຖື GPG key ກໍໄດ້. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດໃໝ່ ຫຼື ອັບເດດພວກມັນໄດ້ ຈົນກວ່າ keys ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Salt clients are set to trust {suse} tools channels GPG keys when they are "
"bootstrapped.  For all other clients and channels, you need to manually "
"trust third party GPG keys."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຊື່ອຖື GPG keys ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມື {suse} ເມື່ອພວກມັນ ຖືກ bootstrapped. ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຊື່ອຖື GPG keys ຈາກພາຍນອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:48
msgid ""
"If you are bootstrapping Salt clients from the {productname} {webui}, you "
"can use a custom Salt state to trust the GPG key."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດ bootstrapping ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຈາກ {productname} {webui}, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Salt state ແບບກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື GPG key ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Trusting a GPG Key With a Custom Salt State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື GPG Key ດ້ວຍ Salt State ແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Locate the key that you need to trust.  Ensure you have the correct key, and "
"that you also have the fingerprint used to verify the key.  This information "
"is available from the vendor or, in some cases, from a key server."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ key ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື. ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ key ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແລະ ທ່ານກໍມີ fingerprint ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນ key ນັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສາມາດຫາໄດ້ຈາກ ຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor) ຫຼື ໃນບາງກໍລະນີແມ່ນຈາກ key server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Copy the key to a file location where the client can access it.  We "
"recommend saving it in the `/srv/www/htdocs/pub/` directory, where all user "
"public files must be saved."
msgstr "ຄັດລອກ key ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/srv/www/htdocs/pub/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:54
msgid ""
"In the `Name` field, type a name for your state.  For example, `GPG Key "
"Trusts`."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Name`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບ state ຂອງທ່ານ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: `GPG Key Trusts`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:55
msgid "In the `Label` field, type a label.  For example, `GPG_Key_Trusts`."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Label`, ໃຫ້ພິມປ້າຍຊື່ (label). ຕົວຢ່າງ: `GPG_Key_Trusts`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the `Description` field, type a short description of the configuration "
"your state performs.  For example, `Trusts GPG Keys for CentOS`."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Description`, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: `Trusts GPG Keys for CentOS`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:57
msgid ""
"In the `SLS Contents` field, create a state to retrieve the appropriate key "
"from the {productname} Server and trust it on the client.  The exact "
"contents of your state varies depending on your client operating system.  "
"For example:"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `SLS Contents`, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ state ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ key ທີ່ເໝາະສົມຈາກ {productname} Server ແລະ ໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອຖືໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ເນື້ອໃນຂອງ state ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rpm_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: rpm --import https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') "
"}}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"
"    - unless: rpm -q gpg-pubkey-<key_id>\n"
msgstr ""
"rpm_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: rpm --import https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') }}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"
"    - unless: rpm -q gpg-pubkey-<key_id>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"deb_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  mgrcompat.module_run:\n"
"    - name: pkg.add_repo_key\n"
"    - path: https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') "
"}}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"
msgstr ""
"deb_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  mgrcompat.module_run:\n"
"    - name: pkg.add_repo_key\n"
"    - path: https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') }}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Alternatively, you can add GPG keys to a configuration channel, using a "
"managed file to deploy them directly on the client.\n"
"  In this case, you would use a local path to the key, rather than a URL.\n"
msgstr ""
"  ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ GPG keys ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ managed file ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນໂດຍກົງໃນລູກຂ່າຍ.\n"
"  ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນ, ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງສຳລັບ key, ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ URL.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Configuration[Channels] and click the name of the state you "
"want to assign a client to.\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Configuration[Channels] ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ state ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Systems[Target Systems] tab and check the clients you "
"want to assign.\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Systems[Target Systems] ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດໃຫ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click btn:[Subscribe systems].\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Subscribe systems].\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When the configuration file is next run on the client, the GPG key is "
"trusted.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າຖືກດຳເນີນການໃນລູກຂ່າຍຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ, GPG key ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can manage your GPG keys from your own repository hosted "
"on an external file management system."
msgstr "ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄຸ້ມຄອງ GPG keys ຂອງທ່ານຈາກ repository ຂອງຕົນເອງ ທີ່ໂຮສ (host) ໄວ້ໃນລະບົບບໍລິຫານຈັດການໄຟລ໌ພາຍນອກໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a custom state at highstate"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ state ແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ highstate"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:68
msgid ""
"To apply a custom state at highstate create a mapping in "
"`/srv/salt/top.sls`.  This short example maps the `test` state to the system "
"group `12`:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ custom state ໃນ highstate ໃຫ້ສ້າງການຈັບຄູ່ (mapping) ໃນ `/srv/salt/top.sls`. ຕົວຢ່າງສັ້ນໆນີ້ຈະຈັບຄູ່ state `test` ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ `12`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /srv/salt/top.sls\n"
"base:\n"
"  'group_ids:12':\n"
"    - match: pillar\n"
"    - test\n"
msgstr ""
"# /srv/salt/top.sls\n"
"base:\n"
"  'group_ids:12':\n"
"    - match: pillar\n"
"    - test\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt File Locations and Structure"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງຂອງໄຟລ໌ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:2
msgid ""
"There are several ways to set up the Salt file structure.  This section "
"describes how Salt is supported and set up as part of {productname} Server.  "
"The main configuration file is `/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`."
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການຕັ້ງໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂອງ Salt. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍວິທີທີ່ Salt ຖືກຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ {productname} Server. ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼັກແມ່ນ `/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Do not edit the `/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf` configuration file.  "
"This file belongs to the `spacewalk-setup` package and is marked as "
"`%config`.  When {suse} updates the `spacewalk-setup` package, the "
"`susemanager.conf` file is overwritten, and any customization is lost.  "
"Instead, add your own configuration file to the `/etc/salt/master.d/` "
"directory.  This prevents the update process from deleting your settings "
"from the main `susemanager.conf` configuration file."
msgstr "ຫ້າມແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf` ໂດຍກົງ. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ເປັນຂອງແພັກເກດ `spacewalk-setup` ແລະ ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນ `%config`. ເມື່ອ {suse} ອັບເດດແພັກເກດ, ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆຈະຫາຍໄປ. ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານເອງໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/etc/salt/master.d/` ແທນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Some settings from `/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf` that can help with "
"finding configuration options:"
msgstr "ບາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈາກ `/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf` ທີ່ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃນການຄົ້ນຫາຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Configure different file roots. Custom salt states should only be placed "
"in\n"
"# /srv/salt.\n"
"# Users should not touch other directories listed here.\n"
"file_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /usr/share/salt-formulas/states\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states\n"
"    - /srv/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /srv/salt\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຕັ້ງຄ່າ file roots ຕ່າງໆ. Salt states ແບບກຳນົດເອງຄວນຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນ\n"
"# /srv/salt ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"# ຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ຄວນແຕະຕ້ອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີອື່ນໆທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້.\n"
"file_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /usr/share/salt-formulas/states\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states\n"
"    - /srv/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /srv/salt\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Configure different pillar roots. Custom pillar data should only be "
"placed\n"
"# in /srv/pillar.\n"
"# Users should not touch other directories listed here.\n"
"pillar_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /srv/pillar\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຕັ້ງຄ່າ pillar roots ຕ່າງໆ. ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ແບບກຳນົດເອງຄວນຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນ\n"
"# /srv/pillar ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"# ຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ຄວນແຕະຕ້ອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີອື່ນໆທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້.\n"
"pillar_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /srv/pillar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:7
msgid ""
"When you are working with `/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`, be aware "
"that:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຮັດວຽກກັບ `/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`, ໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:8
msgid "Files listed are searched in the order they appear"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸຈະຖືກຄົ້ນຫາຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ພວກມັນປະກົດຂຶ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:9
msgid "The first matching file found is called"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:10
msgid "The {productname} Server reads Salt state data from five root directories:"
msgstr "{productname} Server ອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ Salt state ຈາກຫ້າໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ (root directories):"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "`/usr/share/susemanager/salt`"
msgstr "`/usr/share/susemanager/salt`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This directory is shipped and updated with {productname} and includes "
"certificate setup and common state logic to be applied to packages and "
"channels."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຖືກສົ່ງມອບ ແລະ ອັບເດດພ້ອມກັບ {productname} ແລະ ປະກອບມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ແລະ ຕັກກະ state ທົ່ວໄປທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ກັບແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:13
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:17
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:20
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:28
msgid "Do not edit or add custom Salt data to this directory."
msgstr "ຫ້າມແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນ Salt ແບບກຳນົດເອງເຂົ້າໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "`/usr/share/salt-formulas/states`"
msgstr "`/usr/share/salt-formulas/states`"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "`/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states`"
msgstr "`/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:16
msgid ""
"These directories are shipped and updated with {productname} or additional "
"extensions.  They include states for Salt formulas."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສົ່ງມອບ ແລະ ອັບເດດພ້ອມກັບ {productname} ຫຼື ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ພວກມັນປະກອບມີ states ສຳລັບ Salt formulas."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "`/srv/susemanager/salt`"
msgstr "`/srv/susemanager/salt`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:19
msgid ""
"This directory is generated by {productname}, based on assigned channels and "
"packages for clients, groups, and organizations.  This directory will be "
"overwritten and regenerated.  It is the Salt equivalent of the {productname} "
"database."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ {productname}, ໂດຍອີງຕາມຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ແພັກເກັດທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ, ກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ອົງກອນ. ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ ແລະ ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ສະເໝີ. ມັນປຽບເໝືອນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:21
msgid "Within this directory, each organization has a sub-directory."
msgstr "ພາຍໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້, ແຕ່ລະອົງກອນຈະມີໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍຂອງຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: SLS File Directory Structure"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂຄງສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໄຟລ໌ SLS"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"├── manager_org_<org id>\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │    ... files needed by states (uploaded by users)...\n"
"│   └── state.sls\n"
"         ... other SLS files (created by users)...\n"
"For example:\n"
"├── manager_org_TESTING\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │   └── motd     # user created\n"
"│   │    ... other files needed by states ...\n"
"│   └── motd.sls     # user created\n"
"            ... other SLS files ...\n"
msgstr ""
"├── manager_org_<org id>\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │    ... ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ states ຕ້ອງການ (ອັບໂຫຼດໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້)...\n"
"│   └── state.sls\n"
"         ... ໄຟລ໌ SLS ອື່ນໆ (ສ້າງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້)...\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
"├── manager_org_TESTING\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │   └── motd     # ສ້າງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້\n"
"│   │    ... ໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆທີ່ states ຕ້ອງການ ...\n"
"│   └── motd.sls     # ສ້າງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້\n"
"            ... ໄຟລ໌ SLS ອື່ນໆ ...\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "`/srv/salt`"
msgstr "`/srv/salt`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This directory is used for custom state data, modules, and related data.  "
"{productname} does not operate or use this directory directly.  The state "
"data in this directory is used by the client highstate, and is merged with "
"the total state result generated by {productname}.  Use this directory for "
"custom Salt data."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ state ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ໂມດູນ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. {productname} ບໍ່ໄດ້ດຳເນີນການ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ໂດຍກົງ. ຂໍ້ມູນ state ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ client highstate, ແລະ ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບຜົນລັດ state ທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ {productname}. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ Salt ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:26
msgid "The {productname} Server reads Salt pillar data from two root directories:"
msgstr "{productname} Server ອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ Salt pillar ຈາກສອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:27
msgid ""
"/usr/share/susemanager/pillar:: This directory is generated by "
"{productname}.  It is shipped and updated together with {productname}."
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/pillar:: ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ {productname}. ມັນຖືກສົ່ງມອບ ແລະ ອັບເດດພ້ອມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:29
msgid ""
"/srv/pillar:: By default, {productname} does not operate or use this "
"directory directly.  The custom pillar data in this directory is merged with "
"the pillar result created by {productname}.  Use this directory for custom "
"Salt pillar data."
msgstr "/srv/pillar:: ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານແລ້ວ, {productname} ບໍ່ໄດ້ດຳເນີນການ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ໂດຍກົງ. ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ແບບກຳນົດເອງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບຜົນລັດ pillar ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ {productname}. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ Salt pillar ແບບກຳນົດເອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can use the `gitfs` fileserver backend to serve Salt data from git "
"repositories.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-gitfs.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ `gitfs` fileserver backend ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ Salt ຈາກ git repositories ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-gitfs.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bind Formula"
msgstr "Bind Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Bind formula is used to configure the Domain Name System (DNS) on the "
"branch server.  POS terminals will use the DNS on the branch server for name "
"resolution of {saltboot} specific hostnames."
msgstr "Bind formula ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ Domain Name System (DNS) ໃນ branch server. POS terminals ຈະໃຊ້ DNS ໃນ branch server ເພື່ອແປງຊື່ (name resolution) ຂອງ hostname ສະເພາະສຳລັບ {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When you are configuring the Bind formula for a branch server with a "
"dedicated internal network, check that you are using the same fully "
"qualified domain name (FQDN) on both the external and internal branch "
"networks.  If the FQDN does not match on both networks, the branch server "
"will not be recognized as a proxy server."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າ Bind formula ສຳລັບ branch server ທີ່ມີເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນສະເພາະ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ໃຊ້ fully qualified domain name (FQDN) ອັນດຽວກັນ ທັງໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກ ແລະ ພາຍໃນຂອງສາຂາ. ຫາກ FQDN ບໍ່ກົງກັນໃນທັງສອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ, branch server ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຮັບຮູ້ວ່າເປັນ proxy server."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The following procedure outlines a standard configuration with two zones.  "
"Adjust it to suit your own environment."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະສະແດງການຕັ້ງຄ່າມາດຕະຖານທີ່ມີສອງໂຊນ (zones). ໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Zone 1 is a regular domain zone.  Its main purpose is to resolve{saltboot} "
"hostnames such as TFTP, FTP, or Salt.  It can also resolve the terminal "
"names if configured."
msgstr "Zone 1 ແມ່ນ domain zone ປົກກະຕິ. ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອແປງຊື່ {saltboot} hostnames ເຊັ່ນ TFTP, FTP ຫຼື Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Zone 2 is the reverse zone of Zone 1.  Its main purpose is to resolve IP "
"addresses back to hostnames.  Zone 2 is primarily needed for the correct "
"determination of the FQDNs of the branch."
msgstr "Zone 2 ແມ່ນ reverse zone ຂອງ Zone 1. ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອແປງຄ່າ IP address ກັບຄືນເປັນ hostname. Zone 2 ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຫຼາຍສຳລັບການກຳນົດ FQDN ຂອງສາຂາໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#.  REMARK: this procedure is probably too long.  Where to split?
#.  REMARK: are these list items (`*`) substeps?  Or what?  Confusing.
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Bind with Two Zones"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Bind ດ້ວຍສອງໂຊນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Check the `Bind` formula, click `Save`, and navigate to the "
"menu:Formulas[Bind] tab."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກ `Bind` formula, ຄລິກ `Save`, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Formulas[Bind]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:9
msgid "In the `Config` section, select `Include Forwarders`."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ `Config`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ `Include Forwarders`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:10
msgid "In the `Configured Zones` section, use these parameters for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ `Configured Zones`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the `Name` field, enter the domain name of your branch network (for "
"example: `branch1.example.com`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Name`, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `branch1.example.com`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:12
msgid "In the `Type` field, select `master`."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Type`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ `master`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:13
msgid "Click `Add item` to add a second zone, and set these parameters for Zone 2:"
msgstr "ຄລິກ `Add item` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ zone ທີສອງ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Zone 2:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the `Name` field, use the reverse zone for the configured IP range (for "
"example: `com.example.branch1`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Name`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ reverse zone ສຳລັບຊ່ວງ IP ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `com.example.branch1`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:15
msgid "In the `Type` field, select `master`"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Type`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ `master`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:16
msgid "In the `Available Zones` section, use these parameters for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ `Available Zones`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the `Name` field, enter the domain name of your branch network (for "
"example: `branch1.example.org`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Name`, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `branch1.example.org`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:18
msgid "In the `File` field, type the name of your configuration file."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `File`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:19
msgid "In the `Start of Authority (SOA)` section, use these parameters for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ `Start of Authority (SOA)`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the `Nameserver (NS)` field, use the FQDN of the branch server (for "
"example: `branchserver.branch1.example.org`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Nameserver (NS)`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ FQDN ຂອງ branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `branchserver.branch1.example.org`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:21
msgid "In the `Contact` field, use the email address for the domain administrator."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Contact`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບໂດເມນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:22
msgid "Keep all other fields as their default values."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປ່ອຍຊ່ອງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດເປັນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the `Records` section, in subsection `A`, use these parameters to set up "
"an A record for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ `Records`, ຫົວຂໍ້ຍ່ອຍ `A`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ A record ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the `Hostname` field, use the hostname of the branch server (for example: "
"`branchserver`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Hostname`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ hostname ຂອງ branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `branchserver`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:25
msgid ""
"In the `IP` field, use the IP address of the branch server (for example, "
"`192.168.1.5`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `IP`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ IP address ຂອງ branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `192.168.1.5`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the `Records` section, subsection `NS`, use these parameters to set up an "
"NS record for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ `Records`, ຫົວຂໍ້ຍ່ອຍ `NS`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ NS record ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the input box, use the hostname of the branch server (for example: "
"`branchserver`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງກອກຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ hostname ຂອງ branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `branchserver`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the `Records` section, subsection `CNAME`, use these parameters to set up "
"CNAME records for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ `Records`, ຫົວຂໍ້ຍ່ອຍ `CNAME`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ CNAME records ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In the `Key` field, enter `tftp`, and in the `Value` field, type the "
"hostname of the branch server (for example: `branchserver`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Key`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ `tftp`, ແລະ ໃນຊ່ອງ `Value`, ໃຫ້ພິມ hostname ຂອງ branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Click `Add Item`. In the `Key` field, enter `ftp`, and in the `Value` field, "
"type the hostname of the branch server."
msgstr "ຄລິກ `Add Item`. ໃນຊ່ອງ `Key`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ `ftp`, ແລະ ໃນຊ່ອງ `Value`, ໃຫ້ພິມ hostname ຂອງ branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Click `Add Item`. In the `Key` field, enter `dns`, and in the `Value` field, "
"type the hostname of the branch server."
msgstr "ຄລິກ `Add Item`. ໃນຊ່ອງ `Key`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ `dns`, ແລະ ໃນຊ່ອງ `Value`, ໃຫ້ພິມ hostname ຂອງ branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Click `Add Item`. In the `Key` field, enter `dhcp`, and in the `Value` "
"field, type the hostname of the branch server."
msgstr "ຄລິກ `Add Item`. ໃນຊ່ອງ `Key`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ `dhcp`, ແລະ ໃນຊ່ອງ `Value`, ໃຫ້ພິມ hostname ຂອງ branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Click `Add Item`. In the `Key` field, enter `salt`, and in the `Value` "
"field, type the FQDN of the branch server (for example: "
"`branchserver.branch1.example.org`)."
msgstr "ຄລິກ `Add Item`. ໃນຊ່ອງ `Key`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ `salt`, ແລະ ໃນຊ່ອງ `Value`, ໃຫ້ພິມ FQDN ຂອງ branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Set up Zone 2 using the same parameters as for Zone 1, but ensure you use "
"the reverse details:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Zone 2 ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີດຽວກັນກັບ Zone 1, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນແບບປີ້ນກັບ (reverse details):"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:35
msgid "The same SOA section as Zone 1."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ SOA ຄືກັນກັບ Zone 1."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:36
msgid "Empty A and CNAME records."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເຣັກຄອດ A ແລະ CNAME ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:37
msgid "Additionally, configure in Zone 2:"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ Zone 2:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:38
msgid ""
"`Generate Reverse` field by the network IP address set in branch server "
"network formula (for example, `192.168.1.5/24`)."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ `Generate Reverse` ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຕາມ IP address ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ branch server network formula (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `192.168.1.5/24`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:39
msgid ""
"`For Zones` should specify the domain name of your branch network (for "
"example, `branch1.example.org`)."
msgstr "`For Zones` ຄວນລະບຸຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `branch1.example.org`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:40
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:25
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:12
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:44
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:65
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:97
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:11
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:18
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:50
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:11
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:32
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:56
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:72
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:97
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:106
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:113
msgid "Click btn:[Save Formula] to save your configuration."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Save Formula] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:41
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:43
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:26
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:13
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:71
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:16
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:12
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:21
msgid "Apply the highstate."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Reverse name resolution on terminals might not work for networks that are "
"inside one of these IPv4 private address ranges:"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂຊື່ແບບປີ້ນກັບ (Reverse name resolution) ໃນເທີມິນໍອາດຈະໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້ສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ສ່ວນຕົວເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:43
msgid "`10.0.0.0/8`"
msgstr "`10.0.0.0/8`"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:44
msgid "`172.16.0.0/12`"
msgstr "`172.16.0.0/12`"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:45
msgid "`192.168.0.0/16`"
msgstr "`192.168.0.0/16`"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:46
msgid ""
"If you encounter this problem, go to the `Options` section of the Bind "
"formula, and click btn:[Add item]:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານພົບບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ສ່ວນ `Options` ຂອງ Bind formula, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Add item]:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:47
msgid "In the `Options` field, enter `empty-zones-enable`."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Options`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ `empty-zones-enable`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:48
msgid "In the `Value` field, select `No`."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Value`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ `No`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Branch Network Formula"
msgstr "ສູດເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາ (Branch Network Formula)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Branch Network formula is used to configure the networking services "
"required by the branch server, including DHCP, DNS, TFTP, PXE, and FTP."
msgstr "ສູດເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການບໍລິການເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບເຊີເວີສາຂາ, ລວມທັງ DHCP, DNS, TFTP, PXE, ແລະ FTP."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:3
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:3
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The formula is used only for connecting {productname} Proxy 4.3. with "
"{productname} Server {productnumber}.  Do not use this formula if you want "
"to connect {productname} Proxy {productnumber}."
msgstr "ຟໍມູລານີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} Proxy 4.3 ກັບ {productname} Server {productnumber} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຟໍມູລານີ້ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} Proxy {productnumber}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set Up a Branch Server Networking"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບເຄືອຂ່າຍເຊີເວີສາຂາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The branch server can be configured to use networking in many different "
"ways.  The most common ways provide either a dedicated or shared LAN for "
"terminals."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສາຂາສາມາດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອໃຊ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍໄດ້ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ. ວິທີທີ່ນິຍົມທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການສະໜອງ LAN ແບບສະເພາະ ຫຼື ແບບແບ່ງປັນສຳລັບເທີມິນໍ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set Up a Branch Server with a Dedicated LAN"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີສາຂາດ້ວຍ LAN ແບບສະເພາະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In this configuration, the branch server requires at least two network "
"interfaces: one acts as a WAN to communicate with the {susemgr} server, and "
"the other one acts as an isolated LAN to communicate with terminals."
msgstr "ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ເຊີເວີສາຂາຕ້ອງການອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສອງອັນ: ອັນໜຶ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ WAN ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ສື່ສານກັບເຊີເວີ {susemgr}, ແລະ ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ LAN ທີ່ແຍກອອກຕ່າງຫາກເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ສື່ສານກັບເທີມິນໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This configuration allows for the branch server to provide DHCP, DNS, TFTP, "
"PXE, and FTP services to terminals.  These services can be configured with "
"Salt formulas in the {susemgr} {webui}."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີສາຂາສະໜອງການບໍລິການ DHCP, DNS, TFTP, PXE, ແລະ FTP ໃຫ້ແກ່ເທີມິນໍ. ການບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ດ້ວຍສູດ Salt ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {susemgr}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up a Branch Server with a Dedicated LAN"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີສາຂາດ້ວຍ LAN ແບບສະເພາະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:10
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:29
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:40
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:5
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the {susemgr} {webui}, open the details page for the branch server, and "
"navigate to the `Formulas` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {susemgr} {webui}, ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງ branch server, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ `Formulas`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:11
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:30
msgid "In the `Branch Network` section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ `Branch Network`, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:12
msgid "Keep `Dedicated NIC` checked."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໝາຍເລືອກ `Dedicated NIC` ໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the `NIC` field, enter the name of the network device that is connected "
"to the internal LAN."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `NIC`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງອຸປະກອນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ LAN ພາຍໃນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the `IP` field, enter the static IP address to be assigned to the branch "
"server on the internal LAN."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `IP`, ໃຫ້ພິມ static IP address ທີ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ branch server ໃນ LAN ພາຍໃນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:15
msgid "In the `Netmask` field, enter the network mask of the internal LAN."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Netmask`, ໃຫ້ພິມ network mask ຂອງ LAN ພາຍໃນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Check `Enable Route` if you want the branch server to route traffic from "
"internal LAN to WAN."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກ `Enable Route` ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ branch server ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ route ຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ LAN ພາຍໃນໄປຫາ WAN."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Check `Enable NAT` if you want the branch server to convert addresses from "
"internal LAN to WAN."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກ `Enable NAT` ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ branch server ແປງທີ່ຢູ່ (NAT) ຈາກ LAN ພາຍໃນໄປຫາ WAN."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:18
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:34
msgid "Select the `bind` DNS forwarder mode."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂໝດ DNS forwarder ເປັນ `bind`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:19
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Check DNS forwarder fallback if you want to rely on an external DNS if the "
"branch DNS fails."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກ DNS forwarder fallback ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ DNS ພາຍນອກໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ DNS ຂອງສາຂາເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:20
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:36
msgid "Specify the working directory, and the directory owner and group."
msgstr "ລະບຸໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຮັດວຽກ (working directory), ພ້ອມທັງເຈົ້າຂອງ ແລະ ກຸ່ມຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up a Branch Server with a Shared Network"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີສາຂາດ້ວຍເຄືອຂ່າຍແບບແບ່ງປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In this configuration, the branch server has only one network interface "
"card, which is used to connect to the {susemgr} server as well as the "
"terminals."
msgstr "ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ເຊີເວີສາຂາມີກາດເຄືອຂ່າຍພຽງອັນດຽວ, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ {susemgr} ແລະ ເທີມິນໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:23
msgid ""
"This configuration allows for the branch server to provide DNS, TFTP, PXE, "
"and FTP services to terminals.  These services can be configured with Salt "
"formulas in the {susemgr} {webui}.  Optionally, the branch server can also "
"provide DHCP services in this configuration."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີສາຂາສະໜອງການບໍລິການ DNS, TFTP, PXE, ແລະ FTP ໃຫ້ແກ່ເທີມິນໍ. ການບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ດ້ວຍສູດ Salt ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {susemgr}. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ເຊີເວີສາຂາຍັງສາມາດສະໜອງການບໍລິການ DHCP ໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If DHCP services are not provided by the branch server, ensure that your "
"external DHCP configuration is set correctly:"
msgstr "ຫາກເຊີເວີສາຂາບໍ່ໄດ້ສະໜອງການບໍລິການ DHCP, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DHCP ພາຍນອກຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The `next-server` option must point to the branch server for PXE boot to "
"work."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ `next-server` ຕ້ອງຊີ້ໄປຫາ branch server ເພື່ອໃຫ້ PXE boot ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:26
msgid ""
"The `filename` option must correctly identify the network boot program (by "
"default, this is `/boot/pxelinux`)."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ `filename` ຕ້ອງລະບຸຊື່ໂປຣແກຣມ network boot ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `/boot/pxelinux`)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The `domain-name-servers` option must point to the branch server for correct "
"host name resolution."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ `domain-name-servers` ຕ້ອງຊີ້ໄປຫາ branch server ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການແປງຊື່ hostname ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up a Branch Server with a Shared Network"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີສາຂາດ້ວຍເຄືອຂ່າຍແບບແບ່ງປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:31
msgid "Keep `Dedicated NIC` unchecked."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງໝາຍເລືອກ `Dedicated NIC`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:32
msgid "Enable services on the branch server’s firewall."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການບໍລິການຕ່າງໆໃນໄຟວໍ (firewall) ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:33
msgid "Ensure you include DNS, TFTP, and FTP services."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ລວມເອົາການບໍລິການ DNS, TFTP, ແລະ FTP."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up Branch Server Terminal Naming"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕັ້ງຊື່ເທີມິນໍຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In this configuration it is required to fill at least `Branch "
"Identification`.  This identifies Branch Server in Retail subsystem and is "
"also used to better organize terminals with their respective branch servers."
msgstr "ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກອກຂໍ້ມູນຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໃນສ່ວນ `Branch Identification`. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງ Branch Server ໃນລະບົບຍ່ອຍ Retail ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃນການຈັດການເຄື່ອງ POS ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບ branch server ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up a Branch Server Identification"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການລະບຸຕົວຕົນເຊີເວີສາຂາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:41
msgid "In the `Terminal Naming` section, enter the `Branch Identification` string."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ `Terminal Naming`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ `Branch Identification`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:42
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to save your changes."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-branchnetwork.adoc:44
msgid ""
"It is also possible to set various options about terminal naming, for more "
"information about terminal naming see "
"xref:retail:retail-terminal-names.adoc[]."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຕເລືອກຕ່າງໆ ກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຊື່ເທີມິນໍໄດ້, ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:retail:retail-terminal-names.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "DHCPd Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ DHCPd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The DHCPd formula is used to configure the DHCP service on the branch "
"server."
msgstr "ສູດ DHCPd ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການບໍລິການ DHCP ໃນເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring DHCP"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DHCP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:4
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the {susemgr} {webui}, open the details page for the branch server, and "
"navigate to the Formulas tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {susemgr}, ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບເຊີເວີສາຂາ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ Formulas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:5
msgid "Check the `Dhcpd` formula, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກ `Dhcpd` formula, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:6
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Dhcpd] tab, and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Dhcpd], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the `Domain Name` field, enter the domain name for the branch server (for "
"example: `branch1.example.com`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Domain Name`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ໂດເມນສຳລັບ branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `branch1.example.com`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the `Domain Name Server` field, enter either the IP address or resolvable "
"FQDN of the branch DNS server (for example: `192.168.1.5`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Domain Name Server`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ IP address ຫຼື FQDN ຂອງ branch DNS server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the `Listen Interfaces` field, enter the name of the network interface "
"used to connect to the local branch network (for example: `eth1`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Listen Interfaces`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ຂອງ network interface ທີ່ໃຊ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `eth1`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `Network Configuration (subnet)` section, and use these "
"parameters for Network1:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ສ່ວນ `Network Configuration (subnet)`, ແລະ ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Network1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the `Network IP` field, enter the IP address of the branch server network "
"(for example: `192.168.1.0`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Network IP`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ IP address ຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the `Netmask` field, enter the network mask of the branch server network "
"(for example: `255.255.255.0`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Netmask`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ network mask ຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the `Domain Name` field, enter the domain name for the branch server "
"network (for example: `branch1.example.com`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Domain Name`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ໂດເມນສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍ branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the `Dynamic IP Range` section, use these parameters to configure the IP "
"range to be served by the DHCP service:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ `Dynamic IP Range`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ວງ IP ທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ DHCP:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the first input box, set the lower bound of the IP range (for example: "
"`192.168.1.51`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງທຳອິດ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຊ່ວງ IP (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `192.168.1.51`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the second input box, set the upper bound of the IP range (for example: "
"`192.168.1.151`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງທີສອງ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າສິ້ນສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງ IP (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `192.168.1.151`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the `Broadcast Address` field, enter the broadcast IP address for the "
"branch network (for example: `192.168.1.255`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Broadcast Address`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ broadcast IP address ສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the `Routers` field, enter the IP address to be used by routers in the "
"branch server network (for example: `192.168.1.5`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Routers`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ IP address ຂອງ router ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍ branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the `Next Server` field, enter the hostname or IP address of the branch "
"server (for example: `192.168.1.5`)."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Next Server`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ hostname ຫຼື IP address ຂອງ branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the `Filename` field, if you are booting a client using PXE, type the "
"path to the PXE bootloader."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Filename`, ຫາກທ່ານ booting ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຜ່ານ PXE, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາ PXE bootloader."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:21
msgid "There is usually no need to change the default value of `/boot/pxelinux.0`."
msgstr "ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ `/boot/pxelinux.0`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the `Filename Efi` field, if you are booting a UEFI client using PXE, "
"type the path to the PXE bootloader."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Filename Efi`, ຫາກທ່ານ booting ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ UEFI ຜ່ານ PXE, ໃຫ້ພິມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ PXE bootloader."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:23
msgid "There is usually no need to change the default value of `/boot/shim.efi`."
msgstr "ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ `/boot/shim.efi`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the `Filename Http` field, if you are booting a UEFI client using HTTP, "
"type `http://branchserver/saltboot/boot/shim.efi`."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Filename Http`, ຫາກທ່ານ booting ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ UEFI ຜ່ານ HTTP, ໃຫ້ພິມ `http://branchserver/saltboot/boot/shim.efi`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Synchronization Formula"
msgstr "ສູດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບ (Image Synchronization Formula)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Image Synchronization formula is used to configure when OS images are "
"synchronized to the branch server, and to specify which images to "
"synchronize."
msgstr "ສູດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາທີ່ຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບ OS ໄປຫາເຊີເວີສາຂາ, ແລະ ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບໃດແດ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If this formula is not enabled, synchronization must be started manually, "
"and all images will be synchronized."
msgstr "ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ສູດນີ້, ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຕ້ອງຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ແລະ ຮູບພາບທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Image Synchronization"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:6
msgid "Check the `Image Synchronize` formula, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກ `Image Synchronize` formula, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Image Synchronize] tab, and set these "
"parameters:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Image Synchronize], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Check the `Include Image Synchronization in Highstate` field to have image "
"synchronization occur every time highstate is applied."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງ `Include Image Synchronization in Highstate` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This ensures that you do not have to perform image synchronization manually, "
"however it requires a high bandwidth environment."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຮູບພາບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ແຕ່ມັນຕ້ອງການສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີແບນວິດ (bandwidth) ສູງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the `Synchronize only the listed images` field, click btn:[Add item] to "
"add the images you want to have synchronized automatically."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ `Synchronize only the listed images`, ຄລິກ btn:[Add item] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ images ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຊິງໂຄຣໄນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can leave this list blank to have all images "
"synchronized."
msgstr "ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດປະລາຍການນີ້ໃຫ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບພາບທັງໝົດຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-imagesync.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The Image Synchronization state does not delete cached images.  If you are "
"running out of disk space, check the size of the Salt client cache "
"directory, and delete it if required.  By default, the directory is located "
"at `/var/cache/salt/minion`."
msgstr "Image Synchronization ຈະບໍ່ລຶບ images ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ cache. ຫາກພື້ນທີ່ດິດຂອງທ່ານໃກ້ຈະເຕັມ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບຂະໜາດຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ cache ຂອງ Salt client ແລະ ລຶບມັນຖ້າຈຳເປັນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຢູ່ທີ່ `/var/cache/salt/minion`."

#.  FIXME: where appropriate, use the "Confirm with" expression.
#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Liberate Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ Liberate"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The liberate formula migrates systems from EL clients such as {centos} 7 or "
"{rhel} 9 to {sll}.  With this formula the conversion will take place during "
"the client onboarding on {productname}."
msgstr "Liberate formula ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຍ້າຍລະບົບ (migrate) ຈາກ EL clients ເຊັ່ນ {centos} 7 ຫຼື {rhel} 9 ໄປຫາ {sll}. ດ້ວຍຟໍມູລານີ້ ການປ່ຽນແປງຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ (onboarding) ໃນ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:3
msgid "The Liberate Formula comes preinstalled within the server container."
msgstr "Liberate Formula ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າແລ້ວພາຍໃນ server container."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure {productname}"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To provide all the software channels for {sll} on the {productname} Server, "
"proceed as follows."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສະໜອງຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ຊອບແວທັງໝົດສຳລັບ {sll} ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Providing {scclongform} credentials"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:7
msgid "Sign in to {scclongform} at https://scc.suse.com."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {scclongform} ໄດ້ທີ່ https://scc.suse.com."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:8
msgid "Navigate to `My Organization`, and select your organization."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ `My Organization`, ແລະ ເລືອກອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Users[Organization Credentials] and take note of your "
"organization username and password."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Users[Organization Credentials] ແລະ ຈົດບັນທຶກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງອົງກອນທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Organization Credentials] to add the credentials to your {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໃຫ້ກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Add new credential], and enter the {scclongform} username and "
"password noted in a previous step."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Add new credential], ແລະ ປ້ອນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ {scclongform} ທີ່ໄດ້ຈົດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing the SLL/SLES-ES channels:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງ SLL/SLES-ES:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Products]"
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:14
msgid "Select the {sll} Channels that you will use:"
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງ {sll} ທີ່ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:15
msgid "EL7 LTSS: `SUSE Linux Enterprise Server with Expanded Support LTSS 7 x86_64`"
msgstr "EL7 LTSS: `SUSE Linux Enterprise Server with Expanded Support LTSS 7 x86_64`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:16
msgid "EL7: `SUSE Linux Enterprise Server with Expanded Support 7 x86_64`"
msgstr "EL7: `SUSE Linux Enterprise Server with Expanded Support 7 x86_64`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:17
msgid "EL8: `RHEL or SLES ES or CentOS 8 Base`"
msgstr "EL8: `RHEL or SLES ES or CentOS 8 Base`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:18
msgid "EL9: `RHEL and Liberty 9 Base`"
msgstr "EL9: `RHEL and Liberty 9 Base`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:19
msgid "Click the top right button btn:[Add products]."
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Add products] ທີ່ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Initial sychronization can take considerable time. You can check progress by "
"accessing the server machine via SSH and monitoring the logs using:"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັ້ງທຳອິດອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນພໍສົມຄວນ. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດເບິ່ງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າໄດ້ໂດຍການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄື່ອງເຊີເວີຜ່ານ SSH ແລະ ຕິດຕາມລັອກ (logs) ໂດຍໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/*\n"
msgstr "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/*\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating one Activation Key per {sll} parent channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Activation Key ໜຶ່ງອັນຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຂອງ {sll}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Note: Activation Keys are the way to register systems and automatically "
"assign them to the required software and configuration channels "
"corresponding to them."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: Activation Keys ແມ່ນວິທີການລົງທະບຽນລະບົບ ແລະ ກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃຫ້ກັບພວກມັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys], and "
"click the top right button btn:[Create key]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Activation Keys], ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Create key] ທີ່ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:25
msgid "In the `Activation Key` dialog, set the fields:"
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ `Activation Key`, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງຕ່າງໆ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:26
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Description"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:27
msgid "Enter some text describing the activation key."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອອະທິບາຍ activation key."

