msgstr "Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Enter the identifier of the key.  For example [literal`sll9-default` for "
"EL 9 systems.  Note: Keys will have a numeric prefix depending on the "
"organization, so that they are unique."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຕົວລະບຸຂອງຄີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: `sll9-default` ສຳລັບລະບົບ EL 9. ໝາຍເຫດ: ຄີຈະມີຕົວເລກນຳໜ້າຂຶ້ນກັບອົງກອນ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ຊ້ຳກັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:31
