#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:46
msgid "Click btn:[Create Activation Key]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Activation Key]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Liberate formula and assign it to activation keys"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສູດ Liberate ແລະ ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ activation keys"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When installed, the formula can be assigned to an Activation Key by creating "
"a System Group:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ສູດສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key ໄດ້ໂດຍການສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບ (System Group):"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning system group and assigning liberate formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດກຸ່ມລະບົບ ແລະ ກຳນົດສູດ liberate"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups], and "
"click the btn:[Create Group] button in top right corner."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System Groups], ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Group] ທີ່ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:51
msgid "In the dialog, fill in the following data:"
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ, ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Name"
msgstr "ຊື່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:53
msgid "liberate"
msgstr "liberate"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:55
msgid "Systems to be converted to SUSE Liberty Linux"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ SUSE Liberty Linux"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:56
msgid "From the `liberate` System Group page, navigate go to the `Formulas` tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ `liberate` System Group, ໄປທີ່ແທັບ `Formulas`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Select the `Liberate` formula, and click btn:[Save].  A new tab called "
"`Liberate` will appear."
msgstr "ເລືອກ formula `Liberate`, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]. ແທັບໃໝ່ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ `Liberate` ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:58
msgid ""
"On the `Liberate` tab, you see the `Reinstall all packages after conversion` "
"option.  Keep it checked if you want to reinstall all the packages during "
"the migration.  This way you ensure all the packages will have {suse} "
"signatures and no previous package will be kept.  If you do not want to "
"change the state of your system during the migration, uncheck this option "
"and click the btn:[Save Formula] button.  In this case, you can re-install "
"the packages later."
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ `Liberate`, ເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນຕົວເລືອກ `Reinstall all packages after conversion`. ໃຫ້ໝາຍເລືອກໄວ້ ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກແພັກເກັດໃໝ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍລະບົບ. ວິທີນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທຸກແພັກເກັດຈະມີລາຍເຊັນ {suse} ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີແພັກເກັດເກົ່າຫຼົງເຫຼືອຢູ່. ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງສະຖານະຂອງລະບົບໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍຕົວເລືອກນີ້ ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Save Formula]. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດໃໝ່ໄດ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Now a system group exists that has assigned the `Liberate` formula.  This "
"formula will be applied only once to migrate the system to {sll}, even if "
"you run it multiple times.  With the next procedure, assign the system group "
"to the Activation Key."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ມີ system group ທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ formula `Liberate` ແລ້ວ. formula ນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຄັ້ງດຽວເພື່ອຍ້າຍລະບົບໄປຫາ {sll}, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເຈົ້າຈະເປີດໃຊ້ມັນຫຼາຍຄັ້ງກໍຕາມ. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ system group ໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning the system group to the Activation Key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດກຸ່ມລະບົບໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:61
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:62
msgid "Select the Activation Key, for example `sll9-default` for the EL 9 systems."
msgstr "ເລືອກ Activation Key, ຕົວຢ່າງ `sll9-default` ສຳລັບລະບົບ EL 9."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:63
msgid ""
"From the Activation Key page navigate to the menu:Groups[Join] tab, select "
"the `liberate` group, and click the btn:[Join Selected Groups] button.  The "
"group will be assigned to the Activation Key"
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ Activation Key ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Groups[Join], ເລືອກກຸ່ມ `liberate`, ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Join Selected Groups]. ກຸ່ມດັ່ງກ່າວຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ Activation Key."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying migrate directly during registration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ການຍ້າຍລະບົບໂດຍກົງໃນລະຫວ່າງການລົງທະບຽນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:65
msgid "From the Activation Key page, navigate to the `Details` tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ Activation Key, ໄປທີ່ແທັບ `Details`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `Configuration File Deployment` section, and checkb the "
"`Deploy configuration files to systems on registration`option."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ `Configuration File Deployment`, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ `Deploy configuration files to systems on registration`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:67
msgid "Click btn:[Update Activation Key]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Update Activation Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:68
msgid ""
"When you register a system with this key it will perform the migration "
"automatically."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານລົງທະບຽນລະບົບດ້ວຍ key ນີ້, ມັນຈະເຮັດການຍ້າຍລະບົບໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register a new system and proceed to the migration"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນລະບົບໃໝ່ ແລະ ດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:70
msgid ""
"There are two ways to onboard (or register) a new client with the Activation "
"Key:"
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ Activation Key:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]"
msgstr "xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:72
msgid "This is intended for a one-off registration or for testing purposes."
msgstr "ວິທີນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນຄັ້ງດຽວ ຫຼື ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການທົດສອບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]"
msgstr "xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:74
msgid "This is intended to be used for mass registration."
msgstr "ວິທີນີ້ແມ່ນມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "For already registered clients"
msgstr "ສຳລັບໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:76
msgid ""
"Software channels, system group membership, and formulas can be assigned to "
"any already registered client.  This method makes use of the bootstrap "
"script mentioned above."
msgstr "Software channels, ສະມາຊິກ system group, ແລະ formulas ສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ client ໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ. ວິທີນີ້ແມ່ນນຳໃຊ້ bootstrap script ທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Reactivation key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Reactivation key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:78
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the System Details page of any registered "
"client you want to migrate to {sll}."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ເປີດໜ້າ System Details ຂອງໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍໄປເປັນ {sll}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Click the `Reactivation` tab.  If there is already a key listed, you can use "
"it.  If not, click btn:[Generate New Key], and copy the entire key.  The key "
"will start with `re-`."
msgstr "ຄລິກແທັບ `Reactivation`. ຖ້າມີ key ຢູ່ໃນລາຍການແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນໄດ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Generate New Key], ແລະ ກ່າຍເອົາ key ທັງໝົດ. key ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ `re-`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:80
msgid ""
"SSH into this client and set the environment variable to be the key that you "
"copied:"
msgstr "SSH ເຂົ້າໄປໃນໄຄເອັນນີ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment variable) ໃຫ້ເປັນ key ທີ່ທ່ານກັອບປີ້ມາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "export REACTIVATION_KEY=re-xxxxxxxxxxxxxx\n"
msgstr "export REACTIVATION_KEY=re-xxxxxxxxxxxxxx\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc:82
msgid ""
"Run the bootstrap script from "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[], and the system will "
"re-register using the same profile as before, but with the newly assigned "
"{sll} context."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ bootstrap script ຈາກ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[], ແລະ ລະບົບຈະລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ profile ເດີມ, ແຕ່ຈະມີ context ຂອງ {sll} ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃໝ່."

