#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring Formula"
msgstr "ສູດການຕິດຕາມ (Monitoring Formula)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The monitoring services in {productname} are configured using formulas with "
"forms.  The package is installed by default, and contains these formulas:"
msgstr "ການບໍລິການຕິດຕາມໃນ {productname} ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດ (formulas) ພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ (forms). ແພັກເກັດຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ, ແລະ ປະກອບມີສູດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:3
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grafana"
msgstr "Grafana"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:4
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus"
msgstr "Prometheus"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:5
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus Exporters"
msgstr "Prometheus Exporters"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:6
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:106
msgid ""
"For more information about using monitoring, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ການຕິດຕາມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Prometheus Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ Prometheus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Prometheus] tab, and set these parameters in "
"the `Prometheus` section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Prometheus], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Prometheus`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:10
msgid "Check the `Enabled` box to enable Prometheus monitoring."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enabled` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕິດຕາມກວດກາຂອງ Prometheus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the `Scrape interval` field, type the frequency of data scraping, in "
"seconds."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Scrape interval`, ໃຫ້ພິມຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນ (scraping), ເປັນວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:12
msgid "For example, `15` will scrape data every fifteen seconds."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `15` ຈະເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນໃນທຸກໆ 15 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the `Evaluation interval` field, type the frequency of rules evaluation, "
"in seconds."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Evaluation interval`, ໃຫ້ພິມຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງການປະເມີນກົດເກນ, ເປັນວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For example, `15` will evaluate alerting and aggregation rules every fifteen "
"seconds."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `15` ຈະປະເມີນກົດເກນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ແລະ ການລວມຂໍ້ມູນໃນທຸກໆ 15 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:15
msgid "In the `TLS` section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `TLS`, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Check the `Enabled` box to enable the secure configuration on Prometheus "
"server."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enabled` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບປອດໄພໃນ Prometheus server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:17
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:95
msgid ""
"In the `Server Certificate` field, type the path to the TLS server "
"certificate."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Server Certificate`, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ (path) ຂອງ TLS server certificate."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:18
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:96
msgid "In the `Server Key` field, type the path to the TLS server key."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Server Key`, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ TLS server key."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:19
msgid "In the `User` field, type the user name for Prometheus server."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `User`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ Prometheus server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the `Password Hash` field, type the password for Prometheus server hashed "
"with bcrypt."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Password Hash`, ໃຫ້ພິມລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ Prometheus server ທີ່ຜ່ານການ hash ດ້ວຍ bcrypt."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To generate password hash, use tool `htpasswd` available from "
"`apache2-utils` package."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງ password hash, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື `htpasswd` ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກັດ `apache2-utils`."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "htpasswd -nbBC 10 \"\" \"thePassword\" | tr -d ':'\n"
msgstr "htpasswd -nbBC 10 \"\" \"thePassword\" | tr -d ':'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:24
msgid "In the `Uyuni Server` section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Uyuni Server`, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:25
msgid "Check the `Enabled` box to enable monitoring on this server."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enabled` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕິດຕາມກວດກາໃນ server ນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Check the `Autodiscover clients` box to enable Prometheus to automatically "
"find and monitor new clients when they are added to the server."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Autodiscover clients` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Prometheus ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມກວດກາ client ໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອພວກເຂົາຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the `Username` field, type the user name of the Prometheus account on the "
"server."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Username`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງບັນຊີ Prometheus ໃນ server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the `Password` field, type the password of the Prometheus account on the "
"server."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Password`, ໃຫ້ພິມລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງບັນຊີ Prometheus ໃນ server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:29
msgid "In the `Targets TLS` section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Targets TLS`, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Check the `Enabled` box to enable the secure configuration for "
"auto-discovered targets."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enabled` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບປອດໄພສຳລັບເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຄົ້ນຫາແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:31
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:94
msgid ""
"In the `CA Certificate` field, type the path to the Certificate Authority "
"certificate."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `CA Certificate`, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ Certificate Authority certificate."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:32
msgid ""
"In the `Client Certificate` field, type the path to the TLS client "
"certificate for authentication."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Client Certificate`, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ TLS client certificate ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the `Client Key` field, type the path to the TLS client key for "
"authentication."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Client Key`, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ TLS client key ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:34
msgid "In the `Alerting` section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Alerting`, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Check the `Enable local Alertmanager service` box to enable the alert "
"manager service."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enable local Alertmanager service` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ບໍລິການຈັດການການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Check the `Use local Alertmanager` box to use the local alert manager "
"service."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Use local Alertmanager` ເພື່ອໃຊ້ບໍລິການຈັດການການແຈ້ງເຕືອນພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For each alert manager you want to use, in the menu:Alerting[Alertmanagers] "
"section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຈັດການການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແຕ່ລະອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Alerting[Alertmanagers], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. For example, `FIXME`.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In the `IP Address:Port` field, type the location of the alert manager "
"target, including the port number."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `IP Address:Port`, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງເປົ້າໝາຍ alert manager, ລວມທັງໝາຍເລກ port."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:39
msgid ""
"To use a rule file, in the menu:Alerting[Rule Files] section, click btn:[+], "
"and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ກົດເກນ (rule file), ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Alerting[Rule Files], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. For example, `FIXME`.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:40
msgid ""
"In the `Rule Files` field, type the location of the rule file you want to "
"use."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Rule Files`, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ rule file ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:41
msgid ""
"To add a custom scrape configuration, in the `User defined scrape "
"configurations` section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າການ scrape ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `User defined scrape configurations`, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[+], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:42
msgid "In the `Job name` field, type a unique job name for your configuration."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Job name`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ວຽກ (job name) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:43
msgid ""
"In the `Files` field, type the location pattern of file service discovery "
"files you want to use.  For more information, see the upstream documentation "
"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/configuration/#file_sd_config."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Files`, ໃຫ້ພິມຮູບແບບທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ file service discovery ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຕົ້ນທາງ https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/configuration/#file_sd_config."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:45
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:103
msgid ""
"The formula does not generate and deploy the TLS certificates and keys.  "
"Ensure the files are present on the Salt client and readable for the user "
"`prometheus` before applying the highstate.  For more information about "
"generating client and server certificates, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "Formula ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສ້າງ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ TLS certificates ແລະ keys ໃຫ້. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນມີຢູ່ໃນ Salt client ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ `prometheus` ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ highstate. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງ client ແລະ server certificates, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Grafana Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Grafana] tab, and set these parameters in the "
"`Grafana` section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Grafana], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Grafana`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:49
msgid "Check the `Enabled` box to enable Grafana visualizations."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enabled` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງ Grafana."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:50
msgid ""
"`Initial admin password` is used on the first run only, and Grafana UI "
"prompts to change it.  This field cannot be used to change the Grafana "
"password.  For more information on how to change the password, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "`Initial admin password` ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການເປີດໃຊ້ຄັ້ງທຳອິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ Grafana UI ຈະຖາມໃຫ້ປ່ຽນມັນ. ຫ້ອງນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ Grafana ໄດ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:51
msgid ""
"For each Prometheus data source you want to use, in the "
"menu:Datasources[Prometheus] section, click btn:[+], and set these "
"parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (data source) ຂອງ Prometheus ແຕ່ລະອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Datasources[Prometheus], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:52
msgid "In the `Datasource name` field, type a name to identify the data source."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Datasource name`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ເພື່ອລະບຸແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:53
msgid ""
"In the `Prometheus URL` field, type the used protocol, the location of the "
"Prometheus server, and append port `9090`."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Prometheus URL`, ໃຫ້ພິມໂປຣໂຕຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້, ທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ Prometheus server, ແລະ ຕາມດ້ວຍ port `9090`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:54
msgid ""
"For example, `http://example.com:9090`. In case TLS encryption is enabled in "
"Prometheus formula make sure to use `https` protocol and FQDN."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `http://example.com:9090`. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ TLS ໃນ Prometheus formula, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄອນ `https` ແລະ FQDN."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:55
msgid "Optionally, if TLS encryption is enabled in Prometheus formula."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ, ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ TLS ໃນ Prometheus formula."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the fields `Prometheus server username` and `Prometheus server password`, "
"enter basic authentication credentials for Prometheus server matching the "
"ones in Prometheus formula."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Prometheus server username` ແລະ `Prometheus server password`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບ Prometheus server ໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນ Prometheus formula."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:57
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:15
msgid "In the `Dashboards` section, check the dashboards you want to use:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Dashboards`, ໃຫ້ໝາຍເລືອກ dashboards ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:58
msgid "`Uyuni server dashboard`"
msgstr "`Uyuni server dashboard`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:59
msgid "`Uyuni clients dashboard`"
msgstr "`Uyuni clients dashboard`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:60
msgid "`PostgreSQL dashboard`"
msgstr "`PostgreSQL dashboard`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:61
msgid "`Apache HTTPD dashboard`"
msgstr "`Apache HTTPD dashboard`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:62
msgid "`Kubernetes cluster dashboard`"
msgstr "`Kubernetes cluster dashboard`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:63
msgid "`Kubernetes etcd dashboard`"
msgstr "`Kubernetes etcd dashboard`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:64
msgid "`Kubernetes namespaces dashboard`"
msgstr "`Kubernetes namespaces dashboard`"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Report DB"
msgstr "Report DB"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:67
msgid ""
"The Grafana formula can connect directly to the {productname} reporting "
"database and deploy pre-built dashboards for fleet management and compliance "
"reporting."
msgstr "Grafana formula ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} reporting database ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ dashboards ທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າສຳລັບການຈັດການລະບົບ ແລະ ການລາຍງານການປະຕິບັດຕາມກົດເກນ (compliance)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:68
msgid ""
"Before enabling this feature, create a reporting database user.  See "
"xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc[Reporting Database]."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ reporting database ກ່ອນ. ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:reporting-database.adoc[Reporting Database]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Report DB Datasource"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Report DB Datasource"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:70
msgid "In the menu:Datasources[Report DB] section, check the `Enabled` box."
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Datasources[Report DB], ໃຫ້ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enabled`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:72
msgid ""
"The formula automatically connects to the reporting database on the managed "
"{productname} server.  The server hostname and database name are "
"auto-detected.  Database credentials are read from the Salt pillars "
"`reportdb_user` and `reportdb_pass`, which are set when you create the "
"reporting database user with `uyuni-setup-reportdb-user`."
msgstr "Formula ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ reporting database ໃນ {productname} server ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຊື່ hostname ຂອງ server ແລະ ຊື່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກກວດພົບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກອ່ານຈາກ Salt pillars `reportdb_user` ແລະ `reportdb_pass` ເຊິ່ງຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ຕອນເຈົ້າສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ `uyuni-setup-reportdb-user`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:73
msgid ""
"The following dashboards are installed under a `Reporting` folder in "
"Grafana:"
msgstr "Dashboards ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີ `Reporting` ໃນ Grafana:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:74
msgid ""
"`Fleet Overview & Security` : fleet composition, security posture, CVE "
"analysis, patch compliance, proxy infrastructure, and virtualization "
"overview."
msgstr "`Fleet Overview & Security` : ພາບລວມຂອງລະບົບ, ສະຖານະຄວາມປອດໄພ, ການວິເຄາະ CVE, ການປະຕິບັດຕາມການ patch, ໂຄງລ່າງ proxy, ແລະ ພາບລວມຂອງ virtualization."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:75
msgid ""
"`Reports & History` : channels, packages, errata, actions, system inventory, "
"user management, system history, and SCAP compliance."
msgstr "`Reports & History` : ຊ່ອງທາງ, ແພັກເກັດ, errata, ການດຳເນີນການ, ລາຍການລະບົບ, ການຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້, ປະຫວັດລະບົບ, ແລະ ການປະຕິບັດຕາມ SCAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:76
msgid ""
"`Executive Overview` : dynamic statistics including system counts and "
"package queries."
msgstr "`Executive Overview` : ສະຖິຕິທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ລວມທັງຈຳນວນລະບົບ ແລະ ການສອບຖາມແພັກເກັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Prometheus Exporters Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ Prometheus Exporters"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Prometheus Exporters] tab, and set these "
"parameters in the `Node Exporter` section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Prometheus Exporters], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Node Exporter`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:80
msgid "Check the `Enabled` box to enable the node exporter."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enabled` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ node exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:81
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:85
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:90
msgid "In the `Arguments` field, type any customized arguments for this exporter."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Arguments`, ໃຫ້ພິມ arguments ໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງສຳລັບ exporter ນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:82
msgid "For example, `--web.listen-address=\":9100\"`."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `--web.listen-address=\":9100\"`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:83
msgid "In the `Apache Exporter` section:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Apache Exporter`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:84
msgid "Check the `Enabled` box to enable the Apache exporter."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enabled` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Apache exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:86
msgid "For example, `--telemetry.address=\":9117\"`."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `--telemetry.address=\":9117\"`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:87
msgid "In the `Postgres Exporter` section:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Postgres Exporter`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:88
msgid "Check the `Enabled` box to enable the PostreSQL exporter."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enabled` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ PostgreSQL exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:89
msgid "In the `Data source Name` field, type the name of the data source to use."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Data source Name`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງ data source ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:91
msgid "For example, `--web.listen-address=\":9187\"`."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `--web.listen-address=\":9187\"`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:92
msgid "In the `TLS` section:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `TLS`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:93
msgid "Check the `Enabled` box to enable the secure configuration."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enabled` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບປອດໄພ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "File-based service discovery"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາການບໍລິການແບບໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ (File-based service discovery)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:99
msgid ""
"It is possible to define monitored targets using file-based service "
"discovery provided in the Prometheus formula.  This is a basic example "
"demonstrating the usage:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຈະຕິດຕາມໂດຍໃຊ້ການຄົ້ນຫາການບໍລິການແບບໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນສູດ Prometheus. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງພື້ນຖານທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງການນຳໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:100
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[\n"
"  {\n"
"    \"targets\": [ \"<client1>:9100\", \"<client2>:9100\" ],\n"
"    \"labels\": {\n"
"      \"role\": \"<MLM-client>\",\n"
"      \"job\": \"<MLM-refclient>\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  },\n"
"  {\n"
"    \"targets\": [ \"<server>:80\" ],\n"
"    \"labels\": {\n"
"      \"role\": \"<MLM-server>\",\n"
"      \"job\": \"<MLM-refhost>\",\n"
"      \"__metrics_path__\": \"/rhn/metrics\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"]\n"
msgstr ""
"[\n"
"  {\n"
"    \"targets\": [ \"<client1>:9100\", \"<client2>:9100\" ],\n"
"    \"labels\": {\n"
"      \"role\": \"<MLM-client>\",\n"
"      \"job\": \"<MLM-refclient>\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  },\n"
"  {\n"
"    \"targets\": [ \"<server>:80\" ],\n"
"    \"labels\": {\n"
"      \"role\": \"<MLM-server>\",\n"
"      \"job\": \"<MLM-refhost>\",\n"
"      \"__metrics_path__\": \"/rhn/metrics\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:101
msgid "For more information, see https://prometheus.io/docs/guides/file-sd/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://prometheus.io/docs/guides/file-sd/."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "TLS certificates and keys"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ແລະ ຄີ"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:104
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate Forms"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ແບບຟອມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc:105
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:20
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:114
msgid "When you have completed and saved all the forms, apply the highstate."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ບັນທຶກແບບຟອມທັງໝົດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "PXE Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ PXE"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:2
msgid "The PXE formula is used to configure PXE booting on the branch server."
msgstr "ສູດ PXE ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການບູດ PXE ໃນເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring PXE Booting"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການບູດ PXE"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:6
msgid "Select the `Pxe` formula, and click `Save`."
msgstr "ເລືອກ formula `Pxe`, ແລະ ຄລິກ `Save`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:7
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Pxe] tab, and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Pxe], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:8
msgid "In the `Kernel Filename` field, keep the default value."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Kernel Filename`, ໃຫ້ຮັກສາຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:9
msgid "In the `Initrd Filename` field, keep the default value."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Initrd Filename`, ໃຫ້ຮັກສາຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If the terminals connecting to this branch server are running {arm64} "
"architecture, check the `Enable ARM64 UEFI boot` box.  Leave unchecked for "
"{x86_64}."
msgstr "ຖ້າ terminal ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ branch server ນີ້ໃຊ້ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {arm64}, ໃຫ້ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enable ARM64 UEFI boot`. ໃຫ້ປະວ່າງໄວ້ສຳລັບ {x86_64}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:11
msgid "In the `Kernel Filename for ARM64` field, keep the default value."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Kernel Filename for ARM64`, ໃຫ້ຮັກສາຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:12
msgid "In the `Initrd Filename for ARM64` field, keep the default value."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Initrd Filename for ARM64`, ໃຫ້ຮັກສາຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the `Kernel Command Line Parameters` field, keep the default value.  For "
"more information about possible values, see "
"<<retail.sect.formulas.pxe.kernelparams>>."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Kernel Command Line Parameters`, ໃຫ້ຮັກສາຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ <<retail.sect.formulas.pxe.kernelparams>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the `PXE root directory` field, enter the path to the {saltboot} "
"directory (for example, `/srv/saltboot`)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `PXE root directory`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ {saltboot} directory (ຕົວຢ່າງ, `/srv/saltboot`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:15
msgid "Click `Save Formula` to save your configuration."
msgstr "ຄລິກ `Save Formula` ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "{saltboot} Kernel Command Line Parameters"
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ Kernel ຂອງ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:18
msgid ""
"{saltboot} supports common kernel parameters and {saltboot}-specific kernel "
"parameters.  All the parameters can be entered in the `Kernel Command Line "
"Parameters` field of the PXE formula."
msgstr "{saltboot} ຮອງຮັບພະລາມິເຕີ kernel ທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ພະລາມິເຕີສະເພາະຂອງ {saltboot}. ທຸກພະລາມິເຕີສາມາດປ້ອນເຂົ້າໃນຫ້ອງ `Kernel Command Line Parameters` ຂອງ PXE formula ໄດ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "`kiwidebug=1`"
msgstr "`kiwidebug=1`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:20
msgid "Starts a shell on tty2 during boot and enables debug logging in Salt."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ shell ໃນ tty2 ໃນລະຫວ່າງການບູດ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ການບັນທຶກ debug ໃນ Salt."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Do not use this parameter in a production environment as it creates a major "
"security hole.  This parameter should be used only in a development "
"environment for debug purposes."
msgstr "ຫ້າມໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການຜະລິດ (production) ເພາະມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ຮ້າຍແຮງ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການພັດທະນາເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການ debug ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "`MASTER`"
msgstr "`MASTER`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:23
msgid "Overrides auto-detection of the Salt master. For example:"
msgstr "ຂ້າມການກວດຫາອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງ Salt master. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "MASTER=myproxy.domain.com\n"
msgstr "MASTER=myproxy.domain.com\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "`SALT_TIMEOUT`"
msgstr "`SALT_TIMEOUT`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Overrides the local boot fallback timeout if the Salt master does not apply "
"the {saltboot} state within this timeout (default: 60 seconds).  For "
"example:"
msgstr "ຂ້າມເວລາໝົດກຳນົດ (timeout) ຂອງການບູດເຄື່ອງພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ (local boot fallback) ຫາກ Salt master ບໍ່ນຳໃຊ້ສະຖານະ {saltboot} ພາຍໃນເວລານີ້ (ມາດຕະຖານ: 60 ວິນາທີ). ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "SALT_TIMEOUT=300\n"
msgstr "SALT_TIMEOUT=300\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "`DISABLE_HOSTNAME_ID`"
msgstr "`DISABLE_HOSTNAME_ID`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:29
msgid ""
"If the terminal has a hostname assigned by DHCP, it is by default used as a "
"minion ID.  Setting this option to `1` disables this mechanism, and SMBios "
"information will be used as a minion ID."
msgstr "ຫາກເທີມິນໍມີຊື່ໂຮສທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ DHCP, ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານມັນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ minion ID. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຕເລືອກນີ້ເປັນ `1` ຈະປິດການເຮັດວຽກນີ້, ແລະ ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນ SMBios ເປັນ minion ID ແທນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "`DISABLE_UNIQUE_SUFFIX`"
msgstr "`DISABLE_UNIQUE_SUFFIX`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Setting this option to `1` disables adding random generated suffix to "
"terminal minion ID."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຕເລືອກນີ້ເປັນ `1` ຈະປິດການເພີ່ມຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍ (suffix) ທີ່ສຸ່ມສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃຫ້ກັບ minion ID ຂອງເທີມິນໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:32
msgid ""
"If you set this parameter make sure your terminal has either a unique "
"hostname provided by DHCP and DNS, or the terminal hardware comes with a "
"unique serial number stored in its SMBios memory.  Otherwise there is a risk "
"of terminal minion ID duplicity, and bootstrapping the minion will fail."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີນີ້, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເທີມິນໍຂອງທ່ານມີຊື່ໂຮສທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນເຊິ່ງສະໜອງໂດຍ DHCP ແລະ DNS, ຫຼື ອຸປະກອນເທີມິນໍມາກັບໝາຍເລກຊີຣຽວ (serial number) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນເຊິ່ງເກັບໄວ້ໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ SMBios. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ອາດມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ minion ID ຂອງເທີມິນໍຈະຊໍ້າກັນ, ແລະ ການ bootstrap minion ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The following parameters (`MINION_ID_PREFIX`, `salt_device`, `root`) are "
"usually autoconfigured and should be used only in specific conditions such "
"as debugging or development:"
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ (`MINION_ID_PREFIX`, `salt_device`, `root`) ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນເງື່ອນໄຂສະເພາະເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ ການ debugging ຫຼື ການພັດທະນາ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "`MINION_ID_PREFIX`"
msgstr "`MINION_ID_PREFIX`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:35
msgid "Branch ID set in the Branch Network formula form."
msgstr "ID ຂອງສາຂາທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນແບບຟອມສູດເຄືອຂ່າຍສາຂາ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "`salt_device`"
msgstr "`salt_device`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:37
msgid "Device that contains the Salt configuration."
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນທີ່ປະກອບມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Salt."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "`root`"
msgstr "`root`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-pxe.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Device that contains the already deployed root file system.  Used for "
"falling back to local boot."
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນທີ່ປະກອບມີລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຮາກ (root file system) ທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການບູດເຄື່ອງພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ (local boot)."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Saline Formula"
msgstr "Saline Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Saline in {productname} monitoring is configured using formulas with forms.  "
"The package is installed by default, and contains these formulas:"
msgstr "Saline ໃນການຕິດຕາມກວດກາຂອງ {productname} ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ formulas ພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ. ແພັກເກັດນີ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງມາໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແລະ ປະກອບມີ formulas ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:3
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Saline Prometheus"
msgstr "Saline Prometheus"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:4
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Saline Grafana"
msgstr "Saline Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:5
msgid ""
"These formulas are extending the configuration of Grafana and Prometheus "
"created with xref:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[Monitoring Formulas]."
msgstr "Formulas ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຂະຫຍາຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ Grafana ແລະ Prometheus ທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ xref:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[Monitoring Formulas]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Saline Prometheus Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Saline Prometheus Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Saline Prometheus] tab, and set these "
"parameters in the `Saline Prometheus` section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Saline Prometheus], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Saline Prometheus`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Check the `Enable Saline scrape configuration` box to enable Saline "
"Prometheus monitoring."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Enable Saline scrape configuration` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕິດຕາມກວດກາຂອງ Saline Prometheus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Check the `Saline secure connection (HTTPS)` to use secure connection to "
"Saline (used by default)."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກ `Saline secure connection (HTTPS)` ເພື່ອໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ປອດໄພຫາ Saline (ໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Saline Grafana Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Saline Grafana Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Saline Grafana] tab, and set these parameters "
"in the `Saline Grafana` section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Saline Grafana], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Saline Grafana`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:16
msgid "`{productname} server dashboard with Saline`"
msgstr "`{productname} server dashboard with Saline`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:17
msgid "`{productname} Saline States Job dashboard`"
msgstr "`{productname} Saline States Job dashboard`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring Prometheus and Grafana with formulas, "
"see xref:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[Monitoring Formulas]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ດ້ວຍ formulas, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[Monitoring Formulas]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For more information about using monitoring, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[Monitoring with Prometheus and Grafana]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ງານການຕິດຕາມກວດກາ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[Monitoring with Prometheus and Grafana]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{saltboot} Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {saltboot} formula is used to configure disk images and partitioning for "
"the selected hardware type."
msgstr "ສູດ {saltboot} ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບດິດ (disk images) ແລະ ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ (partitioning) ສຳລັບປະເພດຮາດແວທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The {saltboot} formula is meant to be used as a group formula.  Enable and "
"configure {saltboot} formula for hardware type groups."
msgstr "ສູດ {saltboot} ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນສູດກຸ່ມ. ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ {saltboot} ສຳລັບກຸ່ມປະເພດຮາດແວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To apply changes to a terminal, terminal needs to be restarted.  Applying "
"highstate does not have any effect on running terminals."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງກັບເທີມິນໍ, ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຣີສະຕາດເທີມິນໍໃໝ່. ການນຳໃຊ້ highstate ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ ຕໍ່ເທີມິນໍທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Hardware Type Group with {saltboot}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າກຸ່ມປະເພດຮາດແວດ້ວຍ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Open the details page for your new hardware type group, and navigate to the "
"`Formulas` tab."
msgstr "ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບກຸ່ມປະເພດ hardware ໃໝ່ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ `Formulas`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:7
msgid "Select the {saltboot} formula and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກສູດ {saltboot} ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:8
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Saltboot] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Saltboot]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:9
msgid "In the `Disk 1` section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Disk 1`, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the `Disk symbolic ID` field, enter a custom name for the disk (for "
"example, `disk1`)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Disk symbolic ID`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບດິສກ໌ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, `disk1`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:11
msgid "In the `Device type` field, select `DISK`."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Device type`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ `DISK`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the `Disk device` field, select the device that corresponds to the device "
"name on the target machine or asterisk `*`, see "
"xref:saltboot-formula-disk-selection[]."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Disk device`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກອຸປະກອນທີ່ກົງກັບຊື່ອຸປະກອນໃນເຄື່ອງເປົ້າໝາຍ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍດາວ `*`, ເບິ່ງ xref:saltboot-formula-disk-selection[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:13
msgid "In the `RAID level` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `RAID level`, ໃຫ້ປະວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:14
msgid "In the `Disk Label` field, select `gpt`."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Disk Label`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ `gpt`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:15
msgid "In the `Partition` section, set these parameters for `Partition 1`:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Partition`, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ `Partition 1`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the `Partition symbolic ID` field, enter a custom name for the partition "
"(for example, `p1`)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition symbolic ID`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ partition (ຕົວຢ່າງ, `p1`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:17
msgid "In the `Partition size` use value 500."
msgstr "ໃນ `Partition size` ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າ 500."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:18
msgid "In the `Device mount point` use `/boot/efi`."
msgstr "ໃນ `Device mount point` ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `/boot/efi`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:19
msgid "In the `Filesystem format` use `vfat`."
msgstr "ໃນ `Filesystem format` ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `vfat`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:20
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:28
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:36
msgid "In the `OS Image to deploy` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `OS Image to deploy`, ໃຫ້ປະວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:21
msgid "In the `Partition encryption password` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition encryption password`, ໃຫ້ປະວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:22
msgid "In the `Partition flags` use `boot`."
msgstr "ໃນ `Partition flags` ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `boot`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:23
msgid "In the `Partition` section, set these parameters for `Partition 2`:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Partition`, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ `Partition 2`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the `Partition symbolic ID` field, enter a custom name for the partition "
"(for example, `p2`)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition symbolic ID`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ partition (ຕົວຢ່າງ, `p2`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:25
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the `Partition size` field, specify a size for the partition in Mebibytes "
"(MiB)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition size`, ໃຫ້ລະບຸຂະໜາດສຳລັບ partition ເປັນເມບີໄບຕ໌ (MiB)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the `Device mount point` field, select a location to mount the partition "
"(for example, `/data`)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Device mount point`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຈະ mount partition (ຕົວຢ່າງ, `/data`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the `Filesystem format` field, select your preferred format (for example, "
"`xfs`)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Filesystem format`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຮູບແບບທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, `xfs`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:29
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:37
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:48
msgid ""
"In the `Partition encryption password` field, enter a password if you want "
"to encrypt the partition."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition encryption password`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ partition."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:30
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:49
msgid "In the `Partition flags` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition flags`, ໃຫ້ປະວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:31
msgid "In the `Partition` section, set these parameters for `Partition 3`:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Partition`, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ `Partition 3`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:32
msgid ""
"In the `Partition symbolic ID` field, enter a custom name for the partition "
"(for example, `p3`)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition symbolic ID`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ partition (ຕົວຢ່າງ, `p3`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:34
msgid "In the `Device mount point` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Device mount point`, ໃຫ້ປະວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:35
msgid "In the `Filesystem format` field, select `swap`."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Filesystem format`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ `swap`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:38
msgid "In the `Partition flags` field, select `swap`."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition flags`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ `swap`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:39
msgid "In the `Partition` section, set these parameters for `Partition 4`:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Partition`, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ `Partition 4`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:40
msgid ""
"In the `Partition symbolic ID` field, enter a custom name for the partition "
"(for example, `p4`)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition symbolic ID`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສຳລັບ partition (ຕົວຢ່າງ, `p4`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:41
msgid "In the `Partition size` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition size`, ໃຫ້ປະວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:42
msgid "This will ensure the partition uses up all remaining space."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພາກສ່ວນນັ້ນໃຊ້ເນື້ອທີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ຍັງເຫຼືອຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:43
msgid "In the `Device mount point` field, select `/`."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Device mount point`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ `/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:44
msgid "In the `Filesystem format` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Filesystem format`, ໃຫ້ປະວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:45
msgid "In the `OS Image to deploy` field, enter the name of the image to deploy."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `OS Image to deploy`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ຂອງ image ທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:46
msgid "In the `Image version` field, leave it empty."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Image version`, ໃຫ້ປະວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:47
msgid "This will ensure you use the latest available version."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໃຊ້ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Special Partition Types"
msgstr "ປະເພດພາກສ່ວນ (Partition) ພິເສດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:52
msgid "The {saltboot} formula helps you with setting up special partition types."
msgstr "ສູດ {saltboot} ຊ່ວຍທ່ານໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າປະເພດພາກສ່ວນພິເສດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:53
msgid ""
"For terminal to be able to boot locally, either `BIOS grub` or `EFI` "
"partition must be configured."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ terminal ສາມາດບູດພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໄດ້, ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ partition ແບບ `BIOS grub` ຫຼື `EFI` ຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "BIOS grub Partition"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ BIOS grub"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:55
msgid ""
"A BIOS grub partition is needed for local booting from a `GPT` disk on "
"non-EFI machines.  For more information, see "
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BIOS_boot_partition."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ BIOS grub ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການບູດຈາກພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງຈາກດິດແບບ `GPT` ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ EFI. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BIOS_boot_partition."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:56
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:61
msgid "In the formula, enter the following options:"
msgstr "ໃນສູດ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນໂຕເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Partition Symbolic ID: p1\n"
"Partition Size (MiB): 50\n"
"Partition Flags: bios_grub\n"
msgstr ""
"Partition Symbolic ID: p1\n"
"Partition Size (MiB): 50\n"
"Partition Flags: bios_grub\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:58
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:63
msgid "Leave the other fields empty."
msgstr "ປະຊ່ອງອື່ນໆ ໃຫ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "EFI Partition"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ EFI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:60
msgid ""
"An EFI partition is needed for local booting on EFI machines, `Partition "
"Table Type` must be `GPT`.  For more information, see "
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EFI_system_partition."
msgstr "EFI partition ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການບູດພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໃນເຄື່ອງ EFI, ໂດຍ `Partition Table Type` ຕ້ອງເປັນ `GPT`. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EFI_system_partition."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Partition Symbolic ID: p1\n"
"Partition Size (MiB): 500\n"
"Device Mount Point: /boot/efi\n"
"Filesystem Format: vfat\n"
"Partition Flags: boot\n"
msgstr ""
"Partition Symbolic ID: p1\n"
"Partition Size (MiB): 500\n"
"Device Mount Point: /boot/efi\n"
"Filesystem Format: vfat\n"
"Partition Flags: boot\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disk Selection in {saltboot} Formula"
msgstr "ການເລືອກດິດໃນສູດ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When there is only one disk present on target hardware (including USB "
"drives), use an asterisk `*` to automatically select the disk device."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີດິສກ໌ພຽງອັນດຽວໃນ hardware ເປົ້າໝາຍ (ລວມທັງ USB drive), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍດາວ `*` ເພື່ອເລືອກອຸປະກອນດິສກ໌ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:66
msgid ""
"When there are multiple disks, use an asterisk `*` in the device path.  In "
"this example, SATA disks are differentiated from USB disks:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີດິສກ໌ຫຼາຍອັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍດາວ `*` ໃນທີ່ຢູ່ອຸປະກອນ (device path). ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, SATA disk ຈະຖືກແຍກຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ USB disk:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/dev/disk/by-path/*-ata-1\n"
"/dev/disk/by-path/*usb*\n"
msgstr ""
"/dev/disk/by-path/*-ata-1\n"
"/dev/disk/by-path/*usb*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:68
msgid ""
"If the entered value does not contain `/`, the entered value is "
"automatically prepended by `/dev/disk/by-path/`.  For example, `\\*usb*` is "
"the same as `/dev/disk/by-path/\\*usb*`."
msgstr "ຖ້າຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `/`, ຄ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກຕື່ມດ້ວຍ `/dev/disk/by-path/` ໄວ້ທາງໜ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, `\\*usb*` ຈະຄືກັນກັບ `/dev/disk/by-path/\\*usb*`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:69
msgid ""
"If you prefer to select specific devices, you can this format in the disk "
"device field:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເລືອກອຸປະກອນສະເພາະ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຮູບແບບນີ້ໃນຊ່ອງອຸປະກອນດິດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:70
msgid "symbolic names (for example: `/dev/sda`)"
msgstr "ຊື່ສັນຍະລັກ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `/dev/sda`)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:71
msgid "by-path (for example: `/dev/disk/by-path/..`)"
msgstr "ໂດຍທີ່ຢູ່ (by-path) (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `/dev/disk/by-path/..`)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:72
msgid "by-id (for example: `/dev/disk/by-id/...`)"
msgstr "ໂດຍໄອດີ (by-id) (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `/dev/disk/by-id/...`)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:73
msgid ""
"To see a list of available devices from the command prompt, press kbd:[Esc] "
"while waiting for key approval."
msgstr "ຫາກຕ້ອງການເບິ່ງລາຍການອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈາກພອມພ໌ຄຳສັ່ງ (command prompt), ໃຫ້ກົດ kbd:[Esc] ໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ລໍຖ້າການອະນຸມັດຄີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting the {saltboot} Formula"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາສູດ {saltboot}"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "`msdos` Disklabel Limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ Disklabel ແບບ `msdos`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:76
msgid ""
"On the `msdos` disk label, you can create a maximum of four primary "
"partitions.  Extended partitions are not supported.  If you need more than "
"four partitions, use the `GPT` disk label instead."
msgstr "ໃນ disk label ແບບ `msdos`, ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງ primary partition ໄດ້ສູງສຸດພຽງ 4 ອັນ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Extended partition. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຫຼາຍກວ່າ 4 partitions, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `GPT` disk label ແທນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "TFTPd Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ TFTPd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The TFTPd formula is used to configure the TFTP service on the {productname} "
"{smr} branch server."
msgstr "ສູດ TFTPd ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການບໍລິການ TFTP ໃນເຊີເວີສາຂາ {productname} {smr}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring TFTP"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ TFTP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:6
msgid "Select the `Tftpd` formula, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ formula `Tftpd`, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:7
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Tftpd] tab, and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Tftpd], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the `Internal Network Address` field, enter the IP address of the branch "
"server (for example: `192.168.1.5`)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Internal Network Address`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງ branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `192.168.1.5`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the `TFTP Base Directory` field, enter the path to the {saltboot} "
"directory (for example, `/srv/saltboot`)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `TFTP Base Directory`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ {saltboot} directory (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `/srv/saltboot`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:10
msgid "In the `Run TFTP Under User` field, enter `saltboot`."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Run TFTP Under User`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ `saltboot`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization Guest Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ Virtualization Guest"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Virtualization Guest formula is used to configure settings for virtual "
"machine."
msgstr "ສູດ Virtualization Guest ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (virtual machine)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Open the `Tuning` pull-down checklist and select from the following virtual "
"machine performance tuning settings:"
msgstr "ເປີດລາຍການ `Tuning` ແລະ ເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າການປັບແຕ່ງປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ virtual machine ດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:4
msgid "`Disable IRQ balancing`."
msgstr "`Disable IRQ balancing`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:5
msgid ""
"`Disable Kernel Samepage Merging (KSM)`.  Reduces performance overhead by "
"not sharing memory across virtual machines."
msgstr "`Disable Kernel Samepage Merging (KSM)`. ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນພາລະຂອງລະບົບໂດຍການບໍ່ແບ່ງປັນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂ້າມ virtual machines."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:6
msgid ""
"`Optimizations for KVM passed through host CPU`.  Requires the KVM "
"hint-dedicated option to be set on the VM definition."
msgstr "`Optimizations for KVM passed through host CPU`. ຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ KVM hint-dedicated ໃນການກຳນົດ VM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:7
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:11
msgid ""
"When configured, click btn:[Save Formula] to save your configuration, and "
"apply the highstate."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Save Formula] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization Host Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ Virtualization Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Virtualization Host formula is used to configure settings for a "
"virtualization host."
msgstr "ສູດ Virtualization Host ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບເຄື່ອງທີ່ເປັນໂຮສຂອງລະບົບສະເໝືອນ (virtualization host)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hypervisor"
msgstr "ໄຮເປີໄວເຊີ (Hypervisor)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:4
msgid "Select KVM or Xen as the hypervisor."
msgstr "ເລືອກ KVM ຫຼື Xen ເປັນ hypervisor."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create default storage pool"
msgstr "ສ້າງ storage pool ມາດຕະຖານ"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create default virtual network"
msgstr "ສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນມາດຕະຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Default pool: Open the pull-down list and enter the directory name of the "
"default storage pool."
msgstr "Default pool: ເປີດລາຍການລົງມາ ແລະ ປ້ອນຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂອງ storage pool ມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Default net: Open the pull-down list and configure the default virtual "
"network by setting the `Mode` (`NAT` or `Bridge`) and the `Bridge name`."
msgstr "Default net: ເປີດລາຍການລົງມາ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ virtual network ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍກຳນົດ `Mode` (`NAT` ຫຼື `Bridge`) ແລະ `Bridge name`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:10
msgid "Enable IOMMU support (x86_64)."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບ IOMMU (x86_64)."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Formula"
msgstr "ສູດ Yomi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Yomi (yet one more installer) installer for {suse} and openSUSE "
"operating systems is configured using formulas with forms."
msgstr "ຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງ Yomi (yet one more installer) ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse} ແລະ openSUSE ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:3
msgid "The `yomi-formula` package provides these formulas:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ `yomi-formula` ມີ formulas ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:4
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi"
msgstr "Yomi"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:5
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Storage"
msgstr "Yomi Storage"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:6
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Bootloader"
msgstr "Yomi Bootloader"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:7
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Software"
msgstr "Yomi Software"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:8
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Services"
msgstr "Yomi Services"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:9
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Users"
msgstr "Yomi Users"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Install the Yomi Formulas with Forms"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງສູດ Yomi ພ້ອມແບບຟອມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:11
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:25
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, install the "
"`yomi-formula` package:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ `yomi-formula`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:12
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in yomi-formula\n"
msgstr "zypper in yomi-formula\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:13
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:27
msgid "Restart services:"
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດການບໍລິການ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:14
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-master.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-master.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:15
msgid ""
"When the formula package is installed, you need to install the PXE Yomi "
"image on the client, boot the client you want to provision, and enable the "
"Yomi formulas on the client.  For more information on preparing Yomi clients "
"for provisioning, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-yomi.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດສູດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງຮູບພາບ PXE Yomi ໃນເຄື່ອງໄຄເອັນ, ບູດເຄື່ອງໄຄເອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດຕຽມ (provision), ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ສູດ Yomi ໃນໄຄເອັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕຽມໄຄເອັນ Yomi, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-yomi.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Yomi Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ Yomi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Yomi] tab, and set these parameters in the "
"`General Configuration` section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Yomi], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `General Configuration`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:18
msgid "Check the `Events` box to allow monitoring."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Events` ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດການຕິດຕາມກວດກາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the `Reboot` field, select `yes` to instruct the client to reboot after "
"installation."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Reboot`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ `yes` ເພື່ອສັ່ງໃຫ້ client reboot ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Check the `Snapper` box if you are using the btrfs file system on the "
"client."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Snapper` ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ btrfs ໃນ client."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the `Locale` field, select the region and encoding for systemd to use on "
"the client."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Locale`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກພາກພື້ນ ແລະ ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ systemd ໃຊ້ໃນ client."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:22
msgid "For example: `en_US.utf8` for US English and UTF-8."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: `en_US.utf8` ສຳລັບພາສາອັງກິດ (US) ແລະ UTF-8."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:23
msgid "In the `Keymap` field, select the appropriate keyboard layout."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Keymap`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຮູບແບບແປ້ນພິມທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:24
msgid "For example: `us` for a US keyboard layout."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: `us` ສຳລັບແປ້ນພິມແບບ US."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:25
msgid "In the `Timezone` field, select the timezone for the client to use."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Timezone`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເຂດເວລາ (timezone) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ client ໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:26
msgid "For example: `America/New_York` for EST."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: `America/New_York` ສຳລັບ EST."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:27
msgid "In the `Hostname` field, enter the hostname for the client to use."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Hostname`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ hostname ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ client ໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:28
msgid "Leave this blank if you are using DHCP to provide the hostname."
msgstr "ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ DHCP ເພື່ອສະໜອງຊື່ໂຮສ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In the `Machine Id` field, enter a machine identification number for the "
"client."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Machine Id`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນໝາຍເລກປະຈຳເຄື່ອງສຳລັບ client."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:30
msgid "Leave this blank to have systemd generate one automatically."
msgstr "ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ systemd ສ້າງໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:31
msgid "In the `Target` field, enter a systemd target unit."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Target`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ systemd target unit."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Yomi Storage Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ Yomi Storage"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Yomi Storage] tab, and set these parameters in "
"the menu:Partitions[Config] section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Yomi Storage], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Partitions[Config]:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:35
msgid "In the `Labels` field, select the default partition table type to use."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Labels`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກປະເພດ partition table ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:36
msgid ""
"In the `Initial Gap` field, select the default amount of space to leave "
"before the first partition."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Initial Gap`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຂະໜາດພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະປະໄວ້ກ່ອນ partition ທຳອິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:37
msgid "For example: `1{nbsp}MB`, or use `0` to leave no space between partitions."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: `1{nbsp}MB`, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ `0` ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີບ່ອນຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງພາກສ່ວນຂໍ້ມູນ (partitions)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:38
msgid ""
"For each device that you want to configure, in the menu:Partitions[Devices] "
"section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນແຕ່ລະອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Partitions[Devices], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:39
msgid "In the `Device` field, type the mount point for the device."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Device`, ໃຫ້ພິມ mount point ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:40
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:61
msgid "For example, `/dev/sda`."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `/dev/sda`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:41
msgid ""
"In the `Label` field, select the partition table type to use, if it is "
"different from the default label you selected."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Label`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກປະເພດ partition table ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້, ຖ້າມັນແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:42
msgid ""
"In the `Initial Gap` field, select the amount of space to leave before the "
"first partition, if it is different from the default space you specified."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Initial Gap`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຂະໜາດພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງທີ່ຈະປະໄວ້ກ່ອນ partition ທຳອິດ, ຖ້າມັນແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For each partition that you want to create, in the menu:Partitions[Devices > "
"Partitions] section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພາທິຊັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Partitions[Devices > Partitions], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:44
msgid "In the `Partition Number` field, enter a number for the partition."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition Number`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນໝາຍເລກສຳລັບ partition."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The number you enter here is appended to the device name to identify the "
"partition.  For example, partition number `1` on device `/dev/sda` can be "
"identified as `/dev/sda1`."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລກທີ່ເຈົ້າປ້ອນນີ້ຈະຖືກຕໍ່ທ້າຍຊື່ອຸປະກອນເພື່ອລະບຸ partition. ຕົວຢ່າງ, partition ໝາຍເລກ `1` ໃນອຸປະກອນ `/dev/sda` ຈະຖືກລະບຸເປັນ `/dev/sda1`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:46
msgid "In the `Partition Name` field, enter a name for the partition."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition Name`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ສຳລັບ partition."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Leave this blank if you have entered a partition number in the previous "
"field."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ ຫາກເຈົ້າໄດ້ປ້ອນໝາຍເລກພາທິຊັນໃນຫ້ອງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:48
msgid "In the `Partition Size` field, enter a size for the partition."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition Size`, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຂະໜາດສຳລັບ partition."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:49
msgid "For example: `500{nbsp}MB`.  Use `rest` to use all the remaining free space."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: `500{nbsp}MB`. ໃຊ້ `rest` ເພື່ອໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງທີ່ເຫຼືອທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:50
msgid ""
"For each file system that you want to create, in the `Filesystems` section, "
"click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Filesystems`, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[+], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:51
msgid "In the `Partition` field, select the partition to create the file system on."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Partition`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ partition ທີ່ຈະສ້າງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ລົງໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:52
msgid "For example, `/dev/sda1`."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `/dev/sda1`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:53
msgid "In the `Filesystem` field, select the file system type to create."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Filesystem`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກປະເພດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະສ້າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:54
msgid "In the `Mountpoint` field, type the mount point for the file system."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Mountpoint`, ໃຫ້ພິມ mount point ສຳລັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:55
msgid "For example: `/` for root."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: `/` ສຳລັບ root."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:57
msgid ""
"If you want to use LVM or RAID on your devices, click btn:[+] in the "
"appropriate sections, and complete the details for your environment."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ LVM ຫຼື RAID ໃນອຸປະກອນຂອງເຈົ້າ, ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+] ໃນພາກສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ແລະ ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Yomi Bootloader Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Yomi Bootloader Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Yomi Bootloader] tab, and set these parameters "
"in the `Bootloader` section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Yomi Bootloader], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Bootloader`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:60
msgid "In the `Device` field, type the path for the bootloader."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Device`, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ (path) ສຳລັບ bootloader."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:62
msgid ""
"In the `Timeout` field, select the number of seconds grub will wait before "
"booting the default menu entry."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Timeout`, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ grub ຈະລໍຖ້າກ່ອນທີ່ຈະບູດເມນູເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:63
msgid ""
"In the `Kernel` field, type any additional kernel parameters you want to "
"use."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Kernel`, ໃຫ້ພິມພະລາມິເຕີ kernel ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Any kernel parameters you add here will be appended to the "
"`GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT` line during boot."
msgstr "ພະລາມິເຕີ kernel ໃດໆ ທີ່ເຈົ້າເພີ່ມຢູ່ນີ້ ຈະຖືກຕໍ່ທ້າຍແຖວ `GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT` ໃນລະຫວ່າງການບູດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:65
msgid ""
"In the `Terminal` field, type the terminal to use for both terminal input "
"and output."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Terminal`, ໃຫ້ພິມ terminal ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບທັງ input ແລະ output ຂອງ terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:66
msgid "In the `Serial Command` field, type parameters for using the serial port."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Serial Command`, ໃຫ້ພິມພະລາມິເຕີສຳລັບການໃຊ້ serial port."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:67
msgid "Use this only if you are using the serial console as the default terminal."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ຊີຣຽວຄອນໂຊນເປັນເທີມິນໍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:68
msgid ""
"In the `Gfxmode` field, type the resolution to use for the graphical "
"terminal."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Gfxmode`, ໃຫ້ພິມຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ graphical terminal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Use this only if you are using the graphical console as the default "
"terminal."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ກຣາບຟິກຄອນໂຊນເປັນເທີມິນໍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:70
msgid "Check the `Theme` box to use GRUB2 default branding package."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Theme` ເພື່ອໃຊ້ແພັກເກັດ branding ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ GRUB2."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Check the `Disable OS Prober` box to disable using the OS prober to discover "
"other installed operating systems."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Disable OS Prober` ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ OS prober ໃນການຄົ້ນຫາລະບົບປະຕິບັດການອື່ນໆ ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Yomi Software Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Yomi Software Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:74
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Yomi Software] tab, and set these parameters "
"in the menu:Software[Configuration] section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Yomi Software], ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Configuration]:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Check the `Minimal` box to use a minimal installation, which only installs "
"packages listed as `Required`."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Minimal` ເພື່ອໃຊ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ, ເຊິ່ງຈະຕິດຕັ້ງສະເພາະແພັກເກັດທີ່ລະບຸວ່າ `Required` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:76
msgid ""
"For each repository that you want to add, in the menu:Software[Repositories] "
"section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຄັງຊອບແວ (repository) ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Repositories], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:77
msgid "In the `Repository Name` field, type a name for the repository."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Repository Name`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບ repository."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:78
msgid "In the `Repository URL` field, type the location of the repository."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Repository URL`, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ repository."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:79
msgid ""
"To add packages from each repository, in the menu:Software[Packages] "
"section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັກເກັດຈາກແຕ່ລະຄັງຊອບແວ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Packages], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the menu:Software[Packages] field, type the names of the packages to "
"install, or type a pattern to search for the appropriate packages."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ menu:Software[Packages], ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຫຼື ພິມຮູບແບບ (pattern) ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກັດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:81
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:96
msgid "For example, `pattern:enhanced_base glibc-locale`, or `kernel-default`."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `pattern:enhanced_base glibc-locale`, ຫຼື `kernel-default`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:82
msgid "In the menu:Software[Image] section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Image], ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:83
msgid ""
"In the `Image URL` field, type the location of the operating system ISO "
"image to use."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Image URL`, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ ISO image ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:84
msgid "In the `Md5` field, type the MD5 hash to use to verify the ISO."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Md5`, ໃຫ້ພິມ MD5 hash ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການກວດສອບ ISO."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:85
msgid "In the menu:SUSEConect[Config] section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:SUSEConnect[Config], ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:86
msgid ""
"In the `Registration Code` field, type the registration code for the client "
"you are installing."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Registration Code`, ໃຫ້ພິມລະຫັດການລົງທະບຽນສຳລັບ client ທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:87
msgid "You can obtain this code from {scclongform}."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເອົາລະຫັດນີ້ໄດ້ຈາກ {scclongform}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:88
msgid "In the `Email` field, type the administrator email address to use."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Email`, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:89
msgid "In the `Url` field, type the address of the registration server to use."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Url`, ໃຫ້ພິມທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ server ລົງທະບຽນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:90
msgid "For example, use `https://scc.suse.com`, to register with {scclongform}."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃຊ້ `https://scc.suse.com`, ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scclongform}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:91
msgid "In the `Version` field, type the version of the product you are registering."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Version`, ໃຫ້ພິມເວີຊັນຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັງລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:92
msgid ""
"For each product that you want to register, in the "
"menu:SUSEConnect[Products] section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລົງທະບຽນ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:SUSEConnect[Products], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:93
msgid "In the `Product` field, type each product you want to register."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Product`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນແຕ່ລະອັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:94
msgid ""
"For example, `<product_name>/1.1/x86`, for version 1.1 with {x86} "
"architecture."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `<product_name>/1.1/x86`, ສຳລັບເວີຊັນ 1.1 ທີ່ມີສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:95
msgid ""
"In the menu:SUSEConnect[Packages] field, type the names of the packages to "
"install, or type a pattern to search for the appropriate packages."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ menu:SUSEConnect[Packages], ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຫຼື ພິມຮູບແບບເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກັດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Yomi Services Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Yomi Services Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:99
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Yomi Services] tab, and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Yomi Services], ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:100
msgid ""
"Check the `Install salt-minion` box to install and configure the client as a "
"Salt client."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ `Install salt-minion` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ client ໃຫ້ເປັນ Salt client."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:101
msgid ""
"For each service you want to enable, in the menu:Services[Enabled] section, "
"click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະບໍລິການ (service) ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Services[Enabled], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:102
msgid "In the `Service` field, type the name of the service to enable."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Service`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ບໍລິການທີ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:103
msgid "For example, `salt-minion`."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `salt-minion`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:104
msgid ""
"For each service you want to disable, in the menu:Services[Disabled] "
"section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະບໍລິການທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປິດການໃຊ້, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Services[Disabled], ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[+], ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:105
msgid "In the `Service` field, type the name of the service to disable."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Service`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ບໍລິການທີ່ຈະປິດໃຊ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Yomi Users Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Yomi Users Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:108
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Yomi Users] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Yomi Users]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:109
msgid ""
"For each user you want to create, in the `Users` section, click btn:[+], and "
"set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ `Users`, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[+], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:110
msgid "In the `Username` field, type the name of the new user."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Username`, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:111
msgid ""
"In the `Password Hash` field, type the hashed version of the password to "
"use."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ `Password Hash`, ໃຫ້ພິມລະຫັດຜ່ານເວີຊັນທີ່ຜ່ານການ hash ແລ້ວທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:112
msgid ""
"To add a certificate for each user, in the menu:Users[Certificates] section, "
"click btn:[+], and add the certificate to the `Certificate` field."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ certificate ໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄົນ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Users[Certificates], ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[+], ແລະ ເພີ່ມ certificate ເຂົ້າໃນຫ້ອງ `Certificate`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:115
msgid ""
"For more information about using Yomi, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-yomi.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ Yomi, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-yomi.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Formulas Provided by {productname}"
msgstr "Formulas ທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Some formulas are installed by default with {productname}.  Other official "
"formulas can be installed as RPM packages.  When the formula is installed, "
"you can activate them using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ບາງ formulas ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງມາພ້ອມກັບ {productname} ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. formulas ທາງການອື່ນໆສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບແພັກເກັດ RPM. ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ formula ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For information about writing custom formulas, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການຂຽນ custom formulas, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Formulas with Zypper"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Formulas ດ້ວຍ Zypper"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:5
msgid "Formulas are provided in the {productname} pool software channel."
msgstr "Formulas ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໃນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ pool ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If a formula uses the same name as an existing Salt state, the two names "
"will collide, and could result in the formula being used instead of the "
"state.  Always check states and formulas to avoid name clashes."
msgstr "ຫາກ formula ໃຊ້ຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບ Salt state ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຊື່ທັງສອງຈະຊ້ຳກັນ ແລະ ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ formula ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນ state. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບ states ແລະ formulas ສະເໝີເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຊ້ຳກັນຂອງຊື່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Formulas with Zypper"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Formulas ດ້ວຍ Zypper"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, search for available "
"formulas:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ (command prompt), ໃຫ້ຄົ້ນຫາ formulas ທີ່ມີໃຫ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper se --type package formula\n"
msgstr "zypper se --type package formula\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:10
msgid "Get more information about a formula:"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ formula:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper info <formula_name>\n"
msgstr "zypper info <formula_name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:12
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, install the "
"formula:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ສິດ root, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ formula:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in <formula_name>\n"
msgstr "zypper in <formula_name>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate Formulas from the {webui}"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ Formulas ຜ່ານ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Formulas provided by {productname}, or formulas that you have installed, can "
"be activated using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Formulas ທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ {productname}, ຫຼື formulas ທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ, ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Activate Formulas from the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເປີດໃຊ້ Formulas ຜ່ານ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[List], select the "
"client you want to activate the formula for."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[List], ແລ້ວເລືອກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ formula ໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Systems[Formulas] tab, and check the formula you want "
"to activate."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Systems[Formulas], ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກເອົາ formula ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:19
msgid "Click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Navigate to the new subtab for the formula, and configure the formula as "
"required."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍໃໝ່ສຳລັບ formula ນັ້ນ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ formula ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Salt Formulas"
msgstr "Custom Salt Formulas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about writing custom formulas, including "
"formulas with forms.  You can write your own custom formulas, and make them "
"available to client systems in the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການຂຽນ custom formulas, ລວມທັງ formulas ທີ່ມີແບບຟອມ (forms). ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂຽນ custom formulas ຂອງເຈົ້າເອງ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍໃນ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For information about the formulas provided by {productname}, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ formulas ທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "File Structure Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:5
msgid ""
"RPM-based formulas must be placed in a specific directory structure to "
"ensure that they work correctly.  A formula contains two separate "
"directories: `states`, and `metadata`.  Folders in these directories need to "
"have exactly matching names."
msgstr "Formulas ທີ່ເປັນແບບ RPM ຕ້ອງຖືກຈັດວາງໃນໂຄງສ້າງ directory ທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ. formula ປະກອບມີສອງ directory ແຍກກັນຄື: `states` ແລະ `metadata`. ໂຟນເດີໃນ directory ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງມີຊື່ທີ່ກົງກັນຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The formula states directory contains anything necessary for a Salt state to "
"work independently.  This includes `.sls` files, a `map.jinja` file and any "
"other required files.  This directory should only be modified by RPMs and "
"should not be edited manually.  For example, the `locale-formula` states "
"directory is located in:"
msgstr "Directory states ຂອງ formula ປະກອບມີທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ Salt state ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ລວມມີໄຟລ໌ `.sls`, ໄຟລ໌ `map.jinja` ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆ ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ. directory ນີ້ຄວນຖືກແກ້ໄຂໂດຍ RPM ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, directory states ຂອງ `locale-formula` ແມ່ນຕັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states/locale/\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states/locale/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To create formulas with forms, the metadata directory contains a `form.yml` "
"file.  The `form.yml` file defines the forms for {productname}.  The "
"metadata directory also contains an optional `metadata.yml` file with "
"additional information about the formula.  For example, the `locale-formula` "
"metadata directory is located in:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງ formulas ພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ, metadata directory ຕ້ອງມີໄຟລ໌ `form.yml`. ໄຟລ໌ `form.yml` ຈະກຳນົດແບບຟອມສຳລັບ {productname}. metadata directory ຍັງອາດຈະມີໄຟລ໌ `metadata.yml` ເປັນທາງເລືອກເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ formula. ຕົວຢ່າງ, metadata directory ຂອງ `locale-formula` ແມ່ນຕັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/metadata/locale/\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/metadata/locale/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If you have a custom formula that is not in an RPM, it must be in a state "
"directory configured as a Salt file root.  Custom state formula data must be "
"in:"
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າມີ custom formula ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນ RPM, ມັນຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ state ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເປັນ Salt file root. ຂໍ້ມູນ custom state formula ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "/srv/salt/<custom-formula-name>/\n"
msgstr "/srv/salt/<custom-formula-name>/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:12
msgid "Custom metadata information must be in:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ custom metadata ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "/srv/formula_metadata/<custom-formula-name>/\n"
msgstr "/srv/formula_metadata/<custom-formula-name>/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:14
msgid ""
"All custom folders must contain a `form.yml` file.  These files are detected "
"as form recipes and are applied to groups and systems from the {webui}:"
msgstr "ທຸກໂຟນເດີ custom ຕ້ອງມີໄຟລ໌ `form.yml`. ໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກກວດພົບວ່າເປັນ form recipes ແລະ ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບກຸ່ມ ແລະ ລະບົບຕ່າງໆ ຈາກ {webui}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "/srv/formula_metadata/<custom-formula-name>/form.yml\n"
msgstr "/srv/formula_metadata/<custom-formula-name>/form.yml\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The Salt formula directory changed in {productname}{nbsp}4.0.  The old "
"directory location, `/usr/share/susemanager/formulas`, will continue to work "
"for some time.  You should ensure that you update to the new directory "
"location, `/usr/share/salt-formulas/` as soon as possible."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂອງສູດ Salt (Salt formula) ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງໃນ {productname}{nbsp}4.0. ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເກົ່າ, `/usr/share/susemanager/formulas`, ຈະຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຕໍ່ໄປອີກໄລຍະໜຶ່ງ. ເເຈົ້າຄວນກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ອັບເດດໄປຫາທີ່ຕັ້ງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃໝ່, `/usr/share/salt-formulas/` ໂດຍໄວທີ່ສຸດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define Formula with Forms Data"
msgstr "ກຳນົດ Formula ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນແບບຟອມ (Forms Data)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:18
msgid ""
"{productname} requires a file called `form.yml`, to describe how formula "
"data should look within the {webui}.  The `form.yml` file is used by "
"{productname} to generate the desired formula with forms, with values "
"editable by a user."
msgstr "{productname} ຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ `form.yml` ເພື່ອອະທິບາຍວ່າຂໍ້ມູນ formula ຄວນມີໜ້າຕາແນວໃດໃນ {webui}. ໄຟລ໌ `form.yml` ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ {productname} ເພື່ອສ້າງ formula ພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ໂດຍມີຄ່າທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The file contains a list of editable attributes that start with a `$` sign.  "
"These attributes are used to determine how to display the formula in the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍການຂອງຄຸນລັກສະນະ (attributes) ທີ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `$`. ຄຸນລັກສະນະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວິທີການສະແດງຜົນ formula ໃນ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For example, the `form.yml` that is included with the `locale-formula` is "
"in:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `form.yml` ທີ່ມີມານຳ `locale-formula` ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/metadata/locale/form.yml\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/metadata/locale/form.yml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:22
msgid "Part of that file looks like this:"
msgstr "ບາງສ່ວນຂອງໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນມີໜ້າຕາຄືແນວນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"timezone:\n"
"  $type: group\n"
msgstr ""
"timezone:\n"
"  $type: group\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  name:\n"
"    $type: select\n"
"    $values: [\"CET\",\n"
"              \"Etc/Zulu\"\n"
"              ]\n"
"    $default: CET\n"
msgstr ""
"  name:\n"
"    $type: select\n"
"    $values: [\"CET\",\n"
"              \"Etc/Zulu\"\n"
"              ]\n"
"    $default: CET\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  hardware_clock_set_to_utc:\n"
"    $type: boolean\n"
"    $default: True\n"
"...\n"
msgstr ""
"  hardware_clock_set_to_utc:\n"
"    $type: boolean\n"
"    $default: True\n"
"...\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:26
msgid ""
"All values that start with a `$` sign are annotations used to display the UI "
"that users interact with.  These annotations are not part of pillar data "
"itself and are handled as metadata."
msgstr "ຄ່າທັງໝົດທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `$` ແມ່ນຄຳອະທິບາຍ (annotations) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນ UI ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໂຕ້ຕອບນຳ. ຄຳອະທິບາຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ຈະຖືກຈັດການເປັນ metadata."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:27
msgid "This section lists the available attributes:"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ສະແດງລາຍການຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "$type"
msgstr "$type"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The most important attribute is the `$type` attribute.  It defines the type "
"of the pillar value and the form-field that is generated.  The supported "
"types are:"
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນ `$type`. ມັນກຳນົດປະເພດຂອງຄ່າ pillar ແລະ ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນໃນແບບຟອມ (form-field) ທີ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ປະເພດທີ່ຮອງຮັບມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:30
msgid "`text`"
msgstr "`text`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:31
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:83
msgid "`password`"
msgstr "`password`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:32
msgid "`number`"
msgstr "`number`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:33
msgid "`url`"
msgstr "`url`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:34
msgid "`email`"
msgstr "`email`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:35
msgid "`date`"
msgstr "`date`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:36
msgid "`time`"
msgstr "`time`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:37
msgid "`datetime`"
msgstr "`datetime`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:38
msgid "`boolean`"
msgstr "`boolean`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:39
msgid "`color`"
msgstr "`color`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:40
msgid "`select`"
msgstr "`select`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:41
msgid "`group`"
msgstr "`group`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:42
msgid "`edit-group`"
msgstr "`edit-group`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:43
msgid "`namespace`"
msgstr "`namespace`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:44
msgid "`hidden-group` (obsolete, renamed to `namespace`)"
msgstr "`hidden-group` (ເລີກໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ປ່ຽນຊື່ເປັນ `namespace`)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The text attribute is the default and does not need to be specified "
"explicitly."
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະ text ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:46
msgid "Many of these values are self-explanatory:"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍໆຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ງ່າຍດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:47
msgid "The `text` type generates a simple text field"
msgstr "ປະເພດ `text` ຈະສ້າງຫ້ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບງ່າຍໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:48
msgid "The `password` type generates a password field"
msgstr "ປະເພດ `password` ຈະສ້າງຫ້ອງປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:49
msgid "The `color` type generates a color picker"
msgstr "ປະເພດ `color` ຈະສ້າງເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ (color picker)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:50
msgid ""
"The `group`, `edit-group`, and `namespace` (formerly `hidden-group`) types "
"do not generate an editable field and are used to structure form and pillar "
"data.  All these types support nesting."
msgstr "ປະເພດ `group`, `edit-group`, ແລະ `namespace` (ເມື່ອກ່ອນແມ່ນ `hidden-group`) ຈະບໍ່ສ້າງຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດໂຄງສ້າງຂອງແບບຟອມ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar. ທຸກປະເພດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຮອງຮັບການຊ້ອນກັນ (nesting)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The `group` and `namespace` types differ slightly.  The `group` type "
"generates a visible border with a heading.  The `namespace` type shows "
"nothing visually, and is only used to structure pillar data."
msgstr "ປະເພດ `group` ແລະ `namespace` ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນເລັກນ້ອຍ. ປະເພດ `group` ຈະສ້າງຂອບທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ພ້ອມກັບຫົວຂໍ້. ສ່ວນປະເພດ `namespace` ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຜົນຫຍັງໃຫ້ເຫັນ, ແລະ ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:52
msgid ""
"The `edit-group` type allows you to structure and restrict editable fields "
"in a more flexible way.  The `edit-group` type is a collection of items of "
"the same kind.  Collections can have these four shapes:"
msgstr "ປະເພດ `edit-group` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຈັດໂຄງສ້າງ ແລະ ຈຳກັດຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຢ່າງຢືດຢຸ່ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ປະເພດ `edit-group` ແມ່ນກຸ່ມຂອງລາຍການປະເພດດຽວກັນ. ການລວມກຸ່ມສາມາດມີ 4 ຮູບແບບດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:53
msgid "List of primitive items"
msgstr "ລາຍການຂອງຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານ (primitive items)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:54
msgid "List of dictionaries"
msgstr "ລາຍການຂອງ dictionaries"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:55
msgid "Dictionary of primitive items"
msgstr "Dictionary ຂອງຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:56
msgid "Dictionary of dictionaries"
msgstr "Dictionary ຂອງ dictionaries"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:57
msgid "The size of each collection is variable.  Users can add or remove elements."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະກຸ່ມແມ່ນສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລົບອົງປະກອບອອກໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:58
msgid ""
"For example, `edit-group` supports the `$minItems` and `$maxItems` "
"attributes, which simplifies complex and repeatable input structures.  "
"These, and also `itemName`, are optional."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `edit-group` ຮອງຮັບຄຸນລັກສະນະ `$minItems` ແລະ `$maxItems`, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍເຮັດໃຫ້ໂຄງສ້າງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ ແລະ ຊ້ຳໆກັນນັ້ນງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ຄຸນລັກສະນະເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ລວມທັງ `itemName`, ແມ່ນເປັນທາງເລືອກ (optional)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "$default"
msgstr "$default"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Allows you to specify a default value to be displayed.  This default value "
"will be used if no other value is entered.  In an `edit-group` it allows you "
"to create initial members of the group and populate them with specified "
"data."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະສະແດງຜົນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຫາກບໍ່ມີການປ້ອນຄ່າອື່ນ. ໃນ `edit-group`, ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສ້າງສະມາຊິກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງກຸ່ມ ແລະ ໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລົງໄປ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "$optional"
msgstr "$optional"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:62
msgid ""
"This type is a Boolean attribute.  If it is `true` and the field is empty in "
"the form, then this field will not be generated in the formula data and the "
"generated dictionary will not contain the field name key.  If it is `false` "
"and the field is empty, the formula data will contain a `<field name>: null` "
"entry."
msgstr "ປະເພດນີ້ແມ່ນຄຸນລັກສະນະແບບບູລີນ (Boolean). ຫາກມັນເປັນ `true` ແລະ ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນວ່າງຢູ່ໃນແບບຟອມ, ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຂໍ້ມູນ formula ແລະ dictionary ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນກໍຈະບໍ່ມີ key ຂອງຊື່ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນ. ຫາກມັນເປັນ `false` ແລະ ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນວ່າງ, ຂໍ້ມູນ formula ຈະມີລາຍການ `<field name>: null` ປະກົດຢູ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "$ifEmpty"
msgstr "$ifEmpty"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:64
msgid ""
"This type is used if the field is empty.  This usually occurs because the "
"user did not provide a value.  The `ifEmpty` type can only be used when "
"`$optional` is `false` or not defined.  If `$optional` is `true`, then "
"`$ifEmpty` is ignored.  In this example, the `DP2` string would be used if "
"the user leaves the field empty:"
msgstr "ປະເພດນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຫາກຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນວ່າງ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ້ອນຄ່າໃດໆ. ປະເພດ `ifEmpty` ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ `$optional` ເປັນ `false` ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກ `$optional` ເປັນ `true`, `$ifEmpty` ຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ຂໍ້ຄວາມ `DP2` ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ປະຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ວ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"displayName:\n"
"  $type: string\n"
"  $ifEmpty: DP2\n"
msgstr ""
"displayName:\n"
"  $type: string\n"
"  $ifEmpty: DP2\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "$name"
msgstr "$name"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Allows you to specify the name of a value that is shown in the form.  If "
"this value is not set, the pillar name is used and capitalized without "
"underscores and dashes.  Reference it in the same section with "
"`pass:c[${name}]`."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າລະບຸຊື່ຂອງຄ່າທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນແບບຟອມ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ຈະໃຊ້ຊື່ pillar ແທນ ໂດຍປ່ຽນເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ຕັດເຄື່ອງໝາຍ underscore ຫຼື dash ອອກ. ສາມາດອ້າງອີງໃນພາກສ່ວນດຽວກັນດ້ວຍ `pass:c[${name}]`."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "$help and $placeholder"
msgstr "$help ແລະ $placeholder"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:69
msgid ""
"These attributes are used to give a user a better understanding of what the "
"value should be.  The `$help` type defines the message a user sees when "
"hovering over a field The `$placeholder` type displays a gray placeholder "
"text in the field"
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າໃຈດີຂຶ້ນວ່າຄ່າທີ່ຄວນປ້ອນແມ່ນຫຍັງ. ປະເພດ `$help` ກຳນົດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະເຫັນເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປຊີ້ (hover) ໃສ່ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ປະເພດ `$placeholder` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມສີເທົາຈາງໆຢູ່ໃນຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Use `$placeholder` only with text fields like text, password, email or date "
"fields.  Do not add a placeholder if you also use `$default`, as it will "
"hide the placeholder."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ `$placeholder` ສະເພາະກັບຫ້ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ ເຊັ່ນ text, password, email ຫຼື date ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ບໍ່ຄວນເພີ່ມ placeholder ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ `$default` ຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ເພາະມັນຈະບັງ placeholder ໄວ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "$key"
msgstr "$key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:72
msgid ""
"Applicable only if the `edit-group` has the shape of a dictionary.  When the "
"pillar data is a dictionary, the `$key` attribute determines the key of an "
"entry in the dictionary."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະຫາກ `edit-group` ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ dictionary ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ເປັນ dictionary, ຄຸນລັກສະນະ `$key` ຈະກຳນົດ key ຂອງລາຍການໃນ dictionary ນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"user_passwords:\n"
"  $type: edit-group\n"
"  $minItems: 1\n"
"  $prototype:\n"
"    $key:\n"
"        $type: text\n"
"    $type: text\n"
"  $default:\n"
"    alice: secret-password\n"
"    bob: you-shall-not-pass\n"
msgstr ""
"user_passwords:\n"
"  $type: edit-group\n"
"  $minItems: 1\n"
"  $prototype:\n"
"    $key:\n"
"        $type: text\n"
"    $type: text\n"
"  $default:\n"
"    alice: secret-password\n"
"    bob: you-shall-not-pass\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:75
msgid "Pillar:"
msgstr "Pillar:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"user_passwords:\n"
"  alice:\n"
"    secret-password\n"
"  bob:\n"
"    you-shall-not-pass\n"
msgstr ""
"user_passwords:\n"
"  alice:\n"
"    secret-password\n"
"  bob:\n"
"    you-shall-not-pass\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "$minItems and $maxItems"
msgstr "$minItems ແລະ $maxItems"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:78
msgid ""
"In an `edit-group`, `$minItems` and `$maxItems` specifies the lowest and "
"highest numbers for the group."
msgstr "ໃນ `edit-group`, `$minItems` ແລະ `$maxItems` ຈະລະບຸຈຳນວນຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລະ ສູງສຸດສຳລັບກຸ່ມ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "$itemName"
msgstr "$itemName"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In an `edit-group`, `$itemName` defines a template for the name to be used "
"for the members of the group."
msgstr "ໃນ `edit-group`, `$itemName` ກຳນົດຮູບແບບ (template) ສຳລັບຊື່ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບສະມາຊິກໃນກຸ່ມ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "$prototype"
msgstr "$prototype"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:82
msgid ""
"In an `edit-group`, `$prototype` is mandatory and defines the default "
"pre-filled values for newly added members in the group."
msgstr "ໃນ `edit-group`, `$prototype` ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກຕື່ມໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບສະມາຊິກໃໝ່ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "$scope"
msgstr "$scope"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:84
msgid ""
"Specifies a hierarchy level at which a value may be edited.  Possible values "
"are `system`, `group`, and `readonly`."
msgstr "ລະບຸລະດັບລຳດັບຂັ້ນ (hierarchy level) ທີ່ຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້. ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ແມ່ນ `system`, `group`, ແລະ `readonly`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:85
msgid ""
"The default value is `$scope: system`, allows values to be edited at group "
"and system levels.  A value can be entered for each system but if no value "
"is entered the system will fall back to the group default."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `$scope: system`, ເຊິ່ງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂຄ່າໄດ້ທັງໃນລະດັບກຸ່ມ ແລະ ລະດັບລະບົບ. ສາມາດປ້ອນຄ່າສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບໄດ້, ແຕ່ຫາກບໍ່ມີການປ້ອນຄ່າ, ລະບົບຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງກຸ່ມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:86
msgid ""
"The `$scope: group` option makes a value editable only for a group.  On the "
"system level you will be able to see the value, but not edit it."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ `$scope: group` ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ສະເພາະສຳລັບກຸ່ມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນລະດັບລະບົບ ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເຫັນຄ່າໄດ້ ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:87
msgid ""
"The `$scope: readonly` option makes a field read-only.  It can be used to "
"show data to the user, but will not allow them to edit it.  This option "
"should be used in combination with the `$default` attribute."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ `$scope: readonly` ເຮັດໃຫ້ຟີວ (field) ນັ້ນເປັນແບບອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ. ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນ ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາແກ້ໄຂໄດ້. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຄຸນລັກສະນະ `$default`."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "$visibleIf"
msgstr "$visibleIf"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:89
msgid "Deprecated in favor of `$visible`."
msgstr "ຖືກຍົກເລີກ ແລະ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `$visible` ແທນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:90
msgid ""
"Allows you to show a field or group if a simple condition is met.  An "
"example condition is:"
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສະແດງຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມ ຫາກເປັນໄປຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂແບບງ່າຍໆ. ຕົວຢ່າງເງື່ອນໄຂຄື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "some_group#another_group#my_checkbox == true\n"
msgstr "some_group#another_group#my_checkbox == true\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:92
msgid ""
"The left part of the condition is the path to another value, and groups are "
"separated by `#` signs.  The middle section of the condition should be "
"either `==` for a value to be equal or `!=` for values that should be not "
"equal.  The last field in the statement can be any value which a field "
"should have or not have."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຊ້າຍຂອງເງື່ອນໄຂແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາຄ່າອື່ນ, ໂດຍທີ່ແຕ່ລະກຸ່ມຈະຖືກແຍກດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `#`. ສ່ວນກາງຂອງເງື່ອນໄຂຄວນເປັນ `==` ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັນ ຫຼື `!=` ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ເທົ່າກັນ. ສ່ວນສຸດທ້າຍຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມສາມາດເປັນຄ່າໃດໆກໍໄດ້ທີ່ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນຄວນຈະມີ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:93
msgid ""
"The field with this attribute associated with it will be shown only when the "
"condition is met.  In this example the field will be shown only if "
"`my_checkbox` is checked.  The ability to use conditional statements is not "
"limited to check boxes.  It may also be used to check values of "
"select-fields, text-fields, and similar."
msgstr "ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະນີ້ຈະຖືກສະແດງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເປັນໄປຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນຈະສະແດງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ `my_checkbox` ຖືກໝາຍຕິກ. ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການໃຊ້ເງື່ອນໄຂບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳກັດຢູ່ພຽງແຕ່ check box ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແຕ່ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ກວດສອບຄ່າຂອງ select-fields, text-fields ແລະ ອື່ນໆໄດ້ອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:94
msgid "A check box should be structured like this:"
msgstr "Check box ຄວນມີໂຄງສ້າງແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:95
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:99
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:117
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:140
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:149
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"some_group:\n"
"  $type: group\n"
msgstr ""
"some_group:\n"
"  $type: group\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:96
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:100
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:118
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:141
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:150
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  another_group:\n"
"    $type: group\n"
msgstr ""
"  another_group:\n"
"    $type: group\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:97
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:119
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:142
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      my_checkbox:\n"
"        $type: boolean\n"
msgstr ""
"      my_checkbox:\n"
"        $type: boolean\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:98
msgid ""
"Relative paths can be specified using prefix dots.  One dot indicates a "
"sibling, two dots indicate a parent, and so on.  This is mostly useful for "
"`edit-group`."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງແບບທຽບຖານ (Relative paths) ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຈຸດນຳໜ້າ. ຈຸດດຽວໝາຍເຖິງລະດັບດຽວກັນ (sibling), ສອງຈຸດໝາຍເຖິງລະດັບແມ່ (parent), ແລະ ຕໍ່ໆໄປ. ສ່ວນຫຼາຍຈະມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບ `edit-group`."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:101
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:151
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    my_checkbox:\n"
"      $type: boolean\n"
msgstr ""
"    my_checkbox:\n"
"      $type: boolean\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:102
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    my_text:\n"
"      $visibleIf: .my_checkbox == true\n"
msgstr ""
"    my_text:\n"
"      $visibleIf: .my_checkbox == true\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:103
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:153
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  yet_another_group:\n"
"    $type: group\n"
msgstr ""
"  yet_another_group:\n"
"    $type: group\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    my_text2:\n"
"      $visibleIf: ..another_group#my_checkbox == true\n"
msgstr ""
"    my_text2:\n"
"      $visibleIf: ..another_group#my_checkbox == true\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:105
msgid ""
"If you use multiple groups with the attribute, you can allow a users to "
"select an option and show a completely different form, dependent upon the "
"selected value."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຫຼາຍກຸ່ມທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກໃດໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ສະແດງແບບຟອມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນອອກໄປເລີຍ ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບຄ່າທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:106
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:124
msgid ""
"Values from hidden fields can be merged into the pillar data and sent to the "
"client.  A formula must check the condition again and use the appropriate "
"data.  For example:"
msgstr "ຄ່າຈາກຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ສາມາດຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ແລະ ສົ່ງໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້. formula ຕ້ອງກວດສອບເງື່ອນໄຂອີກຄັ້ງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"show_option:\n"
"  $type: checkbox\n"
"some_text:\n"
"  $visibleIf: .show_option == true\n"
msgstr ""
"show_option:\n"
"  $type: checkbox\n"
"some_text:\n"
"  $visibleIf: .show_option == true\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:108
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% if pillar.show_option %}\n"
"do_something:\n"
"  with: {{ pillar.some_text }}\n"
"{% endif %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% if pillar.show_option %}\n"
"do_something:\n"
"  with: {{ pillar.some_text }}\n"
"{% endif %}\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "$values"
msgstr "$values"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:110
msgid ""
"Can only be used together with `$type` Use to specify the different options "
"in the select-field.  `$values` must be a list of possible values to "
"select.  For example:"
msgstr "ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ `$type` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເພື່ອລະບຸຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆໃນ select-field. `$values` ຕ້ອງເປັນລາຍການຂອງຄ່າທີ່ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select_something:\n"
"  $type: select\n"
"  $values: [\"option1\", \"option2\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"select_something:\n"
"  $type: select\n"
"  $values: [\"option1\", \"option2\"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:112
msgid "Or:"
msgstr "ຫຼື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:113
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select_something:\n"
"  $type: select\n"
"  $values:\n"
"    - option1\n"
"    - option2\n"
msgstr ""
"select_something:\n"
"  $type: select\n"
"  $values:\n"
"    - option1\n"
"    - option2\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "$visible"
msgstr "$visible"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Allows you to show a field or group if a condition is met.  You must use the "
"https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl[jexl] expression language to write the "
"condition."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສະແດງຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມ ຫາກເປັນໄປຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂ. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພາສາ jexl (https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl) ໃນການຂຽນເງື່ອນໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:116
msgid "Example structure:"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:120
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:143
msgid "An example condition is:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເງື່ອນໄຂຄື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:121
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "formValues.some_group.another_group.my_checkbox == true\n"
msgstr "formValues.some_group.another_group.my_checkbox == true\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:122
msgid ""
"The field with this attribute will only show if the condition is met.  In "
"this example, the field will show only if `my_checkbox` is checked.  You can "
"also choose other elements for the conditional statement, such as select "
"fields or text fields."
msgstr "ຟີວທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະນີ້ຈະສະແດງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເງື່ອນໄຂກົງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ຟີວຈະສະແດງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ `my_checkbox` ຖືກເລືອກ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກອົງປະກອບອື່ນໆສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງເງື່ອນໄຂໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ select fields ຫຼື text fields."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:123
msgid ""
"If you use multiple groups with the attribute, users can select an option "
"that will show a completely different form, depending on the selected value."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຫຼາຍກຸ່ມທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະນີ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເລືອກຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຈະສະແດງແບບຟອມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນອອກໄປເລີຍ ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບຄ່າທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:125
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"show_option:\n"
"  $type: checkbox\n"
"some_text:\n"
"  $visible: this.parent.value.show_option == true\n"
msgstr ""
"show_option:\n"
"  $type: checkbox\n"
"some_text:\n"
"  $visible: this.parent.value.show_option == true\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:127
#, no-wrap
msgid "$disabled"
msgstr "$disabled"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:128
msgid ""
"Allows you to disable a field or group if a condition is met. You must use "
"the https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl[jexl] expression language to write the "
"condition."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າປິດການໃຊ້ (disable) ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມ ຫາກເປັນໄປຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂ. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພາສາ jexl ໃນການຂຽນເງື່ອນໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:129
msgid "If specified at group level it will disable all fields in that group."
msgstr "ຫາກກຳນົດໃນລະດັບກຸ່ມ, ມັນຈະປິດການໃຊ້ທຸກໆຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:130
#, no-wrap
msgid "$required"
msgstr "$required"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:131
msgid ""
"Fields with this attribute are mandatory. Supports using the "
"https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl[jexl] expresion language."
msgstr "ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ້ອນ (mandatory). ຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ພາສາ jexl ໃນການຂຽນເງື່ອນໄຂ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:132
#, no-wrap
msgid "$match"
msgstr "$match"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:133
msgid "Allows using a regular expression to validate the content of a text field."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ regular expression ເພື່ອກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງເນື້ອໃນໃນຫ້ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:134
msgid "It supports the regular expression features existing in JavaScript."
msgstr "ມັນຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ regular expression ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ JavaScript."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:135
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:10
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:14
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:18
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:136
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      hardware:\n"
"        $type: text\n"
"        $name: Hardware Type and Address\n"
"        $placeholder: Enter hardware-type hardware-address (for example, "
"\"ethernet AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF\")\n"
"        $help: Hardware Identifier - prefix is mandatory\n"
"        $match: \"\\\\w+ "
"[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}\"\n"
msgstr ""
"      hardware:\n"
"        $type: text\n"
"        $name: Hardware Type and Address\n"
"        $placeholder: ປ້ອນ hardware-type hardware-address (ຕົວຢ່າງ, \"ethernet AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF\")\n"
"        $help: Hardware Identifier - ຕ້ອງມີຄຳນຳໜ້າສະເໝີ\n"
"        $match: \"\\\\w+ [A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}\"\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expression language"
msgstr "ພາສາສະແດງເງື່ອນໄຂ (Expression language)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:138
msgid ""
"You must use the https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl[jexl] expression language "
"to write conditions."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພາສາ jexl ໃນການຂຽນເງື່ອນໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:139
msgid "Given a structure like this:"
msgstr "ຈາກໂຄງສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:145
msgid "Absolute paths must begin with `formValues`."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງແບບເດັດຂາດ (Absolute paths) ຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ `formValues`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:146
msgid ""
"Specify relative paths using `this.parent.value` to define the value of the "
"parent."
msgstr "ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງແບບທຽບຖານໂດຍໃຊ້ `this.parent.value` ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງລະດັບແມ່ (parent)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:147
msgid ""
"You can also refer to the parent of the parent, with "
"`this.parent.parent.value`.  This is mostly useful for `edit-group` "
"elements."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດອ້າງອີງເຖິງລະດັບແມ່ຂອງແມ່ໄດ້ ດ້ວຍ `this.parent.parent.value`. ສ່ວນຫຼາຍຈະມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບອົງປະກອບ `edit-group`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:148
msgid "Example for relative paths:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງສຳພັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:152
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    my_text:\n"
"      $visible: this.parent.value.my_checkbox\n"
msgstr ""
"    my_text:\n"
"      $visible: this.parent.value.my_checkbox\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:154
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    my_text2:\n"
"      $visible: this.parent.parent.value.another_group.my_checkbox\n"
msgstr ""
"    my_text2:\n"
"      $visible: this.parent.parent.value.another_group.my_checkbox\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:155
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Basic edit-group"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: edit-group ແບບພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:156
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"partitions:\n"
"  $name: \"Hard Disk Partitions\"\n"
"  $type: \"edit-group\"\n"
"  $minItems: 1\n"
"  $maxItems: 4\n"
"  $itemName: \"Partition ${name}\"\n"
"  $prototype:\n"
"    name:\n"
"      $default: \"New partition\"\n"
"    mountpoint:\n"
"      $default: \"/var\"\n"
"    size:\n"
"      $type: \"number\"\n"
"      $name: \"Size in GB\"\n"
"  $default:\n"
"    - name: \"Boot\"\n"
"      mountpoint: \"/boot\"\n"
"    - name: \"Root\"\n"
"      mountpoint: \"/\"\n"
"      size: 5000\n"
msgstr ""
"partitions:\n"
"  $name: \"Hard Disk Partitions\"\n"
"  $type: \"edit-group\"\n"
"  $minItems: 1\n"
"  $maxItems: 4\n"
"  $itemName: \"Partition ${name}\"\n"
"  $prototype:\n"
"    name:\n"
"      $default: \"New partition\"\n"
"    mountpoint:\n"
"      $default: \"/var\"\n"
"    size:\n"
"      $type: \"number\"\n"
"      $name: \"Size in GB\"\n"
"  $default:\n"
"    - name: \"Boot\"\n"
"      mountpoint: \"/boot\"\n"
"    - name: \"Root\"\n"
"      mountpoint: \"/\"\n"
"      size: 5000\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:157
msgid "Click btn:[Add] to fill the form with the default values."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Add] ເພື່ອຕື່ມແບບຟອມດ້ວຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:158
msgid ""
"The formula is called `hd-partitions` and will appear as `Hd Partitions` in "
"the {webui}."
msgstr "ສູດ (formula) ນີ້ມີຊື່ວ່າ `hd-partitions` ແລະ ຈະປະກົດເປັນ `Hd Partitions` ໃນ {webui}."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:159
#, no-wrap
msgid "formula-custom-harddisk-partitions.png"
msgstr "formula-custom-harddisk-partitions.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:160
msgid ""
"To remove the definition of a partition click the minus symbol in the title "
"line of an inner group."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລົບການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງພາທິຊັນ, ໃຫ້ກົດເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົບ (-) ໃນແຖວຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງກຸ່ມພາຍໃນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:161
msgid "When you are finished, click btn:[Save Formula]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[Save Formula]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:162
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Nested edit-group"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: edit-group ແບບຊ້ອນກັນ (Nested)"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:163
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"users:\n"
"  $name: \"Users\"\n"
"  $type: edit-group\n"
"  $minItems: 2\n"
"  $maxItems: 5\n"
"  $prototype:\n"
"    name:\n"
"      $default: \"username\"\n"
"    password:\n"
"      $type: password\n"
"    groups:\n"
"      $type: edit-group\n"
"      $minItems: 1\n"
"      $prototype:\n"
"        group_name:\n"
"          $type: text\n"
"  $default:\n"
"    - name: \"root\"\n"
"      groups:\n"
"        - group_name: \"users\"\n"
"        - group_name: \"admins\"\n"
"    - name: \"admin\"\n"
"      groups:\n"
"        - group_name: \"users\"\n"
msgstr ""
"users:\n"
"  $name: \"Users\"\n"
"  $type: edit-group\n"
"  $minItems: 2\n"
"  $maxItems: 5\n"
"  $prototype:\n"
"    name:\n"
"      $default: \"username\"\n"
"    password:\n"
"      $type: password\n"
"    groups:\n"
"      $type: edit-group\n"
"      $minItems: 1\n"
"      $prototype:\n"
"        group_name:\n"
"          $type: text\n"
"  $default:\n"
"    - name: \"root\"\n"
"      groups:\n"
"        - group_name: \"users\"\n"
"        - group_name: \"admins\"\n"
"    - name: \"admin\"\n"
"      groups:\n"
"        - group_name: \"users\"\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:164
#, no-wrap
msgid "Writing Salt Formulas"
msgstr "ການຂຽນ Salt Formulas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:165
msgid ""
"Salt formulas are pre-written Salt states.  You can use Jinja to configure "
"formulas with pillar data."
msgstr "Salt formulas ແມ່ນ Salt states ທີ່ຖືກຂຽນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ Jinja ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ formulas ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ pillar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:166
msgid "Basic Jinja syntax is:"
msgstr "ໄວຍາກອນ Jinja ພື້ນຖານຄື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:167
#, no-wrap
msgid "pillar.some.value\n"
msgstr "pillar.some.value\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:168
msgid "When you are sure a pillar exists, use this syntax:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າແນ່ໃຈວ່າ pillar ນັ້ນມີຢູ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄວຍາກອນນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:169
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt['pillar.get']('some:value', 'default value')\n"
msgstr "salt['pillar.get']('some:value', 'default value')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:170
msgid ""
"You can also replace the `pillar` value with `grains`.  For example, "
"`grains.some.value`."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າ `pillar` ເປັນ `grains` ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ, `grains.some.value`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:171
msgid ""
"Using data this way makes the formula configurable.  In this example, a "
"specified package is installed in the `package_name` pillar:"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນໃນແບບນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ formula ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າໄດ້. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ແພັກເກັດທີ່ລະບຸຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນ pillar `package_name`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:172
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"install_a_package:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - name: {{ pillar.package_name }}\n"
msgstr ""
"install_a_package:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - name: {{ pillar.package_name }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:173
msgid ""
"You can also use more complex constructs such as `if/else` and `for-loops` "
"to provide greater functionality:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນຂຶ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ `if/else` ແລະ `for-loops` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:174
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% if pillar.installSomething %}\n"
"something:\n"
"  pkg.installed\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"anotherPackage:\n"
"  pkg.installed\n"
"{% endif %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% if pillar.installSomething %}\n"
"something:\n"
"  pkg.installed\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"anotherPackage:\n"
"  pkg.installed\n"
"{% endif %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:175
msgid "Another example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງອື່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:176
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% for service in pillar.services %}\n"
"start_{{ service }}:\n"
"  service.running:\n"
"    - name: {{ service }}\n"
"{% endfor %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% for service in pillar.services %}\n"
"start_{{ service }}:\n"
"  service.running:\n"
"    - name: {{ service }}\n"
"{% endfor %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:177
msgid ""
"Jinja also provides other helpful functions.  For example, you can iterate "
"over a dictionary:"
msgstr "Jinja ຍັງມີຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດອື່ນໆ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າສາມາດວົນລູບ (iterate) ໃນ dictionary ໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:178
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% for key, value in some_dictionary.items() %}\n"
"do_something_with_{{ key }}: {{ value }}\n"
"{% endfor %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% for key, value in some_dictionary.items() %}\n"
"do_something_with_{{ key }}: {{ value }}\n"
"{% endfor %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:179
msgid ""
"You can have Salt manage your files (for example, configuration files for a "
"program), and change them with pillar data."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຫ້ Salt ຈັດການໄຟລ໌ຂອງເຈົ້າ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບໂປຣແກຣມ), ແລະ ປ່ຽນແປງພວກມັນດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ pillar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:180
msgid ""
"In this example, Salt copies the file "
"`salt-file_roots/my_state/files/my_program.conf` on the server to "
"`/etc/my_program/my_program.conf` on the client and template it with Jinja:"
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, Salt ຈະສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ `salt-file_roots/my_state/files/my_program.conf` ໃນ server ໄປຫາ `/etc/my_program/my_program.conf` ໃນ client ແລະ ໃຊ້ Jinja ເປັນ template:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:181
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/etc/my_program/my_program.conf:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - source: salt://my_state/files/my_program.conf\n"
"    - template: jinja\n"
msgstr ""
"/etc/my_program/my_program.conf:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - source: salt://my_state/files/my_program.conf\n"
"    - template: jinja\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:182
msgid ""
"This example allows you to use Jinja in the file, like the previous example "
"for states:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ Jinja ໃນໄຟລ໌ໄດ້, ຄືກັບຕົວຢ່າງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ສຳລັບ states:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:183
#, no-wrap
msgid "some_config_option = {{ pillar.config_option_a }}\n"
msgstr "some_config_option = {{ pillar.config_option_a }}\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:184
#, no-wrap
msgid "Separate Data"
msgstr "ແຍກຂໍ້ມູນ (Separate Data)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:185
msgid ""
"Separating data from a state can increase flexibility and make it easier to "
"re-use.  You can do this by writing values into a separate file named "
"`map.jinja`.  This file must be within the same directory as the state "
"files."
msgstr "ການແຍກຂໍ້ມູນອອກຈາກ state ສາມາດເພີ່ມຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ນຳກັບມາໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຂຽນຄ່າຕ່າງໆລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ແຍກທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ `map.jinja`. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີດຽວກັນກັບໄຟລ໌ state."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:186
msgid ""
"This example sets `data` to a dictionary with different values, depending on "
"which system the state runs on.  It will also merge data with the pillar "
"using the `some.pillar.data` value so you can access "
"`some.pillar.data.value` by using `data.value`."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ກຳນົດໃຫ້ `data` ເປັນ dictionary ທີ່ມີຄ່າແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າ state ນັ້ນເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ລະບົບໃດ. ມັນຍັງຈະລວມຂໍ້ມູນເຂົ້າກັບ pillar ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າ `some.pillar.data` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ `some.pillar.data.value` ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ `data.value`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:187
msgid ""
"You can choose to override defined values from pillars.  For example, by "
"overriding `some.pillar.data.package` in this example:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກຂຽນທັບ (override) ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຈາກ pillars ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂດຍການຂຽນທັບ `some.pillar.data.package` ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:188
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% set data = salt['grains.filter_by']({\n"
"    'Suse': {\n"
"        'package': 'packageA',\n"
"        'service': 'serviceA'\n"
"    },\n"
"    'RedHat': {\n"
"        'package': 'package_a',\n"
"        'service': 'service_a'\n"
"    }\n"
"}, merge=salt['pillar.get']('some:pillar:data')) %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% set data = salt['grains.filter_by']({\n"
"    'Suse': {\n"
"        'package': 'packageA',\n"
"        'service': 'serviceA'\n"
"    },\n"
"    'RedHat': {\n"
"        'package': 'package_a',\n"
"        'service': 'service_a'\n"
"    }\n"
"}, merge=salt['pillar.get']('some:pillar:data')) %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:189
msgid ""
"When you have created a map file, you can maintain compatibility with "
"multiple system types while accessing deep pillar data in a simpler way."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງໄຟລ໌ map ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດຮັກສາຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບລະບົບຫຼາຍປະເພດ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ທີ່ຢູ່ເລິກໆໄດ້ໃນແບບທີ່ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:190
msgid "Now you can import and use `data` in any file.  For example:"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າ (import) ແລະ ໃຊ້ `data` ໃນໄຟລ໌ໃດກໍໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:191
#, no-wrap
msgid "{% from \"some_folder/map.jinja\" import data with context %}\n"
msgstr "{% from \"some_folder/map.jinja\" import data with context %}\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:192
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"install_package_a:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - name: {{ data.package }}\n"
msgstr ""
"install_package_a:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - name: {{ data.package }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:193
msgid ""
"You can define multiple variables by copying the `{% set ...%}` statement "
"with different values and then merge it with other pillars.  For example:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຕົວປ່ຽນຫຼາຍຕົວໄດ້ໂດຍການກັອບປີ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມ `{% set ...%}` ດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ແລ້ວລວມມັນເຂົ້າກັບ pillars ອື່ນໆ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:194
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% set server = salt['grains.filter_by']({\n"
"    'Suse': {\n"
"        'package': 'my-server-pkg'\n"
"    }\n"
"}, merge=salt['pillar.get']('myFormula:server')) %}\n"
"{% set client = salt['grains.filter_by']({\n"
"    'Suse': {\n"
"        'package': 'my-client-pkg'\n"
"    }\n"
"}, merge=salt['pillar.get']('myFormula:client')) %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% set server = salt['grains.filter_by']({\n"
"    'Suse': {\n"
"        'package': 'my-server-pkg'\n"
"    }\n"
"}, merge=salt['pillar.get']('myFormula:server')) %}\n"
"{% set client = salt['grains.filter_by']({\n"
"    'Suse': {\n"
"        'package': 'my-client-pkg'\n"
"    }\n"
"}, merge=salt['pillar.get']('myFormula:client')) %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:195
msgid "To import multiple variables, separate them with a comma.  For example:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອການນຳເຂົ້າຕົວປ່ຽນຫຼາຍຕົວ, ໃຫ້ແຍກພວກມັນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈ້ຳ (,). ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:196
#, no-wrap
msgid "{% from \"map.jinja\" import server, client with context %}\n"
msgstr "{% from \"map.jinja\" import server, client with context %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:197
msgid ""
"For more information about conventions to use when writing formulas, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/development/conventions/formulas.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດ (conventions) ທີ່ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນການຂຽນ formulas, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/development/conventions/formulas.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:198
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generated Pillar Data"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Pillar ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ (Generated Pillar Data)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:199
msgid ""
"Pillar data is generated by {productname} when events occur like generating "
"the highstate.  You can use an external pillar script to generate pillar "
"data for packages and group IDs, and include all pillar data for a system:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Pillar ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ {productname} ເມື່ອມີເຫດການເກີດຂຶ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ: ການສ້າງ highstate. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ pillar ພາຍນອກເພື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ສຳລັບແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ID ຂອງກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ລວມເອົາຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ທັງໝົດສຳລັບລະບົບໃດໜຶ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:200
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/susemanager/modules/pillar/MLM_minion.py\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/modules/pillar/MLM_minion.py\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:201
msgid "The process is executed like this:"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການແມ່ນເຮັດວຽກດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:202
msgid ""
"The `MLM_minion.py` script starts and finds all formulas for a system by "
"checking the `group_formulas.json` and `server_formulas.json` files."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ `MLM_minion.py` ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຄົ້ນຫາ formulas ທັງໝົດສຳລັບລະບົບໃດໜຶ່ງ ໂດຍການກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ `group_formulas.json` ແລະ `server_formulas.json`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:203
msgid ""
"The script loads the values for each formula (groups and from the system) "
"and merges them with the highstate."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບຈະໂຫລດຄ່າສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ formula (ຈາກກຸ່ມ ແລະ ຈາກລະບົບ) ແລ້ວລວມພວກມັນເຂົ້າກັບ highstate."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:204
msgid ""
"By default, if no values are found, a group overrides a system if `$scope: "
"group`."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຫາກບໍ່ພົບຄ່າໃດໆ, ຄ່າຈາກກຸ່ມຈະຂຽນທັບ (override) ຄ່າຈາກລະບົບ ຫາກກຳນົດເປັນ `$scope: group`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:205
msgid ""
"The script also includes a list of formulas applied to the system in a "
"pillar named `formulas`."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບຍັງຈະລວມເອົາລາຍຊື່ຂອງ formulas ທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບລະບົບໄວ້ໃນ pillar ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ `formulas`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:206
msgid ""
"This structure makes it possible to include states.  In this example, the "
"top file is specifically generated by the `mgr_master_tops.py` script.  The "
"top file includes a state called `formulas` for each system.  This includes "
"the `formulas.sls` file located in `/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states` "
"or `/usr/share/salt-formulas/states/`.  The content looks similar to this:"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດລວມ states ຕ່າງໆເຂົ້າໄດ້. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, top file ແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍສະເພາະ ຈາກສະຄຣິບ `mgr_master_tops.py`. top file ຈະລວມເອົາ state ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ `formulas` ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບ. ເຊິ່ງລວມເຖິງໄຟລ໌ `formulas.sls` ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ `/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states` ຫຼື `/usr/share/salt-formulas/states/`. ເນື້ອໃນຈະມີລັກສະນະຄ້າຍຄືແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:207
#, no-wrap
msgid "include: {{ pillar[\"formulas\"] }}\n"
msgstr "include: {{ pillar[\"formulas\"] }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:208
msgid ""
"This pillar includes all formulas that are specified in the pillar data "
"generated from the external pillar script."
msgstr "Pillar ນີ້ຈະລວມເອົາທຸກໆ formulas ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກສະຄຣິບ pillar ພາຍນອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:209
msgid ""
"Formulas should be created directly after {productname} is installed.  If "
"you encounter any problems with formulas check these things first:"
msgstr "Formulas ຄວນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ສຳເລັດ. ຫາກເຈົ້າພົບກັບບັນຫາໃດໆກ່ຽວກັບ formulas ໃຫ້ກວດສອບສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກ່ອນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:210
msgid "The external pillar script (`MLM_minion.py`) must include formula data."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ pillar ພາຍນອກ (`MLM_minion.py`) ຕ້ອງລວມເອົາຂໍ້ມູນ formula."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:211
msgid ""
"Data is saved to `/srv/susemanager/formula_data` and the `pillar` and "
"`group_pillar` sub-directories."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນ `/srv/susemanager/formula_data` ແລະ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍ `pillar` ແລະ `group_pillar`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:212
msgid "These directories should be automatically generated by the server."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄວນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:213
msgid "Formulas must be included for every client listed in the top file."
msgstr "Formulas ຕ້ອງຖືກລວມເຂົ້າສຳລັບທຸກໆເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ top file."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:214
msgid ""
"Currently this process is initiated by the `mgr_master_tops.py` script which "
"includes the `formulas.sls` file located in "
"`/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states/` or "
"`/usr/share/salt-formulas/states/`.  This directory must be a salt file "
"root.  File roots are configured on the salt-master ({productname}) located "
"at `/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`."
msgstr "ໃນປະຈຸບັນ ຂະບວນການນີ້ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍສະຄຣິບ `mgr_master_tops.py` ເຊິ່ງລວມເອົາໄຟລ໌ `formulas.sls` ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ `/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states/` ຫຼື `/usr/share/salt-formulas/states/`. ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຕ້ອງເປັນ salt file root. File roots ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າຢູ່ໃນ salt-master ({productname}) ທີ່ `/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Formulas"
msgstr "Salt Formulas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Formulas are collections of Salt States that contain generic parameter "
"fields.  Formulas allow for reliable reproduction of a specific "
"configuration.  Some formulas are supplied by {suse}, or you can install "
"formulas from RPM packages or an external git repository."
msgstr "Formulas ແມ່ນການລວມກຸ່ມຂອງ Salt States ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຫ້ອງພາລາມິເຕີທົ່ວໄປ. Formulas ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ບາງ formulas ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໂດຍ {suse}, ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ formulas ຈາກແພັກເກັດ RPM ຫຼື ຈາກຄັງຂໍ້ມູນ git ພາຍນອກໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Formulas work best for large, non-trivial, configurations.  For smaller "
"tasks, use a state rather than a formula.  Formulas and states both act as a "
"kind of configuration documentation.  When you have written and stored the "
"configuration, they provide a snapshot of your infrastructure."
msgstr "Formulas ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ຊັບຊ້ອນ. ສຳລັບວຽກຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ state ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ formula. ທັງ Formulas ແລະ states ຕ່າງກໍເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນເໝືອນເອກະສານບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໄດ້ຂຽນ ແລະ ຈັດເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ພວກມັນຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນພາບລວມ (snapshot) ຂອງໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:4
msgid "Formula data can be managed using the XMLRPC API."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Formula ສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ XMLRPC API."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} {webui} to apply {productname} formulas.  The "
"most commonly used formulas are documented in this section."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ {productname} formulas. formulas ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນມີຄູ່ມືຢູ່ໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use pre-written formulas as a starting point for your "
"own custom formulas.  Pre-written formulas are available from "
"https://github.com/saltstack-formulas."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ formulas ທີ່ຖືກຂຽນໄວ້ແລ້ວເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ custom formulas ຂອງເຈົ້າເອງ. formulas ທີ່ຂຽນໄວ້ແລ້ວແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ທີ່ https://github.com/saltstack-formulas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information on custom formulas, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ custom formulas, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "The gitfs Fileserver Backend"
msgstr "gitfs Fileserver Backend"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In {productname}, `pygit2` is the supported Python interface to git.  When "
"`pygit2` is installed the `gitfs` fileserver backend is available and it is "
"a supported feature."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, `pygit2` ແມ່ນ Python interface ທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ git. ເມື່ອ `pygit2` ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ `gitfs` fileserver backend ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ ແລະ ເປັນຟີເຈີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Configuration options are set in the `/etc/salt/master` file, or in a "
"separate configuration file in the `/etc/salt/master.d/` directory.  The "
"basic settings are:"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການກຳນົດຄ່າແມ່ນຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ `/etc/salt/master`, ຫຼື ໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າແຍກ ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/etc/salt/master.d/`. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນຖານມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "fileserver_backend"
msgstr "fileserver_backend"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"List of fileserver backends that the Salt master checks for files in the "
"order they are defined.  Options:"
msgstr "ລາຍການຂອງ fileserver backends ທີ່ Salt master ຈະກວດສອບຫາໄຟລ໌ຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ຕົວເລືອກມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:6
msgid "`roots`: Files local on the Salt master ({productname} Server)."
msgstr "`roots`: ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ Salt master ({productname} Server) ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"`roots` is required to keep the product running.  You can only enable "
"`gitfs` optionally.  Additionally, {suse} strongly recommends to prefer "
"`roots` (local files) over `gitfs`.  The standard backend."
msgstr "`roots` ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ `gitfs` ເປັນທາງເລືອກເສີມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, {suse} ແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `roots` (ໄຟລ໌ພາຍໃນ) ແທນ `gitfs`. ມັນແມ່ນ backend ມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:8
msgid "`gitfs`: Files stored in one or more git repositories."
msgstr "`gitfs`: ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຈັດເກັບໄວ້ໃນ git repositories ໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍແຫ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:9
msgid "The repositories are defined with `gitfs_remotes`."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (Repositories) ຖືກກຳນົດດ້ວຍ `gitfs_remotes`."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"fileserver_backend:\n"
"  - roots\n"
"  - git\n"
msgstr ""
"fileserver_backend:\n"
"  - roots\n"
"  - git\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "gitfs_remotes"
msgstr "gitfs_remotes"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:13
msgid ""
"List of git repositories.  `git://`, `https://`, `file://`, or `ssh://` URLs "
"can be configured.  For SSH remotes, a `scp`-like syntax is also supported; "
"for example: `gitlab@gitlab.example.com:universe/setup.git`.  Then you can "
"also specify options for credentials, file locations, or branches such as "
"`pubkey`, `privkey`, `root`,`base`."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຂອງ git repositories. ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າ URL ແບບ `git://`, `https://`, `file://`, ຫຼື `ssh://` ໄດ້. ສຳລັບ SSH remotes, ຍັງຮອງຮັບໄວຍາກອນທີ່ຄ້າຍກັບ `scp` ຕົວຢ່າງ: `gitlab@gitlab.example.com:universe/setup.git`. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບ credentials, ສະຖານທີ່ໄຟລ໌, ຫຼື branches ເຊັ່ນ `pubkey`, `privkey`, `root`, `base`."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"gitfs_remotes:\n"
"  - https://example.com/myformulas/formula.git\n"
"  - gitlab@gitlab.example.com:universe/setup.git:\n"
"    - pubkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab.pub\n"
"    - privkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab\n"
"    - root: srv/salt\n"
"    - base: master\n"
msgstr ""
"gitfs_remotes:\n"
"  - https://example.com/myformulas/formula.git\n"
"  - gitlab@gitlab.example.com:universe/setup.git:\n"
"    - pubkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab.pub\n"
"    - privkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab\n"
"    - root: srv/salt\n"
"    - base: master\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "ext_pillar"
msgstr "ext_pillar"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:17
msgid ""
"List of external pillar interfaces.  Salt can also serve pillar data from "
"one or more git repositories.  For syntax and options, also see the "
"`gitfs_remotes` setting."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຂອງ external pillar interfaces. Salt ຍັງສາມາດໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ຈາກ git repositories ໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍແຫ່ງໄດ້. ສຳລັບໄວຍາກອນ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `gitfs_remotes`."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ext_pillar:\n"
"  - git:\n"
"    - master gitlab@gitlab.example.com:universe/setup.git:\n"
"      - root: srv/pillar\n"
"      - pubkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab.pub\n"
"      - privkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab\n"
msgstr ""
"ext_pillar:\n"
"  - git:\n"
"    - master gitlab@gitlab.example.com:universe/setup.git:\n"
"      - root: srv/pillar\n"
"      - pubkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab.pub\n"
"      - privkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:21
msgid "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/gitfs.html"
msgstr "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/gitfs.html"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:22
msgid "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html"
msgstr "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Encrypted Pillars"
msgstr "Pillars ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍ GPG"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{salt} has support to transparently decrypt GPG-encrypted Pillar data "
"built-in.  The decryption happens on the {salt} Master during Pillar "
"rendering."
msgstr "{salt} ມີການຮອງຮັບການຖອດລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນ Pillar ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍ GPG ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ການຖອດລະຫັດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນ {salt} Master ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການ Pillar rendering."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate GPG keyring for {salt} Master"
msgstr "ສ້າງ GPG keyring ສຳລັບ {salt} Master"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The GPG keyring can be specified in `/etc/salt/master` or in its own file "
"under `/etc/salt/master.d/`, for example "
"`/etc/salt/master.d/gpg-pillar.conf`."
msgstr "GPG keyring ສາມາດຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ `/etc/salt/master` ຫຼື ໃນໄຟລ໌ຂອງມັນເອງພາຍໃຕ້ `/etc/salt/master.d/`, ຕົວຢ່າງ `/etc/salt/master.d/gpg-pillar.conf`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:5
msgid "Always create a separate keyring for the {salt} Master."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ສ້າງ keyring ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບ {salt} Master ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating key pair"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຄູ່ລະຫັດ (key pair)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:7
msgid "On the {salt} Master create GPG home directory and restrict its permissions:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {salt} Master, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ (home directory) ຂອງ GPG ແລະ ຈຳກັດສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"
"chmod 700 /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"
msgstr ""
"mkdir /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"
"chmod 700 /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:9
msgid "Generate a key pair interactively."
msgstr "ສ້າງຄູ່ລະຫັດແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:10
msgid "The password must be empty."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງວ່າງ (ບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃສ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານ)."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "gpg --gen-key --homedir /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"
msgstr "gpg --gen-key --homedir /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:12
msgid ""
"{salt} does not run with root permissions on SUSE Linux Enterprise and "
"openSUSE distributions."
msgstr "{salt} ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍສິດ root ໃນລະບົບ SUSE Linux Enterprise ແລະ openSUSE."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "chown -R salt:salt /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"
msgstr "chown -R salt:salt /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:14
msgid "Configure {salt} Master to use the new GPG home directory"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {salt} Master ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງ GPG ໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"echo 'gpg_keydir: /etc/salt/gpgkeys' >/etc/salt/master.d/gpg-pillar.conf\n"
"systemctl reload-or-restart salt-master\n"
msgstr ""
"echo 'gpg_keydir: /etc/salt/gpgkeys' >/etc/salt/master.d/gpg-pillar.conf\n"
"systemctl reload-or-restart salt-master\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use GPG for encrypting Pillar secrets"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ GPG ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນລັບໃນ Pillar"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Salt's GPG renderer decrypts GPG encrypted contents that are ASCII-armored.  "
"To use the GPG renderer in a single Pillar YAML file, change"
msgstr "Salt's GPG renderer ຈະຖອດລະຫັດເນື້ອໃນທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍ GPG ທີ່ເປັນແບບ ASCII-armored. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ GPG renderer ໃນໄຟລ໌ Pillar YAML ດຽວ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "#!jinja|yaml\n"
msgstr "#!jinja|yaml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:19
msgid "to"
msgstr "ເປັນ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "#!jinja|yaml|gpg\n"
msgstr "#!jinja|yaml|gpg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To use Salt's GPG renderer globally, including for "
"xref:client-configuration:custom-info.adoc[], configure Salt Master as "
"follows"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ Salt's GPG renderer ໃນລະດັບສາກົນ (globally), ລວມເຖິງ xref:client-configuration:custom-info.adoc[], ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຄ່າ Salt Master ດັ່ງນີ້"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat >/etc/salt/master.d/z-gpg-pillar.conf <<EOF\n"
"ext_pillar:\n"
"  - gpg: True\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""
"cat >/etc/salt/master.d/z-gpg-pillar.conf <<EOF\n"
"ext_pillar:\n"
"  - gpg: True\n"
"EOF\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The filename should have a `z-` prefix to ensure the GPG renderer runs after "
"other configured pillar renderers."
msgstr "ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຄວນມີຄຳນຳໜ້າວ່າ `z-` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ GPG renderer ຈະເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກ pillar renderers ອື່ນໆທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Encrypting pillar secrets can be done anywhere as long as the GPG and the "
"public key generated in <<proc-key-pair-generation>> are available."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຄວາມລັບຂອງ pillar ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຢູ່ໃສກໍໄດ້ ຕາບໃດທີ່ GPG ແລະ public key ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ <<proc-key-pair-generation>> ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:25
msgid "In this example, \"MLM Salt Master\" is the GPG key’s UID created earlier."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, \"MLM Salt Master\" ແມ່ນ UID ຂອງ GPG key ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"echo 't0ps3cr3t' | gpg --armor --batch --encrypt --recipient \"MLM Salt "
"Master\"\n"
msgstr "echo 't0ps3cr3t' | gpg --armor --batch --encrypt --recipient \"MLM Salt Master\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:27
msgid ""
"When the GPG encrytped contents are created and available as ASCII-armored "
"output, this output can be used as a multi-line string in a pillar YAML "
"file:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເນື້ອໃນທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍ GPG ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ ASCII-armored, ຜົນລັດພໍນີ້ສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ເປັນ multi-line string ໃນໄຟລ໌ pillar YAML ໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "#!yaml|gpg\n"
msgstr "#!yaml|gpg\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"secret:\n"
"  my-secret: |\n"
"    -----BEGIN PGP MESSAGE-----\n"
msgstr ""
"secret:\n"
"  my-secret: |\n"
"    -----BEGIN PGP MESSAGE-----\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    hQEMA3OrmRaWrqgqAQf/ej8xV+nO3HVbQRCeJgCmt5ZjnogT++HHeFzXymfr1SgT\n"
"    XySyAqpIZB2N6MjZXtupO2sCmG6fzqtmnW+vRsZhQG8PAqzRtAekFuVbXzgkigBk\n"
"    338yOdyltVBtMONnkHFQ+7EP1tfJnWLCVrJ1I42vGFLZf2AD1xhbjewCcoaK82J4\n"
"    f8u9U/dxgV0N6na28WG5m6YU5Reu1Ca37PXHuqA/0XZl65DY63xaMPMDHZEi1wkU\n"
"    GXU7OsiL1dO0/sST1Awo5i99kVt/kA6DCGDuxTNpLrauNLOKUbtwcxvavtNZGwdQ\n"
"    yI9zWVx8qerWE0aO3M7zVDJftv77faV2ENiqzaadvtJHAZynW4GW7rSuP1RXFzlB\n"
"    DOAmzdRuIJwiLC9R2BKu3x+avReQb6xoz7eF7WthC0H0dz4mYakwPlVZ5yqYa/+G\n"
"    83i951rqAGI=\n"
"    =g+ji\n"
"    -----END PGP MESSAGE-----\n"
msgstr ""
"    hQEMA3OrmRaWrqgqAQf/ej8xV+nO3HVbQRCeJgCmt5ZjnogT++HHeFzXymfr1SgT\n"
"    XySyAqpIZB2N6MjZXtupO2sCmG6fzqtmnW+vRsZhQG8PAqzRtAekFuVbXzgkigBk\n"
"    338yOdyltVBtMONnkHFQ+7EP1tfJnWLCVrJ1I42vGFLZf2AD1xhbjewCcoaK82J4\n"
"    f8u9U/dxgV0N6na28WG5m6YU5Reu1Ca37PXHuqA/0XZl65DY63xaMPMDHZEi1wkU\n"
"    GXU7OsiL1dO0/sST1Awo5i99kVt/kA6DCGDuxTNpLrauNLOKUbtwcxvavtNZGwdQ\n"
"    yI9zWVx8qerWE0aO3M7zVDJftv77faV2ENiqzaadvtJHAZynW4GW7rSuP1RXFzlB\n"
"    DOAmzdRuIJwiLC9R2BKu3x+avReQb6xoz7eF7WthC0H0dz4mYakwPlVZ5yqYa/+G\n"
"    83i951rqAGI=\n"
"    =g+ji\n"
"    -----END PGP MESSAGE-----\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:31
msgid ""
"When the pillar is assigned to a system with `top.sls`, the GPG encrypted "
"pillar data is available in a decrypted format."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ pillar ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ລະບົບດ້ວຍ `top.sls`, ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍ GPG ຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ຖອດລະຫັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:32
msgid ""
"The client's in-memory cache is only updated on startup or when running "
"execution module functions that trigger a cache refresh such as "
"`saltutil.refresh_pillar`, `pillar.items`, or `state.apply`."
msgstr "In-memory cache ຂອງ client ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ ຫຼື ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກຟັງຊັນ execution module ທີ່ກະຕຸ້ນການຣີເຟຣຊ (refresh) ແຄຊ ເຊັ່ນ `saltutil.refresh_pillar`, `pillar.items`, ຫຼື `state.apply`."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MLM-sles15sp1.tf.local:\n"
"    ----------\n"
"    my-secret:\n"
"        t0p s3cr3t!\n"
msgstr ""
"MLM-sles15sp1.tf.local:\n"
"    ----------\n"
"    my-secret:\n"
"        t0p s3cr3t!\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export the GPG key"
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກ (Export) ລະຫັດ GPG"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:35
msgid "To export the GPG key, use the command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກລະຫັດ GPG, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"gpg --export 'MLM Salt Master' --homedir /etc/salt/gpgkeys --output "
"MLM-salt-master.gpg\n"
msgstr "gpg --export 'MLM Salt Master' --homedir /etc/salt/gpgkeys --output MLM-salt-master.gpg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:37
msgid "Here 'MLM Salt Master' is the name used during key generation."
msgstr "ໃນທີ່ນີ້ 'MLM Salt Master' ແມ່ນຊື່ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງຄີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:38
msgid "The `MLM-salt-master.gpg` public key can be freely shared."
msgstr "Public key `MLM-salt-master.gpg` ສາມາດແບ່ງປັນໄດ້ຢ່າງເສລີ."

#. For more information about GPG, see https://www.gnupg.org/documentation/.
#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring {salt} Events"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມກວດກາ {salt} Events"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In some cases the {salt} event bus could publish significant amount of "
"events with a high rate, what could make it hard to analyze.  Getting the "
"statistics based on the events published in the {salt} event bus can help to "
"identify possible weak points and perform {salt} internals profiling."
msgstr "ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ {salt} event bus ອາດຈະສົ່ງເຫດການ (events) ອອກມາເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວສູງ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການວິເຄາະເປັນໄປໄດ້ຍາກ. ການເກັບກຳສະຖິຕິໂດຍອີງຕາມເຫດການທີ່ຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ໃນ {salt} event bus ສາມາດຊ່ວຍລະບຸຈຸດອ່ອນທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ເຮັດການ profiling ພາຍໃນຂອງ {salt} ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Saline"
msgstr "Saline"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Saline is a powerful tool designed to function as a Prometheus exporter, "
"enabling the collection of metrics based on events from the {salt} event "
"bus.  These metrics are derived from event data available on the {salt} "
"master, similar to what is accessible through the command:"
msgstr "Saline ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບ ທີ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ Prometheus exporter, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເກັບກຳ metrics ໂດຍອີງຕາມເຫດການຈາກ {salt} event bus. metrics ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ແມ່ນໄດ້ມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນເຫດການທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {salt} master, ຄ້າຍຄືກັບສິ່ງທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- salt-run state.event\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- salt-run state.event\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Saline is distributed as a separate container image, `server-saline`, for "
"use with {productname} Server.  All related commands and operations should "
"be executed on the {productname} Server container host system."
msgstr "Saline ຖືກແຈກຢາຍເປັນ container image ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໃນຊື່ `server-saline`, ສຳລັບໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname} Server. ທຸກຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ ການດຳເນີນງານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ຄວນຖືກປະຕິບັດໃນ {productname} Server container host system."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In addition to its role as a Prometheus exporter, Saline also provides the "
"`saline-formula`, which simplifies configuration of Prometheus and Grafana "
"dashboards, enhancing monitoring and visualization capabilities."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກບົດບາດໃນການເປັນ Prometheus exporter ແລ້ວ, Saline ຍັງມີ `saline-formula`, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການກຳນົດຄ່າ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana dashboards ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ການສະແດງຜົນ (visualization)."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Saline deployment"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Saline (Saline deployment)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Deployment instructions depend on when the customer decides to enable "
"Saline."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າລູກຄ້າຕັດສິນໃຈເປີດໃຊ້ Saline ເວລາໃດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Saline can be deployed during the initial installation or an upgrade of the "
"{productname} server, by using command:"
msgstr "Saline ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງຄັ້ງທຳອິດ ຫຼື ການອັບເກຣດ {productname} server, ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install podman --saline-replicas 1\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman --saline-replicas 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If the {productname} server is already installed, you can enable Saline "
"support without running a full server upgrade with this command:"
msgstr "ຫາກ {productname} server ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບ Saline ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດການອັບເກຣດ server ທັງໝົດ ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale uyuni-saline --replicas 1\n"
msgstr "mgradm scale uyuni-saline --replicas 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:14
msgid "If you want to upgrade and add Saline with one single command, use:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການອັບເກຣດ ແລະ ເພີ່ມ Saline ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງດຽວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm upgrade podman && mgradm scale uyuni-saline --replicas 1\n"
msgstr "mgradm upgrade podman && mgradm scale uyuni-saline --replicas 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In all scenarios, the only possible values for `--saline-replicas` are `1` "
"or `0`."
msgstr "ໃນທຸກກໍລະນີ, ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ສຳລັບ `--saline-replicas` ມີພຽງແຕ່ `1` ຫຼື `0` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:17
msgid ""
"After finishing the deployment `{productname}-saline.service` should be "
"configured on the {productname} Server host system."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ `{productname}-saline.service` ຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການກຳນົດຄ່າ ໃນ {productname} Server host system."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "{salt} master configuration recommendations"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າ {salt} master"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:19
msgid ""
"It is recommended to add `master_stats: True` and adjust the value of "
"`master_stats_event_iter: 60` if needed.  Then restart `salt-master` to get "
"the detailed statistics of internal {salt} calls.  This can be help with "
"tuning large scale deployment installations."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ `master_stats: True` ແລະ ປັບຄ່າຂອງ `master_stats_event_iter: 60` ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ຣີສະຕາດ (restart) `salt-master` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງສະຖິຕິລະອຽດຂອງການຮຽກໃຊ້ {salt} ພາຍໃນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ (tuning) ການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Saline formula"
msgstr "Saline formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To configure Prometheus and Grafana dashboards, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc[Saline Formula]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອການກຳນົດຄ່າ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana dashboards, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-saline.adoc[Saline Formula]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Removing Saline"
msgstr "ການຖອນ Saline ອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:23
msgid ""
"To remove Saline from the {productname} Server use `mgradm upgrade podman` "
"with `--saline-replicas 0`."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຖອນ Saline ອອກຈາກ {productname} Server ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `mgradm upgrade podman` ພ້ອມກັບ `--saline-replicas 0`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples of resulting Grafana dashboards"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ Grafana dashboards ທີ່ໄດ້"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Server (with Saline) dashboard"
msgstr "{productname} Server (ພ້ອມ Saline) dashboard"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:26
msgid ""
"The dashboard represents {salt} events with the different views presented on "
"the panels."
msgstr "ແດຊບອດ (Dashboard) ສະແດງເຫດການຂອງ {salt} ດ້ວຍມຸມມອງຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ເທິງແຜງຄວບຄຸມ (panels)."

#. type: Positional ($1) AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:27
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Events"
msgstr "Salt Events"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The panel represents all the {salt} events grouped by categories. `Salt "
"events` represents the total number of all categories of the events."
msgstr "ແຜງຄວບຄຸມສະແດງເຫດການທັງໝົດຂອງ {salt} ທີ່ແບ່ງຕາມໝວດໝູ່. `Salt events` ສະແດງເຖິງຈຳນວນລວມຂອງທຸກໝວດໝູ່ຂອງເຫດການ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "saline-salt-events.png"
msgstr "saline-salt-events.png"

#. type: Positional ($1) AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:31
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minions Activity"
msgstr "ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງ Minions (Minions Activity)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:32
msgid ""
"The panel provides the minions activity status for the specified interval of "
"times. It shows the amount of minions which were active in last minute, 5 "
"minutes, 15 minutes, 1 hour or considered offline on this moment of time or "
"even ever seen (could be targeted or either responded or not) or active."
msgstr "ແຜງຄວບຄຸມສະແດງສະຖານະການເຮັດວຽກຂອງມິນນຽນ (minions) ສໍາລັບຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ. ມັນສະແດງຈຳນວນຂອງມິນນຽນທີ່ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃນ 1 ນາທີ, 5 ນາທີ, 15 ນາທີ, 1 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ທີ່ຜ່ານມາ ຫຼື ຖືວ່າອອບລາຍ (offline) ໃນເວລານີ້ ຫຼື ແມ່ນແຕ່ເຄີຍພົບເຫັນ (ອາດຖືກກຳນົດເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍ ຫຼື ໄດ້ຕອບສະໜອງຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ) ຫຼື ກຳລັງເຄື່ອນໄຫວຢູ່."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "saline-salt-minions-activity.png"
msgstr "saline-salt-minions-activity.png"

#. type: Positional ($1) AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:35
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Events by Tags and Functions"
msgstr "Salt Events ຕາມ Tags ແລະ Functions"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-monitoring.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The panel provides the detailed representation of "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-monitoring.adoc#salt-events-panel[Salt "
"Events] with the event spread by direction The events which are send to the "
"minions are presented on the positive side of the axis, while the events "
"received from the minions are presented on the negative side."
msgstr "ແຜງຄວບຄຸມໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-monitoring.adoc#salt-events-panel[Salt Events] ໂດຍມີການແບ່ງເຫດການຕາມທິດທາງ. ເຫດການທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຫາມິນນຽນຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ເບື້ອງບວກຂອງແກນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຫດການທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈາກມິນນຽນຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ເບື້ອງລົບ."

