#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Guide Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງຄູ່ມື Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt is a remote execution engine, configuration management and "
"orchestration system used by {productname} to manage clients."
msgstr "Salt ແມ່ນລະບົບສັ່ງການທາງໄກ (remote execution engine), ລະບົບຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (configuration management) ແລະ ລະບົບປະສານງານ (orchestration) ທີ່ {productname} ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, the Salt master runs on the {productname} Server, allowing "
"you to register and manage Salt clients."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, Salt master ຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ຈັດການ Salt clients ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:4
msgid "This book is designed to be a primer for using Salt with {productname}."
msgstr "ປຶ້ມຫົວນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເປັນບົດຮຽນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການໃຊ້ Salt ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt, see the Salt documentation at "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/contents.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ Salt ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/contents.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:6
msgid "The current version of Salt in {productname} is {saltversion}."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ Salt ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ {saltversion}."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Rate Limiting"
msgstr "ການຈຳກັດອັດຕາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Salt (Rate Limiting)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt is able to run commands in parallel on a large number of clients.  This "
"can potentially create large amounts of load on your infrastructure.  You "
"can use these rate-limiting parameters to control the load in your "
"environment."
msgstr "Salt ສາມາດສັ່ງການໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍເຮັດວຽກພ້ອມໆກັນໄດ້. ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະສ້າງພາລະ (load) ມະຫາສານໃຫ້ກັບໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງເຈົ້າ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີຈຳກັດອັດຕາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມພາລະໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:3
msgid ""
"These parameters are all configured in the `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` configuration "
"file."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີທັງໝົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Salt commands that are executed from the command line are not subject to "
"these parameters."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ທີ່ຖືກສັ່ງການຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ (command line) ໂດຍກົງ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Batching"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກແບບເປັນຊຸດ (Batching)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:6
msgid ""
"There are two parameters that control how actions are sent to clients, one "
"for the batch size, and one for the delay."
msgstr "ມີສອງພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໜຶ່ງຄືຂະໜາດຂອງຊຸດ (batch size) ແລະ ອີກໜຶ່ງຄືໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າ (delay)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:7
msgid ""
"When the {productname} Server sends a batch of actions to the target "
"clients, it will send it to the number of clients determined in the batch "
"size parameter.  After the specified delay period, commands will be sent to "
"the next batch of clients.  The number of clients in each subsequent batch "
"is equal to the number of clients that have completed in the previous batch."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ {productname} Server ສົ່ງຊຸດຂອງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເປົ້າໝາຍ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງໃຫ້ຕາມຈຳນວນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນພາລາມິເຕີ batch size. ຫຼັງຈາກໝົດໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າທີ່ລະບຸ, ຄຳສັ່ງຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຊຸດຖັດໄປ. ຈຳນວນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃນແຕ່ລະຊຸດຖັດມາຈະເທົ່າກັບຈຳນວນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດແລ້ວໃນຊຸດກ່ອນໜ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Choosing a lower batch size will reduce system load and parallelism, but "
"might reduce overall performance for processing actions."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຂະໜາດ batch size ທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດພາລະຂອງລະບົບ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກແບບຂະໜານ, ແຕ່ອາດຈະຫຼຸດປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍລວມໃນການປະມວນຜົນຄຳສັ່ງ."

#.  Defaulte is 200 according to salt-large-scale-tuning.adoc
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The batch size parameter sets the maximum number of clients that can execute "
"a single action at the same time.  Adjust the `java.salt_batch_size` "
"parameter."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ batch size ແມ່ນກຳນົດຈຳນວນ client ສູງສຸດທີ່ສາມາດປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງດຽວກັນ ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນໄດ້. ໃຫ້ປັບປ່ຽນທີ່ພາຣາມິເຕີ `java.salt_batch_size`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:10
msgid "Defaults to 200."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 200."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Increasing the delay increases the chance that multiple clients will have "
"completed before the next action is issued (more clients are grouped "
"together in subsequent batches), resulting in fewer overall commands, and "
"reducing load."
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມໂອກາດທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງຈະເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດກ່ອນທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງຖັດໄປຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກ (ມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍລວມກຸ່ມກັນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນຊຸດຖັດໄປ), ເຮັດໃຫ້ມີຈຳນວນຄຳສັ່ງໂດຍລວມໜ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ ຫຼຸດພາລະຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The batch delay parameter sets the amount of time, in seconds, to wait after "
"a command from the previous batch is processed before beginning to process "
"the command on the next client.  Adjust the `java.salt_batch_delay` "
"parameter.  Defaults to 1.0 seconds."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ batch delay ແມ່ນກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າຫຼັງຈາກຄຳສັ່ງຈາກ batch ກ່ອນໜ້າ ຖືກປະມວນຜົນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງເລີ່ມປະມວນຜົນຄຳສັ່ງໃນ client ຖັດໄປ. ໃຫ້ປັບປ່ຽນທີ່ພາຣາມິເຕີ `java.salt_batch_delay`. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1.0 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disabling the Salt Mine"
msgstr "ການປິດໃຊ້ງານ Salt Mine"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In older versions, {productname} used a tool called Salt mine to check "
"client availability.  The Salt mine would cause clients to contact the "
"server every hour, which created significant load.  With the introduction of "
"a more efficient mechanism in {productname}{nbsp}3.2, the Salt mine is no "
"longer required.  Instead, the {productname} Server uses Taskomatic to ping "
"only the clients that appear to have been offline for twelve hours or more, "
"with all clients being contacted at least once in every twenty four hour "
"period by default.  You can adjust this by changing the "
"`web.system_checkin_threshold` parameter in `rhn.conf`.  The value is "
"expressed in days, and the default value is `1`."
msgstr "ໃນເວີຊັນເກົ່າ, {productname} ເຄີຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ Salt mine ເພື່ອກວດສອບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ client. Salt mine ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ clients ຕິດຕໍ່ຫາ server ທຸກໆຊົ່ວໂມງ, ເຊິ່ງສ້າງ load ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ດ້ວຍການນຳໃຊ້ກົນໄກທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບກວ່າໃນ {productname}{nbsp}3.2, Salt mine ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ແທນທີ່ນັ້ນ, {productname} Server ຈະໃຊ້ Taskomatic ເພື່ອ ping ຫາສະເພາະ clients ທີ່ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າ offline ເປັນເວລາ 12 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ, ໂດຍທີ່ clients ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຕິດຕໍ່ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງ ໃນທຸກໆ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຄ່ານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນພາຣາມິເຕີ `web.system_checkin_threshold` ໃນ `rhn.conf`. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກກຳນົດເປັນຈຳນວນມື້, ແລະ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `1`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Newly registered Salt clients will have the Salt mine disabled by default.  "
"If the Salt mine is running on your system, you can reduce load by disabling "
"it.  This is especially effective if you have a large number of clients."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ Salt mine ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຖ້າ Salt mine ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຫຼຸດ load ໄດ້ໂດຍການປິດມັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຫັນຜົນຊັດເຈນຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:16
msgid "Disable the Salt mine by running this command on the server:"
msgstr "ປິດ Salt mine ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃນເຊີເວີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:18
msgid ""
"This will restart the clients and generate some Salt events to be processed "
"by the server.  If you have a large number of clients, handling these events "
"could create excessive load.  To avoid this, you can execute the command in "
"batch mode with this command:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ແລະ ສ້າງເຫດການ Salt ບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຊີເວີປະມວນຜົນ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ການຈັດການເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ load ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫານີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລັນຄຳສັ່ງໃນໂໝດ batch ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scaling Minions (Large Scale Deployments)"
msgstr "ການຂະຫຍາຍຈຳນວນ Minions (ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information on managing large scale deployments, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt SSH"
msgstr "Salt SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt SSH allows Salt commands and states to be issued directly over SSH.  "
"SSH connections are created on demand, when the server executes an action on "
"a client."
msgstr "Salt SSH ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ states ຂອງ Salt ຜ່ານ SSH ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ, ເມື່ອເຊີເວີສັ່ງໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt SSH, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/ssh/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt SSH, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/ssh/."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSH Connection Methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In {productname} there are two SSH connection methods, `ssh-push` and "
"`ssh-push-tunnel`.  In both methods the server initiates an SSH connection "
"to the client to execute a Salt call."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} ມີສອງວິທີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຄື: `ssh-push` ແລະ `ssh-push-tunnel`. ໃນທັງສອງວິທີ, ເຊີເວີຈະເປັນຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the `ssh-push` method, the package manager works as normal, and the HTTP "
"or HTTPS connection is directly created."
msgstr "ໃນວິທີ `ssh-push`, ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດຈະເຮັດວຽກຕາມປົກກະຕິ, ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the `ssh-push-tunnel` method, the server creates an HTTP or HTTPS "
"connection through an SSH tunnel.  The HTTP connection initiated by the "
"package manager is redirected through the tunnel using `/etc/hosts` "
"aliasing.  Use this method for in-place firewall environments that block "
"HTTP or HTTPS connections between server and client."
msgstr "ໃນວິທີ `ssh-push-tunnel`, ເຊີເວີຈະສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS ຜ່ານທໍ່ SSH (SSH tunnel). ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຜ່ານທໍ່ SSH ໂດຍໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຊື່ແຝງ (aliasing) ໃນ `/etc/hosts`. ໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີໄຟວໍ (firewall) ປິດກັ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt SSH Integration"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນຂອງ Salt SSH (Salt SSH Integration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:9
msgid "As with all Salt calls, {productname} invokes `salt-ssh` via the `salt-api`."
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt ທັງໝົດ, {productname} ຈະຮຽກໃຊ້ `salt-ssh` ຜ່ານ `salt-api`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Salt SSH relies on a roster to obtain details such as hostname, ports, and "
"the SSH parameters of a client.  {productname} keeps these details in the "
"database and makes them available to Salt SSH by using the `uyuni` roster "
"module, or by generating a temporary roster file on bootstrapping new "
"clients with the {webui}.  The location of the temporary roster file is "
"supplied to Salt SSH using the `roster-file` option.  For the registered "
"clients `roster` set to `uyuni` is used instead to get the roster from the "
"database with `uyuni` salt roster module."
msgstr "Salt SSH ອາໄສ roster ເພື່ອເອົາລາຍລະອຽດຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ hostname, ports, ແລະ SSH parameters ຂອງ client. {productname} ຈະເກັບລາຍລະອຽດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ Salt SSH ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ `uyuni` roster module, ຫຼື ໂດຍການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວໃນລະຫວ່າງການ bootstrap new clients ດ້ວຍ {webui}. ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວຈະຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ Salt SSH ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `roster-file`. ສຳລັບ clients ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ຈະໃຊ້ `roster` ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ `uyuni` ແທນ ເພື່ອເອົາ roster ຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍ `uyuni` salt roster module."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:11
msgid ""
"It is not recommended to run `salt-ssh` as `root` user. This can cause "
"permission issues the next time {productname} tries to use Salt SSH.  Use "
"`mgr-salt-ssh`, which changes the effective user to `salt` and avoids file "
"permission issues.  If you want to use `mgr-salt-ssh` with a user other than "
"`root`, the user should have the permission to change effective user to "
"`salt`."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `salt-ssh` ໃນນາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ `root`. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາເລື່ອງສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ (permission) ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ {productname} ພະຍາຍາມໃຊ້ Salt SSH. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `mgr-salt-ssh` ແທນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະປ່ຽນຜູ້ໃຊ້ ໃຫ້ເປັນ `salt` ແລະ ຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ `mgr-salt-ssh` ດ້ວຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ `root`, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນັ້ນຄວນມີສິດໃນການປ່ຽນຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ເປັນ `salt`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:12
msgid ""
"`mgr-salt-ssh` uses `roster` set to `uyuni` by default, if neither `roster` "
"nor `roster-file` specified in the command line.  It helps to call Salt "
"commands to the registered Salt SSH clients with no roster file generation."
msgstr "`mgr-salt-ssh` ຈະໃຊ້ `roster` ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ `uyuni` ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຖ້າຫາກບໍ່ມີການລະບຸ `roster` ຫຼື `roster-file` ໃນ command line. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຮຽກໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ໄປຫາ Salt SSH clients ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວໄດ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ roster ໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "ການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນ (Authentication)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Salt SSH supports both password and key authentication.  {productname} uses "
"both methods:"
msgstr "Salt SSH ຮອງຮັບທັງການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ ແລະ ດ້ວຍຄູ່ລະຫັດ (key). {productname} ໃຊ້ທັງສອງວິທີຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Password authentication is used only when bootstrapping.  During the "
"bootstrap step the key of the server is not authorized on the client and "
"therefore a password must be used for a connection to be made.  The password "
"is used transiently in a temporary roster file used for bootstrapping and "
"the roster file is removed on finishing processing the event.  This password "
"is not stored."
msgstr "ການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນລະຫວ່າງການ bootstrapping ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ bootstrap, ຄູ່ລະຫັດຂອງເຊີເວີຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານເພື່ອສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. ລະຫັດຜ່ານນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ພຽງຊົ່ວຄາວໃນໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວສຳລັບການ bootstrap ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ roster ຈະຖືກລົບອອກເມື່ອຂະບວນການສຳເລັດ. ລະຫັດຜ່ານນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຈັດເກັບໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:16
msgid ""
"All other common Salt calls use key authentication.  During the bootstrap "
"step the SSH key of the server is authorized on the client and added to the "
"client `/.ssh/authorized_keys` file.  Subsequent calls no longer require a "
"password."
msgstr "ການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt ທົ່ວໄປອື່ນໆທັງໝົດຈະໃຊ້ການກວດສອບສິດດ້ວຍຄີ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນ bootstrap, SSH key ຂອງ server ຈະໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃນ client ແລະ ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ `/.ssh/authorized_keys` ຂອງ client. ການຮຽກໃຊ້ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໆໄປຈະບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານອີກ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Account"
msgstr "ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The user for Salt SSH calls made by {productname} is taken from the "
"`ssh_push_sudo_user` setting.  By default, the user is root."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt SSH ໂດຍ {productname} ແມ່ນເອົາມາຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `ssh_push_sudo_user`. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນ root."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If bootstrapping with default settings fail, check whether the client allows "
"root login with ssh."
msgstr "ຫາກການ bootstrap ດ້ວຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ root ລັອກອິນຜ່ານ ssh ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:20
msgid ""
"If the value of `ssh_push_sudo_user` is not root, then the `--sudo` options "
"of `salt-ssh` are used.  For this user you must configure the `NOPASSWD` "
"option in the `sudoers` file.  At least, set the python binary with the "
"version number; for example:"
msgstr "ຫາກຄ່າຂອງ `ssh_push_sudo_user` ບໍ່ແມ່ນ root, ຕົວເລືອກ `--sudo` ຂອງ `salt-ssh` ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້. ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ ທ່ານຕ້ອງກຳນົດຄ່າຕົວເລືອກ `NOPASSWD` ໃນໄຟລ໌ `sudoers`. ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຄ່າ python binary ພ້ອມກັບເລກເວີຊັນ; ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "<USER> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:/usr/bin/python3.6\n"
msgstr "<USER> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:/usr/bin/python3.6\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "HTTP Redirection"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ HTTP (HTTP Redirection)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The `ssh-push-tunnel` method requires traffic to be redirected through an "
"SSH tunnel.  This allows traffic to bypass firewalls blocking a direct "
"connection between the client and the server."
msgstr "ວິທີ `ssh-push-tunnel` ຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ມີການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຂໍ້ມູນຜ່ານທໍ່ SSH. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດຜ່ານໄຟວໍທີ່ປິດກັ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງລະຫວ່າງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເຊີເວີໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:24
msgid "This is achieved by using port 1233 in the repository URL:"
msgstr "ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ພອດ 1233 ໃນ URL ຂອງຄັງຊອບແວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://MLM-server:1233/repourl...\n"
msgstr "https://MLM-server:1233/repourl...\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:26
msgid "You can alias the MLM-server hostname to `localhost` in `/etc/hosts`:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຊື່ຫຼິ້ນ (alias) hostname ຂອງ MLM-server ໃຫ້ເປັນ `localhost` ໃນ `/etc/hosts`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "127.0.0.1       localhost    MLM-server\n"
msgstr "127.0.0.1       localhost    MLM-server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The server creates a reverse SSH tunnel that connects `localhost:1233` on "
"the client to `MLM-server:443`:"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສ້າງອຸໂມງ SSH ແບບຢ້ອນກັບ (reverse SSH tunnel) ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ `localhost:1233` ຢູ່ເທິງໄຄລເອັນໄປຫາ `MLM-server:443`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh ... -R 1233:MLM-server:443\n"
msgstr "ssh ... -R 1233:MLM-server:443\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:30
msgid ""
"This means that the package manager will actually connect to "
"`localhost:1233`, which is then forwarded to `MLM-server:443` by the SSH "
"tunnel."
msgstr "ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ package manager ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ `localhost:1233` ແທ້ໆ, ເຊິ່ງຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາ `MLM-server:443` ໂດຍ SSH tunnel."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The package manager can contact the server only if the tunnel is open, which "
"occurs only when the server executes an action on the client."
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດຈະສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທໍ່ SSH ເປີດຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຊີເວີສັ່ງໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Manual package manager operations that require server connectivity are not "
"possible in this case."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ການຈັດການແພັກເກັດດ້ວຍມືທີ່ຕ້ອງມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call Sequence"
msgstr "ລຳດັບການຮຽກໃຊ້ (Call Sequence)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:34
msgid "Salt SSH calls run in this sequence:"
msgstr "ການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt SSH ຈະເຮັດວຽກຕາມລຳດັບດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Set `roster` parameter to `uyuni` for registered clients or prepare the Salt "
"roster on bootstrapping for the call"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີ `roster` ເປັນ `uyuni` ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ ຫຼື ກຽມ Salt roster ໃນລະຫວ່າງການ bootstrap ສຳລັບການຮຽກໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Create remote port forwarding option if the contact method is "
"`ssh-push-tunnel`"
msgstr "ສ້າງຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງຕໍ່ພອດທາງໄກ (remote port forwarding) ຫາກວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແມ່ນ `ssh-push-tunnel`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:37
msgid "Compute the `ProxyCommand` if the client is connected through a proxy"
msgstr "ຄຳນວນ `ProxyCommand` ຫາກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ (proxy)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:38
msgid "Create Roster content"
msgstr "ສ້າງເນື້ອໃນຂອງ Roster"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:39
msgid "Create a temporary roster file (only in case of bootstrapping new client)"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວ (ສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີ bootstrap ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:40
msgid "Execute a synchronous `salt-ssh` call using the API"
msgstr "ສັ່ງໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກ `salt-ssh` ແບບຊິງໂຄຣນັດ (synchronous) ໂດຍໃຊ້ API"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:41
msgid "Remove the temporary roster file (only in case of bootstrapping new client)"
msgstr "ລົບໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວອອກ (ສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີ bootstrap ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:42
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:80
msgid "The roster content contains:"
msgstr "ເນື້ອໃນຂອງ roster ປະກອບດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:43
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:81
msgid "`hostname`"
msgstr "`hostname`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:44
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:82
msgid "`user`"
msgstr "`user`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:45
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:84
msgid "`port`"
msgstr "`port`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:46
msgid "`remote_port_forwards`: The remote port forwarding SSH option"
msgstr "`remote_port_forwards`: ຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງຕໍ່ພອດ SSH ທາງໄກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:47
msgid "`ssh_options`: Other ssh options:"
msgstr "`ssh_options`: ຕົວເລືອກ ssh ອື່ນໆ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:48
msgid "`ProxyCommand`: If the client connects through a proxy"
msgstr "`ProxyCommand`: ຫາກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:49
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:88
msgid "`timeout`: defaults to 180 seconds"
msgstr "`timeout`: ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 180 ວິນາທີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:50
msgid "`minion_opts`:"
msgstr "`minion_opts`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:51
msgid "`master`: Set to the minion ID if the contact method is `ssh-push-tunnel`"
msgstr "`master`: ຕັ້ງເປັນ minion ID ຫາກວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແມ່ນ `ssh-push-tunnel`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:52
msgid ""
"`ssh_pre_flight`: The path to the shell script executed on the client before "
"running any Salt command"
msgstr "`ssh_pre_flight`: ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາສະຄຣິບທ໌ເຊວ (shell script) ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍ ກ່ອນການລັນຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ໃດໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:53
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:90
msgid ""
"`ssh_pre_flight_args`: The list of arguments to call the pre flight script "
"on the client"
msgstr "`ssh_pre_flight_args`: ລາຍການພາຣາມິເຕີ (arguments) ເພື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບທ໌ pre-flight ຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap Sequence"
msgstr "ລຳດັບການບູດສະແຕຣັບ (Bootstrap Sequence)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:55
msgid ""
"This section describes the sequence of events when clients are registered to "
"a Salt master.  While bootstrapping is a type of Salt SSH call, the sequence "
"differs slightly from regular SSH calls."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບລຳດັບເຫດການ ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍຖືກລົງທະບຽນເຂົ້າກັບ Salt master. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການບູດສະແຕຣັບແມ່ນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt SSH ຮູບແບບໜຶ່ງ, ແຕ່ລຳດັບຂັ້ນຕອນຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ SSH ປົກກະຕິເລັກນ້ອຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:56
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping uses Salt SSH for communication between the master and the "
"client.  This happens for both regular and SSH clients."
msgstr "ການບູດສະແຕຣັບໃຊ້ Salt SSH ສຳລັບການສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງ master ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນທັງກັບລູກຂ່າຍແບບປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:57
msgid ""
"For a regular Salt client, generate and pre-authorize the Salt key of the "
"client."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ປົກກະຕິ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ ແລະ ອະນຸມັດຄີ Salt ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:58
msgid ""
"For an SSH client, if a proxy was selected, retrieve the SSH public key of "
"the proxy using the `mgrutil.chain_ssh_cmd` runner."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ SSH client, ຫາກມີການເລືອກ proxy, ໃຫ້ດຶງເອົາ SSH public key ຂອງ proxy ໂດຍໃຊ້ `mgrutil.chain_ssh_cmd` runner."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:59
msgid ""
"The runner copies the public key of the proxy to the server using SSH.  If "
"needed, it can chain multiple SSH commands to reach the proxy across "
"multiple hops."
msgstr "ຕົວລັນຈະກັອບປີ້ຄີສາທາລະນະຂອງພຣັອກຊີໄປຫາເຊີເວີໂດຍໃຊ້ SSH. ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ມັນສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄຳສັ່ງ SSH ຫຼາຍຄຳສັ່ງ ເພື່ອເຂົ້າຫາພຣັອກຊີຜ່ານຫຼາຍຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (multiple hops)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:60
msgid "Generate pillar data for bootstrap."
msgstr "ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ສຳລັບການບູດສະແຕຣັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:61
msgid ""
"The pillar data is compiled and stored on the Salt master, and retrieved by "
"the client."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນ ແລະ ເກັບໄວ້ຢູ່ເທິງ Salt master, ແລະ ຖືກດຶງໄປໃຊ້ໂດຍລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:62
msgid "Generate the roster for bootstrapping into a temporary file on the client."
msgstr "ສ້າງບັນຊີລາຍຊື່ (roster) ສຳລັບການບູດສະແຕຣັບ ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:63
msgid "You can use the roster by passing it to the Salt API, with this command:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ roster ໄດ້ໂດຍການສົ່ງມັນໄປຫາ Salt API ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-salt-ssh --roster-file=<temporary_bootstrap_roster> minion state.apply "
"certs,<bootstrap_state>\n"
msgstr "mgr-salt-ssh --roster-file=<temporary_bootstrap_roster> minion state.apply certs,<bootstrap_state>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:65
msgid ""
"For `bootstrap_state`, use `bootstrap` for regular clients or "
"`ssh_bootstrap` for SSH clients."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ `bootstrap_state`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `bootstrap` ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍປົກກະຕິ ຫຼື `ssh_bootstrap` ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:66
msgid ""
"The way the client retrieves the pillar data depends on the contact method "
"you have chosen for your client:"
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ (contact method) ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກໄວ້ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:67
msgid ""
"If you are using the `ssh-push-tunnel` contact method, ensure you have "
"completed the remote port forwarding option."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ `ssh-push-tunnel`, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງຕໍ່ພອດທາງໄກ (remote port forwarding) ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:68
msgid ""
"If the client connects through a proxy, ensure you have completed the "
"`ProxyCommand` option."
msgstr "ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກ `ProxyCommand` ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:69
msgid ""
"This depends on your proxy configuration, including how many proxies you "
"need to connect through."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງຈຳນວນພຣັອກຊີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:70
msgid "Pillar data contains:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Pillar ປະກອບມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:71
msgid "mgr_server: The hostname of the Salt master"
msgstr "mgr_server: ຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname) ຂອງ Salt master"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:72
msgid "mgr_origin_server: The hostname of the {productname} Server"
msgstr "mgr_origin_server: ຊື່ໂຮສ ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:73
msgid "minion_id: The hostname of the client to bootstrap"
msgstr "minion_id: ຊື່ໂຮສ ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະບູດສະແຕຣັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:74
msgid "contact_method: The connection type"
msgstr "contact_method: ຮູບແບບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:75
msgid "mgr_sudo_user: The user for `salt-ssh`"
msgstr "mgr_sudo_user: ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ `salt-ssh`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:76
msgid "activation_key: If selected"
msgstr "activation_key: ຖ້າມີການເລືອກໄວ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:77
msgid "minion_pub: The pre-authorized public client key"
msgstr "minion_pub: ຄີສາທາລະນະຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸມັດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:78
msgid "minion_pem: The pre-authorized private client key"
msgstr "minion_pem: ຄີສ່ວນຕົວຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸມັດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:79
msgid ""
"proxy_pub_key: The public SSH key that was retrieved from the proxy if the "
"target is an SSH client and a proxy was selected"
msgstr "proxy_pub_key: ຄີສາທາລະນະ SSH ທີ່ດຶງມາຈາກພຣັອກຊີ ຖ້າຫາກເປົ້າໝາຍແມ່ນລູກຂ່າຍ SSH ແລະ ມີການເລືອກພຣັອກຊີໄວ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:85
msgid "`remote_port_forwards`: the remote port forwarding SSH option"
msgstr "`remote_port_forwards`: ຕົວເລືອກ SSH ສຳລັບການສົ່ງຕໍ່ພອດທາງໄກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:86
msgid "`ssh_options`: other SSH options:"
msgstr "`ssh_options`: ຕົວເລືອກ SSH ອື່ນໆ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:87
msgid "`ProxyCommand` if the client connects through a proxy"
msgstr "`ProxyCommand` ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:89
msgid ""
"`ssh_pre_flight`: The path to the pre flight shell script (default: "
"`/usr/share/susemanager/salt-ssh/preflight.sh`)"
msgstr "`ssh_pre_flight`: ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ pre flight shell script (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: `/usr/share/susemanager/salt-ssh/preflight.sh`)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:91
msgid "This image provides an overview of the Salt SSH bootstrap process."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນພາບລວມຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນການບູດສະແຕຣັບ Salt SSH."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt SSH Bootstrap Process"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການບູດສະແຕຣັບ Salt SSH"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-bootstrap-process.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-bootstrap-process.png"

#.  This image needs some exposition, at the very least. --LKB 2020-06-16
#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:95
msgid ""
"Salt SSH works with {productname} Proxy by chaining the SSH connection from "
"one server or proxy to the next.  This is also known as a multi-hop or "
"multi-gateway SSH connection."
msgstr "Salt SSH ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ {productname} Proxy ໂດຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຈາກເຊີເວີ ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກບ່ອນໜຶ່ງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ແບບຫຼາຍຈຸດ (multi-hop) ຫຼື ຫຼາຍເກດເວ (multi-gateway)."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-proxy-multi-hop.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-proxy-multi-hop.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:97
msgid ""
"{productname} uses `ProxyCommand` to redirect SSH connections through "
"proxies.  This options invokes an arbitrary command that is expected to "
"connect to the SSH port on the target host.  The SSH process uses standard "
"input and output of the command to communicate with the remote SSH daemon."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ `ProxyCommand` ເພື່ອປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາພອດ SSH ຢູ່ເທິງໂຮສເປົ້າໝາຍ. ຂະບວນການ SSH ຈະໃຊ້ standard input ແລະ output ຂອງຄຳສັ່ງເພື່ອສື່ສານກັບ SSH daemon ທາງໄກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:98
msgid ""
"`ProxyCommand` replaces a TCP/IP connection.  It does not perform any "
"authorization or encryption.  Its role is simply to create a byte stream to "
"the remote SSH daemon port."
msgstr "`ProxyCommand` ຈະເຂົ້າມາແທນທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP/IP. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ກວດສອບສິດ ຫຼື ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃດໆ. ບົດບາດຂອງມັນແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ສ້າງ byte stream ໄປຫາພອດ SSH daemon ທາງໄກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:99
msgid ""
"This image depicts a client connecting to a server that is behind a "
"gateway.  In this example `netcat` is used to pipe port 22 of the target "
"host into the SSH standard input/output:"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີທີ່ຢູ່ທາງຫຼັງເກດເວ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ `netcat` ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພອດ 22 ຂອງໂຮສເປົ້າໝາຍເຂົ້າກັບ standard input/output ຂອງ SSH:"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-proxycommand.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-proxycommand.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:101
msgid "The Salt SSH calls run in this sequence when a proxy is in use:"
msgstr "ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Salt SSH ຈະເຮັດວຽກຕາມລຳດັບນີ້ ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ພຣັອກຊີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:102
msgid "{productname} initiates the SSH connection."
msgstr "{productname} ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:103
msgid ""
"`ProxyCommand` uses SSH to create a connection from the server to the client "
"through the proxies."
msgstr "`ProxyCommand` ໃຊ້ SSH ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກເຊີເວີໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:104
msgid "This example uses `ProxyCommand` with two proxies and the `ssh-push` method:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ໃຊ້ `ProxyCommand` ກັບພຣັອກຊີສອງໂຕ ແລະ ວິທີການແບບ `ssh-push`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:105
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Connect the server to the first proxy:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id -o "
"StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o User=mgrsshtunnel  proxy1\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຊີເວີຫາພຣັອກຊີໂຕທຳອິດ:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o User=mgrsshtunnel  proxy1\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Connect the first proxy to the second, and forward standard input/output "
"on the client to client:22 using the `-W` option:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /var/lib/spacewalk/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push "
"-o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o User=mgrsshtunnel -W client:22  proxy2\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພຣັອກຊີໂຕທຳອິດຫາໂຕທີສອງ, ແລະ ສົ່ງຕໍ່ standard input/output ຢູ່ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍໄປຫາ client:22 ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `-W`:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /var/lib/spacewalk/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o User=mgrsshtunnel -W client:22  proxy2\n"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-push-push-plain-sequence.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-push-push-plain-sequence.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:108
msgid ""
"This example uses `ProxyCommand` with two proxies and the `ssh-push-tunnel` "
"method:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ໃຊ້ `ProxyCommand` ກັບພຣັອກຊີສອງໂຕ ແລະ ວິທີການແບບ `ssh-push-tunnel`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:109
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Connect the server to the first proxy:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id -o "
"User=mgrsshtunnel  proxy1\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຊີເວີຫາພຣັອກຊີໂຕທຳອິດ:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id -o User=mgrsshtunnel  proxy1\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:110
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Connect the first proxy to the second:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /home/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push -o "
"User=mgrsshtunnel  proxy2\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພຣັອກຊີໂຕທຳອິດຫາໂຕທີສອງ:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /home/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push -o User=mgrsshtunnel  proxy2\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Connect the second proxy to the client and open an reverse tunnel (-R "
"1233:proxy2:443) from the client to the HTTPS port on the second proxy:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /home/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push -o User=root "
"-R 1233:proxy2:443 client\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພຣັອກຊີໂຕທີສອງຫາລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເປີດ reverse tunnel (-R 1233:proxy2:443) ຈາກລູກຂ່າຍໄປຫາພອດ HTTPS ຢູ່ເທິງພຣັອກຊີໂຕທີສອງ:\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /home/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push -o User=root -R 1233:proxy2:443 client\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Connect the client to itself and forward the standard input/output of the "
"server to the SSH port of the client (-W client:22).\n"
"This is equivalent to `ssh ... proxy2 netcat client 22` and is needed "
"because SSH does not allow both the reverse tunnel (-R 1233:proxy2:443) and "
"the standard input/output forward (-W client:22) in the same command.\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /root/.ssh/mgr_own_id -W client:22 -o User=root client\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ client ຫາຕົວມັນເອງ ແລະ ສົ່ງຕໍ່ standard input/output ຂອງ server ໄປຫາ SSH port ຂອງ client (-W client:22).\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ `ssh ... proxy2 netcat client 22` ແລະ ເປັນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນເພາະ SSH ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທັງ reverse tunnel (-R 1233:proxy2:443) ແລະ standard input/output forward (-W client:22) ໃນຄຳສັ່ງດຽວກັນ.\n"
"/usr/bin/ssh -i /root/.ssh/mgr_own_id -W client:22 -o User=root client\n"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-push-push-tunnel-sequence.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-push-push-tunnel-sequence.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users and SSH Key Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ SSH Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:115
msgid ""
"To connect to a proxy, the parent server or proxy uses a specific user "
"called `mgrsshtunnel`.  When `mgrsshtunnel` connects, the SSH configuration "
"of the proxy will force the execution of "
"`/usr/sbin/mgr-proxy-ssh-force-cmd`.  This is a simple shell script that "
"allows only the execution of `scp`, `ssh`, or `cat` commands."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ proxy, parent server ຫຼື proxy ຈະໃຊ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ `mgrsshtunnel`. ເມື່ອ `mgrsshtunnel` ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ການກຳນົດຄ່າ SSH ຂອງ proxy ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງ `/usr/sbin/mgr-proxy-ssh-force-cmd`. ນີ້ແມ່ນ shell script ແບບງ່າຍໆທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ ປະຕິບັດໄດ້ແຕ່ຄຳສັ່ງ `scp`, `ssh`, ຫຼື `cat` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:116
msgid ""
"The connection to the proxy or client is authorized using SSH keys in this "
"sequence:"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາພຣັອກຊີ ຫຼື ລູກຂ່າຍ ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ SSH keys ຕາມລຳດັບນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:117
msgid ""
"The server connects to the client and to the first proxy using the key in "
"`/srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id`."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບໄຄລເອັນ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີທຳອິດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ກຸນແຈໃນ `/srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:118
msgid ""
"Each proxy has its own key pair in "
"`/home/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push`."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະ proxy ຈະມີຄູ່ຄີ (key pair) ຂອງຕົນເອງໃນ `/home/mgrsshtunnel/.ssh/id_susemanager_ssh_push`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:119
msgid "Each proxy authorizes the key of the parent proxy or server."
msgstr "ພຣັອກຊີແຕ່ລະໂຕຈະອະນຸມັດຄີຂອງພຣັອກຊີແມ່ ຫຼື ເຊີເວີແມ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:120
msgid "The client authorizes its own key."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍອະນຸມັດຄີຂອງມັນເອງ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-push-ssh-keys.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-push-ssh-keys.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repository Access with a Proxy"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງຊອບແວ (Repository) ດ້ວຍພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:123
msgid ""
"When {productname} connects to a repository using a proxy, it can use either "
"`ssh-push` or `ssh-push-tunnel`."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ {productname} ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາຄັງຊອບແວໂດຍໃຊ້ພຣັອກຊີ, ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງແບບ `ssh-push` ຫຼື `ssh-push-tunnel`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:124
msgid ""
"In both methods the client connects to the proxy to retrieve package and "
"repository information."
msgstr "ໃນທັງສອງວິທີ, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາພຣັອກຊີເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນແພັກເກດ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:125
msgid ""
"In the `ssh-push` method, the package manager connects directly to the proxy "
"using HTTP or HTTPS.  This works in cases where there is no firewall between "
"the client and the proxy that blocks HTTP connections initiated by the "
"client."
msgstr "ໃນວິທີແບບ `ssh-push`, ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກດຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງຫາພຣັອກຊີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ມີຟາຍວໍ (firewall) ລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ ທີ່ບລັອກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-push-repo-access.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-push-repo-access.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:127
msgid ""
"In the `ssh-push-tunnel` method, the HTTP connection to the proxy is "
"redirected through a reverse SSH tunnel."
msgstr "ໃນວິທີແບບ `ssh-push-tunnel`, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ໄປຫາພຣັອກຊີ ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຜ່ານ reverse SSH tunnel."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-push-tunnel-repo-access.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-push-tunnel-repo-access.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:130
msgid ""
"When the `spacewalk-proxy` package is installed on the proxy, the "
"`mgrsshtunnel` user is created."
msgstr "ເມື່ອແພັກເກດ `spacewalk-proxy` ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນພຣັອກຊີ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ `mgrsshtunnel` ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:131
msgid ""
"The initial configuration with `configure-proxy.sh` occurs using this "
"sequence:"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ `configure-proxy.sh` ຈະດຳເນີນຕາມລຳດັບດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:132
msgid "An SSH key pair is generated, or an existing keypair is imported."
msgstr "ຄູ່ຄີ SSH ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ຫຼື ນຳເຂົ້າຄູ່ຄີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:133
msgid ""
"The SSH key of the parent server or proxy is retrieved to authorize it on "
"the proxy."
msgstr "ຄີ SSH ຂອງເຊີເວີແມ່ ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີແມ່ ຈະຖືກດຶງມາເພື່ອອະນຸມັດມັນຢູ່ເທິງພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:134
msgid ""
"The `ssh` daemon on the proxy is configured to restrict the `mgrsshtunnel` "
"user."
msgstr "`ssh` daemon ໃນ proxy ຈະຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າເພື່ອຈຳກັດສິດຜູ້ໃຊ້ `mgrsshtunnel`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:135
msgid ""
"This is done by the `mgr-proxy-ssh-push-init` script, which is called from "
"`configure-proxy.sh`.  It does not have to be manually invoked."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໂດຍສະຄຣິບ `mgr-proxy-ssh-push-init`, ເຊິ່ງຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ຈາກ `configure-proxy.sh`. ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຮຽກໃຊ້ມັນດ້ວຍຕົວເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:136
msgid ""
"The parent key is retrieved by calling an HTTPS endpoint on the parent "
"server or proxy.  The first endpoint tried is "
"`https://$PARENT/pub/id_susemanager_ssh_push.pub`.  If the parent is a proxy "
"then this will return the public SSH key of the proxy."
msgstr "ກຸນແຈແມ່ (Parent key) ຖືກດຶງມາໂດຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ HTTPS endpoint ເທິງເຊີເວີແມ່ ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີ. ເອນພອຍ (endpoint) ທຳອິດທີ່ທົດລອງແມ່ນ `https://$PARENT/pub/id_susemanager_ssh_push.pub`. ຫາກແມ່ເປັນພຣັອກຊີ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນກຸນແຈ SSH ສາທາລະນະຂອງພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:137
msgid ""
"If a 404 error is received from that endpoint, then the parent is assumed to "
"be a server not a proxy, and "
"`https://$PARENT/rhn/manager/download/saltssh/pubkey` is tried instead."
msgstr "ຫາກໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ 404 ຈາກ endpoint ນັ້ນ, ຈະຖືວ່າ parent ແມ່ນ server ບໍ່ແມ່ນ proxy, ແລະ ຈະທົດລອງ `https://$PARENT/rhn/manager/download/saltssh/pubkey` ແທນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:138
msgid ""
"If an SSH key exists at `/srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id.pub` on "
"the server it is returned."
msgstr "ຫາກມີ SSH key ຢູ່ທີ່ `/srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id.pub` ໃນ server ມັນຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:139
msgid ""
"If the public key does not exist because `salt-ssh` has not been invoked "
"yet, a key will be generates by calling the `mgrutil.ssh_keygen` runner."
msgstr "ຫາກບໍ່ມີ public key ເພາະວ່າ `salt-ssh` ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເທື່ອ, ຄີຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍການຮຽກໃຊ້ `mgrutil.ssh_keygen` runner."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:140
msgid ""
"Salt SSH generates a keypair the first time it is invoked with "
"`/srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id`.  The sequence in this section "
"is needed if a proxy is configured before Salt SSH was invoked for the first "
"time."
msgstr "Salt SSH ຈະສ້າງ keypair ໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ມັນຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ `/srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/mgr_ssh_id`. ລຳດັບໃນສ່ວນນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຫາກ proxy ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າກ່ອນທີ່ Salt SSH ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:141
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rotate SSH keys"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນ (Rotate) SSH keys"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:142
msgid ""
"The SSH key is used on `salt-ssh` managed systems.  Additionally, it is used "
"on {productname} Proxies for the user `mgrsshtunnel`.  Normal systems "
"managed with the {salt} `default` method are not affected and do not have "
"this key configured."
msgstr "SSH key ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຈັດການດ້ວຍ `salt-ssh`. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ມັນຍັງຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} Proxies ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ `mgrsshtunnel`. ລະບົບປົກກະຕິທີ່ຈັດການດ້ວຍ ວິທີ `default` ຂອງ {salt} ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດຄ່າຄີນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:143
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Rotating SSH keys"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນ (Rotating) SSH keys"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:144
msgid "On the {productname} Server, as user `root`, change to user `salt`:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃນນາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ `root`, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ `salt`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:145
#, no-wrap
msgid "su -s /bin/bash - salt\n"
msgstr "su -s /bin/bash - salt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:146
msgid "Create a new SSH key:"
msgstr "ສ້າງ SSH key ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:147
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh-keygen -N \"\" -t rsa -q -f /var/lib/salt/.ssh/new_mgr_ssh_id\n"
msgstr "ssh-keygen -N \"\" -t rsa -q -f /var/lib/salt/.ssh/new_mgr_ssh_id\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:148
msgid ""
"Copy the public key into the {salt} filesystem to make it usable in a {salt} "
"state:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ຄີສາທາລະນະເຂົ້າໄປໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງ {salt} ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ {salt} state ໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:149
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp /var/lib/salt/.ssh/new_mgr_ssh_id.pub /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/\n"
msgstr "cp /var/lib/salt/.ssh/new_mgr_ssh_id.pub /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:150
msgid "Change back to user `root` again:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນກັບມາເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ `root` ອີກຄັ້ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:151
#, no-wrap
msgid "exit\n"
msgstr "exit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:152
msgid ""
"Rollout the new key to all systems that need it.  Applying the "
"`util.mgr_rotate_saltssh_key` state will limit the changes to `salt-ssh` "
"managed systems and proxies:"
msgstr "ກະຈາຍຄີໃໝ່ໄປຫາທຸກລະບົບທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ການນຳໃຊ້ state `util.mgr_rotate_saltssh_key` ຈະຈຳກັດການປ່ຽນແປງສະເພາະລະບົບທີ່ຈັດການດ້ວຍ `salt-ssh` ແລະ proxies ເທົ່ານັ້ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:153
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:158
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"salt '*' state.apply util.mgr_rotate_saltssh_key\n"
"mgr-salt-ssh '*' state.apply util.mgr_rotate_saltssh_key\n"
msgstr ""
"salt '*' state.apply util.mgr_rotate_saltssh_key\n"
"mgr-salt-ssh '*' state.apply util.mgr_rotate_saltssh_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:154
msgid ""
"Move the old key away and make the new key the standard key.  Rename "
"`mgr_ssh_id` key to `disabled_mgr_ssh_id` and `new_mgr_ssh_id` key to "
"`mgr_ssh_id` in the SSH keystore of the user `salt` as well as in the {salt} "
"filesystem for the public keys:"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍຄີເກົ່າອອກ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄີໃໝ່ເປັນຄີມາດຕະຖານ. ປ່ຽນຊື່ຄີ `mgr_ssh_id` ເປັນ `disabled_mgr_ssh_id` ແລະ ປ່ຽນຊື່ຄີ `new_mgr_ssh_id` ເປັນ `mgr_ssh_id` ໃນ SSH keystore ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ `salt` ລວມເຖິງໃນ {salt} filesystem ສຳລັບ public keys:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:155
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"su -s /bin/bash - salt\n"
"cd .ssh\n"
"mv mgr_ssh_id disabled_mgr_ssh_id\n"
"mv mgr_ssh_id.pub disabled_mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
"mv new_mgr_ssh_id mgr_ssh_id\n"
"mv new_mgr_ssh_id.pub mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
"cd /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/\n"
"mv mgr_ssh_id.pub disabled_mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
"mv new_mgr_ssh_id.pub mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
msgstr ""
"su -s /bin/bash - salt\n"
"cd .ssh\n"
"mv mgr_ssh_id disabled_mgr_ssh_id\n"
"mv mgr_ssh_id.pub disabled_mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
"mv new_mgr_ssh_id mgr_ssh_id\n"
"mv new_mgr_ssh_id.pub mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
"cd /srv/susemanager/salt/salt_ssh/\n"
"mv mgr_ssh_id.pub disabled_mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"
"mv new_mgr_ssh_id.pub mgr_ssh_id.pub\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:156
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: When containerized proxies exist, re-create the configuration to "
"get the new SSH key into the proxy configuration.  Restart the containers "
"with the new configuration.  It is also possible to change the existing "
"configuration on the podman host (`ssh.yaml`).  Change the value of "
"`server_ssh_key_pub` with the content of the current `mgr_ssh_id.pub`."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຫາກມີ containerized proxies, ໃຫ້ສ້າງການກຳນົດຄ່າໃໝ່ເພື່ອເອົາ SSH key ໃໝ່ ເຂົ້າໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ proxy. ຣີສະຕາດ containers ດ້ວຍການກຳນົດຄ່າໃໝ່. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ podman host (`ssh.yaml`) ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຄ່າຂອງ `server_ssh_key_pub` ດ້ວຍເນື້ອໃນຂອງ `mgr_ssh_id.pub` ປະຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:157
msgid ""
"To remove the disabled keys from the `authorized_keys` files of the "
"`salt-ssh` managed systems and the proxies, apply the state a second time:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບຄີທີ່ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ `authorized_keys` ຂອງລະບົບທີ່ຈັດການດ້ວຍ `salt-ssh` ແລະ proxies, ໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ state ນີ້ເປັນຄັ້ງທີສອງ:"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt States and Pillars"
msgstr "Salt States ແລະ Pillars"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:2
msgid ""
"States are configuration templates.  They allow you to describe what each of "
"your systems should look like, including the applications and services that "
"are installed and running.  Salt state files are referred to as SLS (SaLt "
"State) files."
msgstr "States ແມ່ນແມ່ແບບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (configuration templates). ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານອະທິບາຍວ່າແຕ່ລະລະບົບຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະເປັນແນວໃດ, ລວມທັງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ແລະ ບໍລິການຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ໄຟລ໌ Salt state ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າໄຟລ໌ SLS (SaLt State)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:3
msgid ""
"States are applied to the target systems by matching relevant state data to "
"clients.  The state data comes from {productname} in the form of package and "
"custom states."
msgstr "States ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບລະບົບເປົ້າໝາຍໂດຍການຈັບຄູ່ຂໍ້ມູນ state ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບລູກຂ່າຍ. ຂໍ້ມູນ state ມາຈາກ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງແພັກເກດ ແລະ custom states."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can target clients at three specific levels of hierarchy and priority: "
"individual clients, system groups, and organization.  Individual clients "
"have priority over groups, and groups have priority over the organization."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ໃນສາມລະດັບ ແລະ ບຸລິມະສິດ: ລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະໂຕ, ກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ແລະ ອົງກອນ. ລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະໂຕຈະມີບຸລິມະສິດສູງກວ່າກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ກຸ່ມຈະມີບຸລິມະສິດສູງກວ່າອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:6
msgid "The Organization requires that version 1 is installed."
msgstr "ອົງກອນຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງເວີຊັນ 1."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:7
msgid "All clients are part of the same Organization."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນອົງກອນດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:8
msgid "Group A requires that version 2 is installed."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມ A ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງເວີຊັນ 2."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:9
msgid "Client1, Client2, and Client3 are part of Group A."
msgstr "Client1, Client2, ແລະ Client3 ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມ A."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:10
msgid "Group B requires any version installed."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມ B ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງເວີຊັນໃດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:11
msgid "Client4 is part of Group B."
msgstr "Client4 ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມ B."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:12
msgid "Leading to these possible scenarios:"
msgstr "ນຳໄປສູ່ສະຖານະການເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:13
msgid "Client1 wants package removed, package is removed (Client Level)"
msgstr "Client1 ຕ້ອງການລຶບແພັກເກດ, ແພັກເກດຈະຖືກລຶບ (ລະດັບລູກຂ່າຍ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:14
msgid "Client2 wants version 2, gets version 2 (Client Level)"
msgstr "Client2 ຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນ 2, ກໍຈະໄດ້ເວີຊັນ 2 (ລະດັບລູກຂ່າຍ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:15
msgid "Client3 wants any version, gets version 2 (Group Level)"
msgstr "Client3 ຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນໃດກໍໄດ້, ກໍຈະໄດ້ເວີຊັນ 2 (ລະດັບກຸ່ມ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:16
msgid "Client4 wants any version, gets version 1 (Organization Level)"
msgstr "Client4 ຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນໃດກໍໄດ້, ກໍຈະໄດ້ເວີຊັນ 1 (ລະດັບອົງກອນ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information on Salt states, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/states/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt states, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/states/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You can create custom Salt states with {productname}.  For more information, "
"see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-custom-states.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ custom Salt states ດ້ວຍ {productname}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-custom-states.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Group States"
msgstr "Group States"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Pillar data can be used to perform bulk actions, like applying all assigned "
"states to clients within the group.  This section contains some examples of "
"bulk actions that you can take using group states."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Pillar ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກແບບກຸ່ມ (bulk actions) ໄດ້, ເຊັ່ນ: ການໃຊ້ທຸກ states ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍພາຍໃນກຸ່ມ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ມີຕົວຢ່າງບາງຢ່າງຂອງການເຮັດວຽກແບບກຸ່ມ ໂດຍໃຊ້ group states."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To perform these actions, you will need to determine the ID of the group "
"that you want to manipulate.  You can determine the Group ID by using the "
"`spacecmd` command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸ ID ຂອງກຸ່ມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການ. ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸ ID ຂອງກຸ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `spacecmd`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd group_details\n"
msgstr "spacecmd group_details\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:23
msgid "These examples use an example Group ID of `GID`."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ ID ຂອງກຸ່ມສົມມຸດແມ່ນ `GID`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:24
msgid "To apply all states assigned to the group:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ທຸກ states ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -I 'group_ids:GID' state.apply custom.group_GID\n"
msgstr "salt -I 'group_ids:GID' state.apply custom.group_GID\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:26
msgid "To apply any state (whether or not it is assigned to the group):"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ state ໃດໜຶ່ງ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກຸ່ມຫຼືບໍ່):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -I 'group_ids:GID' state.apply `state`\n"
msgstr "salt -I 'group_ids:GID' state.apply `state`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:28
msgid "To apply a custom state:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ custom state:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -I 'group_ids:2130' state.apply manager_org_1.`customstate`\n"
msgstr "salt -I 'group_ids:2130' state.apply manager_org_1.`customstate`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:30
msgid "Apply the highstate to all clients in the group:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ highstate ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດໃນກຸ່ມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -I 'group_ids:GID' state.apply\n"
msgstr "salt -I 'group_ids:GID' state.apply\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Pillars"
msgstr "Salt Pillars"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:33
msgid ""
"{productname} exposes a small amount of internal data as pillars which can "
"be used with custom states.  Pillars are created on the {productname} "
"Server, and contain information about a client or group of clients.  For "
"custom information in pillars, see "
"xref:client-configuration:custom-info.adoc[].  Pillars are useful for "
"sensitive data, configuration of clients, variables, and any arbitrary data."
msgstr "{productname} ເປີດເຜີຍຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງເປັນ pillars ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ custom states. Pillars ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ pillars, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:custom-info.adoc[]. Pillars ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຄັນ (sensitive data), ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ, ຕົວປ່ຽນ (variables), ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Pillars are managed either automatically by {productname}, or manually by "
"the user."
msgstr "Pillars ຖືກຈັດການທັງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ {productname}, ຫຼື ຈັດການດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:35
msgid ""
"If you change pillar data on the server ({salt} master) the actual pillar "
"data on the client (minion) is updated only after calling "
"`saltutil.refresh_pillar` for the client."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ໃນເຊີເວີ ({salt} master), ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ຕົວຈິງໃນລູກຂ່າຍ (minion) ຈະຖືກອັບເດດຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ມີການຮຽກໃຊ້ `saltutil.refresh_pillar` ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Otherwise it could happen that `pillar.items` and `pillar.get` calls would "
"produce different results with different values of pillars that were not "
"refreshed."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນອາດຈະເກີດເຫດການທີ່ການຮຽກໃຊ້ `pillar.items` ແລະ `pillar.get` ໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ຍ້ອນຄ່າຂອງ pillars ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຣີເຟຣຊ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:37
msgid ""
"To avoid hard-coding organization IDs within {sles} files, a pillar entry is "
"added for each organization:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຂຽນ organization IDs ລົງໄປໂດຍກົງ (hard-coding) ໃນໄຟລ໌ {sles}, pillar entry ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະອົງກອນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "org-files-dir: relative_path_to_files\n"
msgstr "org-files-dir: relative_path_to_files\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:39
msgid ""
"The specified file is available for all clients which belong to the "
"organization."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນອົງກອນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:40
msgid "This is an example of a pillar located at `/etc/motd`:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ pillar ທີ່ຢູ່ `/etc/motd`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"file.managed:\n"
"    - source: salt://{{ pillar['org-files-dir']}}/motd\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: 644\n"
msgstr ""
"file.managed:\n"
"    - source: salt://{{ pillar['org-files-dir']}}/motd\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: 644\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:42
msgid ""
"For more information on Salt pillars, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/pillar/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt pillars, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/pillar/."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download Endpoint"
msgstr "ຈຸດດາວໂຫຼດ (Download Endpoint)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:44
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} assumes that the download endpoint to use is the "
"FQDN of the {productname} Server or Proxy.  However, there are some cases "
"where you might like to use a different FQDN as the download endpoint.  The "
"most common example is if you need to use load balancing, caching proxies, "
"or in environments with complicated networking requirements."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະຖືວ່າຈຸດດາວໂຫຼດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ແມ່ນ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ມີບາງກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ FQDN ອື່ນເປັນຈຸດດາວໂຫຼດ. ຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍແມ່ນເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ load balancing, caching proxies, ຫຼື ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຄວາມຕ້ອງການເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:45
msgid ""
"To change the package download endpoint, you can manually adjust three Salt "
"pillars:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈຸດດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດ, ທ່ານສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນສາມ Salt pillars ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:46
msgid "`pkg_download_point_protocol`, defaults to `https`."
msgstr "`pkg_download_point_protocol`, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `https`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:47
msgid ""
"`pkg_download_point_host`, defaults to the FQDN of the {productname} Server "
"(or Proxy, if in use)."
msgstr "`pkg_download_point_host`, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ FQDN ຂອງ {productname} Server (ຫຼື Proxy, ຖ້າມີການນຳໃຊ້)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:48
msgid "`pkg_download_point_port`, defaults to `443`."
msgstr "`pkg_download_point_port`, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `443`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:49
msgid ""
"If you do not adjust these pillars directly, {productname} will fall back to "
"the default values."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ປັບປ່ຽນ pillars ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍກົງ, {productname} ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Changing the Package Download Endpoint Pillar"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນ Pillar ສຳລັບຈຸດດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Navigate to `/srv/pillar/` and create a file called `top.sls` with these "
"contents:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ `/srv/pillar/` ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຊື່ `top.sls` ທີ່ມີເນື້ອຫາຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"base:\n"
"  '*':\n"
"    - pkg_download_points\n"
msgstr ""
"base:\n"
"  '*':\n"
"    - pkg_download_points\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:53
msgid ""
"This example directs Salt to look at the `pkg_download_points.sls` file to "
"determine the base URL to use.  You can adjust this file to target different "
"clients or groups, depending on your environment."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ກຳນົດໃຫ້ Salt ໄປເບິ່ງທີ່ໄຟລ໌ `pkg_download_points.sls` ເພື່ອລະບຸ base URL ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄຟລ໌ນີ້ເພື່ອເນັ້ນໃສ່ລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ຂຶ້ນກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Remain in `/srv/pillar/` and create a file called `pkg_download_points.sls` "
"with the base URLs you want to use."
msgstr "ຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນ `/srv/pillar/` ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຊື່ `pkg_download_points.sls` ພ້ອມກັບ base URLs ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pkg_download_point_protocol: http\n"
"pkg_download_point_host: example.com\n"
"pkg_download_point_port: 444\n"
msgstr ""
"pkg_download_point_protocol: http\n"
"pkg_download_point_host: example.com\n"
"pkg_download_point_port: 444\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:57
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If you want to use external pillars, for example Group IDs, open "
"the master configuration file and set the `ext_pillar_first` parameter to "
"`true`."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ external pillars, ເຊັ່ນ Group IDs, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ master ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີ `ext_pillar_first` ເປັນ `true`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:58
msgid "You can then use Group IDs to set conditional values, for example:"
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Group IDs ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂ, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% if pillar['group_ids'] is defined and 8 in pillar['group_ids'] %}\n"
"  pkg_download_point_protocol: http\n"
"  pkg_download_point_host: example.com\n"
"  pkg_download_point_port: 444\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"  pkg_download_point_protocol: ftp\n"
"  pkg_download_point_host: example.com\n"
"  pkg_download_point_port: 445\n"
"{%- endif %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% if pillar['group_ids'] is defined and 8 in pillar['group_ids'] %}\n"
"  pkg_download_point_protocol: http\n"
"  pkg_download_point_host: example.com\n"
"  pkg_download_point_port: 444\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"  pkg_download_point_protocol: ftp\n"
"  pkg_download_point_host: example.com\n"
"  pkg_download_point_port: 445\n"
"{%- endif %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:60
msgid "OPTIONAL: You can also use grains to set conditional values, for example:"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ grains ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂ, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% if grains['fqdn'] == 'client1.example.com' %}\n"
"    pkg_download_point: example1.com\n"
"{% elif grains['fqdn'] == 'client2.example.com'' %}\n"
"    pkg_download_point: example2.com\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"    pkg_download_point: example.com\n"
"{% endif %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% if grains['fqdn'] == 'client1.example.com' %}\n"
"    pkg_download_point: example1.com\n"
"{% elif grains['fqdn'] == 'client2.example.com'' %}\n"
"    pkg_download_point: example2.com\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"    pkg_download_point: example.com\n"
"{% endif %}\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Terminology"
msgstr "ຄຳສັບສະເພາະ (Terminology)"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Beacon"
msgstr "ບີຄອນ (Beacon)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Beacons allow you to use the Salt event system to monitor non-Salt "
"processes.  Clients can use beacons to connect to various system processes "
"for constant monitoring.  When a monitored activity occurs, an event is sent "
"on the Salt event bus that can then trigger a reactor."
msgstr "Beacons ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ລະບົບເຫດການ (event system) ຂອງ Salt ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມຂະບວນການທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂອງ Salt. ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດໃຊ້ beacons ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຂະບວນການຕ່າງໆ ຂອງລະບົບເພື່ອຕິດຕາມຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ. ເມື່ອກິດຈະກຳທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ເຫດການຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ Salt event bus ຊຶ່ງສາມາດໄປກະຕຸ້ນ reactor ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To use beacons on {sles} Salt clients, install the `python-pyinotify` "
"package.  For {rhel} systems, install the `python-inotify` package."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ beacons ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຂອງ {sles}, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ `python-pyinotify`. ສຳລັບລະບົບ {rhel}, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ `python-inotify`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information on beacons, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/beacons/"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ beacons, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/beacons/"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Broker"
msgstr "ໂບຣກເກີ (Broker)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The Salt broker allows clients to pass commands to each other.  The broker "
"acts like a switch, therefore peer communication will only work for clients "
"on the same network, or connected to the same proxy."
msgstr "Salt broker ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງຫາາກັນໄດ້. Broker ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ຄືກັບສະວິດຊ໌, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ (peer communication) ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍດຽວກັນ ຫຼື ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາພຣັອກຊີໂຕດຽວກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information on Salt and peer communication, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/peer.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt ແລະ ການສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງກຸ່ມ, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/peer.html."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (Environment)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:10
msgid ""
"{productname} implements Salt with a single environment.  Multiple Salt "
"environments are not supported."
msgstr "{productname} ນຳໃຊ້ Salt ດ້ວຍສະພາບແວດລ້ອມດຽວ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ Salt ຫຼາຍອັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Formulas"
msgstr "ຟໍມູລາ (Formulas)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Formulas are collections of Salt States that contain generic parameter "
"fields.  Formulas are used within {productname} to assist with configuring "
"Salt clients.  Some formulas have extensive configuration options, and use "
"forms to help organize them in the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Formulas ແມ່ນການລວບລວມ Salt States ທີ່ປະກອບມີຊ່ອງໃສ່ພາຣາມິເຕີທົ່ວໄປ. Formulas ຖືກໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ {productname} ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ Salt. ບາງ formulas ມີຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ ແລະ ໃຊ້ forms ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຈັດລະບຽບພວກມັນໃນ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information about formulas, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ formulas, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grains"
msgstr "ເກຣນ (Grains)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Grains provide information about the hardware of a client.  This includes "
"the operating system, IP addresses, network interfaces, and memory.  When "
"you run a Salt command any modules and functions are run locally from the "
"system being called."
msgstr "Grains ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຮາດແວຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ລວມມີລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ທີ່ຢູ່ IP, ອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ. ເມື່ອທ່ານລັນຄຳສັ່ງ Salt, ໂມດູນ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆ ຈະຖືກລັນຢູ່ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information on grains, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/grains/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ grains, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/grains/."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Highstate"
msgstr "ໄຮສະເຕດ (Highstate)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:18
msgid ""
"This term is used when you apply all outstanding states to all targeted "
"clients at the same time.  The highstate must be applied when doing changes "
"to systems, including enabling and disabling formulas."
msgstr "ຄຳສັບນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອທ່ານນຳໃຊ້ states ທັງໝົດທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍເປົ້າໝາຍທັງໝົດໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ highstate ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງລະບົບ, ລວມທັງການເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານ formulas."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key Fingerprints"
msgstr "ຄີຟິງເກີພຣິນ (Key Fingerprints)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Key fingerprints are exchanged between the {productname} Server and Salt "
"clients to verify the identity of the server and the client.  This prevents "
"Salt clients from connecting to the wrong server.  You can see the "
"fingerprints of your Salt clients by navigating to menu:Salt[Keys]."
msgstr "Key fingerprints ຈະຖືກແລກປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີທີ່ຜິດ. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງ fingerprints ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ໂດຍການເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Salt[Keys]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Master"
msgstr "ມາສເຕີ (Master)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:22
msgid ""
"The Salt master issues commands to its attached clients.  In {productname}, "
"the Salt master must be the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Salt master ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່. ໃນ {productname}, Salt master ຈະຕ້ອງແມ່ນເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minions"
msgstr "ມິນນຽນ (Minions)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Salt clients that are connected to and controlled by the {salt} master on "
"the {productname} Server.  In {productname}, these are sometimes referred to "
"as {salt} clients.  This is a difference in terminology only."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ {salt} master ໃນ {productname} Server. ໃນ {productname}, ບາງຄັ້ງຈະເອີ້ນພວກມັນວ່າ {salt} clients. ນີ້ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງໃນການເອີ້ນຊື່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ (Modules)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Functions within Salt are stored in modules.  Salt modules are stored on "
"clients and the {productname} Server within the "
"`/usr/lib/python*/site-packages/salt/` directory.  There are many types of "
"Salt modules, including state and execution modules.  You can write your own "
"Salt modules using Python."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆພາຍໃນ Salt ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໂມດູນ. ໂມດູນ Salt ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ {productname} Server ພາຍໃຕ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/usr/lib/python*/site-packages/salt/`. ມັນມີໂມດູນ Salt ຫຼາຍປະເພດ, ລວມທັງ state ແລະ execution modules. ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນໂມດູນ Salt ຂອງທ່ານເອງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາສາ Python."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For a complete list of available Salt modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/index.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ທັງໝົດຂອງໂມດູນ Salt ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/index.html."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pillars"
msgstr "ພິລລາ (Pillars)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Pillars are created on the {productname} Server.  They contain information "
"about a client or group of clients.  Pillars allow you to send confidential "
"information to a targeted client or group of clients.  Pillars are useful "
"for sensitive data, configuration of clients, variables, and any arbitrary "
"data."
msgstr "Pillars ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}. ພວກມັນມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. Pillars ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເປັນຄວາມລັບໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມເປົ້າໝາຍໄດ້. Pillars ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຄັນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ, ຕົວປ່ຽນ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For more information on pillars, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/pillar.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ pillars, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/pillar.html."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "States"
msgstr "ສະເຕດ (States)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:32
msgid ""
"States are configuration templates.  They allow you to describe what each of "
"your systems should look like, including the applications and services that "
"are installed and running.  States are applied to the target client.  This "
"automates the process of bringing a large number of systems into a known "
"state, and then maintaining them."
msgstr "States ແມ່ນແມ່ແບບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານອະທິບາຍວ່າແຕ່ລະລະບົບຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະເປັນແນວໃດ, ລວມທັງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ແລະ ບໍລິການທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. States ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍເປົ້າໝາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ເປັນໄປແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ບຳລຸງຮັກສາພວກມັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Do not update the `salt` package using states.  Update all other system "
"packages using states.  You can then update the `salt` package from the "
"{productname} {webui} as a separate step."
msgstr "ຫ້າມອັບເດດແພັກເກດ `salt` ໂດຍໃຊ້ states. ໃຫ້ອັບເດດແພັກເກດລະບົບອື່ນໆທັງໝົດໂດຍໃຊ້ states. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດອັບເດດແພັກເກດ `salt` ຈາກ {productname} {webui} ເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:34
msgid ""
"For more information on states, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/starting_states.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ states, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/starting_states.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-terminology.adoc:35
msgid ""
"For more Salt terminology, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/glossary.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳສັບອື່ນໆຂອງ Salt, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/glossary.html."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{salt} timeouts"
msgstr "{salt} timeouts"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "General {salt} timeouts"
msgstr "ຄ່າ timeout ທົ່ວໄປຂອງ {salt}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{salt} features two timeout parameters called `timeout` and "
"`gather_job_timeout` that are relevant during the execution of {salt} "
"commands and jobs--it does not matter whether they are triggered using the "
"command line interface or API.  These two parameters are explained in the "
"following article."
msgstr "{salt} ມີພາລາມິເຕີ timeout ສອງຢ່າງຄື `timeout` ແລະ `gather_job_timeout` ເຊິ່ງກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ ວຽກຂອງ {salt} ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຖືກສັ່ງຜ່ານ command line ຫຼື API. ສອງພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຖືກອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນບົດຄວາມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:4
msgid "This is a normal workflow when all clients are well reachable:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກປົກກະຕິເມື່ອສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດໄດ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:5
msgid "A {salt} command or job is executed:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ ຫຼື ວຽກຂອງ {salt} ຖືກປະຕິບັດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt '*' test.ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:7
msgid ""
"{salt} master publishes the job with the targeted clients into the {salt} "
"PUB channel."
msgstr "{salt} master ເຜີຍແຜ່ວຽກໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍເປົ້າໝາຍຜ່ານຊ່ອງທາງ {salt} PUB."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:8
msgid "Clients take that job and start working on it."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຮັບວຽກນັ້ນໄປ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{salt} master is looking at the {salt} RET channel to gather responses from "
"the clients."
msgstr "{salt} master ຈະເບິ່ງຢູ່ທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງ {salt} RET ເພື່ອລວບລວມການຕອບກັບຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If {salt} master gets all responses from targeted clients, then everything "
"is completed and {salt} master will return a response containing all the "
"client responses."
msgstr "ຖ້າ {salt} master ໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບກັບທັງໝົດຈາກລູກຂ່າຍເປົ້າໝາຍ, ຖືວ່າທຸກຢ່າງສຳເລັດ ແລະ {salt} master ຈະສົ່ງຜົນລັດທີ່ປະກອບມີການຕອບກັບຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:11
msgid ""
"If some of the clients are down during this process, the workflow continues "
"as follows:"
msgstr "ຖ້າມີບາງລູກຂ່າຍປິດຢູ່ (down) ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການນີ້, ຂັ້ນຕອນຈະດຳເນີນຕໍ່ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If `timeout` is reached before getting all expected responses from the "
"clients, then {salt} master would trigger an aditional job (a {salt} "
"`find_job` job) targeting only pending clients to check whether the job is "
"already running on the client."
msgstr "ຖ້າຮອດເວລາ `timeout` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບກັບທັງໝົດຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ, {salt} master ຈະສົ່ງວຽກເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ວຽກ `find_job` ຂອງ {salt}) ໂດຍເນັ້ນໃສ່ສະເພາະລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງຢູ່ ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າວຽກນັ້ນກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:13
msgid "Now `gather_job_timeout` is evaluated.  A new counter is now triggered."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ `gather_job_timeout` ຈະຖືກປະເມີນ. ຕົວນັບເວລາໃໝ່ຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If this new `find_job` job responds that the original job is actually "
"running on the client, then {salt} master will wait for that client's "
"response for another `gather_job_timeout` interval before issuing the next "
"`find_job` job."
msgstr "ຖ້າວຽກ `find_job` ໃໝ່ນີ້ຕອບກັບວ່າວຽກເດີມກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ, {salt} master ຈະລໍຖ້າການຕອບກັບຈາກລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນອີກໄລຍະໜຶ່ງຕາມ `gather_job_timeout` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງ `find_job` ຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In case of reaching `gather_job_timeout` without having any response from "
"the client (neither for the initial `test.ping` nor for the `find_job` job), "
"{salt} master will return with only the gathered responses from the "
"responding clients."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຮອດເວລາ `gather_job_timeout` ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຕອບກັບໃດໆຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນ `test.ping` ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ວຽກ `find_job`), {salt} master ຈະສົ່ງກັບຄືນສະເພາະຜົນລັດທີ່ລວບລວມໄດ້ຈາກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕອບກັບມາເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:16
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} globally sets `timeout` and `gather_job_timeout` "
"to 120 seconds.  So, in the worst case, a {salt} call targeting unreachable "
"clients will end up _with 240 seconds of waiting_ until getting a response."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຕັ້ງຄ່າ `timeout` ແລະ `gather_job_timeout` ໄວ້ທີ່ 120 ວິນາທີ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຮ້າຍແຮງທີ່ສຸດ, ການຮຽກໃຊ້ {salt} ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈະຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າເຖິງ 240 ວິນາທີກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບກັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:17
msgid ""
"You can configure these values differently by creating a "
"`/etc/salt/master.d/custom.conf` configuration file according to syntax in "
"`/etc/salt/master.conf`."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້ໂດຍການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `/etc/salt/master.d/custom.conf` ຕາມຫຼັກໄວຍາກອນໃນ `/etc/salt/master.conf`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Presence Ping Timeouts"
msgstr "ການໝົດເວລາຂອງ Presence Ping"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Before Actions are executed on {salt} clients, whether they scheduled via "
"the Web UI or the API, {productname} performs a \"presence ping\" command to "
"ensure the respective `salt-minion` processes are active and able to "
"respond.  Then, a ping gather job runs on the {salt} master to handle the "
"incoming pings from the clients.  Actual commands will begin only after all "
"clients have either responded to the ping, or timed out."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ Actions ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດໃນລູກຂ່າຍ {salt}, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຖືກກຳນົດເວລາຜ່ານ Web UI ຫຼື API, {productname} ຈະດຳເນີນຄຳສັ່ງ \"presence ping\" ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂະບວນການ `salt-minion` ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງນັ້ນຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ແລະ ສາມາດຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ວຽກ ping gather ຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນ {salt} master ເພື່ອຈັດການກັບການ ping ທີ່ເຂົ້າມາຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ. ຄຳສັ່ງຕົວຈິງຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນຫຼັງຈາກລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດໄດ້ຕອບກັບ ping ຫຼື ຮອດເວລາ timeout ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The presence ping is an ordinary {salt} command, but is not subject to the "
"same timeout parameters as all other {salt} commands "
"(`timeout`/`gather_job_timeout`, described above).  Rather, it has its own "
"parameters "
"(`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`/`java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout`) "
"that can be set in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`."
msgstr "Presence ping ແມ່ນຄຳສັ່ງ {salt} ທົ່ວໄປ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີ timeout ອັນດຽວກັບຄຳສັ່ງ {salt} ອື່ນໆ (`timeout`/`gather_job_timeout` ທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ). ແຕ່ມັນມີພາລາມິເຕີຂອງມັນເອງ (`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`/`java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout`) ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໃນ `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To allow for quicker detection of unresponsive clients, the timeout values "
"for presence pings are by default significantly shorter than the general "
"defaults.  You can configure the presence ping parameters in "
"`/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`, however the default values should be sufficient in most "
"cases."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດກວດພົບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ, ຄ່າ timeout ສຳລັບ presence pings ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະສັ້ນກວ່າຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທົ່ວໄປຫຼາຍ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີ presence ping ໄດ້ໃນ `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`, ແນວໃດກໍຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກໍພຽງພໍແລ້ວໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:22
msgid ""
"A lower total presence ping timeout value will increase the chance of false "
"negatives.  In some cases, a client might be marked as non-responding, when "
"it is responding but did not respond quickly enough.  Additionally, setting "
"this total presence ping timeout value too low could result in a client "
"hanging at the boot screen.  A higher total presence ping timeout will "
"increase the accuracy of the test, as even slow clients will respond to the "
"presence ping before timing out.  Additionally, a higher presence ping "
"timeout could limit throughput if you are targeting a large number of "
"clients, when some of them are slow."
msgstr "ຄ່າການໝົດເວລາ presence ping ທີ່ຕ່ຳເກີນໄປ ຈະເພີ່ມໂອກາດຂອງຄວາມຜິດພາດ (false negatives). ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ລູກຂ່າຍອາດຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ ທັງທີ່ມັນກຳລັງຕອບສະໜອງຢູ່ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄວພໍ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄ່ານີ້ຕ່ຳເກີນໄປອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍຄ້າງຢູ່ໜ້າຈໍບູດ. ຄ່າ presence ping ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳໃນການທົດສອບ, ເພາະວ່າແມ່ນແຕ່ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຊ້າກໍຈະມີເວລາຕອບກັບກ່ອນໝົດເວລາ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຄ່າທີ່ສູງເກີນໄປອາດຈະຈຳກັດປະສິດທິພາບການເຮັດວຽກ (throughput) ຖ້າທ່ານກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ໂດຍທີ່ມີບາງໂຕເຮັດວຽກຊ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:23
msgid ""
"If a client does not reply to a ping within the allocated time, it is marked "
"as `not available`, and is excluded from the command.  The {webui} shows a "
"`minion is down or could not be contacted` message in this case."
msgstr "ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ຕອບກັບ ping ພາຍໃນເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ, ມັນຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າ `ບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ` (not available) ແລະ ຈະຖືກຕັດອອກຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ {webui} ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າ `minion is down or could not be contacted`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The presence ping timeout parameter changes the timeout setting for the "
"presence ping, in seconds.  Adjust the `java.salt_presence_ping_timeout` "
"parameter.  Defaults to 4 seconds."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີ presence ping timeout ຈະປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ timeout ສຳລັບ presence ping (ເປັນວິນາທີ). ໃຫ້ປັບພາລາມິເຕີ `java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 4 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The presence ping gather job parameter changes the timeout setting for "
"gathering the presence ping, in seconds.  Adjust the "
"`java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout` parameter.  Defaults to 1 "
"second."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີ presence ping gather job ຈະປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ timeout ສຳລັບການລວບລວມ presence ping (ເປັນວິນາທີ). ໃຫ້ປັບພາລາມິເຕີ `java.salt_presence_ping_gather_job_timeout`. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1 ວິນາທີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "{salt} SSH Clients (SSH Push)"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} SSH (SSH Push)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:27
msgid ""
"{salt} SSH clients are slightly different than regular clients (zeromq).  "
"{salt} SSH clients do not use {salt} PUB/RET channels but a wrapper {salt} "
"command inside of an SSH call.  {salt} `timeout` and `gather_job_timeout` "
"are not playing a role here."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} SSH ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງເລັກນ້ອຍຈາກລູກຂ່າຍປົກກະຕິ (zeromq). ລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} SSH ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ {salt} PUB/RET ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ wrapper ຂອງ {salt} ພາຍໃນການຮຽກໃຊ້ SSH. ຄ່າ `timeout` ແລະ `gather_job_timeout` ຂອງ {salt} ຈະບໍ່ມີບົດບາດໃນທີ່ນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:28
msgid "{productname} defines a timeout for SSH connections in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr "{productname} ກຳນົດຄ່າ timeout ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໃນ `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-timeouts.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "# salt_ssh_connect_timeout = 180\n"
msgstr "# salt_ssh_connect_timeout = 180\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Often Used Salt Commands"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains the most commonly used Salt commands.  For a complete "
"list of available Salt commands, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/cli/index.html."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆທີ່ສຸດ. ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/cli/index.html."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-run"
msgstr "salt-run"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:4
msgid "Display all clients that are running:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-run manage.up\n"
msgstr "salt-run manage.up\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:6
msgid "Display all clients that are not running:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-run manage.down\n"
msgstr "salt-run manage.down\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:8
msgid "Display the current status of all Salt clients:"
msgstr "ສະແດງສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທັງໝົດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-run manage.status\n"
msgstr "salt-run manage.status\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Check the version of Salt running on the {productname} Server and active "
"clients:"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງເວີຊັນຂອງ Salt ທີ່ລັນຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-run manage.versions\n"
msgstr "salt-run manage.versions\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-cp"
msgstr "salt-cp"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:13
msgid "Copy a file to a client or set of clients:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ຊຸດຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-cp '*' foo.conf /root\n"
msgstr "salt-cp '*' foo.conf /root\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -l"
msgstr "salt-key -l"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:16
msgid "List public keys:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຄີສາທາລະນະ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -l all\n"
msgstr "salt-key -l all\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -a my-minion"
msgstr "salt-key -a my-minion"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:19
msgid "Accept pending key for a minion:"
msgstr "ຍອມຮັບຄີທີ່ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າ (pending key) ສຳລັບ minion:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -a my-minion\n"
msgstr "salt-key -a my-minion\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -A"
msgstr "salt-key -A"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:22
msgid "Accept all pending keys:"
msgstr "ຍອມຮັບຄີທີ່ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າທັງໝົດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -A\n"
msgstr "salt-key -A\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt grains"
msgstr "salt grains"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:25
msgid "List all available grains:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ grains ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:27
msgid "List collected grain system data:"
msgstr "ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ລວບລວມມາຈາກ grains:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' grains.items\n"
msgstr "salt '*' grains.items\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Using Yomi"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ Yomi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Yomi (yet one more installer) is an installer for {suse} and openSUSE "
"operating systems.  Yomi is designed as a Salt state, and can be used for "
"installing {suse} operating systems on new systems."
msgstr "Yomi (yet one more installer) ແມ່ນຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse} ແລະ openSUSE. Yomi ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ເປັນ Salt state, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse} ລົງໃນລະບົບໃໝ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, Yomi can be used as part of provisioning new clients, as "
"an alternative to AutoYaST."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, Yomi ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງການຈັດຽມ (provisioning) ລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ເຊິ່ງເປັນທາງເລືອກນອກຈາກ AutoYaST."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:4
msgid "Yomi consists of two components:"
msgstr "Yomi ປະກອບມີສອງສ່ວນປະກອບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The Yomi formula, which contains the Salt states and modules required to "
"perform the installation."
msgstr "Yomi formula, ຊຶ່ງປະກອບມີ Salt states ແລະ ໂມດູນຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The operating system image, which includes the pre-configured `salt-minion` "
"service."
msgstr "ອິມເມຈລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ເຊິ່ງລວມມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍລິການ `salt-minion` ໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Both components can be used independently of {productname}, or integrated "
"with it.  This section describes how to use it with {productname}."
msgstr "ທັງສອງສ່ວນປະກອບສາມາດໃຊ້ແຍກຈາກ {productname} ໄດ້, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນກໍໄດ້. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການໃຊ້ມັນຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information about using Yomi independently, see "
"https://github.com/openSUSE/yomi."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ Yomi ແບບແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://github.com/openSUSE/yomi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For build assets, see "
"https://build.opensuse.org/project/show/systemsmanagement:yomi."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຊັບສິນການສ້າງ (build assets), ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://build.opensuse.org/project/show/systemsmanagement:yomi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:10
msgid "To use Yomi for installing a client operating system, follow this process:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ Yomi ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:11
msgid "Install the `yomi-formula` package."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ `yomi-formula`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:12
msgid "Prepare the Salt pillar for the new installation."
msgstr "ກຽມ Salt pillar ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:13
msgid "Boot the new client using the PXE boot image for Yomi."
msgstr "ບູດລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ PXE boot image ສຳລັບ Yomi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:14
msgid ""
"To use Yomi with {productname}, ensure you have enough available memory.  To "
"boot from USB or DVD image, you need at least 512{nbsp}MB.  To boot from a "
"PXE server, you need at least 2{nbsp}GB."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ Yomi ກັບ {productname}, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳພຽງພໍ. ໃນການບູດຈາກ USB ຫຼື DVD image, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 512MB. ໃນການບູດຈາກ PXE server, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 2GB."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Yomi Formula"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Yomi Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to install the Yomi formula, which is available "
"as a package in {productname}."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ Yomi formula, ຊຶ່ງມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການເປັນແພັກເກດໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The `yomi-formula` package contains the Salt states and modules that "
"describe the Yomi state, and the formulas with forms to create the pillar.  "
"It also contains documentation about the different sections of the pillar, "
"and some examples about how to parameterize installations based on openSUSE, "
"MicroOS, or SLE."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ `yomi-formula` ບັນຈຸ Salt states ແລະ ໂມດູນທີ່ອະທິບາຍສະຖານະຂອງ Yomi, ແລະ formulas ພ້ອມກັບຟອມເພື່ອສ້າງ pillar. ມັນຍັງມີເອກະສານກ່ຽວກັບພາກສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງ pillar ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີການຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍອີງໃສ່ openSUSE, MicroOS ຫຼື SLE."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:18
msgid "The formula package performs these actions:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ formula ຈະເຮັດວຽກເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Adds a new configuration file called `yomi-formula.conf` in the "
"`/etc/salt/master.d/` directory.  This configuration file defines the Python "
"module and Salt states required by Yomi."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ຊື່ `yomi-formula.conf` ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/etc/salt/master.d/`. ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ກຳນົດໂມດູນ Python ແລະ Salt states ທີ່ Yomi ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Installs the Yomi Salt states in the `/usr/share/salt-formulas/states/` "
"directory."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Yomi Salt states ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/usr/share/salt-formulas/states/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Provides some example configuration files in the `/usr/share/yomi/` "
"directory."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງຢ່າງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/usr/share/yomi/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Installs the required forms and sub-forms in the "
"`/usr/share/salt-formulas/metadata/` directory."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງຟອມ ແລະ ຟອມຍ່ອຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/usr/share/salt-formulas/metadata/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:23
msgid "Provides some pillar examples in the `/usr/share/yomi/pillar/` directory."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງ pillar ບາງຢ່າງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/usr/share/yomi/pillar/`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the Yomi Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Yomi Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more information about the Yomi formula, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Yomi formula, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the PXE Image"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ PXE Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To provision a new client, you need an operating system image to boot from.  "
"You can use any image that contains a `salt-minion` service enabled, "
"together with a minimal set of tools that are required during the "
"installation, for example `parted` or `btrfstools`."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຈັດຕຽມລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການອິມເມຈລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເພື່ອໃຊ້ບູດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ອິມເມຈໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ມີການເປີດໃຊ້ບໍລິການ `salt-minion` ພ້ອມກັບຊຸດເຄື່ອງມືພື້ນຖານທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ ເຊັ່ນ `parted` ຫຼື `btrfstools`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Yomi provides an already prepared image, based on openSUSE Tumbleweed, "
"openSUSE Leap (for {uyuni}), or SLE (for {susemgr}).  For {productname}, the "
"image is packaged as an RPM.  This is done in a similar way to how "
"`pxe-default-image` is distributed."
msgstr "Yomi ໄດ້ຈັດຕຽມອິມເມຈໄວ້ແລ້ວ ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ openSUSE Tumbleweed, openSUSE Leap (ສຳລັບ {uyuni}), ຫຼື SLE (ສຳລັບ {susemgr}). ສຳລັບ {productname}, ອິມເມຈຈະຖືກແພັກເປັນ RPM ເຊິ່ງຄ້າຍຄືກັບວິທີການແຈກຢາຍ `pxe-default-image`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The package installs a standard PXE OEM image generated by Kiwi, the initial "
"kernel and initrd in the `/srv/pxe-yomi-image/` directory, and the second "
"stage kernel, initrd and image in the `/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image` directory."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດຈະຕິດຕັ້ງອິມເມຈ PXE OEM ມາດຕະຖານທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ Kiwi, kernel ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ initrd ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/srv/pxe-yomi-image/`, ແລະ kernel ຂັ້ນຕອນທີສອງ, initrd ແລະ ອິມເມຈໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the PXE Image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ PXE Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:35
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:37
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, install the "
"`pxe-yomi-image` service:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງບໍລິການ `pxe-yomi-image`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in pxe-yomi-image-sle15\n"
msgstr "zypper in pxe-yomi-image-sle15\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15\n"
msgstr "zypper in pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:39
msgid "When you have the package installed, you can register Yomi in {cobbler}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດລົງທະບຽນ Yomi ໃນ {cobbler} ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Yomi in {cobbler}"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ Yomi ໃນ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:41
msgid ""
"{productname} uses {cobbler} to manage the PXE boot service, so you will "
"need to register the image in {cobbler}."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ {cobbler} ເພື່ອຈັດການບໍລິການ PXE boot, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນ image ໃນ {cobbler}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering the Yomi Image in {cobbler}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນ Yomi Image ໃນ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:43
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, create a "
"directory for the Yomi image:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີສຳລັບ Yomi image:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image\n"
msgstr "mkdir /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Define a distribution in {cobbler}, including the path to install the second "
"stage kernel and initrd, the location of the full image, and any further "
"kernel options."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ distribution ໃນ {cobbler}, ລວມທັງເສັ້ນທາງການຕິດຕັ້ງພາກສ່ວນທີສອງຂອງ kernel ແລະ initrd, ບ່ອນເກັບ image ເຕັມ, ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກ kernel ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Adjust this command to include the correct version of the product, and the "
"TFTP server address:"
msgstr "ປັບຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃຫ້ລວມເອົາເວີຊັນຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ TFTP server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler distro add \\\n"
"  --name=pxe-yomi-image \\\n"
"  --kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/linux \\\n"
"  --initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/initrd \\\n"
"  "
"--boot-files='/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.initrd "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.kernel "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.md5=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.md5 "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.config.bootoptions=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15-x86_64-1.0.0.config.bootoptions "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.xz' "
"\\\n"
"  --kernel-options='rd.kiwi.install.pxe "
"rd.kiwi.install.image=tftp://<server-address>/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz "
"rd.kiwi.ramdisk ramdisk_size=2097152 net.ifnames=1'\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler distro add \\\n"
"  --name=pxe-yomi-image \\\n"
"  --kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/linux \\\n"
"  --initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/initrd \\\n"
"  --boot-files='/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.initrd /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.kernel /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.md5=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.md5 /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.config.bootoptions=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15-x86_64-1.0.0.config.bootoptions /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.xz' \\\n"
"  --kernel-options='rd.kiwi.install.pxe rd.kiwi.install.image=tftp://<server-address>/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz rd.kiwi.ramdisk ramdisk_size=2097152 net.ifnames=1'\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler distro add \\\n"
"  --name=pxe-yomi-image \\\n"
"  --kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/linux \\\n"
"  --initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/initrd \\\n"
"  "
"--boot-files='/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.initrd "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.kernel "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.md5=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.md5 "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.config.bootoptions=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15-x86_64-1.0.0.config.bootoptions "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.xz' "
"\\\n"
"  --kernel-options='rd.kiwi.install.pxe "
"rd.kiwi.install.image=tftp://<server-address>/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz "
"rd.kiwi.ramdisk ramdisk_size=2097152 net.ifnames=1'\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler distro add \\\n"
"  --name=pxe-yomi-image \\\n"
"  --kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/linux \\\n"
"  --initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/initrd \\\n"
"  --boot-files='/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.initrd /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.kernel /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.md5=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.md5 /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.config.bootoptions=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15-x86_64-1.0.0.config.bootoptions /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.xz' \\\n"
"  --kernel-options='rd.kiwi.install.pxe rd.kiwi.install.image=tftp://<server-address>/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz rd.kiwi.ramdisk ramdisk_size=2097152 net.ifnames=1'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:49
msgid ""
"By default, the `salt-minion` service in `pxe-yomi-image` is configured to "
"find the Salt master under the `salt` address.  If the DNS server is not "
"able to resolve this address, you need to adjust the `kernel-options` "
"parameter from the {cobbler} command that register the distribution, and add "
"a new kernel command line of `ym.master=master_address`.  This will override "
"the default configuration for the `salt-minion`."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ບໍລິການ `salt-minion` ໃນ `pxe-yomi-image` ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຊອກຫາ Salt master ຜ່ານທີ່ຢູ່ `salt`. ຖ້າ DNS ເຊີເວີບໍ່ສາມາດແປທີ່ຢູ່ນີ້ໄດ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບພາລາມິເຕີ `kernel-options` ຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ {cobbler} ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ distribution ແລະ ເພີ່ມ kernel command line ໃໝ່ແມ່ນ `ym.master=master_address`. ນີ້ຈະເປັນການຂຽນທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ `salt-minion`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering the Yomi Profile in {cobbler}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນ Yomi Profile ໃນ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:51
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, define a "
"profile in {cobbler} based on the image."
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ profile ໃນ {cobbler} ໂດຍອີງຕາມ image ນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler profile add \\\n"
"  --name pxe-yomi-profile \\\n"
"  --distro=pxe-yomi-image\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler profile add \\\n"
"  --name pxe-yomi-profile \\\n"
"  --distro=pxe-yomi-image\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:53
msgid "OPTIONAL: Create a system in {cobbler}."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ສ້າງ system ໃນ {cobbler}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:54
msgid ""
"If you know the MAC address for the new client to be provisioned, you can "
"have it boot directly from the Yomi image."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຮູ້ MAC address ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ມັນບູດໂດຍກົງຈາກ Yomi image ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler system add \\\n"
"   --name=yomi \\\n"
"   --mac=00:11:22:33:44:55 \\\n"
"   --profile=pxe-yomi-profile\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler system add \\\n"
"   --name=yomi \\\n"
"   --mac=00:11:22:33:44:55 \\\n"
"   --profile=pxe-yomi-profile\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:56
msgid ""
"When the new node has been provisioned, remove the temporary {cobbler} "
"system:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ node ໃໝ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລຶບ system ຊົ່ວຄາວໃນ {cobbler} ອອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler system remove --name=yomi\n"
msgstr "cobbler system remove --name=yomi\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Salt Pillar Preparation"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການກຽມ Salt Pillar"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:59
msgid ""
"The parameters of the new installation are defined with a Salt pillar.  The "
"pillar includes parameters that the Yomi state requires during the "
"installation, including the partitions, file systems, repositories, packages "
"installed, and services enabled."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ຈະຖືກກຳນົດດ້ວຍ Salt pillar. Pillar ລວມເອົາພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ Yomi state ຕ້ອງການໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ລວມທັງການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ (partitions), ລະບົບໄຟລ໌, ຄັງຊອບແວ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ບໍລິການທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:60
msgid ""
"The pillar is defined using the formulas with forms.  In this example, we "
"prepare the pillar for a minimal openSUSE Tumbleweed installation.  You can "
"find examples for MicroOS or SLES in the example directory "
"`/usr/share/yomi/pillar/`."
msgstr "Pillar ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍໃຊ້ formulas ພ້ອມກັບຟອມ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາກຽມ pillar ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ openSUSE Tumbleweed ແບບພື້ນຖານທີ່ສຸດ (minimal). ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ MicroOS ຫຼື SLES ໄດ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຕົວຢ່າງ `/usr/share/yomi/pillar/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:61
msgid ""
"To begin, boot the client that you want to provision using the Yomi PXE boot "
"image, using the {cobbler} procedures described earlier in this section."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ບູດລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ Yomi PXE boot image ຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ {cobbler} ທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:62
msgid ""
"When the `salt-minion` service is running on the new client, accept the key "
"by navigating to menu:Salt[Keys].  When the key is accepted, you can view "
"and manage the client by navigating to menu:Systems[Overview].  Navigate to "
"the `Formulas` tab, and add all the Yomi Installer formulas to the client.  "
"When you have added all the formulas, complete the forms and sub-forms.  "
"This section outlines each form and provides example settings for a minimal "
"installation.  For a detailed explanation of every option, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອບໍລິການ `salt-minion` ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຍອມຮັບຄີ (key) ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ Salt[Keys]. ເມື່ອຄີຖືກຍອມຮັບແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ Systems[Overview]. ຈາກນັ້ນໄປທີ່ແທັບ `Formulas`, ແລະ ເພີ່ມທຸກ Yomi Installer formulas ໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ. ເມື່ອເພີ່ມແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຟອມ ແລະ ຟອມຍ່ອຍໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະສະຫຼຸບແຕ່ລະຟອມ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບພື້ນຖານ. ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງແຕ່ລະຕົວເລືອກ, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:64
msgid ""
"The Yomi form contains some general configuration options.  For example, the "
"keyboard language and layout, the locale information, and the option to "
"perform a full reset of the system after provisioning."
msgstr "Yomi form ປະກອບມີບາງຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປ. ເຊັ່ນ: ພາສາ ແລະ ຜັງຄີບອດ (keyboard layout), ຂໍ້ມູນ locale, ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອຣີເຊັດລະບົບທັງໝົດຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:65
msgid "For this example, set the `Reboot` parameter to `yes`."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີ `Reboot` ເປັນ `yes`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:67
msgid ""
"This sub-form provides information about the devices, partitioning, file "
"system (including the BtrFS subvolumes, for example), and LVM and RAID "
"configuration."
msgstr "Sub-form ນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບອຸປະກອນ, ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ, ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ (ລວມທັງ BtrFS subvolumes), ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ LVM ແລະ RAID."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:68
msgid ""
"For this example, we assume that the new client has a single device named "
"`/dev/sda`, and that it belongs to a non-UEFI system.  In this case, we have "
"only three partitions: one for the boot loader, one for swap and one for the "
"system.  We also expect to have an ext4 file system for the root directory."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ມີອຸປະກອນດຽວຊື່ `/dev/sda` ແລະ ເປັນລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ UEFI. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ພວກເຮົາມີພຽງສາມພາກສ່ວນ: ໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ boot loader, ໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ swap ແລະ ອີກໜຶ່ງສຳລັບລະບົບ. ພວກເຮົາຍັງກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ext4 ສຳລັບ root directory."

