msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີ `Kernel` ສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບພາກສ່ວນ `append` ຂອງ GRUB."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:101
msgid ""
"This form provides the different repositories and packages to install.  You "
"can also register the product in this form, using SUSEConnect, and install "
"the different modules after registering."
msgstr "Form ນີ້ກຳນົດຄັງຊອບແວ ແລະ ແພັກເກດຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລົງທະບຽນຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນ form ນີ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ SUSEConnect, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງໂມດູນຕ່າງໆ ຫຼັງຈາກລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:102
msgid ""
"For this example we are going to install a very minimal openSUSE Tumbleweed "
"distribution, using publicly available repositories.  For production "
"deployments, you will need to provide a local repository."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ openSUSE Tumbleweed ແບບພື້ນຖານທີ່ສຸດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄັງຊອບແວສາທາລະນະ. ສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບຈິງ (production), ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຄັງຊອບແວພາຍໃນ (local repository)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:103
msgid "Add a new repository:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄັງຊອບແວໃໝ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:104
msgid "Repository Name: repo-oss"
msgstr "Repository Name: repo-oss"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:105
msgid "Repository URL: http://download.opensuse.org/tumbleweed/repo/oss/"
msgstr "Repository URL: http://download.opensuse.org/tumbleweed/repo/oss/"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:106
msgid "Add these packages:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:107
msgid "pattern:enhanced_base"
msgstr "pattern:enhanced_base"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:108
msgid "glibc-locale"
msgstr "glibc-locale"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:109
msgid "kernel-default"
msgstr "kernel-default"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:110
msgid ""
"You can also add patterns and products, together with packages, by using the "
"correct prefix."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມ patterns ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນ, ພ້ອມກັບແພັກເກດ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ prefix ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:112
msgid ""
"By default Yomi is installed with the `salt-minion` service, but you must "
"enable it."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Yomi ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງພ້ອມກັບບໍລິການ `salt-minion`, ແຕ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:113
msgid "Add a new enabled service:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມບໍລິການທີ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ໃໝ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:114
msgid "Service 1:"
msgstr "Service 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:115
msgid "Service: salt-minion"
msgstr "Service: salt-minion"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:117
msgid ""
"This form sets out the system users.  In this example, we have a single root "
"user.  To provide a password, you must use the hashed version of the "
"password, not the plain text.  This behavior is set to be changed in future "
"versions of Yomi."
msgstr "Form ນີ້ກຳນົດຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້,ພວກເຮົາມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ພຽງຄົນດຽວ. ໃນການຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານແບບ hashed (hashed version), ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ. ຮູບແບບນີ້ອາດຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃນເວີຊັນຕໍ່ໆ ໄປຂອງ Yomi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:118
msgid "User 1:"
msgstr "User 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:119
msgid "Username: root"
msgstr "Username: root"

