msgid "Password Hash: $1$wYJUgpM5$RXMMeASDc035eXNbYWFl0"
msgstr "Password Hash: $1$wYJUgpM5$RXMMeASDc035eXNbYWFl0"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitor the Installation"
msgstr "ຕິດຕາມການຕິດຕັ້ງ (Monitor the Installation)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:122
msgid ""
"You can monitor the installation as it progresses, using the `monitor` tool "
"from Yomi.  You can continue monitoring as the highstate is applied to the "
"new client.  To use the tool, you will need to have enabled `Events` in the "
"Yomi formula, and have the `salt-api` service activated."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື `monitor` ຈາກ Yomi. ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມຕໍ່ໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ highstate ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ `Events` ໃນ Yomi formula ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ບໍລິການ `salt-api`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:123
msgid ""
"For more information about the `salt-api` service, and how to use the "
"`monitor` tool, see https://github.com/openSUSE/yomi."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບໍລິການ `salt-api` ແລະ ວິທີໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື `monitor`, ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/openSUSE/yomi."

