#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/partials/snippet-ptf-loss-during-upgrade.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Risk of Automated Version Downgrade and PTF Loss*\n"
msgstr "*ຄວາມສ່ຽງຂອງການຫຼຸດເວີຊັນອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ການສູນເສຍ PTF*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/partials/snippet-ptf-loss-during-upgrade.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Running the `mgradm upgrade podman` command when no newer upgrade is "
"available will cause the system to automatically revert to the base "
"version.  This process removes all currently applied Program Temporary Fixes "
"(PTFs) without a confirmation prompt."
msgstr "ການລັນຄຳສັ່ງ `mgradm upgrade podman` ໃນເວລາທີ່ບໍ່ມີການອັບເກຣດໃໝ່ກວ່າ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບກັບຄືນໄປເປັນເວີຊັນພື້ນຖານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະລຶບການແກ້ໄຂຊົ່ວຄາວ (PTFs) ທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຖາມຢືນຢັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/specialized-guides/partials/snippet-ptf-loss-during-upgrade.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To avoid unintended data or fix loss, verify upgrade availability before "
"execution.  Future releases will include a confirmation prompt to prevent "
"this behavior."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ຂອງການອັບເກຣດກ່ອນການລັນຄຳສັ່ງ. ເວີຊັນໃນອະນາຄົດຈະມີການເພີ່ມໜ້າຈໍຖາມຢືນຢັນເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນພຶດຕິກຳນີ້."
